  <para style="h">La Amɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">La Amɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">La Amɛ</para>
  <para style="toc3">La</para>
  <para style="mt1">La Amɛ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1" />
  <para style="ms">Mi Gbami 1</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 1:1-41:13">La 1:1—41:13</ref></para>
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 1</para>
  <para style="s1">Wami tso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1" />E ji jɔɔmi kɛ ha ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɔɛ nimli yayamihi a ga womi, nɛ a kɛ yayami peeli bɔɛ, nɛ a nɛ mɛ ngɛ he fɛu yeli a kpɛti. <verse eid="PSA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2" />Se mohu Mawu mlaa amɛ pɛ a he nɛ a bua jɔɔ; nɛ a he pɛ a susuu nyɔ kɛ pia kɛ bɔ nɛ a ma sɔmɔ Mawu ha ngɛ anɔkuale mi.<verse eid="PSA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3" />Jamɛatsɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ kaa pa tue tsohi nɛ woɔ yiblii ngɛ be nɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ nɛ a jɔɔ we. A bahi kplɔ we; nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a ma tsu ɔ, e yaa nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4" />Se yayami peeli a nɔ be ja. A ngɛ kaa dudusa nɛ kɔɔhiɔ fiaa kɛ yaa. <verse eid="PSA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5" />A be sida he nae ngɛ Kojomi Ligbi ɔ nɔ; nɛ a be sihi he hu nae ngɛ dali a kpɛti.<verse eid="PSA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6" />Ejakaa Nutsɔ ɔ buu dali a blɔhi a he, se yayami peeli lɛɛ a blɔ ɔmɛ yaa hɛ mi kpatami mi.<verse eid="PSA 1:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yiwamihelɔ Matsɛ ɔ he la a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1" />Mɛni he je nɛ je ɔ mi mi wo la kɛ wo Nutsɔ ɔ he, nɛ nihi ngɛ yaka nihi a he susue? <verse eid="PSA 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2" />Zugba a nɔ matsɛ ɔmɛ kpe kɛ wo Neneene Tsɛ ɔ kɛ e Mesia a he. <verse eid="PSA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3" />A ngɛ dee ke, “Nyɛɛ ba nɛ wa kpɔ wa he kɛ je e nɔ yemi ɔ sisi. Wa be Mawu nyɔguɛhi pee hu.”<verse eid="PSA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4" />Se Hiɔwe lokoo Mawu ɔ ngɛ mɛ muɔe. A yi mi tomi ɔmɛ peeɔ lɛ muɔ. <verse eid="PSA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5" />Si kake too nɛ e ma ka a hɛ mi kɛ abofu nɛ e maa wo a he gbeye.<verse eid="PSA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6" />Nutsɔ ɔ de ke, “Ye Matsɛ nɛ i suɔ ji enɛ ɔ nɛ. Nɛ i wo lɛ matsɛ ngɛ ye ma klɔuklɔu Yerusalem ɔ mi.”<verse eid="PSA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7" />Nɛ matsɛ ɔ he nɔ ke, “I ma je Mawu yi mi tomi ɔ kpo kɛ tsɔɔ, ejakaa Nutsɔ ɔ de mi ke, ‘Ye bi ji mo, nɛ mwɔnɛ ɔ ji o fɔmi ligbi. Nɛ mwɔnɛ ɔ i kɛ o anunyami ɔ ngɛ mo hae.’ ” <verse eid="PSA 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8" />“Moo lɛɛ mo bi mi kɛkɛ, nɛ i ma wo je ɔ tsuo ngɔ wo o sisi; nɛ je mi ma amɛ tsuo maa pee o nɔ́. <verse eid="PSA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9" />Moo ye a nɔ kɛ dade kpa nɛ o ywia mɛ kaa a ywiaa zu buɛhi.”<verse eid="PSA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10" />Nyɛ zugba a nɔ matsɛ ɔmɛ kɛ nɔ yeli ɔmɛ, nyɛɛ bu tue be nɛ ɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11" />Nyɛ sɔmɔ Nutsɔ ɔ kɛ gbeye yemi kɛ bumi. <verse eid="PSA 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12" />Nyɛɛ ba nyɛ he si ha e Bi ɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e ko na nyɛ he abofu nɛ nyɛ hɛ mi nɛ e ba kpata. E be kɛe nɛ e mi mi fumi ɔ maa te si. Se nihi nɛ kɛ a he kpasa lɛ ɔ ma ya sa we ngɛ e ngɔ nɛ a ma na bua jɔmi.<verse eid="PSA 2:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 3</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu ji David yemi kɛ bualɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo hyɛ bɔ nɛ ye he nyɛli hiɛ ha. Nihi fuu te si kɛ wo mi nɛ a ngɛ hlae nɛ a kpata ye hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2" />A ngɛ dee ke, Mawu be yee kɛ bua mi kɔkɔɔkɔ. <verse eid="PSA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3" />Se neneene Tsɛ, mo ji ye gbaja kɛ ye anunyami kɛ ye hɛ nɔ kami. Mo pɛ nɛ o ma nyɛ maa ye kɛ bua mi.<verse eid="PSA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4" />I kpa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ Mawu nɛ e he nɔ kɛ je e Sɔlemi We ɔ ngɛ Yerusalem. <verse eid="PSA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5" />Kɛkɛ nɛ i hwɔ si ngɛ he jɔmi mi nɛ i te si pɛpɛɛpɛ nɛ nɔ ko pee we mi, ejakaa Tsɛ ɔ ngɛ ye he bue. <verse eid="PSA 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6" />Nɛ ja a he je ɔ, ke he nyɛli akpe nyɔngma te si kɛ wo mi, nɛ a bɔle mi kɛ kpe tete po ɔ, i yi gbeye. <verse eid="PSA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7" />I ma tsɛ lɛ nɛ ma de ke, “Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo te si! Mo he mi, ye Mawu!” Nɛ e ma gba a hɛ mi ma, nɛ e maa ku a lunguhi.<verse eid="PSA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8" />Mawu ngɔ nɛ kunimi yemi jee ke baa nɛ e dɛ mi e we bi ɔmɛ naa jɔɔmi ngɛ.<verse eid="PSA 3:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 4</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɔ be mi la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1" />Oo Mawu, mo nɛ o bu mi dalɔ. I ngɛ mo tsɛe. Mo he nɔ koo, moo na mi mɔbɔ. Moo bu ye pɛɛ kpami ɔ tue, ejakaa mo nɛ o haa mi tsui nɛ o buu ye he be tsuaa be ngɛ ye nɔ nami mi.<verse eid="PSA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu ɔ ngɛ bie ke, “Nimli a bimɛ, mɛni be nɛ nyɛ maa jɔɔ ye hɛ mi si puemi, nɛ nyɛ ma kpa wɔ ɔmɛ jami.”<verse eid="PSA 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3" />Nyɛ kai kaa Nutsɔ ɔ ngɔ nihi nɛ e kpɔ mɛ ɔ kɛ to ha lɛ nitsɛ e he, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e maa bu ye pɛɛ kpami ɔ tue nɛ e ma ha heto. <verse eid="PSA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4" />Nyɛɛ ba Mawu hɛ mi kɛ bumi kɛ gbeye yemi nɛ nyɛ ko pee yayami ngɔ si lɛ. Nyɛɛ hwɔ si dii nɛ nyɛ susu níhi a he. <verse eid="PSA 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5" />Nyɛ wo nyɛ hɛ ngɔ fɔ Mawu nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ sã bɔ nɛ sa kɛ ha lɛ.<verse eid="PSA 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6" />Nihi deɔ ke Mawu be plɛe maa hyɛ wɔ po. Se Nutsɔ, mo ha nɛ o hɛ mi la a nɛ kpɛ ngɛ wa nɔ nɛ zo nɛ gbe mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7" />O ha nɛ i na bua jɔmi pe ngmɔ hulɔ nɛ e ngmɔ ni ba nɛ e bua jɔ e he. <verse eid="PSA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8" />I ma hwɔ si ma hwɔ mahe ngɛ tue mi jɔmi mi, ejakaa mo Nutsɔ o ngɛ ye he bue.<verse eid="PSA 4:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 5</para>
  <para style="s">Mɔtu Sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1" />Oo Nutsɔ, moo bu ye kɔmɔ yemi kɛ pɛɛ kpami ɔ tue, ye Matsɛ kɛ ye Mawu. <verse eid="PSA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2" />Ejakaa mo pɛ nɛ i ma sɔle ma tsɛ. <verse eid="PSA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3" />Mo nɛ i ma wo ye hɛ mi nɔ ma sɔle anɔkuale mi ma tsɛ daa mɔtu ngɛ ye hiami ni ɔmɛ a he.<verse eid="PSA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4" />I le kaa o pi Mawu nɛ naa yi mi wami níhi a he suɔmi, ejakaa o sume yayami. <verse eid="PSA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5" />Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nimli yayamihi be o hɛ mi nyɛe maa da, ejakaa o hiɔ a ni yayami ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6" />O ma kpata a hɛ mi ngɛ a lakpa a he, ejakaa o hiɔ nɔ gbemi kɛ he nɔ womi kɛ sisimi.<verse eid="PSA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7" />Ami lɛɛ o mɔbɔ nami kɛ o suɔmi kɛ o dloomi ɔ maa bu ye he, nɛ e ma kpaka mi kɛ ba o we ɔ. Nɛ gbeye yemi kɛ suɔmi mi nɛ i ma ja mo ngɛ.<verse eid="PSA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8" />Nutsɔ, moo tsɔɔ mi nanema he; moo tsɔɔ mi o dami blɔ ɔ ngɛ o si womi ɔ nya, konɛ he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nine nɛ ko su ye nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9" />Ejakaa anɔkuale kake be a mi; a tsui mi hyi kɛ yi mi wami níhi, nɛ yayami kɛ gbenɔ ga se a woɔ. Nɛ nɔ hɛ mi pɛ a mlɔɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a nine nɛ su nɔ nɛ a ngɛ hlae ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10" />Oo Mawu, moo wo mɛ hiɔ; mo ha nɛ a musu nɛ tloo mɛ; mo ha nɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a klama amɛ nɛ a tsɔ ɔ nɛ du mɛ, ejakaa mo nɛ a te si kɛ si ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11" />Se mo ha nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ woɔ e hɛ kɛ fɔɔ o nɔ ɔ nɛ e na bua jɔmi; e nya, ejakaa mo nɛ o ngɛ e he bue. Mo ha nɛ o bua jɔmi ɔ nɛ e hyi o suɔli ɔmɛ tɔ. <verse eid="PSA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12" />Ejakaa mo, Nutsɔ, o jɔɔ dalɔ nɛ o kɛ o suɔmi ɔ poo piɛ kɛ woɔ e he.<verse eid="PSA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 6</para>
  <para style="s1">Yayami pami kɛ tsami he sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1" />Dabi, Nutsɔ, mo ko sa ye tue kɛ abofu. <verse eid="PSA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2" />Moo na mi mɔbɔ, Nutsɔ, ejakaa i gbɔjɔ. Mo tsa mi, ejakaa ye nɔmlɔ tso ɔ be he wami. <verse eid="PSA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3" />I hao nɛ i pee basaa. Ye juɛmi futu. Oo Nutsɔ, o he nɛ pee oya nɛ o tsa mi.<verse eid="PSA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4" />Ba koo, Nutsɔ, nɛ o ba tsa mi. Mo he mi koo ngɛ o mi mi jɔmi ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5" />Ejakaa ke i gbo ɔ, i be o yi nyɛe ma je ngɛ ye huɛmɛ a hɛ mi kɛ wo o hɛ mi nyami. <verse eid="PSA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6" />I gbɔjɔ kɛ hiɔ. Nɛ ye sɔnue tsuo pɔ kɛ vo nyu, ejakaa ya nɔ nɛ i ngɛ nyɔnyɔɔnyɔ daa. <verse eid="PSA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7" />Ya kɛ kɔmɔ kɛ haomi ha nɛ ye hɛ ngmɛ bɔni yumi; nɛ kulaa je ye he nyɛli a dɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8" />Se jehanɛ ɔ lɛɛ nyɛɛ ho se ya, nimli yayamihi, ejakaa Nutsɔ ɔ nu ye ya fomi ɔ, <verse eid="PSA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9" />kɛ kɔmɔ yemi ɔ. Nɛ e ma ha ye sɔlemi ɔ tsuo heto. <verse eid="PSA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10" />E maa wo ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ fo nɛ e maa gbɛ mɛ ngɔ fĩa tlukaa. E ma ha a hɛ mi ma pue si nɛ a maa kpale a se kɛ zo.<verse eid="PSA 6:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 7</para>
  <para style="s1">Dami sane he sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1" />Oo Nutsɔ, ye Mawu, o nɔ nɛ i ngɔ ye he kɛ fɔ nɛ o je mi kɛ je ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2" />Ko ha he blɔ nɛ a nu mi kaa jata nuɔ nɔ, nɛ a sa mi kɛ ho nɛ nɔ ko be nɛ ma kpɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3" />Nutsɔ, ke ji i ngɛ yayami pee ɔ, lɛɛ e slo. <verse eid="PSA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4" />Ke i pee nɔ ko nɛ pee mi kpakpa yayami ko, aloo i ya tua nɔ ko nɛ i sume lɛ yaka gu. <verse eid="PSA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5" />Lɛɛ e maa da blɔ ke o ha nɛ ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ kpata ye hɛ mi, nɛ a pee mi posoposo, nɛ a naa ye nɔ nɛ a gbe mi klanaa.<verse eid="PSA 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6" />Se ke pi ja a, lɛɛ Nutsɔ, tee si kɛ abofu kɛ kpee ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ. Mo wo o hɛ nɔ nɛ o ye dami sane ha mi. <verse eid="PSA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7" />Mo bua nimli kulaa a nya kɛ ba o hɛ mi nɛ o je hiɔwe lokoo kɛ kojo mɛ ngɛ a yayami ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8" />Moo wo mi nguɔ ngɛ ma hɛ mi, nɛ o je ye bumi kɛ anɔkuale kpo paa nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e na. <verse eid="PSA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9" />Nutsɔ, mo ha nɛ yi mi wami kulaa se nɛ po; nɛ o jɔɔ nihi tsuo nɛ jaa mo ngɛ anɔkuale mi ɔmɛ, ejakaa dami Mawu kɛ dami sane yelɔ ji mo. O hyɛɔ nimli a tsui mi nɛ o naa a yi mi susumi kɛ a yi mi tomi ɔmɛ kɛ jee lokoo.<verse eid="PSA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10" />Ye kɛ̃ɛ̃ pulelɔ kɛ ye he bulɔ ji mo Mawu. O heɔ nihi nɛ a tsui mi tsɔ ɔmɛ a yi wami.<verse eid="PSA 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11" />Mawu ji kojolɔ nɛ yeɔ dami sane kɛ pii si, nɛ e mi mi fuɔ yi mi wali daa ligbi. <verse eid="PSA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12" />Mawu maa duɔ e ta yami ha a nya nɛ e maa gbe mɛ, lɛɛ ja a tsake. E la kɛ̃ɛ̃ tso ɔ mi, <verse eid="PSA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13" />nɛ kɛ̃ɛ̃ mi bihi nɛ la ngɛ a nya ngɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14" />Nɔmlɔ yayami toɔ yi mi wami ga nɛ e tsuɔ he ni nyɔnyɔɔnyɔ. E yeɔ lakpa nɛ e peeɔ nyuami níhi. <verse eid="PSA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15" />Mo ha nɛ e klama amɛ a fɛ nɛ a du lɛ nitsɛ. <verse eid="PSA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16" />E yi mi wami ni ɔmɛ nɛ e to ha ni kpa amɛ a kpa bu lɛ nitsɛ e nɔ. Mo kpata e hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17" />Oo, i naa Nutsɔ ɔ si, ejakaa e hi. Dalɔ ji lɛ. I ma la kɛ je Nutsɔ ɔ biɛ yi daa. Lɛ ji Nutsɔ nɛ pe nutsɔ ɔmɛ kulaa.<verse eid="PSA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 8</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu anunyami kɛ nɔmlɔ agbo jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1" />Oo neneene Tsɛ, wa Mawu, moo hyɛ bɔ nɛ o agbo jemi kɛ anunyami ɔ kpe hiɔwe kɛ zugba a tsuo nɔ ha! A ngɛ lae ngɛ o yi jee ngɛ hiɔwe lokoo. <verse eid="PSA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2" />O tsɔɔ bimwɔwi tsuo o yi jemi. Mo ha nɛ a nyami kɛ o yi jemi ɔ nɛ gbe o he nyɛli ɔmɛ zo.<verse eid="PSA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3" />Ke i wo ye hɛ mi nɔ nɛ i hyɛ Hiɔwe nyɔ mi be mi, nɛ i na o nine nya ni tsumi ɔmɛ, hlami kɛ dodoe ɔmɛ ɔ, <verse eid="PSA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4" />i biɔ ke, mɛni ji nɔmlɔ adesa nɛ e sa kaa e nɔ peeɔ mo kɔmɔ, aloo nɛ o susuu e he po. <verse eid="PSA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5" />Se kɛ ɔ, o bɔ nɔmlɔ nɛ nɔ́ ko bɔɔ pɛ nɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ kɛ pã lɛ. Nɛ o ha lɛ bumi kɛ anunyami.<verse eid="PSA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6" />O wo lɛ ngɔ to o nibɔ ni ɔmɛ tsuo a nɔ; nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ e sisi: <verse eid="PSA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7" />tohi kɛ nahi kɛ nga nɔ lohwehi tsuo, <verse eid="PSA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8" />lohwe pɛlitsɛmɛ, pa mi lo kɛ wo mi nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ wami ngɛ a mi. <verse eid="PSA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9" />Oo Yehowa, wa Nutsɔ, moo hyɛ bɔ nɛ o biɛ ɔ agbo jemi kɛ anunyami kpe je ɔ mi tsuo ha!<verse eid="PSA 8:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 9</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu, Kpɔ̃lɔ Ngua a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1" />Oo Nutsɔ, i ma je o yi kɛ ye tsui kulaa. I ma fiɛ o nyakpɛ ni slɔɔto ɔmɛ nɛ o pee ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2" />I ma na bua jɔmi, nɛ ye mi ma hyi tɔ kɛ nyami ngɛ o he je. Nutsɔ, mo o yi ma la ma je, mo Mawu Ope.<verse eid="PSA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3" />Ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ maa gbee senyasenya ngɛ o hɛ mi, nɛ a hɛ mi ma kpata. <verse eid="PSA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4" />O bu mi bemi, nɛ o ma ye ni tsumi ɔ nɔ mi kɛ je o matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ kaa e hi. <verse eid="PSA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5" />O ka je mi ma amɛ a hɛ mi, nɛ o kpata dikali ɔmɛ a hɛ mi, nɛ o gbe a biɛ kɛ yaa neneene. <verse eid="PSA 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6" />Oo, nyɛ ye he nyɛli, nyɛ gbe nya gbidigbidi. Nutsɔ ɔ ma puɛ nyɛ ma amɛ nɛ nɔ ko be mɛ kaie hu.<verse eid="PSA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7" />Se Nutsɔ ɔ ngɛ tsɛ yee kɛ yaa neneene. <verse eid="PSA 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8" />E ngɛ e matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ e maa kojo je ɔ ngɛ dami nya. <verse eid="PSA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9" />Lɛ ji wesa he kɛ ha nihi nɛ a ngɛ mɛ amimi yee. <verse eid="PSA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10" />Nutsɔ, nihi kulaa nɛ le o mɔbɔ nami ɔ, maa tu fo kɛ ba o ngɔ ngɛ a fimi be mi nɛ o ye kɛ bua mɛ; ejakaa nihi nɛ ngɔ a hɛ kɛ fɔ o nɔ ɔ, o ngmɛɛ we a ti nɔ ko he hyɛ gblee.<verse eid="PSA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11" />Nyɛ la nɛ nyɛ je Zion Mawu ɔ yi. Nyɛɛ fiɛ e ni tsumi ɔmɛ nɛ hɛ be nɔ jee ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ je ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12" />E yeɔ nɔ nɛ a gbe lɛ ɔ e sane kɛ haa lɛ, nɛ e buu nihi nɛ kpaa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛɔ lɛ ɔ tue. E nuɔ nihi nɛ ngɛ haomi mi ɔ a sɔlemi kɛ pɛɛ kpami nɛ e heɔ mɛ.<verse eid="PSA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13" />Oo Nutsɔ, moo na mi mɔbɔ. Hyɛ nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ nae ngɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ mi nyɛɛ ɔ a dɛ mi. Nutsɔ, mo kpɔ mi kɛ je gbenɔ dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14" />Mo he mi koo, nɛ i ma je o yi ngɛ Zion agbo ɔmɛ a nya ngɛ ma hɛ mi, nɛ i ma nya ngɛ ye yi wami hemi kɛ kpɔmi ɔ he.<verse eid="PSA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15" />Yi mi wali ɔmɛ a nɔ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a muɔhi nɛ a tsua kɛ ha ni kpa amɛ a mi, nɛ a klama nɛ a tsɔ kɛ ha ni kpahi ɔ, e du mɛ nitsɛmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16" />Mawu dami sane yemi ɔ ha nɛ je ɔ tsuo le lɛ. E saa yayami peeli a tue nɛ e haa mɛ nitsɛmɛ a klama duɔ mɛ.<verse eid="PSA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17" />Yi mi wali ɔmɛ maa ya abosiamihi a je, nɛ mahi nɛ a hɛ jee Mawu nɔ ɔ, a hɛ mi ma kpata. <verse eid="PSA 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18" />Mawu hɛ be ohiafo nɔ jee kɔkɔɔkɔ, nɛ níhi nɛ ohiafo ngɛ blɔ hyɛe ɔ, e be yaka pee gblee.<verse eid="PSA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19" />Oo Nutsɔ, tee si nɛ o kojo ma amɛ nɛ o sa a tue; ko ha nɛ a ye o nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20" />Mo ha nɛ a he nɛ kpokpo nɛ a ye mo gbeye. Ha nɛ nimli a bimɛ a le kaa adesahi kɛkɛ ji mɛ.<verse eid="PSA 9:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 10</para>
  <para style="s1">Nutsɔ, nɔ nɛ kojoɔ yi mi wali ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1" />Nutsɔ, mɛni he je nɛ o ho se ya lokoo kikɛ ɔ? Mɛni he je nɛ o ngɔ o he kɛ laa mi be mi nɛ o he hia mi pe kulaa?<verse eid="PSA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2" />Moo ba nɛ o kɛ dikali, he nɔ woli, nɛ ngɛ ohiafohi yi mi wae nɛ ɔ nɛ ba ye. Ha nɛ a yi mi yayami nɛ a to kɛ wo nihi a he ɔ nɛ kpa bu mɛ nitsɛmɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3" />Ni nɛ ɔmɛ kɛ a musu ni nami ɔmɛ fiaa. A gbee Mawu he guɛ, nɛ a jeɔ nihi nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ sume ɔ a yi, nihi nɛ a kɔmɔ nɛ a yeɔ pɛ ji sika a.<verse eid="PSA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4" />Yi mi wali kɛ he nɔ woli nɛ ɔmɛ a susumi ji kaa Mawu ko be. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e se blɔ hlami he hia we mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5" />Se a nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ yaa nɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ, nɛ a nine suu a he nyɛli a nɔ. A li kaa o kojomi kɛ tue sami ko ngɛ nɛ ma ba na mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6" />A fiaa nɛ a deɔ ke Nɔmlɔ ko loo Mawu po be a nya nyɛe maa tsi ligbi ko; bɔ fɛɛ bɔ nɛ ji ɔ, nɔ́ nɛ a ngɛ hlae ɔ, a maa pee.<verse eid="PSA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7" />Lakpa kɛ musu bɔmi munyu pɛ nɛ a tuɔ, nɛ a dika ga nɛ a tsɔɔ ɔmɛ ji a fiami nɔ́. <verse eid="PSA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8" />A woɔ ka ngɛ diblii mi ngɛ blɔ he nɛ a gbee blɔ nyɛɛli. <verse eid="PSA 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9" />A woɔ ka kaa jata nɛ ngɛ mlɛe nɛ maa hi kɛ ma nɔ nɔ. Nɛ a nuu nihi nɛ a ngɛ hlae ɔ kaa de dalɔ nuu lohwe kɛ klama. <verse eid="PSA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10" />Nihi nɛ a he be ni ɔmɛ a nyɛ we a he wami nya dami, nɛ a kpataa a hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11" />Nɔ́ nɛ a deɔ a he ji, “Mawu tsa nɛ, nɛ e be lee hulɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12" />Oo Nutsɔ, tee si! Oo Mawu, mo kpata a hɛ mi! O hɛ nɛ ko je ohiafo nɔ aloo nɔ ko nɛ e fi lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13" />Mawu, ko ha nɛ yi mi wali nɛ bui mo ɔ nɛ a ye a he, nɛ e pee mɛ kaa kojomi ko be ha mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14" />Nutsɔ, o na nɔ́ nɛ a ngɛ pee ɔ, nɛ o le awi nɛ a ngɛ yee ɔ. Saa a tue. Mo ji ohiafo hɛ nɔ kami; yemi kɛ bualɔ ji mo, nɛ o yeɔ kɛ buaa nihi nɛ be nɔ́ ko ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15" />Moo ku dikali ɔmɛ a he wami nya. Moo gbla a tue ngɛ a yayami peemi ɔ he kɛ ya si o ma kpata mɛ tsuo a hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16" />Nutsɔ ɔ ji matsɛ kɛ yaa neneene. Nɛ nihi nɛ jaa mawu kpahi ɔ, e ma kpata a hɛ mi ngɛ zugba a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17" />Nutsɔ, o nuɔ humihi a sɔlemi kɛ a kɔmɔ yemi. O ma he mɛ. O maa pee a hiami ni ha mɛ nɛ o ma kɛ jɔɔ a bua. <verse eid="PSA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18" />Tsɛ Mawu, moo nu awusahi kɛ nihi nɛ a ngɛ mɛ amimi yee ɔmɛ a sɔlemi kɛ pɛɛ kpami. Moo kɛ mɛ nɛ hi si bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nɔ ko nɛ ko wo a he gbeye hu.<verse eid="PSA 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 11</para>
  <para style="s1">Nutsɔ, wa he fãlɔ anɔkualetsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1" />Nutsɔ ɔ ji ye hɛ nɔ kami kɛ ye wesa he. Kɛ e peeɔ kɛɛ nɛ o deɔ mi ke, “Moo tu fo kɛ ho yoku ɔmɛ a nɔ ya nɛ o ya laa?”<verse eid="PSA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2" />Ejakaa he nyɛli ɔmɛ dla a kɛ̃ɛ̃ ɔmɛ nɛ a pee klaalo kɛ to Mawu bi ɔmɛ ngɛ diblii mi. <verse eid="PSA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3" />A de wɔ ke, “Nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ futu, blɔ nya tomi ko be ɔ, nɔ ko bui mlaa hu. Nɔ́ pe nɛ dali kɛ nimli kpakpahi maa pee ji kaa a tu fo kɛ je.”<verse eid="PSA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4" />Se Nutsɔ ɔ ngɛ e Sɔlemi We ɔ kɛ sa. E matsɛ Sɛ ɔ maa si nɛ e ngɛ tsɛ yee kɛ je hiɔwe lokoo. Nɛ e ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ nɔ yae ngɛ zugba a nɔ hyɛe pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="PSA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5" />E kaa ni kpakpahi kɛ ni yayamihi tsuo hyɛɔ ha. E hiɔ nihi nɛ suɔ yayami kɛ basabasa peemi. <verse eid="PSA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6" />E ma ha la maa nɛ kaa hiɔmi kɛ je Hiɔwe kɛ pue dikali a nɔ nɛ e maa sa mɛ kɛ kɔɔhiɔ nɛ ngɛ tsoe kɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7" />Ejakaa mi mi jɔlɔ kɛ Tsɛ kpakpa ji Mawu; e suɔ nɔ́ kpakpa kɛ kpakpa peemi. Ni nɛmɛ nɛ peeɔ kpakpa nɛ a yee Mawu gbeye ɔ maa na e hɛ mi daa.<verse eid="PSA 11:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 12</para>
  <para style="s1">Dalɔ kpɔmi ngɛ yayami peeli a kpɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1" />Nutsɔ, moo ye kɛ bua wɔ! Nimli kpakpa amɛ tsuo ngɛ tae oyaoya. Jije nimli kpakpahi ngɛ piɔ ngɛ je ɔ mi? <verse eid="PSA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ lakpa yee nɛ e ngɛ e nyɛmi sisie; lakpa pɛ nɛ a ngɛ yee ha a he. Anɔkuale yemi be hu.<verse eid="PSA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3" />Se Mawu be nihi nɛ ngɛ kikɛmɛ a ni nɛ ɔmɛ pee ɔ mɔbɔ nae. <verse eid="PSA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4" />E ma kpata lakpatsɛ ɔmɛ a hɛ mi, nihi nɛ deɔ ke, “Wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa nya wa hɛɛ, nɛ nɔ́ nɛ wa suɔ ɔ nɛ wa ma de, wa maa ye lakpa bɔ nɛ wa ma nyɛ. Mɛnɔ maa ye wa nɔ?” <verse eid="PSA 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5" />Nɔ́ nɛ Mawu ngɛ jamɛatsɛ ɔmɛ dee ji, “I ma te si ma fã nihi nɛ a ngɛ mɛ amimi yee kɛ nihi nɛ be nɔ ko ɔmɛ a he, ejakaa i nu a kɛmɛmi kɛ a huu fami ɔ he, nɛ i ma kpɔ mɛ kaa bɔ nɛ a ngɛ mi blɔ hyɛe nɛ ma pee ɔ.” <verse eid="PSA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6" />Nutsɔ ɔ wui si yaka. E tui munyu gu, nɛ gbi nɛ jee e nya a ji anɔkuale nɛ he tsɔ. E munyu ngɛ kaa sika hiɔ nɛ a tsu he si kpaago. <verse eid="PSA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7" />Oo Nutsɔ, wa le kaa o maa bu o we bimɛ a he daa, nɛ o ma kpɔ mɛ kɛ je dikali a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8" />Ejakaa yi wali kɛ dikali kpe je ɔ, nɛ nɔ́ yayami mohu yi nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ jeɔ.<verse eid="PSA 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 13</para>
  <para style="s1">Yemi kɛ buami he Sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1" />Nutsɔ, mɛni be o hɛ maa je ye nɔ kɛ ya si? Kɛ yaa neneene lo? Nɛ kɛ ya si mɛni be nɛ o ma plɛ o hɛ mi kɛ fɔ he kpa, be mi nɛ ye yi fi ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2" />Mɛni be nɛ i ma ngɔ nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ haoe ngɛ he ngɛ ye mi daa a kɛ laa kɛ ya si? Nɛ kɛ yaa si mɛni be nɛ ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ maa ye ye nɔ? <verse eid="PSA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3" />Mo ha mi heto Nutsɔ, ye Mawu. Ha nɛ o la a nɛ tso ha mi ngɛ diblii ɔ mi, ke pi ja a, i ma gbo. <verse eid="PSA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4" />Ko ha nɛ ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ nɛ a de ke, “Wa ye e nɔ!” Ko ha nɛ a nya ngɛ ye si gbeemi ɔ he.<verse eid="PSA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5" />Ejakaa ami lɛɛ, mo o nɔ nɛ i wo ye hɛ kɛ fɔ. O mɔbɔ nami kɛ yi wami hemi ji ye bua jɔmi kɛ hɛ nɔ kami. <verse eid="PSA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6" />I ma wo ye gbi nɔ nɛ ma la kɛ je Nutsɔ ɔ yi, ejakaa e jɔɔ mi pe bɔ nɛ i ma nyɛ ma tsɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 13:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 14</para>
  <para style="s1">Nimli a yi mi wami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1" />Nɔ nɛ ma de ke, “Mawu be” ɔ, jamɛatsɛ ɔ e li nɔ́. Nɛ nɔ nɛ ma de ja a, nɔmlɔ puɛpuɛ kɛ musutsɛ nyagbe ji lɛ.<verse eid="PSA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2" />Nutsɔ ɔ ngɛ nimli a bimɛ hyɛe kɛ je hiɔwe lokoo kaa nɔ́ lelɔ ko ngɛ a kpɛti nɛ suɔ kaa e maa pee Mawu suɔmi nya ni lo. <verse eid="PSA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3" />Se e nɛ nɔ kake po; yayami puɛ mɛ tsuo nɛ a tla kɛ je Mawu blɔ ɔ nɔ. Nɔmlɔ dalɔ kake po be. <verse eid="PSA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4" />A yeɔ ye bi ɔmɛ kaa a yeɔ abolo nɛ a susuu we sɔlemi he. Anɛ nɔ́ pɛ nɛ a li kikɛ ɔ lo?<verse eid="PSA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5" />Se be ko ma nɛ gbeye maa nu mɛ, ejakaa Mawu kɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ suɔ lɛ ɔ ngɛ. E ji a he. <verse eid="PSA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6" />Ohiafohi kɛ humihi kɛ nihi nɛ a ngɛ mɛ amimi yee ɔ a wesa he ji lɛ. <verse eid="PSA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7" />I na nɛ mwɔnɛ ɔ ji a yi wami hemi be ɔ, nɛ Mawu maa je Zion kɛ ba nɛ e ba he e nimli ɔmɛ a yi wami. Mɛni bua jɔmi nɛ e bi ɔmɛ be nae be mi nɛ e ma kpɔ Israel?<verse eid="PSA 14:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 15</para>
  <para style="s1">Nihi nɛ suɔ Nutsɔ ɔ a subai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1" />Nutsɔ, mɛnɔ ngɛ he blɔ nɛ e saa we nɛ e yi nɛ na wami ngɛ o we ɔ ngɛ o yoku klɔuklɔu ɔ nɔ?<verse eid="PSA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ tɔmi ko be e he nɛ e hine anɔkuale yelɔ kɛ pi si. <verse eid="PSA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3" />Nɔ nɛ tui nɔ he munyu yaya nɛ e bui sieku yemi he tue; nɛ e pee we nɔmlɔ ko yayami. <verse eid="PSA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4" />E hiɔ nihi nɛ kua Mawu nɛ a yi lɛ gbeye. E kaa yayami peelɔ hɛ mi. E jeɔ nihi nɛ yee Mawu gbeye nɛ a suɔ lɛ ɔ a yi. E yeɔ e si womi nɔ be fɛɛ be. <verse eid="PSA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5" />E paa sika nɛ e he we he kpa pe bɔ nɛ sa. Nɔ nɛ he we nyɔ mi ni nɛ e ya yeɔ lakpa odase kɛ siɔ humi bi. Kikɛmɛ a nɔmlɔ ɔ maa da si daa; nɔ́ ko be e he kɔe, nɛ nɔ́ ko be nɛ maa wo e he gbeye.<verse eid="PSA 15:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 16</para>
  <para style="s1">Hɛ Nɔ kami he sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1" />Oo Mawu, mo he ye yi wami, ejakaa i ba o ngɔ nɛ ma ba sa we. <verse eid="PSA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2" />I de lɛ ke, “Mo ji ye Mawu, nɛ i be yemi kɛ bualɔ ko ja mo.” <verse eid="PSA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3" />Nihi nɛ le Mawu ɔmɛ ji nihi nɛ i suɔ nɛ ma kɛ bɔ; mɛ ji anɔkuale odehehi. <verse eid="PSA 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4" />Ni nɛmɛ nɛ nyɛɛɔ mawu kpahi a se ɔ, a maa ye aywilɛho. I be tɛlie ha jamɛ a mawu ɔmɛ, nɛ i be bɔ ko sae ha mɛ hulɔ. A biɛ tete i be tsɛe.<verse eid="PSA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5" />Nutsɔ ɔ nitsɛ ji ye gbosi ni kɛ ye nike ni. Lɛ ji ye nya ngma kɛ ye nyu nɛ i nuɔ. Lɛ ji ye bua jɔmi nɛ pe kulaa. E baa ye nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ yi ha mi daa. <verse eid="PSA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6" />Zugba a he nɛ nyu jɔjɔɛ ngɛ, kɛ he nɛ nga bɔ ngɛ nɛ e ngɔ haa mi kaa ye blɔ fa mi nɔ́. Mɛni nyakpɛ gbosi ni ji nɛ! <verse eid="PSA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7" />I ma je ye ga wolɔ Mawu ɔ yi daa. E haa mi juɛmi ngɛ ye si hwɔmi be mi, nɛ e tsɔɔ mi nɔ́ nɛ ma pee.<verse eid="PSA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8" />I susuu Nutsɔ ɔ he daa, nɛ i nuɔ e he ngɛ ye kasa nya daa; lɔ ɔ he je ɔ nɔ ko be ye nane nyɛɛ maa tɔtɔ. <verse eid="PSA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9" />Ye tsui kɛ ye nɔmlɔ tso kɛ ye mumi tsuo hyi kɛ bua jɔmi. <verse eid="PSA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10" />Ejakaa o be mi sie ngɛ gbeje, nɛ o be o suɔlɔ ɔ sie nɛ e sa ngɛ gbogboe muɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11" />O ha nɛ i na bua jɔmi. Mo o ngɔ kɛ o mi nɛ bua jɔmi nɛ se pui ngɛ.<verse eid="PSA 16:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 17</para>
  <para style="s1">David ngɛ Mawu pɛli sisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1" />Nutsɔ, moo bu ye pɛɛ kpami ɔ tue. I ye anɔkuale nɛ i pee nɔ́ nɛ da, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, moo ye ye sane ɔ ha mi. Moo bu ye ngmlaa kpami ɔ tue. <verse eid="PSA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2" />Moo wo mi nguɔ ngɛ ma hɛ mi, ejakaa dami sane yelɔ ji mo. <verse eid="PSA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3" />O ka mi nɛ o hyɛ ha nɛ o na kaa i hi. O ba slaa mi nyɔ mi be mi nɛ o na kaa i be yi mi tomi yaya ko ngɛ ye mi, o na kaa i tu anɔkuale. <verse eid="PSA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4" />I ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ nɛ i kɛ yayami peeli bɔɛ. <verse eid="PSA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5" />Ye nane tlɛ kɛ ji o blɔ ɔmɛ a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6" />Oo Mawu, mɛni he je nɛ i ngɛ sɔlee kikɛ ɔ? Ejakaa i le kaa o ma ha mi heto. Moo bu ye sɔlemi ɔ tue! <verse eid="PSA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7" />Mo je o suɔmi nɛ nya wa a kpo kɛ tsɔɔ mi ngɛ nyakpɛ blɔhi a nɔ, mo Yiwamihelɔ nɛ jeɔ nihi kulaa kɛ jee a he nyɛli a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8" />Moo baa ye yi kaa a baa hɛ ngmɛ yi. Moo gba bu ye nɔ nɛ o wo mi ngɔ laa ngɛ o pɛli sisi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ he nyɛli a nine nɛ ko su ye nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9" />Ejakaa muɔ sɛ ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a hɛ mi nɛ a hɛ tsu wo ye he. <verse eid="PSA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10" />Mɔbɔ nami ko be a mi, nɛ a woɔ a he nɔ. Hyɛ bɔ nɛ a ngɛ fiãe ha! <verse eid="PSA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11" />Jehanɛ ɔ lɛɛ a po sá wo ye he nɛ a nu mi ta. E piɛ nɛ a ma wo mi ngɔ fia si. <verse eid="PSA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12" />A ngɛ kaa jatahi nɛ ngɛ hlae nɛ a gba ye lo, aloo jata bimɛ nɛ wo ka ngɛ mlɛe nɛ a maa nu lohwe.<verse eid="PSA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13" />Nutsɔ, tee si kɛ kpee mɛ. Moo tsiɛ mɛ kɛ ya se nɛ o poo mɛ kɛ pue si. Ba nɛ o ba he mi kɛ je je mi bi nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ je mi ní nami pɛ ji a kɔmɔ ɔ a dɛ. <verse eid="PSA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14" />Nimli nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ mo nɔuu nɛ o dloo mɛ níhi slɔɔtohi, nɛ o ha nɛ a bimɛ kɛ a bibimɛ na ni nɛ a na he jɔmi ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15" />Ami lɛɛ je nɛ ɔ mi ní nami pee we mi akɔnɔ; nɔ́ nɛ hia mi ji kaa i kɛ mo wa kpɛti nɛ da, nɛ ke i pue ngɛ hiɔwe hwɔɔ se ɔ, ma na o hɛ mi. Enɛ ɔ mohu nɛ ma ha mi bua jɔmi.<verse eid="PSA 17:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 18</para>
  <para style="s1">David kunimi yemi he la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, hyɛ bɔ nɛ i suɔ mo ha! Ejakaa o pee nyakpɛ níhi agbohi kɛ ha mi.<verse eid="PSA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2" />Yehowa ji ye tɛ sa, kɛ ye wesa he. Lɛ ji yoku mi he nɛ i laa ye he ngɛ. Lɛ ji ye Yiwamihelɔ. E ji tɛ sa kɛ mwɔ mi he nɛ ke i laa ye he ngɛ nɛ nɔ ko be ye he sue. Lɛ ji ye dama. E ngɛ kaa na ku e koli nɛ e kɛ nɔɔ kunɔ kɛ fãa e he. <verse eid="PSA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3" />Nɔ́ nɛ hia mi peemi pɛ ji kaa ma kpa ngmlaa ma tsɛ lɛ kɛkɛ e ma he mi kɛ je he nyɛli ɔmɛ a dɛ mi. A je Mawu yi daa.<verse eid="PSA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4" />Gbenɔ fi mi kɛ e kpa amɛ, nɛ abosiamitsɛmɛ te si kɛ wo mi wawɛɛ. <verse eid="PSA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5" />A du mi kpɛii nɛ i nɛ yemi kɛ buami ko, nɛ i hua hluu nɛ ma je ye he kɛ je gbenɔ kpa amɛ nɛ ngɛ mi gblae ɔmɛ a mi.<verse eid="PSA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6" />I kpa ngmlaa ngɛ ye haomi ɔ mi kɛ tsɛ Nutsɔ ɔ nɛ e ye kɛ bua mi. E he nɔ kɛ je Sɔlemi We ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɛ zugba huanya nɛ yoku ɔmɛ hoso, ejakaa Mawu na abofu. <verse eid="PSA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8" />La gegeege je e nya mi nɛ e ha nɛ zugba a nu la; nɛ la su ku je e gugwɔ mi kɛ je kpo. <verse eid="PSA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9" />E kple si kɛ je hiɔwe nɛ diblii ha e he. <verse eid="PSA 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10" />E hi bɔfo kerub nɔ nɛ e te kaa kɔɔhiɔ nɛ e ba ye kɛ bua mi. <verse eid="PSA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11" />E wo diblii kɛ ha e he nɛ bɔ kuu kpii nɛ wo kaa nyu nyɛɛ e hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12" />Si kake too ɔ, e he kpɛmi ɔ je si ngɛ bɔ kuu ɔmɛ a mi kɛ hiɔmi tɛhi kɛ la nɛ ngɛ tsoe.<verse eid="PSA 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13" />Nutsɔ ɔ wo gbi ngɛ hiɔwe, nɛ Mawu nɛ pe mawuhi kulaa a tu munyu kɛ hiɔmi tɛhi kɛ la nɛ ngɛ tsoe. <verse eid="PSA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14" />Nɛ e kɛ hiɔmi la pami nɛ ngɛ kaa kɛ̃ɛ̃ mi bihi nɛ he ngɛ gbeye ɔ wo ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ fo. <verse eid="PSA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ngɛ o fami ɔ nya a, wo fã. Nɛ ngɛ o mumi womi nya a, o pa amɛ a mi gbli nɛ a sisi tomi ɔmɛ fɔɔ si paa.<verse eid="PSA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16" />O je hiɔwe kɛ je mi kɛ je ye ka kɛ ye nɔ́ nami ɔmɛ a mi. O je mi kɛ je pahi nɛ mi kuɔ ɔmɛ a mi. <verse eid="PSA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17" />O kpɔ mi, nɔ nɛ be yemi kɛ buami ko ɔ kɛ je ye he nyɛli kɛ nihi nɛ nyɛɛ mi ɔmɛ a dɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18" />Ligbi nɛ i gbɔjɔ pe kulaa a nɛ a te si ba tua mi, se mo Mawu o pɛtɛ ye he. <verse eid="PSA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19" />O kpaka mi kɛ ho he nɛ ye yi ma na wami ngɛ ya, ejakaa o suɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20" />Yehowa ye kɛ bua mi, ejakaa i peeɔ nɔ́ nɛ da nɛ ye he hu tsɔ. <verse eid="PSA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21" />I bu e mlaa amɛ tue. I ji Mawu se, nɛ i pee we yayami. <verse eid="PSA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22" />I yeɔ e mlaa amɛ kulaa a nɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ nɛ i tɔ we kake po nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23" />I bɔ mɔde nɛ i ye kulaa nɔ, nɛ i yu ye he kɛ je yayami peemi he. <verse eid="PSA 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Nutsɔ ɔ dloo mi kɛ jɔɔmi babauu, ejakaa i peeɔ nɔ́ nɛ da. E le kaa ye tsui mi tsɔ, ejakaa e le ye nane hiami ɔmɛ tsuo.<verse eid="PSA 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o naa mɔbɔ nali ɔmɛ mɔbɔ. Nɛ dali ɔmɛ hu o kɛ mɛ yeɔ dami sane. <verse eid="PSA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26" />O haa nihi nɛ a tsui mi tsɔ ɔmɛ naa jɔɔmi, nɛ nihi hu nɛ jee o blɔ ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ naa haomi. <verse eid="PSA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27" />O heɔ humihi a yi wami, se o kuɔ he woli kɛ fiali a nya. <verse eid="PSA 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28" />Mo nɛ o ha ye la a kpɛ. Nutsɔ ye Mawu ɔ ha nɛ ye diblii ɔ plɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29" />O he wami nya a, ma nyɛ ma tu gbogbo, nɛ ma nyɛ ma da ta fɛɛ ta nya.<verse eid="PSA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30" />E nɔ Mawu be! Hyɛ bɔ nɛ e hi kɛ pi si ha! E si womi ɔmɛ kulaa baa mi, nɛ e hine tu tɛ pulemi nɔ́ kɛ ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ laa ngɛ e se ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31" />Mɛnɔ nɛ e hine Mawu pe wa Mawu ɔ? Mɛnɔ nɛ hine tɛ sa pe lɛ?<verse eid="PSA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32" />E woɔ mi he wami, e baa ye yi nɛ e buu ye blɔ ɔmɛ kulaa a he kɛ yaa he tsuaa he. <verse eid="PSA 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33" />E ha we nɛ ye nane saneɔ ke i ngɛ kɔ̃ nya tete nyɛɛe. <verse eid="PSA 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34" />E fiɔ gbaja haa mi kɛ ha ta, nɛ e woɔ mi he wami nɛ i kɛ tsiɛɔ dade kɛ̃ɛ̃.<verse eid="PSA 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35" />Mawu, o yi wami hemi ɔ ji ye dama. O hiɔ nine puleɔ mi, nɛ o mi mi himi he je ɔ, i pee agbo. <verse eid="PSA 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36" />O je blɔ gbajaa ha mi konɛ ma ko sane. <verse eid="PSA 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37" />O ha nɛ i wo ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ fo nɛ i nyɛɛ a se kɛ ya si i ya na mɛ. I fiaa mɛ ní nɛ i ye a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38" />I nyɛ a nɔ kɛ wo zugba nɛ a nyɛ we nɔ́ ko nɛ a pee. I naa a kuɛhi a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39" />O ha mi he wami nɛ i kɛ ye ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nɔ, ejakaa o fi gbaja ha mi kɛ ha ta a. <verse eid="PSA 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40" />O ha nɛ ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ tu fo ngɛ ye nya. I kpata ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ mi nyɛɛ ɔmɛ a hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41" />Ngmlaa je a nya, se a nɛ bualɔ ko. A tsɛ Nutsɔ ɔ, se e pui a nya mi. <verse eid="PSA 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42" />I pee mɛ kaa zugba zu, nɛ i muɔ mɛ kɛ pue he kaa dwɔmi. <verse eid="PSA 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43" />O ha nɛ i ye kunimi ngɛ ta fɛɛ ta mi, nɛ o wo mi ma amɛ tsuo a nɔ tsɛ; nɛ nihi nɛ i li po ba pee ye sɔmɔli. <verse eid="PSA 18:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44" />Ma je li nɛ a kɛ mi kpi hyɛ tete po ba ha mi yi. <verse eid="PSA 18:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45" />Gbeye nu mɛ nɛ a je a laami he ɔmɛ ba ha yi.<verse eid="PSA 18:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46" />Mawu ngɛ! Nyɛ je e yi, nɔ nɛ ji tɛ sa nɛ buu wa he ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 18:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47" />Lɛ ji Mawu nɛ woɔ nihi nɛ yeɔ mi awi ɔ hiɔ, nɛ e baa mahi si ngɛ ye hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 18:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48" />Nɛ e kpɔɔ mi kɛ jee ye he nyɛli a dɛ mi. E kɛ mi toɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ nɛ a nine sui ye nɔ, nɛ e jeɔ mi kɛ jee he nyɛli kpanaku ɔmɛ a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 18:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, i ma je o yi ngɛ jejeeje tsuo. I ma la kɛ je o yi. <verse eid="PSA 18:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50" />O he mi, matsɛ nɛ o hla a, ye yi wami behi babauu kɛ gu nyakpɛ blɔhi a nɔ. O jeɔ o suɔmi kɛ mi mi jɔmi kpo daa kɛ tsɔɔ mi; nɛ o maa pee ja a nɔuu kɛ ha bibimɛ nɛ maa ba ngɛ ye se ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 18:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 19</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu anunyami ngɛ adebɔ mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1" />Hyɛ bɔ nɛ hiɔwe ngɛ Mawu anunyami kpo jee ha; e ngɛ Mawu nine nya ní peemi ní ɔmɛ jee kɛ ngɛ tsɔɔe paa. <verse eid="PSA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2" />Nyɔ kɛ pia tsuo ɔ, a ngɛ Mawu he odase yee. <verse eid="PSA 19:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3-4" />O be munyu ko loo pɛmi ko he nue, a pee dii ngɛ hiɔwe, se sɛ nɛ a hɛɛ ɔ ya suu je ɔ mi he fɛɛ he. Pu ɔ ngɛ hiɔwe he nɛ Mawu ngɔ lɛ kɛ to ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 19:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5" />E tee mɔtu kɛ e he fɛu kaa yotsɛ nɛ dla e he kɛ je tsu mi; aloo kaa fo tulɔ nɛ dla e he kɛ yaa fo kami. <verse eid="PSA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6" />Pu ɔ nyɛɛ ngɛ hiɔwe kɛ jee site he kɛ yaa sinɔ he, nɛ nɔ́ ko laa we ngɛ e la a nya.<verse eid="PSA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7-8" />Mawu mlaa amɛ hi kɛ pi si. A buu wa he, a tsɔɔ wɔ hɛ mi tɛmi, nɛ wa naa bua jɔmi. A ji kane kɛ ha wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 19:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9" />Nutsɔ ɔ jami he mlaa amɛ hi nɛ e sa kaa a hi si daa. E kojomi ɔmɛ da be tsuaa be. <verse eid="PSA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10" />A he hia nɔmlɔ pe sika tsu, nɛ a ngɔɔ pe hwo nɛ ngɛ dɛe kɛ je hwo gbaku mi. <verse eid="PSA 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11" />Ejakaa a jeɔ wɔ kɛ jee oslaa mi, nɛ a nɔ yelɔ yeɔ kunimi.<verse eid="PSA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12" />Kɛ ma pee kɛ le yayamihi nɛ ngɛ ye tsui mi kɛɛ? Moo tsu ye he kɛ je laami tɔmi nɛ ɔmɛ a mi. <verse eid="PSA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13" />Moo baa ye yi nɛ o kudɔ mi kɛ je tɔmihi nɛ ye hɛ ngɛ he ɔ a he; nɛ o ye kɛ bua mi nɛ ma kpa peemi. Nɛ jaja a loko ji i ma ye ye he kɛ je fɔ bumi kɛ mlaa nɔ tɔmi mi.<verse eid="PSA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ye tɛ sa kɛ Yiwamihelɔ, mo ha nɛ ye tsui mi susumi ni ɔmɛ kɛ ye nya mi munyuhi a pee níhi nɛ maa sa o hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 19:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 20</para>
  <para style="s1">Kunimi yemi he sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1" />Mawu kɛ mo nɛ hi si ngɛ o haomi be mi. Yakob Mawu ɔ nɛ je mo kɛ je matahu mi. <verse eid="PSA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2" />E je e he klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɛ Zion nɛ e ye kɛ bua mo. <verse eid="PSA 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3" />Mawu nɛ kai o nike ni ɔmɛ kɛ afɔle ɔmɛ nɛ o saa kɛ haa lɛ ɔ nɛ e bua nɛ jɔ a he. <verse eid="PSA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4" />E ha mo níhi nɛ o tsui suɔ ɔmɛ, nɛ e ha nɛ o yi mi tomi ɔmɛ a ba mi. <verse eid="PSA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5" />Wa ma hwɔ lele kɛ bua jɔmi kɛ nya o kunimi yemi ɔ he, nɛ wa je Mawu yi ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ e pee ha mo ɔ he. Mawu nɛ ha o bimi ni ɔmɛ kulaa heto.<verse eid="PSA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6" />“Mawu nɛ baa Matsɛ ɔ yi,” nɛ i le kaa e peeɔ. E buɔ mi tue kɛ jee hiɔwe lokoo, nɛ e haa nɛ i yeɔ kunimi agbohi. <verse eid="PSA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7" />Ma komɛ fĩaa kɛ fɔɔ a sojahi kɛ ta hwumi níhi a nɔ, se wɔɔ lɛɛ wa Tsɛ Mawu ɔ nɔ kɛkɛ wa fĩaa kɛ toɔ. <verse eid="PSA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8" />Jamɛ a ma amɛ a yi maa hɛ si nɛ a hɛ mi ma kpata, se wɔɔ lɛɛ wa nine maa ya hiɔ mi daa nɛ wa maa da wa da he.<verse eid="PSA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9" />Oo Nutsɔ, mo ha wa matsɛ ɔ kunimi yemi. Tsaatsɛ, moo nu wa pɛɛ kpami ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 21</para>
  <para style="s1">Kunimi yemi he yi jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1" />Oo Mawu, hyɛ bɔ nɛ matsɛ ɔ bua jɔɔ e he ngɛ o he wami ɔ nya. Bɔ nɛ e ngɛ nyae, ejakaa o he e yi wami. <verse eid="PSA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2" />O ha lɛ níhi nɛ e bi mo ɔ, nɛ o ha e tsui nɔ e mi.<verse eid="PSA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3" />O wo lɛ ngɔ hi matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ, nɛ o dloo lɛ ní kpakpahi kɛ nɔ yami. O bu lɛ matsɛ pɛɛ nɛ a kɛ sika tsu kpakpa pee. <verse eid="PSA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4" />E bi wami se kɛmi kɛ si himi kpakpa, nɛ o wo ngɔ dloo lɛ. E wami ligbi ɔmɛ a se be poe gbleegbleegblee. <verse eid="PSA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5" />O ha e na biɛ kpakpa kɛ anunyami. Nɛ o wlua lɛ kɛ afɛu kɛ agboje níhi. <verse eid="PSA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6" />O dloo lɛ neneene bua jɔmi nɛ e ma na ngɛ o mi daa. <verse eid="PSA 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7" />Nɛ akɛnɛ matsɛ ɔ wo e hɛ kɛ fɔ Mawu nɔ he je ɔ, e be nɔ́ tɛe nɛ e be si hu nɔe ligbi ko, ejakaa nɔ nɛ e kpasa ji Mawu nɛ pe mawuhi kulaa a, e suɔmi nɛ e kɛ suɔ lɛ ɔ be nyagbe.<verse eid="PSA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8" />Oo neneene Tsɛ, o nine maa gbe o he nyɛli kɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ sume mo ɔ tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 21:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9-10" />Ke o je o he kpo ɔ, o hɛ mi la a ma kpata mɛ kɛ a bimɛ tsuo a he mi. <verse eid="PSA 21:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11" />Ejakaa nimli nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ o he ga toe, Tsaatsɛ, se e ma kpa bu a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12" />A maa tu fo nɛ a maa gbɛ kɛ fĩa ke a na o kɛ̃ɛ̃ ɔ nɛ o ka kɛ ma a nɔ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, wa ngɛ o yi jee ngɛ o anunyami he wami ɔ he. Wa maa po lahi nɛ wa kɛ kai o ni nguahi nɛ o pee ɔmɛ.<verse eid="PSA 21:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 22</para>
  <para style="s1">Nɔ nami he ngmlaa kɛ yi jemi la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1" />Ye Mawu, ye Mawu, mɛni he je nɛ o si mi? Mɛni he je nɛ o yi kɛ bua we mi, nɛ o ku tue kɛ fɔ ye nɔ́ nami ɔmɛ a nɔ? <verse eid="PSA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2" />I ngɛ mo tsɛe nyɔ kɛ pia, kɛ ye hɛ mi vo nyu, ke o ye kɛ bua mi, se klanaa. <verse eid="PSA 22:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3-4" />I le kaa Mawu nɛ ngɛ klɔuklɔu ji mo!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PSA 22:3-4">Yi jemi nɛ wa tsɛ ɔmɛ kɛ haa mo ɔ bɔle o matsɛ sɛ ɔ. A ngɔ a hɛ kɛ fɔ o nɔ, nɛ o je mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 22:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5" />A kpa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ mo nɛ o bu mɛ tue. A tsɛ we mo yaka gblee ngɛ a fimi be ɔmɛ a mi.<verse eid="PSA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6" />Se ami lɛɛ i pi nɔmlɔ hu, gɔgɔ kɛkɛ ji mi, nɛ nɔ ko bui mi. <verse eid="PSA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ yeɔ ye he fɛu faa! <verse eid="PSA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8" />A muɔɔ mi nɛ a biɔ ke, “Nɔ ɔ nɛ ke e wo e kɔmɔ kulaa kɛ fɔ Mawu nɔ ɔ ji enɛ ɔ lo? Nɔ ɔ nɛ ke Mawu naa e he bua jɔmi ɔ ji enɛ ɔ lo? Wa ma he e munyu ɔ maa ye, ke Mawu he e yi wami.”<verse eid="PSA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9" />Mo nɛ o ha ye nyɛ fɔ mi pɛpɛɛpɛ nɛ tɔtɔmi ko be. Nɛ o hyɛ mi kɛ je ye bimwɔyo mi. <verse eid="PSA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10" />I ngɔ ye hɛ ngɔ fɔ o nɔ kɛ je ligbi nɛ a fɔ mi ɔ, nɛ mo ji ye Mawu be fɛɛ be. <verse eid="PSA 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11" />Koo je ye he! Haomi na mi, nɛ i be yemi kɛ bualɔ ko.<verse eid="PSA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12" />He nyɛli nɛ he ngɛ gbeye bɔle mi kɛ kpe, a ngɛ kaa Bashan na kuhi. <verse eid="PSA 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13" />A pa nya mi kɛ ma ye ngɔ kaa jatahi nɛ ngɛ kee kɛ yaa nu lohwe. <verse eid="PSA 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14" />Ye he wami tsuo ta, kaa nyu nɛ kpa pue si. Ye wuhi tsuo je a bi a nya, nɛ ye tsui ngɛ sue. <verse eid="PSA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15" />Ye kuɛ si gbli kaa zu, nɛ ye lilɛ du ye nya mi, ejakaa o si mi kɛ ha gbenɔ. <verse eid="PSA 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16" />Ye he nyɛli, nimli yayamihi, a bɔle mi kaa gbehi; a ngɛ ye ninehi kɛ nanehi kɔɔe. <verse eid="PSA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17" />I ma nyɛ maa kane wuhi abɔ nɛ ngɛ ye nɔmlɔ tso ɔ mi. Hyɛ bɔ nɛ nimli yayami nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ mi kpee ha. <verse eid="PSA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18" />A fia asɔ ngɛ ye tade ɔmɛ a nɔ, nɛ a gba kɛ ha a he.<verse eid="PSA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, koo sa kɛ ya se. Oo Mawu, mo ji ye he wami, mo he ha mi mla! <verse eid="PSA 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20" />Mo je mi kɛ je gbenɔ mi. Mo kpɔ ye wami nɛ he jua wa a kɛ je nimli yayami nɛ ɔmɛ a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21" />Mo kpɔ mi kɛ je jata nɛ ɔmɛ a nya mi, nɛ o je mi kɛ je nga mi na nɛ ɔmɛ a koli kpɛ. Ee, Mawu ma he ye tsɛmi ɔ nɔ, nɛ e ma kpɔ mi.<verse eid="PSA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22" />I ma je o yi kɛ tsɔɔ ye nyɛmi ɔmɛ tsuo; nɛ i ma ye o nyakpɛ níhi nɛ o tsu ɔmɛ a he odase ngɛ asafo ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23" />I ma de ke, “Mo je Mawu yi, mo nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ o yee lɛ gbeye. Nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ bu e biɛ ɔ. Israel ma a tsuo, nyɛ je e yi. <verse eid="PSA 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24" />Ejakaa e bu ye haomi tsɛmi ɔ tue. E plɛ we e se kɛ wui mi. Benɛ i kpa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ lɛ ɔ, e nu nɛ e ba.”<verse eid="PSA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25" />I ma da si ngɛ o nimli ɔmɛ tsuo a hɛ mi nɛ i ma je o yi. I ma ye ye si womi ɔmɛ a nɔ ngɛ nihi tsuo nɛ buu o biɛ ɔ a hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26" />Ohiafo ɔmɛ maa ye ni nɛ a maa tɔ. Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ hlaa Mawu se blɔ ɔ, e maa na lɛ nɛ e ma je e biɛ ɔ yi. A tsui ma nya kɛ neneene bua jɔmi. <verse eid="PSA 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27" />Je ɔ tsuo maa na nɛ a maa kpale kɛ ba Mawu ngɔ. Jejeeje ɔ tsuo ma ja lɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28" />Ejakaa Tsaatsɛ Mawu ji Matsɛ; lɛ nɛ e yeɔ je ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29" />He nɔ woli kɛ humihi tsuo, nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ji adesa nɛ a fɔ lɛ nɛ e ma gbo ɔ, ma ja lɛ. <verse eid="PSA 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30" />Wa bi ɔmɛ hu ma sɔmɔ lɛ; ejakaa a maa nu e nyakpɛ ni peemi ni ɔmɛ a he ngɛ wa nya. <verse eid="PSA 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31" />Bimɛ nɛ a fɔ we lolo po maa nu nyakpɛ ni slɔɔtohi nɛ e tsu ha wɔ ɔmɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 23</para>
  <para style="s1">To kpakalɔ kpakpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1" />Yehowa ji ye kpakalɔ. Nɔ́ ko he be mi hiae.<verse eid="PSA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2" />Nga nɛ bɔ nɔ e haa i buu si nɛ i jɔɔ ye he ngɛ; nɛ nyu dɔhi nɛ a he jɔ he e kpakaa mi kɛ yaa. <verse eid="PSA 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3" />Ke i gbɔjɔ ɔ, e woɔ mi he wami. E kɛ mi fɔɔ blɔ dade nɔ ngɛ e biɛ ɔ he je.<verse eid="PSA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, ke i ngɛ nyɛɛe ngɛ gbenɔ dɔ ɔ mi ngɛ diblii ɔ mi tete i yi gbeye, ejakaa o ngɛ ye kasa nya. O kpakami tso ɔ kɛ o dema tso ɔ ngɛ ye he bue. A ji ye bua jɔmi níhi.<verse eid="PSA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5" />O ngmɛ mi okplɔɔ kɛ niye ni kpakpa ngɛ ye he nyɛli a hɛ mi. O peeɔ mi nubwɔ kɛ jɔɔmi babauu.<verse eid="PSA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6" />O mi mi jɔmi kɛ o mɔbɔ nami ɔ maa nyɛɛ ye se ye wami be ɔ kulaa. Nɛ i ma hi o ngɔ ngɛ o we ɔ kɛ ya neneene.<verse eid="PSA 23:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 24</para>
  <para style="s1">Anunyami Matsɛ ɔ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1" />Mawu nɔ́ ji je ɔ kɛ e mi nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2" />Lɛ nɛ e tsiɛ wo ɔmɛ kɛ ya se nɛ e ha nɛ zugba gbigbli je kpo.<verse eid="PSA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3" />Mɛnɔ maa kuɔ Mawu yoku ɔ, nɛ e maa sɛ e hi he ɔ? Nɛ mɛnɔ maa da Mawu hɛ mi? <verse eid="PSA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4" />Ja nihi nɛ a tsui mi tsɔ, a gbi nɔmlɔ, a yeɔ anɔkuale nɛ a kã we lakpa kita. <verse eid="PSA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5" />Mawu maa jɔɔ nimli nɛ ɔmɛ, nɛ e ma he a yi wami. Nɛ lɛ kɛ e maa wo mɛ nguɔ. <verse eid="PSA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6" />Nimli kaa kikɛ ɔmɛ nɛ a ngɛ he blɔ nɛ a daa Yakob Mawu ɔ hɛ mi nɛ a jaa lɛ.<verse eid="PSA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7" />Blema agbohi, nyɛ bli nɛ Anunyami Matsɛ ɔ nɛ e sɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8" />Mɛnɔ ji Anunyami Matsɛ nɛ ɔ? Lɛ ji Mawu Ope kɛ he walɔ nɛ a yi e nɔ ngɛ ta mi. <verse eid="PSA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9" />Nyɛ bli blema agbo ɔmɛ gbajaa nɛ Anunyami Matsɛ ɔ nɛ e sɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10" />Mɛnɔ ji Anunyami Matsɛ nɛ ɔ? Lɛ ji hiɔwe ta hwuli tsuo a Tatsɛ. Lɛ ji Anunyami Matsɛ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 25</para>
  <para style="s1">Haomi mi sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo nɛ i ngɛ kue fae ha. <verse eid="PSA 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2" />Ko kua mi. Mo o nɔ nɛ i wo ye hɛ ngɔ fo. Mo ko ha nɛ ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nine nɛ su ye nɔ. Ko ha nɛ a ye ye nɔ kunimi. <verse eid="PSA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3" />Ni nɛmɛ nɛ heɔ o nɔ yeɔ ɔ, a hɛ mi be si puee ligbi ko. Se nihi tsuo nɛ yeɔ nihi awi, nɛ a pee we fɔ yemi nɔ́ ko ɔ, a ma kpata a hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4" />Oo Mawu, moo tsɔɔ mi blɔ nɛ sa nɛ ma gu ɔ. Ha nɛ ma le o blɔ dadɛ ɔ nɛ ma nyɛɛ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5" />Mo kpaka mi nɛ o tsɔɔ mi ni, ejakaa mo ji Mawu nɛ heɔ ye yi wami. I be hɛ nɔ kami ko, ja mo kɛkɛ o mi nɛ i naa hɛ nɔ kami ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 25:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6-7" />Oo Tsaatsɛ, moo ku hɛ kɛ fɔ ye nihe mi yayami ɔmɛ a nɔ. Nɛ o ngɔ mɔbɔ nami kɛ yayami pami, suɔmi kɛ mi mi jɔmi hɛ ngmɛ kɛ hyɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 25:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8" />Mawu hi, nɛ dalɔ ji lɛ. E tsɔɔ blɔ tlali tsuo blɔ nɛ ji blɔ dadɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9" />E maa tsɔɔ nihi nɛ maa kpale kɛ ba e ngɔ kɛ he si bami ɔ blɔ nɛ da, nɛ hi. <verse eid="PSA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10" />E woɔ anɔkuale kɛ mi mi himi kɛ kpakaa nihi tsuo nɛ yeɔ e mlaa amɛ a nɔ, nɛ a buɔ e gbi tue ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11" />Se Mawu, ye he yayami ɔmɛ hiɛ tsɔ. Oo, moo ngɔ kɛ ke mi ngɛ o anunyami biɛ ɔ he je.<verse eid="PSA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12" />Jije nɔmlɔ nɛ yee Mawu gbeye nɛ buɔ lɛ tue ɔ ngɛ? Mawu maa tsɔɔ lɛ blɔ nɛ e gu.<verse eid="PSA 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13" />Mawu maa jɔɔ lɛ, nɛ e bimɛ maa ye zugba a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14" />Mawu kɛ nɔmlɔ huɛ bɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ ha nihi nɛ yee lɛ gbeye. Nɛ mɛ pɛ e haa nɛ a leɔ e si womi ɔmɛ a mi laami munyu ɔmɛ.<verse eid="PSA 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15" />I hyɛɔ Mawu blɔ daa nɛ e ye kɛ bua mi, ejakaa lɛ pɛ nɛ e ma nyɛ ma kpɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16" />Ba koo, Tsaatsɛ, nɛ o ba je o mɔbɔ nami ɔ kpo ngɔ tsɔɔ mi, ejakaa peepee ta ye he, nɛ i ngɛ haomi agbo mi. <verse eid="PSA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17" />Se ye haomi ɔmɛ a nya ngɛ wae. Oo, mo je mi kɛ je kulaa mi. <verse eid="PSA 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18" />Moo bu ye kɔmɔ yemi ɔmɛ tue, nɛ o nu ye nɔ́ yeyee ɔmɛ a he, nɛ o wo ye he yayami ɔmɛ tsuo ngɔ ke mi. <verse eid="PSA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19" />Moo hyɛ bɔ nɛ ye he nyɛli hiɛ ha, kɛ bɔ nɛ a sume mi kulaa ha. <verse eid="PSA 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20" />Mo kpɔ mi kɛ je a dɛ mi nɛ o he ye yi wami. Oo, ko ha nɛ a de ke i he o nɔ ye yaka gu.<verse eid="PSA 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21" />Mo ha mi dami kɛ juɛmi kpakpa nɛ a pee ye he bumi níhi, ejakaa i ngɛ mo blɔ hyɛe nɛ o baa ye yi, <verse eid="PSA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22" />nɛ o kpɔ Israel kɛ je e haomi ɔmɛ tsuo a mi.<verse eid="PSA 25:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 26</para>
  <para style="s1">Bemi yemi he pɛɛ kpami sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo po sanehi nɛ a kɛ fo ye nɔ ɔ tsuo a mi, ejakaa i bɔ mɔde nɛ ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ, nɛ i wo ye hɛ ngɔ fɔ o nɔ kulaa. <verse eid="PSA 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2" />Moo ka mi nɛ o hyɛ ha, nɛ o maa na ye anɔkuale ɔ. Moo hyɛ ye yi mi tomi ɔmɛ kɛ ye tsui mi hulɔ. <verse eid="PSA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3" />Ejakaa o mɔbɔ nami kɛ o anɔkuale ɔ ngɛ ye hɛ mi daa. <verse eid="PSA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4" />I kɛ nɔ sisili kɛ nya enyɔtsɛmɛ bɔɛ, ejakaa lakpatsɛmɛ kɛ osatotsɛmɛ ji mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5" />I kɛ yayami peeli bɔɛ, nɛ i sume a sihi hehi hulɔ. <verse eid="PSA 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6" />I fɔɔ ye dɛ kɛ tsɔɔ kaa i pee we tɔmi nɔ́ ko, nɛ i baa o bɔ sami la tɛ ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7" />I laa si nami la kɛ yeɔ o nyakpɛ ni peemi ni ɔmɛ tsuo a he odase.<verse eid="PSA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8" />Tsaatsɛ, i suɔ o we ɔ, he nɛ o hɛ mi nyami kɛ kpɛmi hii ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9-10" />Ko wo mi ngɔ piɛ yayami peeli kɛ nɔ gbeli a he. Nihi nɛ tee si kɛ woɔ nihi nɛ pee we nɔ́ ko, nɛ a heɔ nyɔ mi ni ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 26:9-10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11" />Oo Mawu i be kaa mɛ. I bɔɔ mɔde kaa ma nyɛɛ dami blɔ luluulu ɔ nɔ, nɛ ma pee nɔ́ nɛ da. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, moo na mi mɔbɔ nɛ o he ye yi wami.<verse eid="PSA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12" />Ma hɛ mi nɛ i jeɔ o yi ngɛ, nɛ i yeɔ odase paa kaa mo nɛ o ha nɛ i daa si.<verse eid="PSA 26:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 27</para>
  <para style="s1">Kunimi yemi ngɛ Mawu mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1" />Mawu ji ye kane kɛ ye yi wami nami; mɛnɔ nɛ i ma ye gbeye? Lɛ ji ye tɛ sa, mɛnɔ po ma ye gbeye? <verse eid="PSA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2" />Ke dikali te si ba na mi ɔ, a ma tɛ nɔ́ nɛ a maa nɔ si. <verse eid="PSA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3" />Ke ta ngua ko ba na mi tete po ɔ, ye tsui be poe, ejakaa i le kaa Mawu ma he mi.<verse eid="PSA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4" />Nɔ́ kake nɛ i biɔ Mawu daa, nɛ lɔ ɔ ji ye hiami nɔ́ pe kulaa ji kaa, ma hi e we ɔ kɛ sɔlemi, nɛ ma hi e hɛ mi ye wami ligbi ɔmɛ tsuo, nɛ ma na e himi kɛ e anunyami ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5" />Lejɛ ɔ nɛ i ma hi, nɛ e ma wo mi ngɔ laa ngɛ haomi be mi. E ma wo mi ngɔ to tɛ sa nɛ ya hiɔmi nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6" />He nyɛlɔ ko nine be ye nɔ sue ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. Nɛ i ma sã bɔ ha lɛ kɛ ye nya he yi jemi la kɛ bua jɔmi, <verse eid="PSA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7" />Tsaatsɛ, moo bu ye kue fami tue. Naa mi mɔbɔ nɛ o ye kɛ bua mi.<verse eid="PSA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8" />I nu he ngɛ ye mumi mi lokoo be nɛ o tsɛ nɛ o de ke, “Oo ye bimɛ, nyɛ hla ye se blɔ.” Nɛ ye mumi kplɛɛ nɛ e he nɔ de ke, “Tsaatsɛ, i ma.”<verse eid="PSA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9" />Oo, mo ko wo o hɛ mi ngɔ laa mi be mi nɛ i ngɛ mo hlae. Ko wo abofu kɛ fie o sɔmɔlɔ ɔ. O ye kɛ bua mi hyɛ ngɛ ye kahi slɔɔto ɔmɛ a mi; ko si mi piɔ. Oo Mawu, ye yi wami helɔ, ko kua mi. <verse eid="PSA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10" />Ejakaa ke ye tsɛ kɛ ye nyɛ ngmɛɛ ye he ɔ, mo nɛ o ma he mi nɛ o maa jɔɔ ye bua.<verse eid="PSA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11" />Tsaatsɛ, moo tsɔɔ mi nɔ́ nɛ o suɔ nɛ ma pee, ejakaa he nyɛli wo ka ngɛ mlɛe nɛ a ye mi awi. <verse eid="PSA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12" />Ko ha nɛ a nine nɛ su ye nɔ; ko ha nɛ ma sɛ a dɛ mi. Ejakaa nɔ́ nɛ i pee we hu a ke i pee, nɛ a ngɛ ye he ga toe be fɛɛ be. <verse eid="PSA 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13" />I ngɛ Mawu blɔ hyɛe nɛ e je mi, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma na e mi mi himi ɔ ekohu be mi nɛ i ngɛ wami mi nɛ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14" />Moo to tsui, moo hyɛ Mawu blɔ nɛ e ma he o yi wami. Moo pee kɔ. Moo hyɛ lɛ blɔ nɛ e maa ye kɛ bua mo .<verse eid="PSA 27:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 28</para>
  <para style="s1">David sɔle kɛ ha kpɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1" />Tsaatsɛ, i ngɛ mo pɛɛ kpae nɛ o he mi; ejakaa mo ji ye tɛ sa, he nɛ ye yi naa wami ngɛ. Ke o he we nɔ ɔ, lɛɛ ye kɔni mi ma jɔ nɛ ye yi maa ta. <verse eid="PSA 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2" />I wo ye ninehi a nɔ kɛ ngɛ o he klɔuklɔu ɔ tsɔɔe, nɛ i ngɛ mo pɛɛ kpae ke o ye kɛ bua mi. Oo Tsaatsɛ, moo bu ye pɛɛ kpami ɔ tue.<verse eid="PSA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3" />Ko wo mi kɛ piɛ yi mi wali ɔmɛ nɛ a nya mi munyu ngɔɔ, se dika ngɛ a tsui mi ɔ a he nɛ o gbla ye tue. <verse eid="PSA 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4" />Moo gbla a tue bɔ nɛ sa mɛ ngɛ a ni peemi ni ɔmɛ a he; moo wo a dika ni peemi ni ɔmɛ a he hiɔ bɔ nɛ sa. Moo wo a yi mi wami ni ɔmɛ kulaa a he hiɔ. <verse eid="PSA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5" />A bui Mawu ha nɔ́ ko nɔ ko; a bui níhi nɛ e tsu loo níhi nɛ e bɔ ɔ; nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Mawu maa ku mɛ kɛ pue si kaa bɔ nɛ a kuɔ tsu momohi nɛ a mɛ mɛ hu ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6" />Oo, nyɛ je Mawu yi, ejakaa e nu ye kue fami ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7" />Lɛ nɛ e buu ye he nɛ e baa ye yi. I ngɔ ye hɛ kɛ fɔ e nɔ nɛ e ye kɛ bua mi. I na bua jɔmi ngɛ ye tsui mi nɛ i je e yi kɛ yi jemi lahi. <verse eid="PSA 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8" />Mawu buu e nimli ɔmɛ a he, nɛ e haa e matsɛ ɔ nɛ lɛ nitsɛ e pɔ lɛ nu ɔ yeɔ kunimi.<verse eid="PSA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9" />Tsaatsɛ, mo fa o nimli ɔmɛ a he, nɛ o jɔɔ ni nɛmɛ nɛ ji mo nitsɛ o ni ɔmɛ. Mo kpaka mɛ kaa to hyɛlɔ kpakaa e tohi, nɛ o hɛɛ mɛ daa ngɛ o dɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 28:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 29</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu he wami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1" />Nyɛ je Mawu yi, nyɛ e bɔfo ɔmɛ; nyɛ je e he wami kɛ e anunyami ɔ yi. <verse eid="PSA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2" />Nyɛ je Tsɛ ɔ yi ngɛ e anunyami biɛ ɔ he. Nyɛɛ ba e hɛ mi kɛ níhi nɛ a he tsɔ.<verse eid="PSA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3" />Mawu gbi ngɛ jijie ngɛ bɔ kuu ɔmɛ a mi. Anunyami Mawu ɔ ngɛ gbi woe ngɛ hiɔwe. <verse eid="PSA 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4" />He wami ngɛ e gbi ɔ mi; e ngɛ jijie kɛ agbo jemi. <verse eid="PSA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5" />Gbi ɔ huleɔ sida tso ɔmɛ, nɛ e fɛɛ Lebanon tso agbo ɔmɛ a mi. <verse eid="PSA 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6" />E hosoo Lebanon kɛ Sirion yoku ɔmɛ, nɛ e haa a tuu kaa na bihi. <verse eid="PSA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7" />Mawu gbi pɛ ngɛ hiɔmi oslabai ɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8" />E gbi ɔ pɛ kɛ nyɛɛ nga a nɔ nɛ e ha nɛ Kades zugba a hoso. <verse eid="PSA 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu gbi hosoo nɛ e hiaa tso nguahi kɛ pueɔ si. E haa nɛ hue ɔmɛ a mi peeɔ paa. A huanyaa ngɛ e hosomi ɔ nya. Se nɔ tsuaa nɔ kpaa ngmlaa ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ a deɔ ke, “Anunyami, anunyami ha Mawu!”<verse eid="PSA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10" />Ngɛ nyu jemi be ɔ mi ɔ, Mawu tsɔɔ nɔ yemi he wami nɛ e hɛɛ ngɛ adebɔ níhi kulaa nɔ. Amlɔ nɛ ɔ hu e ngɛ e he wami ɔ tsɔɔe lolo. <verse eid="PSA 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11" />E ma ha e we bi ɔmɛ he wami. Nɛ e ma ha a na tue mi jɔmi.<verse eid="PSA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 30</para>
  <para style="s1">Oslaa mi jemi he sina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, i ngɛ o yi jee, ejakaa o he ye yi wami kɛ je ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a dɛ mi. O ha we nɛ a ye ye nɔ kunimi. <verse eid="PSA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2" />Oo Tsaatsɛ, ye Mawu, i kpa mo pɛɛ ke o tsa mi, nɛ o ha i na he wami ekohu. <verse eid="PSA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3" />O kpale mi kɛ je gbenɔ muɔ nya, kɛ je gbenɔ nitsɛ dɛ mi, nɛ o ha mi wami ekohu.<verse eid="PSA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4" />Oo, nyɛ la nɛ nyɛ je e yi, nyɛ he tsɔli ɔmɛ. Nyɛ kai níhi nɛ e tsu ha nyɛ ɔmɛ, nɛ nyɛ je e biɛ klɔuklɔu ɔ yi. <verse eid="PSA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5" />E abofu se kɛ we; nɛ e mɔbɔ nami ngɛ daa. Wa ma fo ya nyɔnyɔɔnyɔ se mɔtu pɛ bua jɔmi ba.<verse eid="PSA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6-7" />Benɛ i na ye he ɔ, i de ke, “Enɛ ɔ lɛɛ e se be poe. Nɔ́ ko be ye nya tsie amlɔ nɛ ɔ. Mawu na mi mɔbɔ. E ngɔ mi kɛ da si kpɛii kaa yoku.” Tsaatsɛ, kɛkɛ nɛ o ngmɛɛ ye he, nɛ o po o jɔɔmi ɔ se ngɛ ye nɔ. Kɛkɛ nɛ kã je ye mi nɛ gbeye nu mi. <verse eid="PSA 30:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8" />Oo Mawu, i kpa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ mo, nɛ i fa kue ha mo hluu nɛ i bi ke, <verse eid="PSA 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9" />“Oo Tsaatsɛ, mɛni se o ma na ngɛ ye gbenɔ he? Kɛ ma pee kɛ je o yi kɛ ha ye huɛmɛ kɛɛ? Kɛ ye gbogboe maa pee ngɛ muɔ mi kɛ ye o anɔkuale yemi ɔ he odase kɛ ha je ɔ kɛɛ? <verse eid="PSA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10" />Moo bu mi tue, Mawu, nɛ o na mi mɔbɔ, nɛ o ye kɛ bua mi.” <verse eid="PSA 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e ha nɛ ye aywilɛho yemi ɔ plɛ bua jɔmi. E tsake ye aywilɛho yemi tade ɔmɛ nɛ e ngɔ nyami tadehi kɛ wo mi, <verse eid="PSA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12" />konɛ ma la bua jɔmi lahi kɛ ha Mawu, pe bɔ nɛ i ma hwɔ si ngɛ gbogboe muɔ mi dii. Oo Tsaatsɛ ye Mawu, i ma na mo si daa.<verse eid="PSA 30:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 31</para>
  <para style="s1">Haomi be mi sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1" />Neneene Tsɛ, mo kɛkɛ o nɔ i heɔ yeɔ. Ko ha nɛ ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a ye ye nɔ. Mo kpɔ mi, ejakaa mo ji Mawu nɛ peeɔ nɔ́ dadɛ be fɛɛ be. <verse eid="PSA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2" />Mo ha ye tsɛmi ɔ heto mla. Moo bu ye pɛɛ kpami ɔ tue, nɛ o pee o he tɛ sa ha mi nɛ ma laa ye he kɛ je ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3" />Mo ji ye tɛ sa kɛ ye mwɔ, mo kudɔ mi kɛ je oslaa nɛ ɔ mi nɛ o kɛ wo o biɛ ɔ hɛ mi nyami. <verse eid="PSA 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4" />Mo kudɔ ye nane kɛ je klama amɛ nɛ ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ tsɔ mi ɔ a he. Ejakaa mo ji ye laami he. <verse eid="PSA 31:4" /><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5-6" />I to ye klaa kɛ wo o dɛ mi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PSA 31:5-6">O kpɔ mi, mo Mawu nɛ o yeɔ o si womi nɔ. Mo pɛ i sɔmɔɔ. O sume nihi nɛ jaa wɔhi. <verse eid="PSA 31:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7" />Ngɛ o mɔbɔ nami ɔ he je ɔ, i na bua jɔmi, ejakaa o bu ye haomi ɔmɛ a he tue nɛ o na pimi nɛ ye susuma ngɛ pie ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8" />O ha we he blɔ nɛ ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nine nɛ su ye nɔ; o ha mi sida he nɛ ma kɛ fa ye he.<verse eid="PSA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9-10" />Oo Mawu, moo na mi mɔbɔ ngɛ ye haomi ɔ mi. I fo ya hluu nɛ ye hɛ ngmɛhi tsu ngɛ ye yi he; kɔmɔ yemi ha nɛ i pee hiɔtsɛ. Kɔmɔ yemi ha nɛ i ngɛ he lo tae, nɛ ye wami be ɔ ngɛ kpiti pee. Ye he yayami ɔmɛ ha nɛ i gbɔjɔ. Nɛ i fɔɔ si kɛ aywilɛho kɛ zo. <verse eid="PSA 31:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11" />Ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ kɛ ye kasa nyatsɛmɛ kɛ ye huɛmɛ po ngɛ ye he fɛu yee. A sume nɛ a na mi. Nɛ ke a kɛ mi kpe ɔ, a plɛɔ a hɛ mi kɛ fɔɔ he kpa. <verse eid="PSA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ hɛ je ye nɔ kaa nɔ nɛ gbo. I pee kaa buɛ kokoe nɛ a sake kɛ fɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13" />I nu lakpa nɛ ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ ngɛ yee ngɛ ye he ɔ. He fɛɛ he nɛ i gu ɔ, i ngɛ gbeye yee, ejakaa a ngɛ ye he ga toe nɛ a maa gbe mi.<verse eid="PSA 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14-15" />Se Tsaatsɛ, mo o nɔ nɛ i wo ye hɛ ngɔ fa. I de ke, “Mo pɛ ji ye Mawu; ye be ɔmɛ kulaa ngɛ o dɛ mi. Mo kpɔ mi kɛ je ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ kɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ mi hlae nɛ a ma puɛ ɔ a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 31:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16" />Moo na o sɔmɔlɔ ɔ mɔbɔ ekohu; mo he ye yi wami, ejakaa o mi mi jɔ saminya. <verse eid="PSA 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17" />Mawu, mo nɛ i ngɛ tsɛe, ko ha nɛ ye hɛ mi nɛ pue si. Dikali ɔmɛ lɛɛ mo ha nɛ a hɛ mi nɛ pue si ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ a heɔ yeɔ ɔ he je; nɛ o ha nɛ a ya hwɔ ngɛ a gbogboe muɔ ɔmɛ a mi. <verse eid="PSA 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18" />Ha nɛ lakpa yeli ɔmɛ, he nɔ woli kɛ he woli ɔmɛ nɛ gbee dali a he guɛ ɔ, a nya nɛ jɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19" />Oo, o mi mi jɔmi ɔ kle kɛ ha nihi nɛ deɔ faii ke o ma kpɔ mɛ ɔ. Ejakaa o ngɔ jɔɔmi babauu kɛ to ha nihi nɛ heɔ o nɔ yeɔ nɛ a buu mo ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20" />Moo ngɔ nihi nɛ o suɔ mɛ ɔ ngɔ laa ngɛ o hɔ̃ ɔ sisi, nɛ o nine nɛ bu a he kɛ je a he nyɛli a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21" />A jɔɔ Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ejakaa e ha nɛ i na kaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ ye he bue daa kaa mwɔ he gbogbo. <verse eid="PSA 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22" />Ye nya sɔ tsɔ benɛ i de ke, “Nutsɔ ɔ kua mi” ɔ, ejakaa o bu ye pɛɛ kpami ɔ tue nɛ o ha mi heto.<verse eid="PSA 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23" />Oo, nyɛɛ suɔ Mawu, nyɛ e he tsɔli ɔmɛ tsuo, ejakaa Mawu buu nihi nɛ yeɔ lɛ anɔkuale ɔ a he, nɛ e kɛ mi mi fumi gblaa nihi kulaa nɛ kuaa lɛ kɛ he nɔ womi ɔ a tue. <verse eid="PSA 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ nya nɛ nyɛ na kã, ke ji Mawu nɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɔ nyɛ hɛ kɛ fɔ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 31:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 32</para>
  <para style="s1">Tsui tsakemi yiblii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1" />Ni nɛmɛ nɛ a wo a he yayami kɛ a tɔmi ɔmɛ kulaa ngɔ ke mɛ ɔ, bua jɔmi ji a nɔ́. E ji bua jɔmi babauu kɛ ha nɔ ko nɛ a laa e yayamihi a nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2" />E ji he jɔmi kɛ ha nihi nɛ jajeɔ a he yayamihi kɛ tsɔɔ ngɛ anɔkuale mi, nɛ Mawu ngɔɔ kɛ kee mɛ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3" />Be ko nɛ be ɔ, i ngɔɛ kaa yayami peelɔ ji mi. Nɛ ye lakpa yemi ɔ ha nɛ ye ni pee mɔbɔ, nɛ ye kɔni mi jɔ. <verse eid="PSA 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4" />O gbla ye tue hluu nyɔ kɛ pia, nɛ ye he wami kulaa mii kaa bɔ nɛ níhi gbliɔ ngɛ pu tsomi be mi. <verse eid="PSA 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5" />Benɛ i jaje ye yayami ɔmɛ tsuo kɛ tsɔɔ mo nɛ i kpa a nɔ laami ɔ, i de ye he ke, “I ma jaje ye yayami ɔmɛ kɛ tsɔɔ Mawu.” Nɛ o wo kɛ ke mi. Ye tɔmi ɔmɛ kulaa a se po.<verse eid="PSA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i ngɛ dee ke, nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ Mawu nɔ yeɔ ɔ, e jaje e tɔmi ɔmɛ kɛ tsɔɔ lɛ, ke e na kaa e tɔ ɔ, ngɛ be mi nɛ be ngɛ nɛ a maa ngɔ kɛ ke lɛ ɔ. Nɛ ke e pee ja a, e hɛ mi be kpatae.<verse eid="PSA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7" />Mo ji ye laami he ngɛ je mi haomihi tsuo a mi. Nɛ mo o kudɔɔ mi nɛ ma ko sɛ haomi mi. O ha nɛ i laa kunimi yemi lahi. <verse eid="PSA 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8" />Tsaatsɛ de ke, “I ma tsɔɔ mo wami blɔ kpakpa a nɛ o nyɛɛ nɔ. I ma wo mo ga, nɛ i ma hyɛ o nɔ yami. <verse eid="PSA 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9" />Koo pee o he kaa teji loo okpɔngɔ, nɛ ja a wo e nya mi ga kɛ e se kpa loko ji e kplɛɔ nɛ a kpakaa lɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10" />Yi wu tsotsɛmɛ naa nɔ́ babauu, se Mawu suɔmi nɛ se pui ɔ buu ni nɛmɛ nɛ heɔ e nɔ yeɔ ɔ a he. <verse eid="PSA 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11" />Nyɛ dali nyɛ nya nɛ nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ nyɛ he; nyɛ nihi nɛ nyɛ peeɔ e suɔmi nya ni ɔ, nyɛ hwɔ lele.<verse eid="PSA 32:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 33</para>
  <para style="s1">Asafo la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1" />Nyɛ dali kulaa nyɛ kpa ngmlaa kɛ bua jɔmi kɛ je Mawu yi, ejakaa e sa kaa a je e yi. <verse eid="PSA 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2" />Nyɛɛ fia yi jemi la ngɔngɔɛhi ngɛ saku kɛ kpa saku nɔ kɛ ha Mawu. <verse eid="PSA 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3" />Nyɛɛ po yi jemi la hehi nɛ nyɛɛ fia ngɛ kpa saku nɔ kɛ bua jɔmi kɛ ha lɛ.<verse eid="PSA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4" />Ejakaa anɔkuale munyuhi ji Mawu munyu ɔmɛ, nɛ e sa kaa wa he nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e pee ɔ waa ye. <verse eid="PSA 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5" />E suɔ nɔ́ nɛ da kɛ nɔ́ nɛ hi. E suɔmi ɔ hyi je ɔ tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6" />E tu munyu kɛkɛ nɛ hiɔwe ɔ bɔ ade kɛ e mi hlami kɛ dodoe ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7" />E bɔ wo ɔmɛ nɛ e bua a nya kɛ to a to he.<verse eid="PSA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8" />Nyɛ nimli nɛ ngɛ je ɔ mi tsuo, nyumuhi, yihi kɛ jokuɛwi, nyɛɛ ye Mawu gbeye nɛ nyɛ wo bumi kɛ ha lɛ. <verse eid="PSA 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9" />Ejakaa e tu munyu kɛkɛ nɛ je ɔ bɔ ade. E fã, nɛ e ba je kpo. <verse eid="PSA 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10" />E haa nɛ majemaje ɔ nɛ sume lɛ ɔ tsuo a yi mi tomi ɔmɛ peeɔ yaka. <verse eid="PSA 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11" />Se lɛ nitsɛ e blɔ nya tomi ɔmɛ ngɛ daa. E yi mi tomi ɔmɛ tsakee we, a ngɛ ja a nɔuu kɛ ha yi nɔhi kulaa.<verse eid="PSA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12" />A jɔɔ ma nɛ e Mawu ji Yehowa, nɛ e hla e mi bimɛ ngɔ pee lɛ nitsɛ e nimli. <verse eid="PSA 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13" />Mawu fɔɔ hɛ kɛ jee hiɔwe lokoo nɛ e hyɛɔ adesahi a bimɛ. <verse eid="PSA 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14" />E naa je ɔ mi nimli ɔmɛ tsuo kɛ jee e sihi he ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15" />Lɛ nɛ e bɔ a tsuihi nɛ e naa nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a ngɛ pee ɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16" />Sojahi abɔ kɛ a ta hwumi ni kpakpahi be matsɛ ko yi wami nyɛe ma he. Ejakaa tsa pi nɔmlɔ he wami kɛkɛ nɔ nɛ a guɔ kɛ heɔ e yi wami. <verse eid="PSA 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17" />Ta hwumi okpɔngɔ kɛkɛ be hae nɛ a ye kunimi, e ngɛ he wami se e be yi wami nyɛe ma he.<verse eid="PSA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18" />Mawu hɛ ngɛ nihi nɛ buu lɛ ɔmɛ a he, nɛ nihi nɛ wo a hɛ ngɔ fɔ e suɔmi kɛ mɔbɔ nami ɔ nɔ ɔ, e baa a yi daa. <verse eid="PSA 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19" />E kpɔɔ mɛ kɛ jee gbenɔ dɛ mi, nɛ e baa a yi ngɛ hwɔ be mi. <verse eid="PSA 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20" />Tsɛ ɔ pɛ nɔ wa ngɔ wa hɛ kɛ fɔ nɛ e he wa yi wami. Lɛ pɛ e ma nyɛ ye kɛ bua wɔ nɛ e maa bu wa he. <verse eid="PSA 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21" />Wa bua jɔɔ ngɛ Mawu mi, ejakaa e biɛ klɔuklɔu ɔ nɔ wa ngɔ wa hɛ kɛ fɔ. <verse eid="PSA 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo ko ha nɛ o suɔmi ɔ se nɛ e po ngɛ wa nɔ, ejakaa mo kɛkɛ o nɔ nɛ wa ngɔ wa hɛ kɛ fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 33:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 34</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu yi jemi la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1" />I ma na Mawu si daa ngɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ mi, nɛ e yi jemi be ye nya mi tae ligbi ko. <verse eid="PSA 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2" />I ma fiã kɛ fɔ e mi mi jɔmi nɛ e ngɛ kɛ ha mi ɔ nɔ. Nihi kulaa nɛ ngɛ nɔ́ nae ɔ, a na tsui. <verse eid="PSA 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3" />Nyɛ ha nɛ waa pee kake kɛ je Mawu yi, nɛ waa wo e biɛ ɔ hɛ mi nyami.<verse eid="PSA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4" />I kpa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ lɛ nɛ e he mi nɔ. E je mi kɛ je gbeye nɛ i ngɛ yee ɔ kulaa mi. <verse eid="PSA 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5" />Nihi nɛ woɔ a hɛ mi nɔ nɛ a hyɛɔ lɛ ɔ, a hɛ mi kpɛɔ, nɛ a hɛ mi be si pue ligbi ko. <verse eid="PSA 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6" />Nyumu ohiafo nɛ ɔ kpa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ Yehowa, nɛ Yehowa bu lɛ tue nɛ e je lɛ kɛ je e nɔ́ nami ɔmɛ a mi. <verse eid="PSA 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7" />Ejakaa Mawu Bɔfo ɔ buu ni nɛmɛ nɛ buɔ lɛ tue ɔ a he, nɛ e kpɔɔ mɛ kɛ jeɔ haomihi a mi.<verse eid="PSA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8" />Nyɛ wo nyɛ he kɛ ha Mawu nɛ nyɛɛ hyɛ ha, nɛ nyɛ maa na kaa e hi. A jɔɔ nihi nɛ saa we ngɛ e ngɔ. <verse eid="PSA 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9" />Ke Mawu nɔ ji mo ɔ, moo ye lɛ gbeye, ejakaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ peeɔ ja a, e nine suu nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ he ngɛ lɛ hiae ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10" />Jata bimɛ po hwɔ yee mɛ, se nɔ́ kpakpa ko he hia we nihi nɛ yee Mawu gbeye ɔmɛ.<verse eid="PSA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11" />Ye bimɛ, nyɛ ba bu mi tue nɛ ma tsɔɔ nyɛ nɔ́ he je nɛ Mawu nɔ hemi kɛ yemi kɛ e gbeye yemi he hia. <verse eid="PSA 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12" />Mɛnɔ suɔ je mi si himi kpakpa kɛ wami se kɛmi? <verse eid="PSA 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13" />Moo hyɛ o lilɛ saminya, nɛ o hyɛ o he ngɛ lakpa yemi he. <verse eid="PSA 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14" />Moo jɔɔ yayamihi nɛ o le nɛ o peeɔ ɔ tsuo, nɛ o pee kpakpa. Bɔɔ mɔde nɛ o kɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ hi si ngɛ tue mi jɔmi mi. Moo di enɛ ɔ se wawɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15" />Mawu hɛ ngɛ dali a he nɛ e buɔ a tsɛmi tue. <verse eid="PSA 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16" />Mawu to e yi mi nɛ e ma kpata yayami peeli ɔmɛ a hɛ mi, nɛ a be mɛ kaie tete po ngɛ zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17" />Dali ɔmɛ tsɛɔ lɛ nɛ e buɔ mɛ tue nɛ e heɔ a yi wami kɛ jee haomi mi.<verse eid="PSA 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18" />Mawu ngɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ haomi mi ɔ a kasa nya kpakpaakpa; nɛ e heɔ nihi nɛ a he yayami dɔɔ mɛ ɔ a yi wami. <verse eid="PSA 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19" />Nɔmlɔ kpakpa a, e yi e he kɛ ji haomi fɛɛ haomi mi, lɛ hu haomihi baa e nɔ. Se Mawu yeɔ kɛ buaa lɛ ngɛ eko fɛɛ eko mi. <verse eid="PSA 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20" />Mawu buu e he tete kɛ jee oslaa mi nɛ e wu ko kui.<verse eid="PSA 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21" />Amanehlu maa ba dikali ɔmɛ a nɔ bɔ fɛɛ bɔ nɛ ji; nɛ a maa gbla nihi nɛ nyɛɛ dalɔ ɔ a tue wawɛɛ. <verse eid="PSA 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22" />Se nihi nɛ sɔmɔɔ Mawu ɔ, e ma kpɔ mɛ; nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ saa we ngɛ e ngɔ ɔ, a maa ngɔ e he kɛ ke lɛ.<verse eid="PSA 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 35</para>
  <para style="s1">Pɛɛ kpami kɛ ha kpɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo je o hɛ mi kɛ pi ni nɛmɛ nɛ te si kɛ wo mi ɔ; nɛ o kɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ kɛ mi ngɛ fiae ɔ nɛ fia. <verse eid="PSA 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2" />Mo wo o tu tɛ pulemi nɔ́ ɔ, kɛ o ta hwumi nɔ́ ɔmɛ nɛ o ba kpɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3" />Mo wo akplɔ ɔ nɔ nɛ o kɛ pule ye he, ejakaa ye se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ na mi ta. Mo de ye susuma ke o ma he mi kɛ je a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4" />Mo ha nɛ zo nɛ gbe ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ hlae nɛ a kpata ye hɛ mi ɔ. Mo ha nɛ a kpale, nɛ a juɛmi nɛ futu. <verse eid="PSA 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5" />Ha kɔɔhiɔ nɛ fli mɛ kɛ mane kaa dudusa, nɛ Mawu Bɔfo ɔ nɛ fie mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6" />Mo ha a blɔ nɔ nɛ wo diblii nɛ e nɔ nɛ sane, nɛ Mawu Bɔfo ɔ nɛ nyɛɛ a se kɛ fo. <verse eid="PSA 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7" />Ejakaa i pee we mɛ yayami ko, se a tsɔ mi klama, nɛ i pee we mɛ nɔ́ ko se a tsua muɔ voo ngɛ ye blɔ mi ha mi nɛ ma nɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8" />Ha nɛ a hɛ mi nɛ kpata tlukaa, mɛ nitsɛmɛ a ya amɛ nɛ du mɛ.<verse eid="PSA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9" />Se ami lɛɛ ye bua maa jɔ ngɛ Mawu mi, ejakaa e ma he ye yi wami. <verse eid="PSA 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10" />I ma je e yi kɛ ye tsui kulaa, nɛ i ma bi ke, “Mɛnɔ kɛ mo sɔ ngɛ hiɔwe loo zugba a nɔ kulaa? Mɛnɔ hu buu ni nɛmɛ nɛ gbɔjɔ ɔmɛ a he kɛ jee he wali ɔmɛ a dɛ mi, nɛ e buu ni nɛmɛ nɛ be nɔ ko ɔmɛ a he kɛ jee ni nɛmɛ nɛ waa mɛ yi kpɛti ɔmɛ a dɛ mi, kɛ ohiafo ɔmɛ hu kɛ jee ojo fiali ɔmɛ a dɛ mi?”<verse eid="PSA 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11" />Nimli yayahi ngɛ lakpa odase yee ngɛ ye he; a po munyuhi nɛ i li he nɔ́ ko kɛ fɔ ye nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12" />I pee mɛ kpakpa, se a pee mi yayami kɛ to nane mi. Ye nane ngɛ gbenɔ muɔ nya. <verse eid="PSA 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13" />Benɛ a be he wami ɔ, i bu kpekpe nɛ i hi ngma, nɛ i sɔle kɛ kpa Nutsɔ ɔ pɛɛ nɛ e ha nɛ a na he wami ekohu, se Mawu bui tue. <verse eid="PSA 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14" />Ye ni pee mɔbɔmɔbɔ kaa nɔ́ nɛ ye nyɛ loo ye huɛ loo ye nyɛminyumu ji nɔ nɛ ngɛ gboe. <verse eid="PSA 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15" />Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ nɛ i sɛ haomi mi ɔ, a bua jɔ; a kɛ nibwɔhi nɛ i li po kpe kutuu kɛ ngɛ ye he sieku yee. <verse eid="PSA 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16" />A kɛ ma a mi nihi nɛ a hɛ mi be anunyami ko hii si nɛ a ngɛ mi gbiɛe kɛ ngɛ a be puɛe.<verse eid="PSA 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mɛni be nɛ o maa hyɛ mɛ nɛ a puɛ mi kɛ ya si? Mo kpɔ mi ngɛ jata nɛ ɔmɛ a dɛ nɛ o he ye yi wami. <verse eid="PSA 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18" />Mo he ye yi wami, nɛ i ma na mo si ngɛ asafo ɔ kulaa hɛ mi, nɛ i ma je o yi ngɛ kpe nguahi a mi.<verse eid="PSA 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19" />Ko ha ye he nyɛli nɛ i pee we mɛ nɔ́ ko se a kɛ mi ngɛ hwue ɔ nɛ a ye ye nɔ. Mo ko ha nɛ a ye ye he fɛu kaa i nɔ si. <verse eid="PSA 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20" />A tui tue mi jɔmi kɛ kpakpa peemi he munyu, se mohu a ngɛ nihi nɛ a li nɔ́ ko nɛ a ngɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a he mɔde bɔe ɔ a he ga tsɔe. <verse eid="PSA 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21" />A kpa ngmlaa nɛ a de ke, “Ahaa! Wa na yayami nɛ o pee ɔ kɛ wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa hɛ ngmɛ.” <verse eid="PSA 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22" />Se Nutsɔ, mo nitsɛ o le nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ. Mo ko pee kɔ, nɛ mo ko si mi.<verse eid="PSA 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23" />Oo ye Tsɛ kɛ ye Mawu, moo te si nɛ o po ye he kpa. <verse eid="PSA 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24" />Dalɔ ji mo, mo ha nɛ je ɔ tsuo nɛ na kaa i yi fɔ; ko ha nɛ ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a bua nɛ jɔ. <verse eid="PSA 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25" />Ko ha nɛ a de ke, “Nɔ́ nɛ wa ngɛ hlae nɛ ba e nɔ ɔ, e be kɛe nɛ e maa ba mi, nɛ wa nine maa su e nɔ.” <verse eid="PSA 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26" />Ha zo nɛ gbe mɛ; mo ha nɛ oslaa nɛ ba a nɔ, ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ fiãe nɛ a ngɛ nyae ngɛ ye haomi ɔ he ɔ, nɛ o ha a nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ hɛ mi nɛ kpata, nɛ abɔ ahlua. <verse eid="PSA 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27" />Se o ha ni nɛmɛ nɛ hlaa ye nɔ yami ɔ, a bua nɛ jɔ a he wawɛɛ. Mo ha a nya kɛ bua jɔmi nɛ a de kɛ ngmlaa ke, “Mawu ji Ope, e bua jɔɔ kaa e maa ye kɛ bua e sɔmɔlɔ ɔ.” <verse eid="PSA 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28" />Nɛ i ma jaje o agbo jemi kɛ o himi kɛ tsɔɔ nɔ tsuaa nɔ; nɛ i ma je o yi daa.<verse eid="PSA 35:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 36</para>
  <para style="s1">Yayami peeli a ni tsutsui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1" />Yayami ngɛ dikali a tsui mi, nɛ e ngɛ mɛ yayami peemi blɔ tsɔɔe be fɛɛ be. Mawu gbeye yemi ko be a mi nɛ maa gbla a se. <verse eid="PSA 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2" />A fĩaa nɛ a susuu kaa a ma nyɛ ha a yayami ɔmɛ a nɔ nɛ a be mɛ nae. <verse eid="PSA 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3" />Dika kɛ lakpa munyu pɛ nɛ a tuɔ; a pí a he ni leli kɛ nimli kpakpahi hulɔ. <verse eid="PSA 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4" />Dika ga pɛ nɛ a toɔ ngɛ sa mi nyɔnyɔɔnyɔ kɛ je nanɛɛ, nɛ a susuu we bɔ nɛ a ma kpa ngɛ yayami se mohu he.<verse eid="PSA 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5" />Se Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o suɔmi nɛ se pui ɔ ngɛ kɛ su hiɔwe tɔɔ, nɛ o anɔkuale ɔ ngɛ kɛ je hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ kɛ ya si hiɔwe lokoo. <verse eid="PSA 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6" />O dami sane yemi hi kɛ pi si kaa o yoku ngua amɛ. Nɛ ni lemi nɛ ngɛ o kojomi ɔmɛ a mi kuɔ kaa bɔ nɛ wo ɔmɛ a mi kuɔ ɔ. Mo nɛ o baa nimli kɛ lohwehi tsuo a yi. <verse eid="PSA 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, hyɛ bɔ nɛ o suɔmi he jua wa ha, e ngɛ daa nɛ e tsakee we; o pɛlihi a sisi hɔ ɔ ji a laami he. <verse eid="PSA 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8" />O dlooɔ mɛ kɛ mo nitsɛ o niye ni nɛ a yeɔ, nɛ o haa mɛ nyu kɛ jee o bua jɔmi pa amɛ a mi nɛ a nuu.<verse eid="PSA 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9" />Ejakaa o mi a naa wami kɛ jee, nɛ o La a mi wa naa wa la ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10" />Ha nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ le mo ɔ a na o suɔmi nɛ se pui ɔ; nɛ o he ni nɛmɛ nɛ suɔ kaa a maa pee o suɔmi nya ni ɔ a yi wami daa.<verse eid="PSA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11" />Ko ha he nɔ woli nɛ ɔmɛ he blɔ nɛ a naa ye nɔ, nɛ o ko ha yi mi wali ɔmɛ a nine nɛ su ye nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12" />Moo hyɛ, a nɔ si. A wo mɛ kɛ fia si nɛ a be si tee hu.<verse eid="PSA 36:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 37</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu nɔmlɔ ko e anɔkuale odase yemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1" />Ko ha nɛ dikalɔ ɔ e sane nɛ hao mo, nɛ mo ko je yayami peeli hunga. <verse eid="PSA 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2" />A yi be ko nɛ a poo mɛ kɛ pueɔ si kaa nga; a nglaa nɛ a nɛ mɛ hu. <verse eid="PSA 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3" />Moo lɛɛ mo wo o hɛ kɛ fɔ Mawu nɔ. O mi mi nɛ jɔ nɛ o pee nihi kpakpa, konɛ o yi nɛ na wami ngɛ zugba a nɔ. O maa ya nɔ, nɛ o ma na he jɔmi.<verse eid="PSA 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4" />O bua nɛ jɔ Mawu he, nɛ e ma ha mo nɔ nɛ o tsui ngɛ hlae. <verse eid="PSA 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5" />Mo wo o he kɛ ha lɛ, nɛ o wo o hɛ kɛ fɔ e nɔ ngɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ mi, nɛ e maa ye kɛ bua mo. <verse eid="PSA 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6" />E ma ha o anɔkuale ɔ maa je kpo, nɛ o dami ɔ ma kpɛ kaa piani pu.<verse eid="PSA 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7" />Mo na tsui nɛ o hyɛ Mawu blɔ; nɛ o hɛ nɛ kó kɔ yayami peeli nɛ ngɛ nɔ yae ɔ a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8" />Ko na abofu; nɛ o ko wo o tsui la. Koo ye o tsui nɛ o hao, ejakaa haomi kɛkɛ e ma tsɛ kɛ ha mo. <verse eid="PSA 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9" />A ma kpata dikali ɔmɛ a hɛ mi, se ni nɛmɛ nɛ wo a hɛ kɛ fɔ Mawu nɔ ɔ, a maa jɔɔ mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10" />Be bɔɔ pɛ nɛ piɛ nɛ a be dikali ɔmɛ nae hu. O ma hla mɛ se o be mɛ nae. <verse eid="PSA 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11" />Se nihi kulaa nɛ baa a he si ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi ɔ, a maa jɔɔ mɛ nɛ a ma na tue mi jɔmi babauu.<verse eid="PSA 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12" />Dikali toɔ nimli kpakpahi a he ga nɛ a susuu a hɛ mi kpatami he. <verse eid="PSA 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13" />Se Mawu muɔɔ mɛ, ejakaa e le kaa a kojomi be ma. <verse eid="PSA 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14" />Dikali to a yi mi nɛ a ma kpata ohiafo hɛ mi, nɛ a dla a he nɛ a maa gbe nihi nɛ peeɔ kpakpa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15" />Se mɛ nitsɛmɛ a klaate ɔmɛ a nya nɛ a maa nɔ ngɛ, nɛ a awi yemi ní ɔmɛ maa ku dukuduku.<verse eid="PSA 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16" />Níhi bɔɔ nɛ dalɔ ngɛ ɔ, e hi pe dikali a níhi babauu nɛ a na. <verse eid="PSA 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17" />Ejakaa Mawu maa gbe yayami peeli ɔmɛ a he wami nya la, nɛ dali ɔmɛ ɔ, e maa bu a he.<verse eid="PSA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu naa ni tsumi kpakpa nɛ dali tsuɔ daa nɛ ɔ, nɛ e haa mɛ neneene hiɔwo. <verse eid="PSA 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19" />E hyɛɔ a nɔ ngɛ fimi behi a mi; nɛ hwɔ be mi tete po nɔ́ ko he hia we mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20" />Se dikali ɔmɛ a hɛ mi ma kpata; Mawu he nyɛli ɔmɛ ma gbo kaa nga gboɔ, nɛ a maa ta kaa la su ku taa a. <verse eid="PSA 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21" />Nimli yayami ɔmɛ paa nɔ́, nɛ a nyɛ we ngwɔ he nɛ a toɔ; se nimli kpakpa amɛ toɔ ngwɔ he nɛ e bee nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22" />Ni nɛmɛ nɛ Mawu jɔɔ mɛ ɔ, a maa ye zugba a nɔ; se ni nɛmɛ nɛ e gbiɛ mɛ ɔ, a hɛ mi ma kpata.<verse eid="PSA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23" />Mawu tsɔɔ nimli kpakpa amɛ he nɛ sa nɛ a gu. E naa a nane hiami ɔmɛ a he bua jɔmi. <verse eid="PSA 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24" />Ke a nɔ si ɔ, a plaa we, ejakaa Tsɛ Mawu hɛɛ a mi.<verse eid="PSA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25" />I hi nihe mi, se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, i wa. Ngɛ jehahi abɔ nɛ i ye ɔ kulaa mi ɔ, i nɛ kaa Mawu kua e sɔmɔlɔ ko aloo e ha hwɔ ye e bimɛ. <verse eid="PSA 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26" />Se mohu ɔ, dali ɔmɛ a mi jɔ nɛ a kee nɔ ní, a paa ní kɛ haa ni kpahi; nɛ a bimɛ peeɔ jɔɔmi kɛ haa mɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, moo jɔɔ yayami peemi nɛ o pee kpakpa, konɛ o na neneene sihi he. <verse eid="PSA 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28" />Ejakaa Mawu suɔ dami sane yemi, nɛ e be nihi nɛ yeɔ lɛ anɔkuale ɔ kuae. E maa bu a he daa; se ni nɛmɛ nɛ suɔ yi mi wami ni tsumi ɔ, a hɛ mi ma kpata.<verse eid="PSA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29" />Zugba a maa pee dali ɔmɛ a nɔ́ nɛ a maa hi nɔ daa. <verse eid="PSA 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30" />Nɔmlɔ kpakpa tuɔ ni lemi munyu, nɛ e yeɔ dami sane daa. <verse eid="PSA 37:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31" />E toɔ Mawu mlaa amɛ ngɛ e tsui mi nɛ e nane be tɔtɔe gblee.<verse eid="PSA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32" />Yayami peeli woɔ ka kɛ haa nimli kpakpa amɛ, a hlaa a he blɔ nɛ a gbe mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 37:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33" />Se Mawu be he nyɛli ɔmɛ he blɔ hae nɛ a ye kunimi, nɛ e be hae nɛ dali ɔmɛ a ye fɔ ke a kɛ mɛ ya ha kojomi.<verse eid="PSA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34" />Moo hyɛ Mawu blɔ. Moo ya nɔ nɛ o pee e suɔmi nya ni, nɛ e maa wo o hɛ mi nyami. O maa ye zugba a nɔ, nɛ o maa na kaa e kpata yi mi wali ɔmɛ a hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35" />I le nyumu yayami peelɔ he wolɔ ko. E je oblai nɛ e ka gbauu. <verse eid="PSA 37:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36" />Pee se ɔ, i nɛ lɛ hu; i hla lɛ se i nɛ lɛ. <verse eid="PSA 37:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37" />Se nɔmlɔ kpakpa a, e sane ɔ ngɛ slɔɔto. E woɔ weku nɛ e ngɛ tue mi jɔmi, nɛ e nyagbe peeɔ bua jɔmi. <verse eid="PSA 37:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38" />Se nimli yayami ɔmɛ ɔ, a ma kpata a hɛ mi, nɛ a weku maa gu.<verse eid="PSA 37:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39" />Mawu heɔ dali a yi wami, nɛ lɛ ji a we sami he ngɛ haomi be mi. <verse eid="PSA 37:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40" />E yeɔ kɛ buaa mɛ nɛ e heɔ a yi wami. E kpɔɔ mɛ kɛ jeɔ dikali a dɛ mi, ejakaa a heɔ e nɔ yeɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 38</para>
  <para style="s1">Yayami peelɔ pɛɛ kpami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, koo sa ye tue kɛ abofu. <verse eid="PSA 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2" />O kɛ̃ɛ̃ ɔ plaa mi; ye tue gblami ɔ nya wa ha mi. <verse eid="PSA 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3" />O mi mi fumi ɔ wo mi hiɔ, nɛ ye yayami ɔmɛ ha nɛ ye nɔmlɔ tso tsuo ku pue si. <verse eid="PSA 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4" />Ye yayami ɔmɛ hiɛ, a pee kaa tlomi nɛ ngɛ mi gbee. <verse eid="PSA 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5" />Ngɛ ye nɔ́ limi he je ɔ, ye pa amɛ sa nɛ a ngɛ fu jee. <verse eid="PSA 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6" />Ye yayami ɔmɛ a he je ɔ, ye mi dɔ nɛ e ngɛ mi yee. Kɔmɔ yemi nɔ kɛkɛ se i ngɛ mɔtu kɛ gbɔkuɛ. <verse eid="PSA 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7" />Ye se tso ngɛ mi yee, nɛ ye he mi tsuo jɔɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8" />Peepee ta ye he, ye tsui ngɛ mi yee nɛ i ngɛ kɛmɛe.<verse eid="PSA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o le bɔ nɛ i suɔ kaa ma na he wami ekohu ha; o ngɛ ye kɛmɛmi ɔ he nue paa. <verse eid="PSA 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10" />Ye tsui ngɛ fiae kplakplaakpla. Ye he wami ta, nɛ ye hɛ ngmɛ yu. <verse eid="PSA 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11" />Ye pa amɛ a he je ɔ, ye huɛmɛ kɛ ye wekuli po bɛ ye kasa mi.<verse eid="PSA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12" />Ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ ngɛ mi hlae nɛ a gbe. A tsɔ klamahi ha mi; nɛ daa je nɛ maa na a, a ngɛ ye hɛ mi kpatami he susue. <verse eid="PSA 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13" />Se i pee kaa tue kokoetsɛ nɛ nui ye he gbeye womi ɔmɛ, kɛ mumui nɛ nyɛ we nɔ́ ko nɛ e de. <verse eid="PSA 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14" />I pee dii ngɛ a hɛ mi kaa nɔ nɛ nui nɔ; kɛ nɔ nɛ be mɛ heto nyɛe ma ha. <verse eid="PSA 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15" />Ejakaa i wo ye hɛ ngɔ fɔ o nɔ, oo Tsaatsɛ, ye Mawu. Mo nɛ o ma je ye nya. <verse eid="PSA 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16" />Ko ha nɛ ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ nɛ a nya, nɛ ye si gbeemi ɔ nɛ pee mɛ bua jɔmi.<verse eid="PSA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17" />Be fɛɛ be ɔ, yayami ngɛ ye blɔ mi bae; enɛ ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ mi haoe daa. <verse eid="PSA 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18" />I ngɛ ye yayami ɔmɛ jajee; nɔ́ nɛ i pee ɔ ngɛ mi dɔe. <verse eid="PSA 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19" />Ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ ngɛ mi yi mi wae wawɛɛ, nɛ a ngɛ mi nyɛe be mi nɛ i pee we mɛ nɔ́ ko. <verse eid="PSA 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20" />Ni nɛmɛ nɛ woɔ yayami ngɔ toɔ kpakpa nane mi ɔ te si kɛ si mi, ejakaa i bɔɔ mɔde nɛ ma pee nɔ́ nɛ da.<verse eid="PSA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21" />Tsaatsɛ, ko si mi, nɛ o kɛ mi wa kpɛti nɛ ko kɛ, oo ye Mawu! <verse eid="PSA 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22" />O he nɛ sɔ nɛ o ye kɛ bua mi koo! Oo Mawu, ye yi wami helɔ!<verse eid="PSA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 39</para>
  <para style="s1">Wami be kpiti kɛ e mi yakayaka níhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1" />I de ye he ke, i ma kpa kɔmɔ yemi! Titli ɔ, ke yayami peeli ba bɔle mi ɔ, i ma pee dii. <verse eid="PSA 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2" />I pɛ ye nya mi nɛ ma de nɔ́ ko, kpakpa jio, yaya jio. Se ye nɔ́ nami ɔ ngɛ nɔ yae mohu.<verse eid="PSA 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3" />I hao saminya, si abɔ nɛ i ngɛ yi mi susue ɔ, si abɔ nɛ i ngɛ haoe ngɛ ye mi ji lɔ ɔ nɛ. Nyagbe mi ɔ, i tu munyu nɛ i de Mawu ke: <verse eid="PSA 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4" />Tsaatsɛ, moo ye kɛ bua mi nɛ ma le kaa be kpiti ko kɛkɛ i ma ye ngɛ zugba a nɔ. Mo ha nɛ ma le kaa be kuku ko pɛ nɛ piɛ ha mi. <verse eid="PSA 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5" />Tsa pi ye wami se de kɛ! Ye wami be ɔ kulaa ngɛ kaa hɛ ngmɛfia ngɛ o hɛ mi. Adesa bee kaa kɔɔhiɔ nɛ ngɛ fiae. <verse eid="PSA 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6" />E ngɛ kaa nini ko kɛkɛ. Nɛ e dengme gbomi yami kɛ bami kulaa ya peeɔ yaka. E gboɔ dengme nɛ e buaa níhi a nya, se e li nɔ nɛ ba yeɔ. <verse eid="PSA 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mɛnɔ nɔ nɛ ma wo ye hɛ kɛ fɔ mɔ? Mo pɛ o nɔ nɛ ye hɛ ngɛ.<verse eid="PSA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8" />Mo je mi kɛ je ye yayami ɔmɛ tsuo a mi; ko ha nɛ nihi nɛ be juɛmi ɔ a muɔ mi.<verse eid="PSA 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, i plɛ mumui ngɛ o hɛ mi. I be nɔ́ ko dee, ejakaa mo nɛ o ha nɛ i ngɛ nɔ́ nae kikɛ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo ko fia mi nɔ hu. Bɔ nɛ o gbla ye tue ɔ e hiɛ; i ma ho gbomi ya. <verse eid="PSA 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11" />Ke o gbla nɔmlɔ tue ngɛ e yayami he ɔ, kɛkɛ e hɛ mi kpata, ejakaa nɔmlɔ he wɛ, e ngɛ kaa bo nɛ lohwe tsɔwi yeɔ ngɛ kpɛɛ mi. Ee, nɔmlɔ bee kaa kɔɔhiɔ nɛ ngɛ fiae.<verse eid="PSA 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo bu ye kue fami ɔ tue! Nɛ o nu ye ya fomi ɔ. Mo ko pee kɔ nɛ o pui ye nya mi. Mo he mi koo, be nɛ i ngɛ ya foe ɔ. Ami hu o nubwɔ kɛkɛ ji mi. Blɔ hialɔ kɛkɛ ji mi nɛ i bee ngɛ je ɔ mi kaa ye tsɛ ɔmɛ nɔuu.<verse eid="PSA 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo na mi mɔbɔ nɛ o kɛ pa mi. Ko tú o hɛ mi kɛ wo mi hu, konɛ ami hu ma na bua jɔmi bɔɔ ekohu, loko ji ye gbenɔ be nɛ ba su.<verse eid="PSA 39:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 40</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu suɔmi nya ni peemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1" />I to tsui kɛ hyɛ Mawu blɔ nɛ e ye kɛ bua mi. Kɛkɛ nɛ e bu mi tue, nɛ e nu ye ya fomi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2" />E je mi kɛ je hɛ mi kpatami muɔ kɛ mɔsɔ nɛ mi ti ɔ mi. Nɛ e wo mi kɛ ma tɛ sa nɔ, nɛ e ha ye nane pi si. <verse eid="PSA 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3" />E wo ye nya Mawu yi jemi la he. Enɛ ɔ ma ha nɛ nihi fuu maa nu anunyami níhi nɛ e pee ha mi ɔ he. A maa ye lɛ gbeye nɛ a ma wo a hɛ kɛ fɔ e nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4" />A jɔɔ nihi nɛ woɔ a hɛ kɛ fɔɔ Mawu nɔ, nɛ a be hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ he nɔ woli kɛ wɔ jali a mi.<verse eid="PSA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5" />Oo Tsaatsɛ, ye Mawu, o tsu nyakpɛ ní agbohi kɛ ha wɔ be babauu. O hɛ ngɛ wa nɔ be fɛɛ be. Mɛnɔ hu ma nyɛ pee nihi nɛ o pee ɔ? O tsu nyakpɛ níhi babauu ha wɔ bɔ nɛ i be nyɛe maa kane.<verse eid="PSA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6" />O hla we afɔle ngɛ o bimɛ a dɛ: lohwe mlukuhi nɛ a maa sa ngɛ bɔ sami la tɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, ha we mo bua jɔmi pɔtɛɛ ko. Se mohu o ha mi tue nɛ ma kɛ nu o gbi. <verse eid="PSA 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7" />Kɛkɛ nɛ i de ke, “Hyɛ, i ba kaa bɔ nɛ gbali ɔmɛ kulaa wo si de ngɛ ye he ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8" />I suɔ nɛ ma pee o suɔmi nya ni, ye Mawu, ejakaa a ngma o mlaa a ngɛ ye tsui mi!”<verse eid="PSA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9" />I fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ kaa o kɛ nimli a he yayami paa mɛ. Tsaatsɛ, i yi he gbeye kaa bɔ nɛ o le ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10" />I laa we yi wami hemi Manye Munyu ɔ nɔ. I fiɛɛ o suɔmi kɛ anɔkuale ɔ daa ngɛ asafo ɔ kulaa hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11" />Oo Mawu, ko je o mɔbɔ nami ɔ ngɛ ye nɔ! Ha nɛ o suɔmi kɛ o anɔkuale ɔ nɛ baa ye yi daa. <verse eid="PSA 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12" />Ke pi ja a, ye hɛ mi ma kpata, ejakaa haomi slɔɔto bɔle mi kɛ kpe, haomi slɔɔto nɛ hiɛ pe bɔ nɛ i ma nyɛ ma kane. Ye yayami ɔmɛ hiɛ pe bɔ nɛ ma nyɛ ma kane. A du mi kɛ je hiɔmi kɛ ba ma si. Jehanɛ ɔ lɛɛ e ngɛ mi zo pee kaa ma wo ye hɛ mi nɔ. Ye tsui ngɛ haoe ngɛ ye mi.<verse eid="PSA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13" />Oo Mawu, mo he ye yi wami! O he nɛ sɔ nɛ o ye kɛ bua mi! <verse eid="PSA 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14" />Mo ha nɛ a lu. Moo ku ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nya la. <verse eid="PSA 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15" />Ha zo nɛ gbe ni ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ nyae ngɛ ye haomi ɔmɛ a he ɔ, nɛ o ko ha a nine nɛ su ye nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16" />Mo ha nɛ nihi tsuo nɛ suɔ mo nɛ a ngɛ yi wami hemi hlae ɔ, a na bua jɔmi. Nɛ nihi kulaa nɛ na yi wami hemi ní nɛ o tsu ha mɛ ɔ, a de ke: “Mawu kle niinɛ!”<verse eid="PSA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17" />Ohiafo nɛ be nɔ́ ko kulaa ji mi, se Tsaatsɛ, o hɛ ji ye nɔ! Oo ye Mawu, mo ji ye yemi kɛ bualɔ. Ye yi wami helɔ kɛ Mawu ji mo. O he nɛ sɔ nɛ o kpɔ mi.<verse eid="PSA 40:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 41</para>
  <para style="s1">Ohiafohi a kaimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1" />Mawu jɔɔ nihi nɛ naa ohiafohi mɔbɔ ɔ. E jeɔ mɛ kɛ jeɔ a haomihi a mi. <verse eid="PSA 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2" />E buu a he nɛ e baa a yi. E woɔ a hɛ mi nyami ngɛ ma hɛ mi, nɛ e kpataa a he nyɛli a he wami. <verse eid="PSA 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3" />E yeɔ kɛ buaa mɛ ngɛ a hiɔ numi be mi nɛ e tsaa mɛ.<verse eid="PSA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4" />I sɔle nɛ i de ke, “Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo na mi mɔbɔ nɛ o tsa mi, i pee yayami kɛ si mo.” <verse eid="PSA 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5" />Ye he nyɛli ngɛ dee ngɛ ye he ke, “Mɛni be e ma gbo nɛ e biɛ maa laa!” <verse eid="PSA 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6" />Ke i be he wami nɛ a ba slaa mi ɔ, a toɔ hɛ mi saminya kaa nɔ nɛ a kɛ mi ngɛ huɛ si himi kpakpa mi; se be fɛɛ be nɛ ɔ, a sume mi nɛ a bua jɔɔ a he kaa i hwɔɔ si ngɛ hiɔ sa nɔ. Ke a ba slaa mi nɛ a yaa a, a yeɔ ye he fɛu nɛ a muɔɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7" />A to a yi mi nɔ́ nɛ a maa pee ke i gbo. <verse eid="PSA 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8" />A ke, “E hiɔ ɔ he wa; e be si tee!”<verse eid="PSA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9" />Nɔmlɔ nɛ i buu kaa lɛ ji ye huɛ kpakpa pe kulaa nɛ i kɛ lɛ yeɔ ni ngɛ ka kake mi ɔ hu te si kɛ wo mi. <verse eid="PSA 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ko kua mi, moo na mi mɔbɔ nɛ o tle mi si ekohu, konɛ ma na nɔ́ ko ma de ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ ! <verse eid="PSA 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11" />I le kaa o bua jɔ ye he, ejakaa o ha we nɛ ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ nɛ a ye ye nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12" />O baa ye yi, ejakaa i yeɔ anɔkuale; nɛ o ha mi he blɔ nɛ ma hi o ngɔ daa.<verse eid="PSA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13" />Nyɛ je Yehowa Israel Mawu ɔ yi, nɔ nɛ ngɛ kɛ je blema, nɛ e ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene ɔ. Amen!<verse eid="PSA 41:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42" />
  <para style="ms">Mi Gbami 2</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 42:1-72:20">La 42:1—72:20</ref></para>
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 42</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu se blɔ hlami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1" />Oo Mawu, kaa bɔ nɛ kuma yee nga mi lohwe ngɛ sapu mi ɔ, ja a pɛ nɛ o he kuma ngɛ mi yee. <verse eid="PSA 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2" />O he kuma ngɛ mi yee, mo Mawu hɛ kalɔ. Mɛni be mi ma na o hɛ mi? <verse eid="PSA 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3" />Ya fomi nɔ kɛkɛ se i ngɛ nyɔ kɛ pia, nɛ i ngɛ pɛɛ kpae ke o ye kɛ bua mi, be mi nɛ ye he nyɛli ngɛ ye he fɛu yee. A ngɛ mi bie ke, “Jije o Mawu ɔ ngɛ?”<verse eid="PSA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4" />Ye susuma, mo na he nɔ kami! Tse o kai be ko nɛ be ɔ? Be nɛ o nyɛɛ nihi fuu a hɛ mi kɛ yaa Sɔlemi We ɔ ya sɔmɔɔ ngɛ gbijlɔ ligbi nɔ kɛ bua jɔmi kɛ Mawu yi jemi la a? <verse eid="PSA 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5" />Mɛni ba nɛ aywilɛho nu mi kikɛ ɔ? Mɛni he je nɛ i hao ngɛ ye mumi mi tɔɔ nɛ ɔ? Wo o hɛ kɛ fɛ Mawu nɔ! I ma la kɛ je e yi ekohu ngɛ e yemi kɛ buami ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6" />Ami ji nɛ ɔ nɛ, ye ni pee mɔbɔ. Se kɛ ɔ, i ma susu mo Mawu o mi jɔmi kɛ ha zugba nɛ ɔ he, he nɛ Yordan Pa a bee ngɛ, kɛ he nɛ Hemon kɛ Miza yoku ɔmɛ ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7" />Haomi kɛ aywilɛho ba na mi kaa bɔ nɛ oslɔke kuɔ kɛ pueɔ nɔ nɔ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8" />Se kɛ ɔ, Tsaatsɛ Mawu jeɔ e suɔmi kpo kɛ tsɔɔ mi daa, nɛ nyɔ mi tsuo i laa e la amɛ kɛ faa kue ha Mawu nɛ haa mi wami ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9" />“Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ye he piɛlɔ, mɛni he je nɛ o hɛ je ye nɔ? Mɛni he je nɛ i ngɛ nɔ́ nae kikɛ ɔ ngɛ ye he nyɛli a dɛ mi?” <verse eid="PSA 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10" />Ye he fɛu nɛ a ngɛ yee ɔ, kɛ ye hɛ mi si nɛ a ngɛ puee ɔ ha nɛ i hao. A ngɛ mi bie ke, “Jije o Mawu ɔ ngɛ lo?” <verse eid="PSA 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11" />Se, oo ye klaa, o kɔni mi nɛ ko jɔ. Nɛ o juɛmi nɛ ko tsake. Moo hyɛ Mawu blɔ. Ejakaa i le kaa i ma na he blɔ kɛ je e yi ekohu ngɛ níhi nɛ e pee ha mi ɔ he. Lɛ ji ye yemi kɛ bualɔ! Lɛ ji ye Mawu.<verse eid="PSA 42:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 43</para>
  <para style="s1">Pɛɛ kpami kɛ ha kpɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo ye ye sane ɔ ha mi nɛ o kpɔ mi kɛ je nihi nɛ mɔbɔ nami kɛ anɔkuale yemi ko be a mi ɔ a dɛ mi, nɛ o ko bu a nya pomi ɔmɛ tue. <verse eid="PSA 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2" />Ejakaa mo ji Mawu, nɛ mo ji ye yi baalɔ. Mɛni he je nɛ o si mi kɛ fɔ si? Mɛni he je nɛ ye he nyɛli ngɛ mi yi mi wae nɛ i ngɛ nɔ́ nae?<verse eid="PSA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3" />Oo ha nɛ o la kɛ o anɔkuale ɔ nɛ tsɔɔ mi blɔ nɛ a kpaka mi kɛ ba o Sɔlemi We nɛ ngɛ o Zion yoku klɔuklɔu ɔ nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4" />Lejɛ ɔ nɛ i ma sa kɛ su Mawu bɔ sami la tɛ ɔ he ngɛ. Mo Mawu nɔ nɛ haa mi bua jɔmi ɔ. I ma fia ye kpa saku ɔ nɛ i ma la kɛ je mo ye Mawu o yi. <verse eid="PSA 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5" />Oo ye susuma, mɛni he je nɛ o ngɛ haoe nɛ o pee yeyeeye kikɛ ɔ? Mo wo o hɛ kɛ fɔ Mawu nɔ. I ma je e yi lolo ngɛ e nyakpɛ yemi kɛ buami ɔ he; e ma ha ma muɔ ekohu, lɛ ji ye Mawu!<verse eid="PSA 43:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 44</para>
  <para style="s1">Kpɔmi kɛ nɔ nami mi jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa nu, nɛ wa nɛmɛ hu de wɔ nyakpɛ anunyami ni nguahi nɛ o pee blema lokoo ngɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2" />Bɔ nɛ o fie wɔ jali ɔmɛ kɛ je zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ o ngɔ kulaa kɛ ha wɔ, nɛ o ha Israel he si ngɛ e he fɛɛ he ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3" />Tsa pi mɛ nitsɛmɛ a he wami kɛ a nile nya nɛ a ye kunimi ngɛ, se mo o he wami, o suɔmi kɛ mɔbɔ nɛ o na mɛ ɔ he je.<verse eid="PSA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4" />Ye Matsɛ kɛ ye Mawu ji mo. Moo wo kunimi yemi si kɛ ha o bi ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5" />Ejakaa o he wami nya, kɛ o biɛ ɔ he je nɛ wa ye wa he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nɔ ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6" />I wo we ye hɛ kɛ fɔɛ ye ta hwumi ni ɔmɛ a nɔ. A be ye yi wami nyɛe ma he gblee. <verse eid="PSA 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7" />Mo pɛ o ma nyɛ ha wɔ kunimi yemi ngɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ nyɛɛ wɔ ɔmɛ a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8" />Mawu ji ye fiami nɔ́ daa. I be mo si nyɛe ma na bɔ nɛ sa! <verse eid="PSA 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9" />Se Tsaatsɛ Mawu, be ko mi ɔ, o kua wɔ nɛ wa hɛ mi pue si. O yi kɛ bua we wɔ ngɛ wa ta amɛ a mi. <verse eid="PSA 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10" />O ha wa he nyɛli ɔmɛ kɛ wɔ hwu ta saminya nɛ a ye wa nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11" />O ha he blɔ nɛ a gbe wɔ kaa a gbee tohi, nɛ a gbɛ wɔ ngɔ fia mahi a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12" />O jua wɔ adufude, ejakaa wa he be jua ko ngɛ o hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13" />Mahi nɛ bɔle wɔ ɔmɛ na nɔ́ nɛ o pee wɔ ɔ nɛ a ye wa he fɛu nɛ a muɔ wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14" />O ha nɛ ma amɛ ye wa he fɛu. Wa he guɛ gbo nɛ a muɔ wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15" />Be fɛɛ be ɔ, ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ ngɛ ye hɛ mi si puee, nɛ zo ngɛ mi pee, <verse eid="PSA 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16" />ngɛ ye he fɛu yeli kɛ muɔli kɛ nihi nɛ kɛ nɔ́ pɛ ɔ a hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17" />Neneene Tsɛ, wa na ni nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo be mi nɛ wa hɛ ji o nɔ, nɛ wa tɔ we waa kɛ mo wa kpɛti somi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18" />Wa kpale we ngɛ o se, nɛ tsa pi nɛ wa bui mo nɛ wa yi o mlaa amɛ a nɔ hulɔ. <verse eid="PSA 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19" />Kaa wa pee ja a, jinɛ wa maa nu wa tue nɛ o gbla ngɛ nga a nɔ ɔ sisi, nɛ o si wɔ kɛ wo diblii mi kɛ ha gbenɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20" />Kaa wa jɔɔ wa Mawu ɔ jami, nɛ wa bɔni wɔhi jami, <verse eid="PSA 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21" />Anɛ Mawu be lee lo? Ejakaa e le tsui fɛɛ tsui mi laami níhi kulaa. <verse eid="PSA 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22" />Se tsa pi ja a ji wa sane ɔ. Mo o he nɛ a ngɛ wa hɛ mi kpatae ngɛ, nɛ wa fɔɔ si kaa tohi nɛ a maa gbe.<verse eid="PSA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23" />Oo Tsaatsɛ, o he nɛ tsiɛ. Moo te si nɛ o huanya o he. Mɛni he je nɛ o ngɛ mahe hwɔe? Anɛ o ngmɛɛ wa he kulaa lo? <verse eid="PSA 44:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24" />Mɛni he je nɛ o ngɛ wɔ laae? Mɛni ba nɛ o je hɛ ngɛ wa haomi kɛ yi kpɛti nɛ a ngɛ wɔ wae ɔ he? <verse eid="PSA 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25" />Wa hwɔɔ si ngɛ zugba nɛ wa ngɔ wa hɛ mi kɛ bu si. <verse eid="PSA 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo te si nɛ o ba ye kɛ bua wɔ. Mo kpɔ wɔ ngɛ o suɔmi nɛ se pui ɔ he je.<verse eid="PSA 44:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 45</para>
  <para style="s1">Matsɛ yo ngɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1" />Susumi kpakpa ko ba ye mi; i ma po la kɛ ha Matsɛ ɔ. La ngɛ ye nya bae kaa bɔ nɛ e baa asilɛte nya a.<verse eid="PSA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2" />O nɔ afɛu nɔmlɔ ko be; o nya mi tsɔ. Mawu nitsɛ ngɛ mo jɔɔe daa.<verse eid="PSA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3" />Moo mia kɛ ta hwumi nihi, he walɔ matsɛ; anunyami nɔmlɔ ji mo nɛ o je agbo!<verse eid="PSA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4" />Moo ya ngɛ agbo jemi mi nɛ o ya ye kunimi; nɛ o fa anɔkuale kɛ he si bami kɛ dami sane yemi he. O maa ye kunimi ejakaa o ngɛ he wami.<verse eid="PSA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5" />O kɛ̃ɛ̃ mi bi ɔmɛ a nya ba, nɛ a gbɔɔ o he nyɛli ɔmɛ kɛ sɛɛ a tsui mi tɔɔ, nɛ a nɔɔ ngɛ o hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, o matsɛ yemi ɔ ngɛ daa. Dami sane yemi ji o matsɛ tso.<verse eid="PSA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7" />O suɔ nɔ́ nɛ da, nɛ o hiɔ nɔ́ yaya. Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ o Mawu ɔ ha o na bua jɔmi pe nɔ fɛɛ nɔ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8" />O tadehi a mi ngɛ via jee kɛ mimɛ kɛ nu je via, nɛ lali ngɛ lae kɛ kpa sakuhi kɛ ngɛ o hɛ ja jee ngɛ o matsɛ we nɛ a ngɔ suɔ wu kɛ dla mi ɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 45:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9" />Matsɛmɛ a biyihi ngɛ o anunyami yi ɔmɛ a kpɛti. Nɛ manyɛ ɔ nɛ wo sika tsu níhi nɛ a kɛ je Ofir ɔ daa si ngɛ o hiɔ nɔ je. <verse eid="PSA 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10" />“Oo biyo, moo bu ye ga womi ɔ tue. Koo ye o tsui ngɛ o fɔli nɛ ngɛ o ma mi lokoo ɔ a he. <verse eid="PSA 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11" />O he peeɔ o huno matsɛ ɔ fɛu. Moo ba o he si kɛ ha lɛ, ejakaa o nutsɔ ji lɛ. <verse eid="PSA 45:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12" />Tiro bihi nɛ ji wa mwɔnɛmwɔnɛ ɔ niatsɛmɛ pe kulaa a ma ba ke mo ni nɛ a kɛ hla blɔ nya.”<verse eid="PSA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13" />Matsɛ biyo ɔ ngɛ mlɛe ngɛ e tsu ɔ mi. E wo afɛu sika tsu tade. <verse eid="PSA 45:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14" />E wo tade nɛ a kɛ nine lo, nɛ e anunyami mawa amɛ kpaka lɛ kɛ yaa matsɛ ɔ ngɔ. <verse eid="PSA 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15" />A sɛ matsɛ we ɔ mi kɛ bua jɔmi kɛ nyami. <verse eid="PSA 45:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16" />O bi ɔmɛ ma ba ye matsɛ ngɛ a tsɛ nane mi, nɛ a maa ye matsɛ ngɛ je ɔ mi tsuo.<verse eid="PSA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17" />I ma ha a bu o biɛ ɔ ngɛ yi nɔhi kulaa, nɛ je ɔ tsuo ma je o yi kɛ ya neneene.<verse eid="PSA 45:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 46</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu, wa he wami kɛ wesa he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1" />Mawu ji wa wesa he kɛ wa he wami. Lɛ e yeɔ kɛ buaa wɔ ngɛ wa haomi behi a mi. <verse eid="PSA 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, ke je ɔ hɛ mi kpata, nɛ yokuhi hia kɛ ya nɔ wo mi tete, wa be gbeye yee. <verse eid="PSA 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3" />Ke wo ɔmɛ gli nɛ yokuhi hoso po, wa be gbeye yee.<verse eid="PSA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4" />Pa ko ngɛ wa Mawu ma a mi nɛ haa nɔ bua jɔmi. Lejɛ ɔ ji Mawu Ope ɔ sihi he klɔuklɔu. <verse eid="PSA 46:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5" />Akɛnɛ Mawu nitsɛ sihi he ji jamɛ a ma a he je ɔ, ke haomi ko na lɛ ɔ, ke zugba hoso tete, e be he nue, Mawu maa ye kɛ bua lɛ oya. <verse eid="PSA 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6" />Mahi naa abofu nɛ a gliɔ, se ke Mawu wo gbi ɔ, zugba a he jɔɔ dii nɛ nɔ yemihi a hɛ mi kpataa.<verse eid="PSA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7" />Yehowa, tahi a Mawu ɔ kɛ wɔ ngɛ. Yakob Mawu ɔ ji wa wesa he. <verse eid="PSA 46:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8" />Nyɛɛ ba, nyɛɛ ba nɛ nyɛ ba hyɛ nyakpɛ níhi nɛ wa Mawu ɔ tsu ɔ, bɔ nɛ e kpataa je ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9" />E gbee tahi a nya ngɛ je ɔ mi tsuo. E kuɔ ta hwumi níhi dukuduku nɛ e saa mɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10" />“Nyɛɛ pee dii! Nyɛɛ le kaa Ami ji Mawu Ope ɔ! Je ɔ tsuo maa wo ye hɛ mi nyami.”<verse eid="PSA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11" />Yehowa, tahi a Mawu ɔ kɛ wɔ ngɛ. Yakob Mawu ɔ ji wa wesa he.<verse eid="PSA 46:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 47</para>
  <para style="s1">Matsɛ ɔ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1" />Nyɛɛ ba, nyɛ ba fia nyɛ dɛ kɛ bua jɔmi, nɛ nyɛ la kɛ je Mawu yi. <verse eid="PSA 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2" />Ejakaa Mawu Ope ɔ he ngɛ gbeye. Lɛ ji je ɔ tsuo Matsɛ. <verse eid="PSA 47:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3" />E ha wa ye ma amɛ a nɔ kunimi, <verse eid="PSA 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4" />nɛ e ngɔ jɔɔmi nɛ hi pe kulaa kɛ ha Yakob bimɛ nɛ e suɔ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5" />Mawu ho hiɔwe ya kɛ ngmlaa nɛ nya wa, kɛ tɛtlɛmatlɛ pɛmi. <verse eid="PSA 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6" />Nyɛ la yi jemi la kɛ ha Mawu, nyɛ la yi jemi la! Nyɛ la yi jemi la kɛ ha wa Matsɛ ɔ, nyɛ la yi jemi la! <verse eid="PSA 47:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7" />Ejakaa Mawu ji je ɔ tsuo Matsɛ, nyɛ la yi jemi la kɛ ha lɛ. <verse eid="PSA 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8" />E hii si ngɛ e matsɛ sɛ klɔuklɔu ɔ nɔ, nɛ e ngɛ ma amɛ tsuo a nɔ yee. <verse eid="PSA 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9" />Je ɔ mi nɔ yeli ɔmɛ kɛ wɔ pee kake kɛ ngɛ Abraham Mawu ɔ yi jee, ejakaa Mawu nɔ́ ji zugba a nɔ ta hwumi ni ɔmɛ. A woɔ e hɛ mi nyami babauu ngɛ he fɛɛ he.<verse eid="PSA 47:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 48</para>
  <para style="s1">Zion, Matsɛ ɔ sihi he ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1" />Hyɛ bɔ nɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu kle ha! E sa kaa wa je e yi babauu. E sihi he ji Zion Yoku ɔ nɔ ngɛ Yerusalem. <verse eid="PSA 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2" />Hyɛ bɔ nɛ e ngɛ fɛu! Zion Yoku ɔ ji je ɔ tsuo bua jɔmi he. E fɔɔ si ngɛ Yerusalem Jɔ mi blɔ lokoo. Lejɛ ɔ ji Matsɛ ngua a sihi he.<verse eid="PSA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3" />Mawu nitsɛ ji Yerusalem he bulɔ. <verse eid="PSA 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4" />Zugba a nɔ matsɛ ɔmɛ tsuo ba kpe nɛ a hyɛ ma a ha. <verse eid="PSA 48:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5" />Se nɔ́ nɛ a na a ha a nya kpɛ a he nɛ a kpale a sɛ kɛ fo. <verse eid="PSA 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6" />A ye gbeye nɛ a pee yeyeeye kaa yo nɛ nu kɔɔmi. <verse eid="PSA 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7" />Ejakaa Mawu kpataa ta hwumi lɛ nguahi tete a hɛ mi hɛ ngmɛfia. <verse eid="PSA 48:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8" />Bɔ nɛ wa nu wa Mawu nɛ ji hiɔwe tatsɛ ɔ e ma a anunyami he ɔ, ja a ji bɔ nɛ wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa ba na. Mawu to Yerusalem si kɛ yaa neneene.<verse eid="PSA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o Sɔlemi We ɔ ji he nɛ wa susuu o mi mi jɔmi kɛ o suɔmi he ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, bɔ nɛ a le o biɛ ngɛ zugba a tsuo nɔ ɔ, ja a nɔuu a je ɔ o yi ngɛ he fɛɛ he, ngɛ o yi wami hemi nɛ gbɛ fia je ɔ tsuo nɔ ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11" />Mo nya, oo Yerusalem! Yuda bi, nyɛ nya, ejakaa nyagbe mi ɔ, Mawu ma ha nɛ a ye nyɛ sane ha nyɛ ngɛ dami nya. <verse eid="PSA 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12" />Nyɛ ya hyɛ ma a ha. Nyɛɛ bɔle lɛ kɛ kpe nɛ nyɛɛ kane e sãu ɔmɛ saminya. <verse eid="PSA 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13" />Nyɛɛ hyɛ e gbogbo ɔmɛ nɛ nyɛɛ kpa matsɛ we ɔmɛ a mi konɛ nyɛɛ sɛɛ ha nyɛ bimɛ.<verse eid="PSA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14" />Ejakaa Mawu agbo nɛ ɔ ji wa Mawu kɛ yaa neneene. Lɛ ji wa blɔ tsɔɔlɔ kɛ yaa si wa ma gbo.<verse eid="PSA 48:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 49</para>
  <para style="s1">Ni nami kɛ yakayaka ni peemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1" />Nyɛɛ bu tue, nyɛ je mi bimɛ tsuo, <verse eid="PSA 49:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2" />nihi nɛ a buu kɛ nihi nɛ a bui, niatsɛmɛ kɛ ohiafohi kulaa, nyɛɛ bu ye munyu ɔmɛ tue. <verse eid="PSA 49:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3" />Ejakaa nile kɛ ni a se kɔmi juɛmi ngɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4" />Ma tu munyu ngɛ abɛ gbi mi, nɛ ma fia saku kɛ tsɔɔ sisi. <verse eid="PSA 49:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5" />I yi gbeye ngɛ haomi behi a mi ke he nyɛli bɔle mi tete. <verse eid="PSA 49:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6" />A kɛ a hɛ fɔ a ni nami nɔ, nɛ a fĩaa ngɛ he. <verse eid="PSA 49:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7" />Se bɔ fɛɛ bɔ nɛ a na ni kɛ ha a, a ti nɔ ko be nyɛe ma kpɔ e nyɛmi kɛ je yayami he tue gblami mi. Ejakaa Mawu ngɔɛ yayami kɛ pɛ nɔ kɛ gui jamɛ a blɔ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 49:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8" />Ejakaa klaa he jua wa hluu pe bɔ nɛ a maa ngɔ je nɛ ɔ mi ni nami kɛ kpɔ.<verse eid="PSA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9" />Zugba a nɔ ni nami ɔ kulaa hiɛ bɔ nɛ e ma nyɛ he klaa kake po yi wami nɛ e ma kpɔ lɛ kɛ je abosiamihi a je.<verse eid="PSA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10" />Niatsɛ kɛ he nɔ wolɔ kɛ ni lelɔ, nyɛ kulaa nyɛ ma gbo kaa ni kpa amɛ. Ejakaa nyɛ be wami se kɛmi pe kuasiahi; nɛ nyɛ ma si nyɛ ni ɔmɛ kɛ ha ni kpahi. <verse eid="PSA 49:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11" />Nyɛɛ kɛ nyɛ biɛhi woɔ nyɛ we ɔmɛ kaa nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ nɔ́ ji zugba a, nɛ nyɛ maa hi nɔ kɛ ya neneene. <verse eid="PSA 49:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12" />Se nɔmlɔ kɛ e anunyami ɔ kulaa ma gbo kaa lohwe. <verse eid="PSA 49:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13" />Kikɛ ɔ ji nimli nɛ ɔmɛ a kuasia jemi, se ke a gbo se ɔ, a ma de ngɛ a he ke a ngɛ juɛmi saminya.<verse eid="PSA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14" />Gbenɔ ji nimli kulaa a kpakalɔ. “Mɔtu mi ɔ,” nimli yaya amɛ maa pee nimli kpakpa amɛ a nyɔguɛhi. Ejakaa he wami nɛ a hɛɛ be mi nɛ a ji niatsɛmɛ ɔ, e laa ke ji a gbo; a be nyɛe ma wo kɛ ya.<verse eid="PSA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15" />Se ami lɛɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu ma kpɔ ye klaa kɛ je gbenɔ he wami dɛ mi, ejakaa e ma he mi. <verse eid="PSA 49:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, o ko ye tsui ke ji nimli yaya amɛ na ni nɛ a ma we kpakpahi. <verse eid="PSA 49:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17" />Ejakaa ke a gbo ɔ, a be nɔ ko woe kɛ ya. A hɛ mi nyami be a se nyɛɛe. <verse eid="PSA 49:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18" />Ni nalɔ buu e he kaa nɔmlɔ nɛ ngɛ bua jɔmi si himi mi, nɛ je ɔ hu jeɔ e yi mohu, <verse eid="PSA 49:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19" />se nyagbe mi ɔ, lɛ hu e gboɔ kaa nɔ fɛɛ nɔ, nɛ e yaa neneene hɛ mi kpatami mi.<verse eid="PSA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20" />Ejakaa nɔmlɔ kɛ e hɛ mi anunyami ɔ kulaa a, e ma gbo kaa lohwe.<verse eid="PSA 49:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 50</para>
  <para style="s1">Anɔkuale Mawu jami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu Ope ɔ, Neneene Tsɛ ɔ, tsɛ adesahi kulaa kɛ je pu site he kɛ pu sinɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2" />Mawu anunyami la a kpɛɛ kɛ jee Sɔlemi We nɛ hi kɛ pi si ɔ, nɛ ngɛ Zion Yoku ɔ nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3" />E baa kɛ hiɔwe simi, la glegleegle bɔle e he; nɛ kɔɔhiɔ nɛ nya wa ngɛ fiae kɛ ngɛ lɛ bɔlee. <verse eid="PSA 50:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4" />E ba nɛ e ba kojo e ni ɔmɛ. E de hiɔwe kɛ zugba kɛ ngmlaa ke, <verse eid="PSA 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5" />“Nyɛ bua ye nimli ɔmɛ a nya, nihi nɛ sã bɔ ngɛ ye afɔle sami la tɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ a kɛ mi so kaa a maa bu mi tue ɔ.” <verse eid="PSA 50:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6" />Mawu maa kojo mɛ kɛ anɔkuale kojomi, ejakaa hiɔwe kulaa yeɔ he odase kaa dalɔ ji lɛ.<verse eid="PSA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7" />“Oo ye bimɛ, nyɛɛ bu mi tue! Ejakaa ami ji nyɛ Mawu. Nyɛɛ bu mi tue! Nyɛ nya nɛ i ngɛ poe ji nɛ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="PSA 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8" />I be sane ko ngɛ bɔ sami níhi nɛ nyɛ kɛ ba ye bɔ sami la tɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ he, ejakaa nyɛɛ kɛ baa be fɛɛ be. <verse eid="PSA 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9" />Se tsa pi na kuhi kɛ apletsihi nɛ a ma kɛ sã bɔ ɔ ji nɔ́ titli nɛ i ngɛ hlae ngɛ nyɛ dɛ. <verse eid="PSA 50:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10" />Ejakaa nga nɔ kɛ hue mi lohwe ɔmɛ, nahi nɛ ngɛ yokuhi a kpɛ a nɔ kulaa a, ye níhi ji mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11" />Nɛ i le lohwe pɛlitsɛhi nɛ ngɛ yoku ngua amɛ kulaa a nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 50:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12" />Ke hwɔ ngɛ mi yee ɔ, i be nyɛ dee, ejakaa je ɔ tsuo kɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ ngɛ mi ɔ ye níhi i. <verse eid="PSA 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13" />Dabi, nyɛ lo kɛ muɔ nɛ nyɛ kɛ saa bɔ ɔ he hia we mi. <verse eid="PSA 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14" />Nyɛɛ sa si nami afɔle kɛ ha Mawu, nɛ nyɛɛ ye nyɛ si womi ɔmɛ a nɔ kɛ ha hiɔwe No ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 50:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15" />Nɛ nyɛ tsɛ mi ngɛ nyɛ fimi ligbi ɔmɛ a nɔ; ma je nyɛ konɛ nyɛɛ wo ye hɛ mi nyami.”<verse eid="PSA 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16" />Se Mawu de nimli yaya amɛ ke: Nyɛ ko tsi ye mlaa amɛ a nɔ ta hu, nɛ nyɛɛ jɔɔ somi ɔmɛ a he susumi. <verse eid="PSA 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17" />Ejakaa nyɛ kua ye tsɔsemi ɔ, nɛ nyɛ bui ye mlaa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 50:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18" />Nyɛ naa julɔ nɛ nyɛ yeɔ kɛ buaa lɛ, nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ nimli yayahi kɛ ajuama bɔli bɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 50:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19" />Nyɛ gbiɛɛ nɔ, nyɛ yeɔ lakpa, nɛ nyɛ tuɔ munyu basabasahi. <verse eid="PSA 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20" />Nyɛ tuɔ nyɛ nyɛmimɛ a he munyu. <verse eid="PSA 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21" />Nyɛ pee enɛ ɔmɛ kulaa, se nɛ i pui nyɛ nya mi ɔ, e peeɔ nyɛ kaa e hɛwi mi. Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ nyɛ tue gblami be ɔ su, nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ nya poe. <verse eid="PSA 50:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22" />Nyɛ nihi kulaa nɛ nyɛ hɛ je imi nyɛ Mawu ɔ nɔ ɔ, enɛ ɔ ji nyɛ nyagbe he blɔ nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ hae, loko i ma kpata nyɛ hɛ mi, nɛ nɔ ko be nɛ maa ye kɛ bua nyɛ.<verse eid="PSA 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23" />Se anɔkuale yi jemi ji bɔ sami nɛ sa. Nɛ enɛ ɔ ji nɔ nɛ woɔ ye hɛ mi nyami. Nihi nɛ yeɔ ye mlaa amɛ a nɔ ɔ, i ma he a yi wami.<verse eid="PSA 50:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 51</para>
  <para style="s1">David he piami sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo na mi mɔbɔ. Moo ngɔ ye tɔmi ɔmɛ kɛ ke mi ngɛ o suɔmi kɛ mi mi jɔmi babauu ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 51:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2" />Mo fɔ ye he yayami ɔmɛ nɛ ye he nɛ je falefale. <verse eid="PSA 51:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3" />Ejakaa i le ye yayami ɔmɛ, a ngɛ ye hɛ mi daa. <verse eid="PSA 51:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4" />Mo kɛkɛ o nɔ nɛ i tɔ, nɛ i pee nɔ nɛ dɛ ngɛ o hɛ mi. O na kulaa nɛ ye tue gblami ɔ sa mi. Piami ko be o kojomi ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 51:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5" />A ngɔ ye hɔ ngɛ yayami mi, nɛ yayami mi nɔuu a fɔ mi ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 51:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6" />O suɔ anɔkuale nɛ je tsui klɔuu mi, mo ha mi anɔkuale nɛ ɔ he nile ɔ eko.<verse eid="PSA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7" />Mo fɔ ye he yayami ɔmɛ, nɛ ye he maa je ekohu. Moo du ye he ha mi, nɛ i ma hiɔ futafuta pe klala. <verse eid="PSA 51:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8" />Nɛ ke o gbla ye tue se ɔ, mo ha nɛ ma na bua jɔmi ekohu. <verse eid="PSA 51:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9" />Moo ku hɛ ngɔ fɔ ye yayami ɔmɛ a nɔ nɛ o ngɔ ye tɔmi ɔmɛ kulaa kɛ ke mi. <verse eid="PSA 51:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10" />Oo Mawu, moo bɔ tsui nɛ hi kɛ ha mi, tsui nɛ hyi fɔ kɛ susumi kpakpa kɛ níhi nɛ sa. <verse eid="PSA 51:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11" />Mo ko fie mi kɛ je o hɛ mi, nɛ mo ko je o Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɛ ye mi. <verse eid="PSA 51:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12" />Mo ha nɛ ma na o yi wami hemi ɔ mi bua jɔmi ɔ ekohu, nɛ o ha ma bu mo tue. <verse eid="PSA 51:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13" />Nɛ i ma tsɔɔ yayami peeli kpa amɛ o blɔ ɔmɛ nɛ a tsake a tsui, nɛ a kpale kɛ ba o ngɔ. <verse eid="PSA 51:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14" />Mo ko bu mi gbenɔ fɔ. Oo, ye Mawu, mo pɛ o ma nyɛ ye yi wami ma he. I ma la wawɛɛ kɛ je o yi ngɛ ye yi wami hemi ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 51:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo ha mi nya, nɛ i ma la kɛ je o yi.<verse eid="PSA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16" />O nya we bɔ sami he, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke i sã bɔ ha mo tete po e be o hɛ muɔe. <verse eid="PSA 51:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17" />He piami kɛ tsui tsakemi ji nɔ́ nɛ jɔɔ o bua. Oo, Neneene Tsɛ, o kua we nɔ nɛ pia e he ngɛ e tɔmi he ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18" />Moo na Zion mɔbɔ nɛ o pee lɛ kpakpa ngɛ o dloomi ɔ he, nɛ o kpale fia Yerusalem gbogbo ɔmɛ.<verse eid="PSA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19" />Ke ye tsui mi tɛ ɔ, o bua maa jɔ kpakpa nɛ i ma pee ɔ he; nɛ ke i sã bɔ kɛ na kuhi ngɛ o bɔ sami la tɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, o ma na he bua jɔmi.<verse eid="PSA 51:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 52</para>
  <para style="s1">Fiali a nyagbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1" />Mɛni he je nɛ o fiaa, nɛ o tsɛɔ o he katsɛ ngɛ o ni yayami peemi he? Mawu suɔmi se pui. <verse eid="PSA 52:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2" />O he sɔɔ kɛ ga yayahi a tsɔmi, nɛ o lilɛ nya ba kaa yi sɛmi ha, nɛ o tsuɔ yi mi wami ni tsumihi. <verse eid="PSA 52:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3" />O suɔ nɔ́ yayami peemi pe bɔ nɛ o suɔ nɔ́ kpakpa. Nɛ o suɔ lakpa yemi pe anɔkuale tumi. <verse eid="PSA 52:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4" />Ní puɛmi munyu nɛ o tuɔ, mo lakpatsɛ.<verse eid="PSA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5" />Mawu ma kpata o hɛ mi; nɛ e ma je mo kɛ je o sihi he ɔ, nɛ e ma wo mo kɛ je nimli hɛ kali a kpɛti. <verse eid="PSA 52:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6" />Mawu se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ maa na enɛ ɔ nɛ a maa ye gbeye; se a maa muɔ nɛ a ma de ke, <verse eid="PSA 52:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7" />“Nyɛɛ hyɛ níhi nɛ baa ni nɛmɛ nɛ bui Mawu ɔ a nɔ. Nihi nɛ ngɔɔ a hɛ kɛ fɔɔ a ni nami nɔ, nɛ a tsuɔ yi mi wami ni tsumi ɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8" />Se ami lɛɛ i ngɛ kaa nu tso nɛ bɔɔ ngɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu nitsɛ we ɔ, nɛ i ngɔ ye hɛ ngɔ fɔ e mɔbɔ nami nɛ ngɛ daa a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 52:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, i ma je o yi daa ngɛ ye tue gblami ɔ he, nɛ i ma hyɛ o mɔbɔ nami ɔ blɔ ejakaa nɔ fɛɛ nɔ le kaa Mawu mɔbɔ nalɔ ji mo.<verse eid="PSA 52:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 53</para>
  <para style="s1">Yi mi wali a he yayami kɛ a nyagbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1" />Kuasiahi nɛ susuu kaa “Mawu ko be.” Yi mi wali kɛ yayami peeli ji mɛ.<verse eid="PSA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu hyɛɛ adesahi kɛ jee hiɔwe kaa e maa na nɔ́ lelɔ ko nɛ ngɛ e se blɔ hlae lo. <verse eid="PSA 53:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3" />Se mɛ tsuo a puɛ kɛ yayami, nɛ a tsui je Mawu he. Nɔ kake too po be nɛ peeɔ kpakpa, nɔ ko be. <verse eid="PSA 53:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4" />Kɛ e ba kɛɛ? Anɛ yayami peeli be juɛmi lo? Ejakaa a ngɛ ye nimli ɔmɛ yee kaa a yeɔ abolo, nɛ a kua Mawu. <verse eid="PSA 53:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5" />Se e be kɛe nɛ gbeye nɔ́ nɛ a nui eko hyɛ maa ba a nɔ. Mawu maa gbɛ he nyɛli nɛ ɔmɛ a wuhi kɛ fia. A hɛ mi ma kpata, ejakaa Mawu kua mɛ.<verse eid="PSA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6" />Oo, i na nɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu je Zion kɛ ba nɛ e ba he Israel yi wami! Benɛ Neneene Tsɛ ɔ nitsɛ ma kpɔ mɛ ekohu ɔ, a bua maa jɔ a he saminya.<verse eid="PSA 53:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 54</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu yeɔ kɛ buaa nɔ́ nali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo ba kɛ he wami nɛ o ba he ye yi wami. Mo fa ye he kɛ o he wami ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 54:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2" />Oo, moo bu ye pɛɛ kpami ɔ tue. <verse eid="PSA 54:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3" />Ejakaa yi mi wali kɛ basabasa peeli nɛ li Mawu ɔ ngɛ hlae nɛ a gbe mi.<verse eid="PSA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4" />Se Mawu ji ye yemi kɛ bualɔ, nɛ lɛ ji nɔ nɛ le ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 54:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5" />E ma ha ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a ni peemi ni yaya amɛ ma kpa bu a nɔ. Oo Mawu, moo tane dikali nɛ ɔmɛ a yi ngɛ o si womi ɔ nya. <verse eid="PSA 54:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6" />I ma je ye tsui mi kɛ sã bɔ kɛ ha mo; nɛ ma je o biɛ ɔ yi, oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ejakaa e sa.<verse eid="PSA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7" />Ejakaa o je mi kɛ je ye haomi slɔɔto ɔmɛ tsuo a mi, nɛ o ha i ye ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nɔ kunimi.<verse eid="PSA 54:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 55</para>
  <para style="s1">Kɛ ha nihi nɛ huɛmɛ tsɔɔ a se blɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo bu ye pɛɛ kpami ɔ tue; mo ko wo o hɛ mi kɛ laa ngɛ ye ni bimi ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 55:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2" />Moo bu mi tue, Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ejakaa ye haomi ɔmɛ ha nɛ i ngɛ kɔmɔ yee nɛ i ngɛ ya foe.<verse eid="PSA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3" />Ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ bɔle mi kɛ ngɛ ye he gbeye woe kaa a maa gbe mi. A teɔ si kɛ woɔ mi ngɛ mi mi fumi mi. <verse eid="PSA 55:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4" />Ye tsui ngɛ mi yee nɛ gbenɔ fiɛ nu mi. <verse eid="PSA 55:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5" />Gbeye kɛ sawale nu mi nɛ i pee sislii. <verse eid="PSA 55:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6" />Oo, i na nɛ i ngɛ pɛli kaa bleku lahuɛ, jinɛ i ko te kɛ ho lokoo ma je ya nɛ i ya jɔɔ ye he. <verse eid="PSA 55:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7" />Jinɛ i ma ho nga nɔ tsitsaa he ko ya nɛ ma ya hi lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 55:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8" />I ko ma haomi agbo nɛ ɔ nya fo nɛ i ya hla wesa he.<verse eid="PSA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9" />Oo, Neneene Tsɛ, moo gbe a juɛmi nɛ o wo a kpɛti pɛ, nɛ o ha mɛ nitsɛmɛ a basabasa ni peemi ni ɔmɛ nɛ kpata a hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 55:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10" />A ngɛ a ma a he bue nyɔ kɛ pia mohu, se a haomi ɔ ngɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a kpɛti ngɛ ma a mi, nɛ lɔ ɔ ji yi kpɛti wami kɛ lakpa yemi. <verse eid="PSA 55:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11" />A ngɛ nihi gbee, a ngɛ jue nɛ a ngɛ nihi sisie ngɛ jua amɛ a nɔ kɛ he tsuaa he nɛ a maa gu.<verse eid="PSA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12" />Kaa he nyɛlɔ ko nɛ ngɛ mi jɛe ɔ, jinɛ e ko hɛwi mi; jinɛ i ko tu fo kɛ laa lɛ. <verse eid="PSA 55:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13" />Se mo mohu i, mo ye jua, ye fiɛlɔ kɛ ye huɛ. <verse eid="PSA 55:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14" />Mo nɛ i kɛ mo susuu níhi a he nɛ wa sɛɛ ni nɛ wa muɔɔ, nɛ wa nyɛɛ kɛ yaa Mawu We ɔ kaa nɔ kɛ e nyɛmi ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 55:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15" />Mo ha nɛ a gbo kpatakpata, ejakaa yayami ngɛ a wehi a mi nɛ a puɛ kɛ yayami.<verse eid="PSA 55:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16" />Se ami lɛɛ i ma tsɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɛ e he ye yi wami, nɛ e maa pee hulɔ. <verse eid="PSA 55:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17" />Ma sɔle nɛ ma kpa pɛɛ nyɔ kɛ pia nɛ e ma he nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 55:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18" />Ta a nya wa ha mi, ejakaa nihi fuu te si kɛ wo mi, se e ma kpɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 55:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19" />Mawu nitsɛ, nɛ lɛ ji Mawu kɛ je blema a, ma ha mɛ heto. Ejakaa a tue gbo nɛ a yi lɛ gbeye, nɛ a bui kita amɛ hulɔ.<verse eid="PSA 55:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20" />Ye huɛ nɛ i kɛ lɛ ngɛ saminya a tsɔɔ ye se blɔ. E yi e si womi ɔmɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 55:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21" />E nya mi ngɔɔ kaa hwo, se e tsui mi duɔ nɛ awi yemi ngɛ e mi.<verse eid="PSA 55:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22" />Mo wo o kɔmɔ ɔmɛ tsuo kɛ ha Mawu nɛ lɛ e maa ye ha mo. E ha we he blɔ nɛ nɔmlɔ kpakpa hɛ mi pueɔ si. <verse eid="PSA 55:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23" />Mawu maa ngɔ ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ kɛ ya hɛ mi kpatami muɔ ɔ mi, nɛ e maa po nimli gbeli kɛ lakpatsɛ ɔmɛ a ligbi ɔmɛ a nɔ. Se ami lɛɛ i wo ye hɛ kɛ fɔ o nɔ nɛ o ma he ye yi wami.<verse eid="PSA 55:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 56</para>
  <para style="s1">He kɛ Mawu nɔ fɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo na mi mɔbɔ, ejakaa he nyɛli te si kɛ wo mi. A ngɛ mi haoe daa je nɛ maa na. <verse eid="PSA 56:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2" />He nyɛli nɛ kɛ mi ngɛ hwue ɔ a yi gbo, nɛ a ngɛ he blɔ hlae nɛ a ye ye nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3" />Ke be nɛ gbeye nu mi ɔ, i woɔ ye hɛ ngɔ fɔɔ o nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 56:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4" />I ma wo ye hɛ ngɔ fɔ Mawu si womi ɔmɛ a nɔ. Akɛnɛ i woɔ ye hɛ ngɔ fɔɔ Mawu nɔ ɔ, mɛni nɔmlɔ adesa ma nyɛ maa pee mi? <verse eid="PSA 56:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5" />A plɛɛ ye munyu hɛ mi kɛ buɔ si, nɛ a toɔ ye hɛ mi kpatami he ga daa ligbi. <verse eid="PSA 56:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6" />A buaa a he nya nɛ a woɔ ka ha mi ngɛ laami mi. A ngɛ ye se blɔ hlae nɛ a tane ye yi. <verse eid="PSA 56:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7" />A susuu kaa a maa ye a he kɛ a yayami ɔmɛ. Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo ko ha mɛ he blɔ. Mo kplɔ mɛ kɛ pue si ngɛ o mi mi fumi ɔ nya.<verse eid="PSA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8" />O na bɔ nɛ i hao nyɔ nɛ ɔ mi nɛ i fiaa si ha. O nu ye kɔmɔ ɔmɛ. O ngma kulaa ngɛ o womi ɔ mi.<verse eid="PSA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9" />Ligbi ɔ nɛ i tsɛ mo pɛ nɛ ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ kpale ngɛ ye se. I le kaa Mawu ngɛ ye se. <verse eid="PSA 56:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10" />I ngɔ ye hɛ kɛ fɔ Mawu nɔ, nɛ i jeɔ e yi ngɛ e si womi ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 56:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11" />O nɔ nɛ i wo ye hɛ ngɔ fo, mɛni nɔmlɔ adesa ma nyɛ mi maa pee? <verse eid="PSA 56:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, i ma ye ye si womi ɔmɛ a nɔ ha mo nɛ i ma na mo si ngɛ o yemi kɛ buami ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 56:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13" />Ejakaa o kpɔ mi kɛ je gbenɔ dɛ mi, nɛ o ha we nɛ ye nane nɛ sane, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma sɔmɔ mo Tsaatsɛ Mawu ngɛ hɛ kali a zugba a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 56:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 57</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu kpɔ David kɛ je Matsɛ Saulo dɛ mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, moo na mi mɔbɔ, ejakaa o nɔ nɛ i ngɔ ye hɛ kɛ fɔ. O ngɔ nɛ i ma sa we ngɛ kɛ ya si haomi nɛ ɔ nya maa be. <verse eid="PSA 57:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2" />I ma kpa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ Hiɔwe Mawu ɔ, nɔ nɛ haa mi ye hiami ni ɔmɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 57:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3" />E maa tsɔ kɛ je hiɔwe lokoo nɛ a ba he ye yi wami ngɛ e suɔmi kɛ anɔkuale ɔ he je. E ma kpɔ mi kɛ je nihi nɛ ngɛ mi haoe, nɛ ngɛ ye hɛ mi kpatami hlae ɔ a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 57:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4" />He nyɛli nɛ ngɛ kaa jatahi bɔle mi kɛ kpe. A lungu nya ba kaa akplɔ kɛ kɛ̃ɛ̃ mi bi, nɛ a lilɛ hu nya ba kaa ha. <verse eid="PSA 57:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo je o klemi ɔ kpo ngɛ hiɔwe lokoo nɛ o ha nɛ a na o anunyami ɔ ngɛ zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 57:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6" />Ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ tsɔ mi klama nɛ i ye gbeye. A tsua muɔ ha mi, se mɛ nitsɛmɛ a ya nɔ mi.<verse eid="PSA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, ye bua jɔ ye he. I ma la kɛ je o yi. <verse eid="PSA 57:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8" />O hɛ nɛ tsiɛ, ye susuma, nɛ o fia saku kɛ je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi. <verse eid="PSA 57:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9" />I ma na mo si ngɛ ma hɛ mi, nɛ i ma je o yi ngɛ he fɛɛ he. <verse eid="PSA 57:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10" />Ejakaa o mi mi jɔmi kɛ o suɔmi kpe je ɔ kɛ ho hiɔwe lokoo ya.<verse eid="PSA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo ha nɛ o agbo jemi ɔ nɛ je si ngɛ hiɔwe, nɛ a na o anunyami ɔ ngɛ zugba a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 57:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 58</para>
  <para style="s1">Yi mi wali a tue gblami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1" />Nyɛ kojoli, anɛ nyɛ kojoɔ ngɛ dami nya lo? Nyɛ nɔ yeli, anɛ nyɛ yeɔ dami sane lo? <verse eid="PSA 58:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2" />Dabi, dika yemi he pɛ nyɛ susuu, nɛ nyɛ yeɔ awi ngɛ zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 58:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3" />A fɔ mɛ yayami peeli, nɛ a bɔni lakpa yemi kɛ je a jokuɛwi a si tɔɔ <verse eid="PSA 58:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4" />A ngɛ kaa sinɔ duɔtsɛhi, loo sanga nɛ tsi e tue, <verse eid="PSA 58:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5" />konɛ e ko nu sinɔ tsopatsɛ ko gbi.<verse eid="PSA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo ku a so ɔmɛ. Mo kplɔ jata bi nɛ ɔmɛ a lungu ɔmɛ ngɛ a nya mi. <verse eid="PSA 58:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7" />Mo ha nɛ a mii kaa nyu ngɛ zugba gbigbli nɔ. Nɛ o ha a ta hwumi ni ɔmɛ a he nɛ ko ba se nami. <verse eid="PSA 58:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8" />Nɛ a laa kaa ahua laa ngɛ basa mi; nɛ o ha a gbo kaa bɔ nɛ bimwɔwi gboɔ ngɛ muɔ nɔ nɛ a nɛ pu hɛ mi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 58:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9" />Mawu maa wɛɛ mɛ, nikɔtɔma kɛ jokuɛ tsuo. E ma ngla mɛ oya pe bɔ nɛ la tsoo kɛ nuu kutu sisi loko e dɔɔ la a.<verse eid="PSA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10" />Dali maa na yayami peeli nɛ ɔmɛ a tue gblami ɔ nɛ a bua maa jɔ; nɛ a maa nyɛɛ nga nɔ he nɛ dikali ɔmɛ a muɔ pue si ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 58:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11" />Nɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ maa na kaa dali ngɛ hiɔwo, nɛ niinɛ Mawu ko ngɛ nɛ yeɔ dami sane ngɛ zugba a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 58:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 59</para>
  <para style="s1">Yayami peeli a hiɔ womi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo kpɔ mi kɛ je ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a dɛ mi. Moo bu ye he nɛ hɛ mi kpatali nɛ ɔmɛ a nine nɛ ko su ye nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 59:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2" />Moo baa ye yi nɛ o kpɔ mi kɛ je dikali kɛ nɔ gbeli nɛ ɔmɛ a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 59:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3" />A wo ka nɛ a tane ye yi. Oo, Tsaatsɛ Mawu, dikali kpanakuhi kpe kɛ wo ye he, nɛ pi yayami ko nɛ i pee hulɔ. <verse eid="PSA 59:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4" />Se kɛ ɔ, a ngɛ hlae nɛ a kpata ye hɛ mi. Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo wo o he nɔ nɛ o ye kɛ bua mi. <verse eid="PSA 59:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, oo Yehowa, tahi a Mawu, Israel Mawu, o hɛ nɛ tsiɛ nɛ o gbla yayami peeli ɔmɛ tsuo a tue. Mo ko na dikali yayami peeli nɛ ɔmɛ mɔbɔ. <verse eid="PSA 59:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6" />A baa daa gbɔkuɛ nɛ a ba hwɔɔ wɔ. A hii si poe ngɛ ma a mi kaa gbehi. <verse eid="PSA 59:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7" />A kpaa ngmlaa nɛ a tuɔ munyu basabasa kɛ siɔ Mawu, nɛ a susuu kaa nɔ ko be nue. <verse eid="PSA 59:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8" />Se Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o muɔɔ mɛ, nɛ o yeɔ mahi nɛ jaa wɔ ɔmɛ a he fɛu.<verse eid="PSA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, Mo nɔ nɛ o haa mi he wami, i ma la kɛ je o yi, ejakaa mo ji ye wesa he. <verse eid="PSA 59:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10" />Ye Mawu suɔmi nɛ e kɛ suɔ mi ɔ tsakee we. E ma ba ye kɛ bua mi nɛ i ma ye ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nɔ kunimi. <verse eid="PSA 59:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11" />Mo ko tane a yi, ejakaa e kɛ we nɛ ye ma mi bi ɔmɛ a hɛ jee kikɛmɛ a tue gblami nɛ ɔ nɔ; se mohu ha nɛ a didaa ngɛ o he wami ɔ nya nɛ o si mɛ si; mo ji wa he pulelɔ. <verse eid="PSA 59:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12" />A ji he nɔ woli, nɔ gbiɛli kɛ lakpa yeli sɔuu, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, o nine nɛ su a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 59:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13" />Mo kpata a hɛ mi ngɛ mi mi fumi mi, mo kpata a hɛ mi kɛ ya si a be mɛ nae hu, konɛ nimli adesahi a le kaa Tsaatsɛ Mawu ji nɔ nɛ yeɔ Israel nɔ kɛ ya si zugba a nyagbe hehi kulaa. <verse eid="PSA 59:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14" />A kpaleɔ kɛ baa daa gbɔkuɛ kɛ ngmlaa kaa gbehi, nɛ a hii ma a mi kpae. <verse eid="PSA 59:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15" />A kpaa si kɛ hlaa niye ni, nɛ a ha we nɛ a nu nɔ́, ke a tɔɛ.<verse eid="PSA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16" />Se ami lɛɛ, i ma la daa mɔtu kɛ je o he wami kɛ o mɔbɔ nami ɔ yi, ejakaa mo ji ye laami he kɛ ye wesa he ngɛ ye fimi be mi. <verse eid="PSA 59:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, Mo nɔ nɛ haa mi he wami, ma la kɛ je o yi, ejakaa mo ji ye wesa he kɛ mɔbɔ nalɔ.<verse eid="PSA 59:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 60</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel kpɔmi he Sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o kua wɔ nɛ o ku wa he gbogbohi tsuo. O mi mi fu nɛ o si wɔ. Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo pee wɔ o nihi ekohu. <verse eid="PSA 60:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2" />O ha nɛ ma nɛ ɔ ye gbeye nɛ e hoso; o ywia ma a. Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo dla ma a amlɔ nɛ ɔ nɔuu, ejakaa e huanya kɛ e sisi tomi ɔ tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 60:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3" />O wa wɔ yi mi wawɛɛ, nɛ o ha wa na nɔ saminya.<verse eid="PSA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4" />Se o ha wɔ aflaangaa nɛ maa nyɛɛ wa hɛ mi. Nɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ suɔ anɔkuale ɔ maa nyɛɛ e se, <verse eid="PSA 60:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5" />konɛ o nyɛ nɛ o kpɔ o suɔmi bi ɔmɛ. Moo ngɔ o hiɔ nine nɛ mi wa a nɛ o kɛ kpɔ wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 60:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu de kɛ je e he klɔuklɔu ɔ ke, “I ma gba Sekem kɛ Suko dɔ ɔ kɛ ha ye nimli ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 60:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7" />Ye nɔ ji Gilead kɛ Manase. Efraim ma fɔ tatsɛ nguahi, nɛ Yuda mi matsɛhi maa je. <verse eid="PSA 60:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8" />Moab maa pee ye sɔmɔlɔ, nɛ Edom hu ye nyɔguɛ. Nɛ i ma ye Filisti bi ɔmɛ a nɔ kunimi.”<verse eid="PSA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9" />Mɛnɔ kɛ mi maa ya Edom mahi nɛ a ngɛ a he bue ɔ a mi nɛ ma ya ye a nɔ kunimi? <verse eid="PSA 60:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10" />Mawu ji nɔ nɛ maa pee. Nɔ nɛ sake wɔ kɛ fɔ he ɔ! Lɛ Nɔ nɛ ngmɛɛ wa he kɛ ha wa he nyɛli ɔmɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 60:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo ye kɛ bua wɔ nɛ waa kɛ wa he nyɛli ɔmɛ nɛ kpe, ejakaa adesa yemi kɛ buami sui he ko.<verse eid="PSA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12" />Ke Mawu ye kɛ bua wɔ ɔ, wa maa pee ni nguahi, ejakaa e maa naa wa he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 60:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 61</para>
  <para style="s1">He bumi sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo bu mi tue! Moo bu ye sɔlemi kɛ pɛɛ kpami ɔ tue! <verse eid="PSA 61:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2" />Se he fɛɛ he nɛ i ngɛ ɔ, ke zugba a nyagbe he tsitsaa tete ɔ, i ma kpa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ mo nɛ o ye kɛ bua mi. Ke ye mumi nya ta, nɛ ye tsui hao ɔ , mo kpaka mi kɛ ya Tɛ ngua gojoo ɔ he, nɛ ma na laami he. <verse eid="PSA 61:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3" />Ejakaa mo ji ye wesa he, mwɔ nɛ he wa, he nɛ ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nine be ye nɔ sue ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 61:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4" />Oo, i ma hi o we ɔ daa, konɛ ye yi nɛ na wami ngɛ o pɛlihi a sisi. <verse eid="PSA 61:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, o nu ye si womi ɔmɛ, nɛ o jɔɔ mi kɛ jɔɔmi nɛ o ngɔ kɛ to ha nihi nɛ buu o biɛ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6" />Moo piɛ matsɛ ɔ jeha amɛ a he ha lɛ, nɛ e se nɛ kɛ ngɛ je mi. <verse eid="PSA 61:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7" />Ha nɛ e ye matsɛ ngɛ o biɛ mi daa. Oo, mo ha nɛ o suɔmi kɛ mi mi jɔmi kɛ anɔkuale ɔ nɛ bu e he. <verse eid="PSA 61:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8" />Nɛ i ma je o biɛ ɔ yi be fɛɛ be, nɛ i ma ye ye si womi kaa i ma je o yi daa a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 61:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 62</para>
  <para style="s1">Ngɔɔ o hɛ kɛ fɔ Mawu pɛ nɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1" />I daa si dii ngɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu hɛ mi, nɛ i ngɛ lɛ mlɛe nɛ e kpɔ mi. Ejakaa e ngɔ kɛkɛ nɛ a naa yi wami hemi kɛ jee. <verse eid="PSA 62:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2" />Hɛɛ, lɛ kɛkɛ ji ye tɛ sa, ye kpɔlɔ, ye he bulɔ kɛ ye laami he. Mɛni he je mɔ nɛ i ma ye gbeye ke haomi ko ba ye nɔ?<verse eid="PSA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3" />Mɛni be nyɛ maa hao nɔmlɔ kake ɔ kɛ ya si, nɛ nyɛ tsuo nyɛ ma tsitsɛɛ lɛ kɛ fɔ si, nɔ nɛ ngɛ kaa gbogbo nɛ ngɛ hulee aloo piɛ nɛ ngɛ si nɔe ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 62:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4" />A yi mi tomi kɛkɛ ji kaa a je lɛ kɛ je e sɛ ɔ nɔ. A naa lakpa yemi he bua jɔmi, nɛ benɛ a ngɛ jɔɔe kɛ a nya a, a ngɛ gbiɛe ngɛ a mi. <verse eid="PSA 62:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5" />Se i daa si dii ngɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu hɛ mi, nɛ i ngɛ lɛ mlɛe nɛ e kpɔ mi. Ejakaa e ngɔ kɛkɛ nɛ a naa yi wami hemi kɛ jee. <verse eid="PSA 62:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6" />Hɛɛ, lɛ kɛkɛ ji ye tɛ sa, ye kpɔlɔ, ye he bulɔ kɛ ye laami he. Mɛni he je mɔ nɛ i ma ye gbeye ke haomi ko ba ye nɔ?<verse eid="PSA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7" />Ye he bumi kɛ ye nɔ yami jee Mawu kɛkɛ dɛ mi. Lɛ ji ye wesa he, he nɛ he nyɛlɔ ko nine be ye nɔ sue ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 62:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8" />Oo ye we bimɛ, nyɛɛ ngɔ nyɛ hɛ kɛ fɔ e nɔ be fɛɛ be. Nyɛɛ ngɔ nyɛ hiami ni ɔmɛ kulaa kɛ fɔ e hɛ mi, ejakaa e ma nyɛ maa ye kɛ bua nyɛ. <verse eid="PSA 62:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9" />Nimli nguahi kɛ nimli guhi kulaa ji nɔ́ ko ngɛ e hɛ mi. Ke a ngmɛ mɛ ɔ, kɔɔhiɔ po jiɔ pe mɛ.<verse eid="PSA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10" />Nyɛ ko fia ojo, nɛ nyɛ ko ju. Ke nyɛ bɔni ni nami ɔ, nyɛɛ kɛ nyɛ hɛ nɛ ko fɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 62:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11" />Ke Mawu tu munyu ɔ, e sa nɛ ma bu tue, ejakaa e dɛ mi nɛ he wami ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 62:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12" />Suɔlɔ kɛ mi mi jɔlɔ ji Mawu, nɛ e woɔ wa ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ hiɔ ngɛ wa ni tsumihi nɛ wa tsuɔ kɛ haa lɛ ɔ he.<verse eid="PSA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 63</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu se blɔ hlami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ye Mawu, hyɛ bɔ nɛ i hla o se blɔ hluu ha! Hyɛ bɔ nɛ o he kuma ye mi ha ngɛ nga kplanaa nɛ ɔ nɔ, he nɛ nyu ko be. O he hia mi saminya! <verse eid="PSA 63:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2" />I suɔ kaa ma ya o he klɔuklɔu ɔ konɛ ma na o he wami kɛ o anunyami ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 63:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3" />Ejakaa o suɔmi kɛ o mi mi jɔmi hi ha mi hluu pe wami tete. I ngɛ o yi jee. <verse eid="PSA 63:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4" />I ma je o yi be abɔ nɛ i ngɛ je mi ɔ, nɛ i ma wo ye ninehi a nɔ nɛ ma sɔle kɛ ha mo. <verse eid="PSA 63:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5" />Nyagbe mi ɔ, ye bua maa jɔ ye he saminya, nɛ i ma je o yi kɛ bua jɔmi babauu.<verse eid="PSA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6" />I hwɔɛ mahe nyɔnyɔɔnyɔ nɛ i ngɛ o he susue, <verse eid="PSA 63:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7" />ngɛ bɔ nɛ o ye kɛ bua mi ɔ he. Nɛ ye bua jɔ ye he babauu nyɔ ɔ mi tsuo benɛ i ngɛ o pɛlihi a sisi nɛ o ngɛ ye he bue ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 63:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8" />I nyɛɛ o se kpakpaakpa, nɛ o hiɔ nine nɛ mi wa a hɛɛ ye mi nɛ e ngɛ ye he bue. <verse eid="PSA 63:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9" />Se nihi nɛ ngɛ ye gbemi he ga woe ɔ maa ya neneene hɛ mi kpatami mi. <verse eid="PSA 63:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10" />A ma gbo ngɛ klaate nya nɛ nga mi gbehi maa ye mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 63:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11" />Se ami lɛɛ ye bua maa jɔ ye he ngɛ Mawu mi. Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ heɔ e nɔ yeɔ ɔ, e bua nɛ jɔ, se lakpatsɛ ɔmɛ lɛɛ a ma ha a maa pee dii.<verse eid="PSA 63:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 64</para>
  <para style="s1">He bumi Sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo bu ye sɔlemi ɔ tue! <verse eid="PSA 64:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2" />Oo, moo bu ye he kɛ je yi mi wali kɛ awi yeli nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ ye he ga woe ɔ a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 64:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3" />A puɛ mi kɛ a lilɛhi nɛ nya ba amɛ. A nya mi munyuhi hí, a gbɔɔ mi ngɛ ye tsui mi tɔɔ kaa kɛ̃ɛ̃ mi bihi. <verse eid="PSA 64:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4" />A fiaa nɔ nɛ li nɔ́ ko ɔ nɔ́ ngɛ laami mi. A peeɔ enɛ ɔ nɛ a yi gbeye. <verse eid="PSA 64:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5" />A woɔ a si bi he wami nɛ a pee nɔ́ yayami. A kpee ngɛ laami mi nɛ a tsɔɔ a klama amɛ. A deɔ ke, “A be wɔ nae ngɛ hiɛ ɔ gblee!” <verse eid="PSA 64:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6" />A peeɔ klaalo kɛ hlaa yayami peemi se blɔ. A puɛɔ be babauu kɛ hii a ni yayami ɔmɛ a he susue.<verse eid="PSA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7" />Se Mawu nitsɛ maa fia mɛ nɔ́ kɛ fɔ si. E kɛ̃ɛ̃ mi bi ɔ ma na mɛ tlukaa. <verse eid="PSA 64:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8" />E ma kpata a hɛ mi ngɛ a nya mi munyu nɛ hí ɔ he je, nɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ maa na a ma huanya yi. <verse eid="PSA 64:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9" />Kɛkɛ ɔ, nɔ tsuaa nɔ maa ye gbeye nɛ a maa jaje nyakpɛ ni nguahi nɛ Mawu pee ɔmɛ, nɛ a maa nu sisi. <verse eid="PSA 64:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10" />Nɛ dalɔ ɔ bua maa jɔ ngɛ Mawu mi. E ma he e nɔ maa ye nɛ e ma je e yi.<verse eid="PSA 64:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 65</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu he wami kɛ e ni kpakpa peemi ɔmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɛ ngɛ Zion, wa daa si ngɛ o yi jee, nɛ wa ngɛ wa si womi ɔmɛ a nɔ yee. <verse eid="PSA 65:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2" />Akɛnɛ o buu sɔlemi kɛ pɛɛ kpami tue he je ɔ, adesa fɛɛ adesa maa ba o ngɔ kɛ a hiami ni ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 65:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3" />Yayami ngɛ wa tsui mi, se o kɛ kee wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 65:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4" />A jɔɔ nɔ nɛ o hla nɛ e hi o hi he klɔuklɔu ɔ. Ní kpakpa amɛ nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ma ha wɔ bua jɔmi babauu. <verse eid="PSA 65:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu wa kpɔlɔ, kɛ gu o ni tsumihi kɛ o he wami nɛ he ngɛ gbeye ɔ nɔ ɔ, o ma fɔ wa he kɛ je wa he nyɛli a dɛ mi. Mo pɛ ji adesa fɛɛ adesa hɛ nɔ kami ngɛ je ɔ mi kulaa kɛ wo nɔ tsitsaa.<verse eid="PSA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6" />O bɔ yoku ɔmɛ kɛ o he wami ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 65:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7" />O jɔɔ wo ɔmɛ a glimi kɛ je ɔ tsuo gidigidi peemi he. <verse eid="PSA 65:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8" />Mawu, o anunyami ni peemi ni ɔmɛ peeɔ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nyakpɛ ngɛ je ɔ kɔ nya he fɛɛ he. Mɔtu kɛ gbɔkuɛ kulaa a, a naa bua jɔmi. <verse eid="PSA 65:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9" />O haa nyu nɛɛ kɛ pueɔ zugba a nɔ nɛ e baa ni. Mawu, o pa amɛ a mi be gblie! O dlaa zugba a kɛ haa o bimɛ nɛ e haa a kpaa blɛfo babauu. <verse eid="PSA 65:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10" />O haa nyu nɛɛ babauu nɛ dɔ ɔmɛ hyiɔ. Nyu fiami haa nɛ zugba a he jɔɔ nɛ zu kpɔ ɔmɛ ywiaa, nɛ dumi wu ɔmɛ puɛɔ. <verse eid="PSA 65:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11" />O ha nɛ ni baa babauu ngɛ jeha a tsuo mi, nɛ he tsuaa he nɛ o maa gu ɔ, niye ni baa lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 65:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12" />Nga amɛ a nɔ hyiɔ tɔtɔɔtɔ kɛ ngma, nɛ yoku ɔmɛ a he hu peeɔ bua jɔmi kɛ niye ni sɔuu. <verse eid="PSA 65:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13" />Tohi hyiɔ nga amɛ a nɔ, nɛ dɔ ɔmɛ a mi yuɔ kɛ blɛfo sɔuu. Je ɔ tsuo laa kɛ bua jɔmi.<verse eid="PSA 65:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 66</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu yi jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1" />Je ɔ tsuo nyɛ la kɛ je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi! <verse eid="PSA 66:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2" />Nyɛ la kɛ je e anunyami biɛ ɔ yi. Nɛ nyɛɛ tsɔɔ bɔ nɛ e he ngɛ nyakpɛ ha.<verse eid="PSA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, hyɛ bɔ nɛ o ni tsumi ɔmɛ a he ngɛ gbeye ha! O he wami kle, nɛ e be nyakpɛ kaa o he nyɛli ɔmɛ ha yi. <verse eid="PSA 66:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4" />Je ɔ kulaa ma kpla si ma ja mo, nɛ a ma la kɛ je o yi ngɛ o anunyami ní ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 66:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5" />Nyɛɛ ba nɛ nyɛ ba hyɛ anunyami níhi nɛ Mawu tsu, kɛ nyakpɛ níhi nɛ e ha a ba e nimli ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 66:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6" />E je blɔ kɛ gu wo ɔ kpɛti kɛ ha mɛ, nɛ a po wo ɔ kɛ nane. Jamɛ a ligbi ɔ pee bua jɔmi kɛ nyami ligbi.<verse eid="PSA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7" />Ngɛ e he wami ɔ he je ɔ, e maa ye matsɛ kɛ ya neneene. E hyɛɛ ma amɛ tsuo a je mi bami. Oo nyɛ mahi nɛ nyɛ tsɔɔ atuã, e maa ba nyɛ si.<verse eid="PSA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8" />Nyɛ je Mawu yi, nyɛ je ɔ kulaa, nyɛ la kɛ je e yi. <verse eid="PSA 66:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9" />Ejakaa wa wami ngɛ e dɛ mi, nɛ e hɛɛ wa mi konɛ wa ko nɔ si. <verse eid="PSA 66:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o ka wɔ hyɛ ha, nɛ o kɛ tsu wa he kaa a tsuɔ sika hiɔ he ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 66:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11" />O kɛ o ya a du wɔ, nɛ o ngɔ tlomihi nɛ jiɔ kɛ tloo wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 66:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12" />O ha nɛ he nyɛli wa wɔ yi mi. Wa nyɛɛ la mi nɛ wa po pa hu. Se nyagbe mi ɔ, o ke wɔ ba ni nami kɛ he jɔmi mi.<verse eid="PSA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i ba o Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ ma ba ye ye si womi ɔ nɔ nɛ ma sa afɔle kɛ ha mo. <verse eid="PSA 66:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14" />Ejakaa be mi nɛ i sɛ haomi mi ɔ, i wo mo sihi fuu. <verse eid="PSA 66:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ i ngɔ apletsi kuhi kɛ jijɔ kuhi kɛ na kuhi nɛ wo zɔ kɛ ba ngɛ. Nɛ bɔ sami la su ku ɔ maa ba o ngɔ.<verse eid="PSA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16" />Nyɛɛ ba nɛ nyɛ ba nu, nyɛ nihi tsuo nɛ nyɛ buu Mawu ɔ, nɛ i ma de nyɛ níhi nɛ e tsu kɛ ha mi. <verse eid="PSA 66:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17" />Ejakaa i kpa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ lɛ nɛ e ye kɛ bua mi, nɛ i je e yi. <verse eid="PSA 66:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18" />E ji i jaje we ye tomi ɔmɛ ɔ, jinɛ e be mi tue bue. <verse eid="PSA 66:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19" />Se e bu mi tue. E nu ye sɔlemi kɛ pɛɛ kpami ɔ, nɛ e ha mi heto.<verse eid="PSA 66:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20" />A je Mawu yi daa, ejakaa e bu ye sɔlemi ɔ tue, nɛ e suɔmi kɛ mɔbɔ nami ɔ ngɛ ye nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 66:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66" />
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 67</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu tsɔlɔ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo na wɔ mɔbɔ nɛ o jɔɔ wɔ. Mo ha nɛ o hɛ mi nɛ kpɛ ngɛ wa nɔ kɛ bua jɔmi, be mi nɛ o plɛ ngɛ wɔ hyɛe ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 67:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2" />Moo tsɔ wɔ je ɔ mi tsuo nɛ wa ya jaje o yi wami hemi he wami ɔ he sane kɛ neneene blɔ nya nɛ o to kɛ ha nimli adesahi kulaa a. <verse eid="PSA 67:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3" />Oo, i na nɛ je ɔ tsuo je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi! <verse eid="PSA 67:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4" />Oo, je ɔ kulaa ma na bua jɔmi nɛ a ma la, ejakaa mo ji a Matsɛ, nɛ o maa kojo ngɛ dami nya. <verse eid="PSA 67:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5" />Oo, je ɔ tsuo nɛ je Mawu yi! Nɛ je ɔ mi bimɛ kulaa a na mo si. <verse eid="PSA 67:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6" />Ejakaa zugba a ba ni babauu. Tsaatsɛ Mawu, wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa Mawu ɔ, e jɔɔ wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 67:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7" />Nihi nɛ ngɛ zugba kpahi a nɔ lokoo ɔ ma ja lɛ.<verse eid="PSA 67:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67" />
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 68</para>
  <para style="s1">Je ɔ kulaa a Mawu ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo te si nɛ o gbɛ ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ kɛ fia! Moo fie mɛ kɛ ho! <verse eid="PSA 68:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2" />Moo nyɛɛ a se kaa la su ku nyɛɛ kɔɔhiɔ se ɔ. Mo ha nɛ a hɛ mi nɛ kpata kulaa kaa hwo gbaku nɛ sile ngɛ la mi. Mo ha nɛ yi mi wali ɔmɛ a hɛ mi nɛ kpata ngɛ o hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 68:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3" />Se dalɔ nɛ nya. E bua nɛ jɔ nɛ e nya. <verse eid="PSA 68:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4" />Nyɛ la nɛ nyɛ je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi. Nyɛ wo nyɛ gbi nɔ nɛ nyɛ la kɛ je e yi, nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ bɔ kuu mi ɔ. Yehowa ji e biɛ. Oo, nyɛ nya ngɛ e hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 68:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5" />Lɛ ji awusahi a tsɛ; e yeɔ yalɔyihi a sane haa mɛ, ejakaa e ngɛ klɔuklɔu. <verse eid="PSA 68:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6" />E haa nɔ nɛ be nɔ ko ɔ naa weku, nɛ e jeɔ nihi nɛ a wo mɛ tsu mi nɛ a ngɛ lae kɛ bua jɔmi ɔ. Se atuã tsɔli ɔmɛ lɛɛ hwɔ maa ye mɛ nɛ a maa na nɔ́.<verse eid="PSA 68:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, be mi nɛ o kpaka o nimli ɔmɛ kɛ gu nga a nɔ ɔ <verse eid="PSA 68:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8" />zugba hoso nɛ Hiɔwe si. Sinai Yoku ɔ huanya ngɛ o hɛ mi, mo Israel Mawu ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 68:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o ha nɛ nyu ba nɛ ngɛ o zugba a nɔ fuu, e ha zugba a hi nɛ e ba ni. <verse eid="PSA 68:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10" />Lejɛ ɔ ji he nɛ o nimli ɔmɛ hi, ejakaa lejɛ ɔ ji he nɛ o ngɔ kɛ ha mɛ kaa a we, be mi nɛ a ngɛ fimi mi ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 68:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu wo gbi. Yihi babauu hwɔ lele kɛ bua jɔmi ke, <verse eid="PSA 68:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12" />“Ta amɛ nɛ ba tua wɔ nɛ a kpata wa hɛ mi ɔ, a gbɛ fia!” Yi ɔmɛ nɛ a si ngɛ se ɔ dla ta ni ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 68:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13" />Nyɛɛ hyɛ bɔ nɛ a he ngɛ kpɛe kɛ june nɛ a ha ngɛ ta a mi ɔ. A he fɛɛ he ngɛ kpɛe kaa lahuɛ he tsɛli. <verse eid="PSA 68:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14" />Mawu gbɛ a he nyɛli ɔmɛ kɛ fia kaa bɔ nɛ kɔɔhiɔ gbɛɛ ba gbigbli kɛ fiaa ngɛ Zalmon hue tso ɔmɛ a mi ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 68:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15" />Oo Basan yoku nguahi! <verse eid="PSA 68:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16" />Oo Basan yoku gagahi nɛ ngɛ fɛu! Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ ngɛ Zion Yoku ɔ hunga jee, he nɛ Mawu hla nɛ e maa hi kɛ ya neneene ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 68:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu hia kɛ e he bɔfohi babauu kɛ je Sinai Yoku ɔ nɔ kɛ ho e Sɔlemi We klɔuklɔu ɔ mi ya ngɛ Zion Yoku ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 68:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18" />E kpaka nihi babauu nɛ a nuu mɛ ɔ kɛ kuɔ yoku ɔmɛ. E ngɔ nike níhi nɛ e na amɛ kɛ ha nyumuhi, nihi tete nɛ a ji atuã tsɔli ngɛ be ko nɛ be ɔ mi ɔ. Tsaatsɛ Mawu maa hi wa kpɛti ngɛ hiɛ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 68:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19" />E ji anunyami Mawu! Lɛ nɛ e tlooɔ wa tlomi ɔmɛ daa, nɛ e heɔ wa yi wami hulɔ.<verse eid="PSA 68:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20" />E jeɔ wɔ! E kpɔɔ wɔ kɛ jeɔ gbenɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 68:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21" />Se e maa ku e he nyɛli ɔmɛ dukuduku, ejakaa a jɔɔ we a fɔ yemi ni ɔmɛ peemi, nɛ a ngmɛɛ we a kuɛ mi timi ni peemi ni ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 68:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu de ke, “I ma kpale mɛ kɛ je Basan kɛ ba ekohu, i ma kpale ye we bi ɔmɛ kɛ je wo ɔ sisi lokoo kɛ ba ekohu; <verse eid="PSA 68:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23" />konɛ nyɛ kpata nyɛ he nyɛli ɔmɛ a hɛ mi. Nɛ nyɛɛ ngɔ a muɔ kɛ kpa nyɛ nanehi a he, nɛ nyɛ gbehi a ye mɛ.”<verse eid="PSA 68:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ye Matsɛ ɔ, kɛ e se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ yaa e sihi he klɔuklɔu ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 68:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25" />Lali nyɛɛ e hɛ mi, la poli ngɛ e se, nɛ yiwi nɛ ngɛ akasawa fiae nyɛɛ kpɛti. <verse eid="PSA 68:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26" />Nyɛ ha nɛ nihi tsuo nɛ ngɛ Israel ɔ a je Mawu yi, lɛ ji Israel yemi kɛ bualɔ. <verse eid="PSA 68:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27" />Benyamin wɛtso wayo ɔ maa nyɛɛ hɛ mi. Yuda matsɛmɛ kɛ nimeli kɛ Zebulun kɛ Naftali matsɛmɛ maa nyɛɛ se tutuutu. <verse eid="PSA 68:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo wlua o he, nɛ o tsɔɔ o kpɔ mi he wami, ejakaa o tsu ni nguahi kɛ ha wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 68:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29" />Je mi matsɛ ɔmɛ ngɔ a nike ni ɔmɛ kɛ ma o Sɔlemi We ɔ ngɛ Yerusalem. <verse eid="PSA 68:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, mo ka wa he nyɛli ɔmɛ a hɛ mi. Moo jɔɔ a he nɛ o ha a ngɔ a akɔblee ɔmɛ kɛ ba. Moo gbɛ nihi nɛ nyaa ta hwumi he ɔ kɛ fia. <verse eid="PSA 68:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31" />Mizraim maa ngɔ dadehi nɛ he jua wa kɛ ba kɛ. Etiopia ma kpa e ninehi a mi nɛ e maa sɔle kɛ je Mawu yi. <verse eid="PSA 68:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32" />Oo, nyɛ zugba a nɔ matsɛmɛ, nyɛ la kɛ ha Tsaatsɛ Mawu; nyɛ la nɛ nyɛ je e yi. <verse eid="PSA 68:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33" />Lɛ ji nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ ngɛ Hiɔwe blema a, nɔ nɛ woɔ gbi ngɛ bɔ kuu ɔ mi ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 68:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34" />Mawu nɔ ji he wami! A naa e agbo jemi ɔ ngɛ Israel; e he wami ɔ kle ngɛ hiɔwe. <verse eid="PSA 68:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35" />Israel Mawu ɔ he ngɛ gbeye ngɛ e sihi he klɔuklɔu ɔ. E haa e we bimɛ he wami. A je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi!<verse eid="PSA 68:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68" />
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 69</para>
  <para style="s1">Sɔmɔlɔ nɛ ngɛ nɔ nae ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1" />Oo ye Mawu, mo kpɔ mi! Nyu ngɛ mi jee! <verse eid="PSA 69:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2" />Nyu bɔle mi kɛ kpe nɛ ye yi ngɛ mue. <verse eid="PSA 69:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3" />I fo ya hluu nɛ pɔ tɔ ye he, Ye kuɛ si gbli nɛ ye gbi fia. Ye hɛ ngmɛhi fuu ngɛ ya nɛ i fo ɔ he je. I ngɛ ye Mawu ɔ mlɛe nɛ e je mi. <verse eid="PSA 69:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4" />Ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ hiɛ fuu. I pee we mɛ nɔ ko se a ngɛ ye se blɔ hlae nɛ a gbe mi. A ngɛ hlae nɛ a gbla ye tue be mi nɛ i pee we nɔ ko.<verse eid="PSA 69:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o le bɔ nɛ i jee kuasia ha, nɛ o le ye yayami ɔmɛ kulaa. <verse eid="PSA 69:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, mo ko ha nɛ zo nɛ gbe ni nɛmɛ nɛ heɔ o nɔ yeɔ ɔ ngɛ ye he. Oo Israel Mawu, mo ko ha nɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ o se blɔ hlae ɔ a hɛ mi nɛ pue si. <verse eid="PSA 69:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7" />Ejakaa o he je ɔ, ye he guɛ gbo nɛ zo gbe mi. <verse eid="PSA 69:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8" />Ye nyɛmimɛ tete pee kaa nihi nɛ li mi. <verse eid="PSA 69:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9" />Mawu kɛ e We ɔ he hɛ dɔ yi ye nɔ. Akɛnɛ i hɛɛ o ni tsumi ɔ mi he je ɔ, o he nyɛli ɔmɛ jɛɔ mi kaa bɔ nɛ a jɛɔ mo ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 69:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10" />A yeɔ ye he fɛu nɛ a muɔɔ mi ke i ngɛ mɔbɔ yee, nɛ i ngɛ ngma hie ngɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu hɛ mi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 69:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11" />A tuɔ ye he munyu ke i bu mɔbɔ yemi bo ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 69:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12" />Ma a tsuo tuɔ ye he munyu, nɛ da deli tete woɔ mi la. <verse eid="PSA 69:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13" />Se Neneene Tsɛ, i kamaa we, i yaa nɔ kɛ sɔlemi ɔ. Ejakaa be ɔ su, nɛ o ba o tue si nɛ o maa bu mi tue. O na suɔmi kɛ mi mi jɔmi babauu kɛ ha mi. Jehanɛ ɔ, mo ha ye sɔlemi kɛ pɛɛ kpami ɔ heto nɛ o kpɔ mi kaa bɔ nɛ o wo mi si ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 69:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14" />Mo je mi kɛ je haomi nɛ ɔ mi. Ko ha nɛ ye yi nɛ laa. Mo kpɔ mi kɛ je nihi nɛ sume mi ɔ a dɛ mi, nɛ o je mi kɛ je haomi agbo nɛ i ngɛ mi nɛ ɔ mi.<verse eid="PSA 69:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15" />Mo ko ha nɛ nyu ɔ nɛ laa ye yi, aloo ma tlɔ wo ɔ mi; mo je mi kɛ je gbenɔ muɔ nɛ ngɛ ye he gbeye woe ɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 69:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16" />Oo Yehowa, mo ha ye sɔlemi kɛ pee kpami ɔ heto, ejakaa o suɔmi kɛ mi mi jɔmi ɔ ngɛ nyakpɛ; nɛ o mɔbɔ nami hiɛ babauu, suɔmi kɛ mi mi jɔmi sɔuu. <verse eid="PSA 69:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17" />Mo ko ngɔ o he kɛ laa mi, ejakaa i ngɛ haomi agbo mi. O he nɛ pee oya! Moo ba nɛ o ba je mi. <verse eid="PSA 69:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo ba nɛ o ba je mi. Mo kpɔ mi kɛ je ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ kulaa a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 69:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19" />O le bɔ nɛ a tuɔ ye he munyu, kɛ bɔ nɛ a gbeɔ ye he guɛ ha. O naa mɛ tsuo nɛ o le nɔ́ nɛ a ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ deɔ.<verse eid="PSA 69:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20" />Sumemi nɛ a sume mi ɔ ngɛ ye tsui yee; ye susuma pee vii ngɛ ye mi. Kaa a ti nɔ kake po maa na mi mɔbɔ aloo e maa jɔɔ ye bua a jinɛ e ko hi. <verse eid="PSA 69:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21" />Benɛ hwɔ ngɛ mi yee ɔ, a ha mi duɔ ke ma ye, nɛ benɛ kuma ngɛ mi yee wawɛɛ ɔ, a ha mi nyu nɛ a kɛ tsopa wo mi ke ma nu. <verse eid="PSA 69:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22" />Mo ha nɛ a niye ni nɛ plɛ la zu, nɛ a bua jɔmi se nɛ po. <verse eid="PSA 69:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23" />Mo ha nɛ diblii nɛ wo mɛ, a hɛ nɛ yu, nɛ a ku pue si. <verse eid="PSA 69:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24" />O muklii mi nɛ fu mɛ; nɛ o ha o mi mi fumi nɛ nya wa a nɛ kpata a hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 69:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25" />Mo ha nɛ a we ɔmɛ a mi nɛ je gu nɛ a pee we dokuhi. <verse eid="PSA 69:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26" />Ejakaa a ngɛ nɔ nɛ o fia lɛ nɔ́ kɛ fɔ si ɔ yi mi wae. Nɛ a ngɛ nɔ nɛ o gbɔ lɛ nɔ́ ɔ pa a he fɛu yee. <verse eid="PSA 69:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27" />Mo bua a yayami ɔmɛ a nya nɛ o hɛ nɛ ko je a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 69:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28" />Moo gbe nimli nɛ ɔmɛ kɛ je nimli nɛ ngɛ je mi ɔ a kpɛti. Ko ha nɛ a na bua jɔmi nɛ dali ɔmɛ naa ngɛ a si himi mi ɔ eko.<verse eid="PSA 69:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29" />Se, oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo kpɔ mi kɛ je ohia kɛ hiɔ dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 69:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30" />Kɛkɛ ɔ, i ma la kɛ je Mawu yi. Ye sina maa pee e yi jemi. <verse eid="PSA 69:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31" />Lɔ ɔ maa jɔ e bua pe na ku nɛ i ma kɛ sã bɔ ha lɛ. <verse eid="PSA 69:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32" />He si bali ɔmɛ maa na kaa a Mawu ɔ ngɛ a se. Nɛ e be nyakpɛ kaa a bua maa jɔ a he babauu. Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ hla Mawu se blɔ ɔ maa hi si ngɛ bua jɔmi mi. <verse eid="PSA 69:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33" />Ejakaa Yehowa buu e ni ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ fimi mi ɔ a ngmlaa kpami tue, nɛ e kplɛɛ we a he nɔ́ kulaa.<verse eid="PSA 69:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34" />A je e yi, hiɔwe kɛ zugba kulaa! A je e yi, wo ɔmɛ kɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ ngɛ a mi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 69:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35" />Ejakaa Mawu ma he Yerusalem yi wami; nɛ e maa ma Yuda ma amɛ ekohu. E nimli ɔmɛ maa hi a mi nɛ a be kpɔe ngɛ a dɛ. <verse eid="PSA 69:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36" />A bimɛ maa ye zugba a nɔ; nɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ suɔ e biɛ ɔ, e maa hi lejɛ ɔ, nɛ e yi ma na wami.<verse eid="PSA 69:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69" />
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 70</para>
  <para style="s1">Yemi kɛ buami he pɛɛ kpami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo kpɔ mi! Mawu, o he nɛ pee oya nɛ o ye kɛ bua mi! <verse eid="PSA 70:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2-3" />A ngɛ ye gbemi he blɔ hlae, a suɔ kaa a maa ye mi awi. Mo ha nɛ a juɛmi nɛ futu! Moo gbe mɛ zo! Moo tsi a nya! Ko ha nɛ a ya nɔ nɛ a ye ye he fɛu. <verse eid="PSA 70:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4" />Se mo ha nɛ o se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ a na bua jɔmi; nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ suɔ o yi wami hemi ɔ, a nya nɛ a de ke, “Mɛni nyakpɛ Mawu ji nɛ ɔ!” <verse eid="PSA 70:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5" />Se i ngɛ haomi agbo mi. O he nɛ sɔ nɛ o ba ye kɛ bua mi, ejakaa mo pɛ nɛ o ma nyɛ ye kɛ bua mi, nɛ o ma kpɔ mi. Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, koo kpɛ se!<verse eid="PSA 70:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70" />
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 71</para>
  <para style="s1">Nɔmoyo dalɔ sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo ji ye laami he! Mo ko kua mi! <verse eid="PSA 71:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2" />Mo kpɔ mi kɛ je ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a dɛ mi, ejakaa dalɔ ji mo! Mo kpɔ mi! Moo ba o tue si nɛ o bu ye pɛɛ kpami ɔ tue nɛ o he ye yi wami. <verse eid="PSA 71:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3" />Moo pee o he Tɛ Sa agbo kɛ ha mi nɛ ma kpasa mo, he nɛ i ma hi daa, nɛ ye yi ma na wami kɛ je ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a dɛ mi. Ejakaa o fa kaa a he ye yi wami. <verse eid="PSA 71:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo kpɔ mi kɛ je yayami peeli kɛ yi mi wali nɛ ɔmɛ a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 71:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, mo pɛ ji ye hɛ nɔ kami; i ngɔ ye hɛ kɛ fɔ o nɔ kɛ je ye jokuɛwi a si tɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 71:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6" />O kɛ mi ngɛ kɛ je ye fɔmi be mi tɔɔ, nɛ o ye kɛ bua mi be fɛɛ be, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je nɛ i ngɛ o yi jee daa nɛ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="PSA 71:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7" />Nɛ ye kunimi yemi nɛ peeɔ nihi fuu nyakpɛ ɔ ji kaa mo ji ye he bulɔ nɛ he wa. <verse eid="PSA 71:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8" />Jena ligbi ɔ kulaa i ma je o yi nɛ i ma wo o hɛ mi nyami, oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ngɛ níhi tsuo nɛ o pee kɛ ha mi ɔ he.<verse eid="PSA 71:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9" />Nɛ jehanɛ ɔ, mo ko ngmɛɛ ye he ngɛ ye bwɔmi si. Mo ko kua mi be mi nɛ ye he wami ngɛ gbɔjɔe nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 71:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10" />Ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ ngɛ nya si hɔɔe ke, <verse eid="PSA 71:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11" />“Mawu kua lɛ! Jehanɛ ɔ wa nine maa su e nɔ. Nɔ ko be nɛ maa ye kɛ bua lɛ hu.” <verse eid="PSA 71:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo ko je ye he! Moo ba mla! Moo ye kɛ bua mi! <verse eid="PSA 71:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13" />Mo kpata ye he nyɛli nɛ ɔmɛ a hɛ mi nɛ o ha a ni tsumi ɔ nɛ pee yaka gu, nɛ a hɛ mi nɛ pue si.<verse eid="PSA 71:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14" />I ngɛ mo blɔ hyɛe nɛ o ye kɛ bua mi. I ma je o yi daa. <verse eid="PSA 71:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15" />I be nyɛe ma kane si abɔ nɛ o je mi kɛ je oslaa mi ɔ. I ma de nɔ tsuaa nɔ bɔ nɛ o hi ha, kɛ bɔ nɛ o hyɛɔ ye nɔ daa be fɛɛ be ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 71:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o he wami nya nɛ i nyɛɛɔ ngɛ. I deɔ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ke mo pɛ ji dalɔ kɛ anɔkualetsɛ. <verse eid="PSA 71:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o tsɔse mi kɛ je ye jokuɛwi a si tɔɔ, nɛ i yeɔ he odase kɛ deɔ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ be tsuaa be, nyakpɛ níhi nɛ o tsuɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 71:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, i bwɔ nɛ ye yi hiɔ mua, mo ko kua mi. Mo ha mi be nɛ ma sɛɛ kɛ de yi nɔ bi nɛ ɔmɛ ke a bimɛ nɛ maa ba a, o he wami kɛ o nyakpɛ ni tsumi agbo ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 71:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o he wami kɛ o dami ɔ ngɛ kɛ ya su hiɔwe tɔɔ. O tsu nyakpɛ ni tsumihi. Jije Mawu kpa ko ngɛ nɛ ngɛ kaa mo? <verse eid="PSA 71:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20" />O ha nɛ i na haomi babauu. Se o maa ngɔ mi kɛ ba wami mi ekohu, kɛ je zugba a sisi tɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 71:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21" />O ma ha mi hɛ mi nyami nɛ kle pe kekle nɔ́ ɔ, nɛ i ma na bua jɔmi ekohu.<verse eid="PSA 71:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22" />I ma la kɛ saku kɛ je o yi, nɛ i ma jaje mo Israel Nɔ Klɔuklɔu Kake ɔ, o anɔkuale si womi ɔmɛ kɛ tsɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 71:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23" />I ma kpa ngmlaa nɛ i ma la kɛ je o yi ngɛ kpɔmi nɛ o kpɔ mi ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 71:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24" />I ma jaje nɛ i ma de ni kpahi daa ligbi, o dami sane yemi kɛ o himi ɔ. Ejakaa nihi kulaa nɛ ngɛ hlae nɛ a ye mi awi ɔ, o pue a hɛ mi si, nɛ o gbe a he guɛ.<verse eid="PSA 71:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71" />
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 72</para>
  <para style="s1">Sɔlemi ke ha Matsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo ye kɛ bua matsɛ ɔ, nɛ e kojo bɔ nɛ o suɔ, nɛ o ye kɛ bua e bi ɔ, nɛ e nyɛɛ ngɛ dami nya. <verse eid="PSA 72:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2" />Moo ye kɛ bua lɛ nɛ e kojo o we bi ɔmɛ, kɛ ohiafo ɔmɛ tete ngɛ dami nya. <verse eid="PSA 72:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3" />Mo ha nɛ yoku ɔmɛ a ba ni ngɛ e matsɛ yemi kpakpa he je. <verse eid="PSA 72:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4" />Moo ye kɛ bua lɛ nɛ e fa ohiafohi kɛ nihi nɛ e fi mɛ ɔ a he, nɛ e kpata a haoli ɔmɛ a hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 72:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5" />Mo ha nɛ ohiafo ɔmɛ kɛ nihi nɛ e fi mɛ ɔmɛ, a ba a he si kɛ ha mo daa be fɛɛ be, be abɔ nɛ pu kɛ nyɔhiɔ ngɛ Hiɔwe nɛ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 72:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6" />Mo ha nɛ ye bi nɛ ɔ e matsɛ yemi ɔ nɛ e hi, nɛ e wo yiblii kaa bɔ nɛ hiɔmi nɛɛ kɛ pueɔ nga amɛ a nɔ nɛ a peeɔ mlɔmlɔɔmlɔ ɔ, aloo bɔ nɛ hiɔmi fiaa nɛ e haa zugba a he jɔɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 72:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7" />Nimli kpakpahi kulaa a ya nɔ ngɛ e matsɛ yemi ɔ mi, nɛ a na tue mi jɔmi babauu kɛ ya nyagbe. <verse eid="PSA 72:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8" />Mo ha nɛ e matsɛ yemi ɔ nɛ je wo nya kɛ ya wo nya, kɛ je Yufrate Pa a nya kɛ ya si zugba a nyagbe he. <verse eid="PSA 72:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9" />Si kpali ngɛ zugba a nɔ ɔ, a kpla si kɛ ha lɛ; nɛ e he nyɛli ɔmɛ a ngɔ a hɛ mi kɛ bu si. <verse eid="PSA 72:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10" />Nɛ matsɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ Mediteranea wo ɔ nya, kɛ matsɛmɛ nɛ je Tarsis kɛ wo kpɔ ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ, kɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ je Sheba kɛ Seba a, a ngɔ nike ni kɛ ba ha lɛ. <verse eid="PSA 72:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11" />Matsɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ he fɛɛ he ɔ maa ba a he si kɛ ha lɛ, nɛ mɛ tsuo a ma sɔmɔ lɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12" />E maa hyɛ nihi nɛ be nɔ́ ko ɔmɛ, kɛ ohiafo ɔmɛ a nɔ, ke a kpa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ lɛ ɔ, ejakaa a be nɔ kpa ko nɛ ma fa a he. <verse eid="PSA 72:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13" />Gbɔjɔli ɔmɛ kɛ nihi nɛ e fi mɛ ɔmɛ a he mɔbɔ maa pee lɛ nɛ e maa ye kɛ bua mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 72:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14" />E ma je mɛ kɛ je nɔ yemi yaya kɛ basabasa mi, ejakaa a wami he jua wa ha lɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15" />E yi ma na wami, nɛ a maa ngɔ Sheba sika tsu ɔ kɛ ha lɛ. Nihi maa sɔle kɛ ha lɛ be fɛɛ be. E nimli ɔmɛ ma je e yi kɛ je mɔtu kɛ ya si gbɔkuɛ. <verse eid="PSA 72:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16" />Moo jɔɔ wɔ kɛ ngmɔ ni babauu ngɛ zugba a kulaa nɔ, kɛ yoku ɔmɛ tete a nɔ. Tso yiblii nɛ ba kaa Lebanon ni ɔmɛ; nɛ ma amɛ a mi nɛ hyi tɔ kaa bɔ nɛ zugba a nɔ nga ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 72:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17" />A wo e biɛ hɛ mi nyami daa; e biɛ kpakpa nɛ hi si daa kaa bɔ nɛ pu ngɛ ɔ, nɛ e mi a je kɛ jɔɔ je ɔ tsuo; nɛ mahi tsuo a je e yi.<verse eid="PSA 72:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18" />A je Yehowa Israel Mawu ɔ yi, nɔ nɛ lɛ pɛ e tsuɔ nyakpɛ níhi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 72:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19" />A je e anunyami biɛ ɔ yi kɛ ya neneene. Zugba a tsuo nɛ hyi tɔ kɛ e anunyami ɔ! Amen, Amen.<verse eid="PSA 72:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20" />David, Isai bi ɔ, sɔlemi la amɛ a nyagbe ji enɛ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72" />
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73" />
  <para style="ms">Mi Gbami 3</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 73:1-89:52">La 73:1—89:52</ref></para>
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 73</para>
  <para style="s1">Yi mi wali a nɔ yami kɛ a nyagbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu mi hi kɛ ha Israel kɛ nihi nɛ a tsui mi tsɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 73:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2" />Se ami lɛɛ i su muɔ ɔ nya haa. Ye nanehi ngɛ sanee nɛ i nɔ mi ta. <verse eid="PSA 73:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3" />Ejakaa ye tsui ngɛ mi haoe ngɛ fiali kɛ yi mi wali a ni nami fuu ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 73:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4" />Anɔkuale, ngɛ a wami si himi mi kulaa a, a nɛ nyagba ko. Ni sɔuu kɛkɛ se a ngɛ nae. <verse eid="PSA 73:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5" />Haomi bɛ a nɔ be fɛɛ be, nɛ a nɛ nyagba ko kaa bɔ nɛ ni kpa amɛ ngɛ nae ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 73:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a fiaa nɛ a hyɛ we a se, nɛ yi mi wami ni nɛ a tsuɔ. <verse eid="PSA 73:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7" />A na ni kpɔtɔɔ nɛ a pee tɔbɔtɔbɔ, a nine suu nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a ngɛ hlae ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 73:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8" />A yeɔ Mawu he fɛu, nɛ a woɔ e nimli ɔmɛ a he gbeye. A fiaa ngɛ a munyu tumi mi. <verse eid="PSA 73:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9" />A fiaa kɛ siɔ hiɔwe tete, nɛ a nuu a he ngɛ he fɛɛ he.<verse eid="PSA 73:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Mawu nimli ɔmɛ a kɔni mi jɔɔ, nɛ a juɛmi futuu, se a de we nɔ́ ko. <verse eid="PSA 73:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11" />A biɔ ke, “Anɛ Mawu naa nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ nɔ yae ɔ lo? <verse eid="PSA 73:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12" />Nyɛɛ hyɛ fiali nɛ ɔmɛ, a nɛ haomi ko, be fɛɛ be nɛ ɔ ni kɛkɛ se a ngɛ nae.”<verse eid="PSA 73:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13" />Anɛ ami lɛɛ tsa pi be nɛ i ngɛ puɛe nɛ ɔ lo? Mɛni he je nɛ i ngɛ nɔ́ nae kaa ye tsui mi nɛ tsɔ? <verse eid="PSA 73:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14" />Nɔ́ nɛ kɛkɛ nɛ i ngɛ nae ngɛ mi ji haomi kɛ aywilɛho be fɛɛ be. <verse eid="PSA 73:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15" />Ke ja a ji bɔ nɛ i de niinɛ ɔ, lɛɛ i pee o nimli ɔmɛ a se blɔ tsɔɔlɔ. <verse eid="PSA 73:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16" />Se kɛ ɔ, bɔ nɛ nimli nɛ sume Mawu ɔ a ngɛ ni nae ɔ, e nya tsɔɔmi wa.<verse eid="PSA 73:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17" />Nɛ ligbi kake ɔ, i ho Mawu he klɔuklɔu ɔ ya nɛ ma ya sɔle, nɛ i susu nimli yayami nɛ ɔmɛ a hwɔɔ se si himi he. <verse eid="PSA 73:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18" />A ngɛ blɔ nɛ nɔ saneɔ nɔ nyɛɛe, nɛ tlukaa a, Mawu ma tsitsɛɛ a kue se mi kɛ je muɔ ɔ tue kɛ ya hɛ mi kpatami mi. <verse eid="PSA 73:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19" />Nɛ lɔ ɔ maa pee a bua jɔmi ɔ e nyagbe kɛ neneene pimi. <verse eid="PSA 73:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20" />A piɔ si himi ɔ ngɛ kaa nlami kɛkɛ. A hɛ maa tsiɛ nɛ a maa na nɔ́ nɛ ji anɔkuale ɔ kaa bɔ nɛ nɔ ko hɛ tsiɛɛ kɛ jee nlami je nɛ e naa kaa nihi nɛ e nla amɛ a pi nihi nɛ ngɛ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 73:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21" />Benɛ i na enɛ ɔ, i pee basaa. <verse eid="PSA 73:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22" />I na kaa i jee kuasia nɛ i li nɔ́ ko. Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, i pee kaa lohwe ko kɛkɛ ngɛ o hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 73:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23" />Se ja a tete po ɔ, o suɔ mi. O hɛɛ ye hiɔ nine mi. <verse eid="PSA 73:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24" />O maa ya nɔ ma kudɔ mi kɛ o nile kɛ ga womi ngɛ ye wami be ɔ kulaa mi; nɛ pee se ɔ, o maa ngɔ mi kɛ ya o hiɔwe anunyami ɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 73:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25" />Mɛnɔ i ngɛ ngɛ hiɔwe pe mo? Nɛ i hla we nɔ ko ngɛ zugba a nɔ ja mo. <verse eid="PSA 73:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26" />Ye he wami ngɛ gbɔjɔe; nɛ ye mumi si we nɔ, se Mawu ngɛ. Lɛ ji ye tsui he wami, nɛ e ngɛ kɛ ha mi daa.<verse eid="PSA 73:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27" />Se nihi nɛ a sume nɛ a sɔmɔ Mawu ɔ, a hɛ mi ma kpata, ejakaa e kpataa nihi nɛ sɔmɔɔ mawu kpahi ɔ a hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 73:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28" />Se ami lɛɛ i sa kɛ su e he bɔ nɛ ma nyɛ. I ngɔ lɛ, nɛ i ma jaje kɛ de nɔ tsuaa nɔ bɔ nɛ e kpɔɔ mi ngɛ nyakpɛ blɔhi a nɔ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 73:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73" />
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 74</para>
  <para style="s1">Yoku ɔ hɛ mi kpatami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mɛni ba nɛ o ngmɛɛ wa he kulaa kikɛ ɔ? Mɛni ba nɛ o muklii mi fu wɔ kikɛ ɔ, wɔ nɛ ji mo nitsɛ o bimɛ ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 74:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2" />Mo kai kaa mo nitsɛ o nimli ji wɔ, nihi nɛ o hla kɛ je blema, nɛ o je kɛ je nyɔguɛ yemi mi, nɛ o ngɔ kɛ pee o suɔmi bimɛ. O ngɔ Yerusalem kɛ pee o we ngɛ zugba a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 74:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3" />Moo nyɛɛ ma a e we doku ɔmɛ a mi nɛ o hyɛ bɔ nɛ he nyɛlɔ ɔ pee o sihi he klɔuklɔu ɔ ha. <verse eid="PSA 74:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4" />Lejɛ ɔ nɛ a gba ta ngɛ, nɛ a ma a wɔ ɔmɛ ngɛ nɛ a kɛ tsɔɔ a kunimi yemi. <verse eid="PSA 74:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5" />Nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ gbɛ yukuyuku kaa hue nɛ a sa kɛ pue si. <verse eid="PSA 74:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6" />A ba kɛ a lema kɛ hama amɛ nɛ a ba ywia sinya amɛ, <verse eid="PSA 74:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7" />nɛ a sa o sihi he klɔuklɔu ɔ dukuduku kɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 74:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8" />Nɛ a de a he ke, “Nyɛ ha nɛ waa gbe Mawu biɛ kulaa.” Kɛkɛ nɛ a sɛ ma a mi nɛ a bɔni kpe he ɔmɛ, he nɛ wa sɔmɔɔ mo ngɛ ɔ sami.<verse eid="PSA 74:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9" />Nɔ́ ko kulaa be hu nɛ tsɔɔ kaa o we bi ji wɔ, O gbali ɔmɛ ta, nɛ nɔ ko li be mi nɛ kulaa nya ma ta. <verse eid="PSA 74:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, kɛ ya si mɛni be nɛ o ma ha he blɔ nɛ wa he nyɛli ɔmɛ ma pue o biɛ ɔ hɛ mi si. Anɛ o ma ha he blɔ nɛ a ye a he kɛ ya nyagbe lo? <verse eid="PSA 74:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11" />Mɛni ba nɛ o ngɛ se kpɛe? Mɛni ba nɛ o tsi o he wami ɔ nya? Moo fɔ o kɔni nɛ o fia mɛ nyagbe kɔ.<verse eid="PSA 74:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12" />Mawu ji ye Matsɛ kɛ je blema; o yeɔ kɛ buaa mi ngɛ he fɛɛ he. <verse eid="PSA 74:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13" />O gba Wo Tsutsu ɔ mi kɛ o he wami, nɛ o ywia wo wɔ ɔ e yi ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 74:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14" />O ngɔ lɛ kɛ ha nihi nɛ po ma ngɛ nga nɔ ɔ nɛ a ye. <verse eid="PSA 74:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15" />Ngɛ o fami nya a, nyu sú kɛ je zu mi ha o nimli ɔmɛ nɛ a nu; nɛ jehanɛ ɔ, o je blɔ kɛ gu Yordan Pa a mi ha mɛ nɛ a nyɛɛ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 74:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16" />Nyɔ kɛ pia kulaa o nɔ́ i. Mo nɛ o bɔ dodoe kɛ pu. <verse eid="PSA 74:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17" />Adebɔ kulaa ngɛ o dɛ mi. Mo nɛ o bɔ gbo kɛ gbiɛ hulɔ. <verse eid="PSA 74:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo hyɛ bɔ nɛ he nyɛli nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ o he fɛu yee ha. Oo Yehowa, he nɔ woli ngɛ o biɛ ɔ musu bɔe.<verse eid="PSA 74:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo kpɔ mi. Moo bu o lahuɛ ɔ he kɛ je lohwe awi yeli ɔmɛ a dɛ mi. Mo he o nimli ɔmɛ a yi wami kɛ je lohwe nɛ ɔmɛ a dɛ. <verse eid="PSA 74:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20" />Mo kai o si womi ɔ. Ejakaa zugba a nɔ wo diblii, nɛ e hyi tɔ kɛ nimli yi mi wali. <verse eid="PSA 74:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ko ha nɛ o nimli ɔmɛ nɛ a ngɛ a nɔ yee ɔ, a hɛ mi nɛ pue si. Moo ye kɛ bua ohiafohi kɛ nihi nɛ e fi mɛ ɔ, nɛ a je o yi. <verse eid="PSA 74:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo te si nɛ o kɛ wa he nyɛli ɔmɛ nɛ kpe. Mo kai jɛmi nɛ atuã tsɔli nɛ ɔmɛ jɛ mo kɛ je mɔtu kɛ ya si gbɔkuɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 74:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23" />Koo ku o tue kɛ fɔ gbiɛmi nɛ o he nyɛli ɔmɛ ngɛ mo gbiɛe ɔ nɔ. A ngɛ ngmlaa kpae wawɛɛ be fɛɛ be.<verse eid="PSA 74:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74" />
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 75</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu kojolɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, wa ngɛ mo si nae. O nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ tsɔɔ kaa o ngɛ wa yi baae.<verse eid="PSA 75:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu ha heto ke, “Ee, ke be ɔ su ɔ, i ma gbla yi mi wali ɔmɛ a tue. <verse eid="PSA 75:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3" />Zugba a ngɛ hosoe nɛ e nɔ nimli ɔmɛ a tsui po mohu, se e sisi tomi ɔmɛ ngɛ pɛpɛɛpɛ, ejakaa i wo mɛ kɛ to he nɛ sa.<verse eid="PSA 75:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4" />I wo he nɔ woli ɔmɛ si kaa a jɔɔ pupuupu peemi. Nɛ i de yi mi wali ɔmɛ ke, a ko wo a he nɔ, <verse eid="PSA 75:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5" />nɛ a jɔɔ fiami.” <verse eid="PSA 75:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6" />Ejakaa nɔ yami kɛ he wami ji zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ he ko he ko, <verse eid="PSA 75:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7" />Mawu ngɔ kɛkɛ nɛ e jee. Lɛ nɛ e woɔ nɔ nɔ, nɛ lɛ nɔuu e baa nɔ si. <verse eid="PSA 75:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8" />Yehowa hɛɛ kɔɔpoo kɛ e mi wai nɛ ngɛ fiae ngɛ e dɛ mi, nɛ ji yi mi wali ɔmɛ a kojomi. Nɛ a maa nu jamɛ a kɔɔpoo ɔ mi nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ kɛ pi si.<verse eid="PSA 75:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9" />Se ami lɛɛ i ma je Yakob Mawu ɔ yi be tsuaa be. <verse eid="PSA 75:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu de ke, “I ma gbe nimli yayami ɔmɛ a he wami nya la, se nimli kpakpa amɛ ɔ, i ma wo mɛ he wami.”<verse eid="PSA 75:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75" />
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 76</para>
  <para style="s1">Kpɔmi he sina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1" />Mawu biɛ kle ngɛ Yuda kɛ Israel. <verse eid="PSA 76:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2" />E we ji Yerusalem. Nɛ e sihi he ji Zion Yoku ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 76:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3" />Nɛ lejɛ ɔ ji he nɛ e kuɔ wa he nyɛli ɔmɛ a ta hwumi ni ɔmɛ ngɛ.<verse eid="PSA 76:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4" />Neneene yoku ɔmɛ kɛ mo sɔɛ ngɛ anunyami mi! <verse eid="PSA 76:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5" />Wa yeɔ wa he nyɛli ngua amɛ a nɔ. A hwɔɔ gbenɔ mahe ngɛ wa hɛ mi. Nɔ ko nɔ ko be nyɛe ma wo nine nɔ ngɛ wa nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 76:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6" />Yakob Mawu, benɛ o nga a yi ɔ, okpɔngɔhi kɛ a nɔ hili ɔmɛ nɔ si. <verse eid="PSA 76:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7" />E be nyakpɛ kaa a yee mo gbeye saminya. Mɛnɔ ma nyɛ da Mawu mi mi fumi nya. <verse eid="PSA 76:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8" />O kojo mɛ kɛ je hiɔwe tɔɔ; zugba a hoso nɛ e pee dii ngɛ o hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 76:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9" />O te si nɛ o maa gbla yayami peeli ɔmɛ a tue, nɛ o fa nihi nɛ he jɔ ngɛ zugba a nɔ ɔ a he. <verse eid="PSA 76:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10" />O tsakeɔ nɔmlɔ yaka mi mi fumi ke woɔ o hɛ mi nyami. O ngɔɔ kɛ peeɔ o he dlami nɔ́.<verse eid="PSA 76:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11" />Moo ye si ɔmɛ kulaa nɛ o wo Yehowa o Mawu ɔ nɔ. Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ wo nike ni kɛ ba ha lɛ. A bu lɛ nɛ a ye lɛ gbeye. <verse eid="PSA 76:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12" />Ejakaa e kuɔ matsɛbihi kɛ pueɔ si, nɛ e peeɔ zugba a nɔ matsɛ ɔmɛ gbeye níhi.<verse eid="PSA 76:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76" />
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 77</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu mɔbɔ nami kaimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1" />I kpa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu. I tsɛ, nɛ i tsɛ lɛ ekohu. Oo, e sa nɛ e bu mi tue! <verse eid="PSA 77:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2" />I ngɛ haomi agbo mi, nɛ e yemi kɛ buami he hia mi saminya. I wo ye nine nɔ nɛ i sɔle nyɔnyɔɔnyɔ tsuo kɛ pɛɛ kpami. I be bua jɔmi nae kɛ ya si e maa bu mi tue. <verse eid="PSA 77:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3" />I susu Mawu he nɛ i kɛmɛ. Ye hɛ ja kɛ aywilɛho ngɛ e yemi kɛ buami he. <verse eid="PSA 77:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4" />I be mahe nyɛe maa hwɔ kɛ ya si e maa bu mi tue. I ngɛ haoe tsɔ pe bɔ nɛ ma nyɛ ma sɔle tete.<verse eid="PSA 77:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5" />I ngɛ blema be kpakpa amɛ a he susue kɛ sa. <verse eid="PSA 77:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6" />Nɛ nyɔ mi be fɛɛ be ɔ, bua jɔmi lahi sɔuu nɛ i laa. Ye mumi ɔ hlaa níhi a mi, nɛ i yaa ye yi mi ngɛ níhi nɛ ngɛ nɔ yae piɔ ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 77:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7" />Anɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu kua mi kulaa lo? E be mi mɔbɔ nae hu lo? <verse eid="PSA 77:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8" />Anɛ e suɔmi kɛ mi mi jɔmi ɔ ta kulaa? E yi e si womi ɔ nɔ lo? <verse eid="PSA 77:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9" />Anɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu hɛ je e dloomi ɔ nɔ? Nɛ e kɛ mi mi fumi po e suɔmi ɔ se lo? <verse eid="PSA 77:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10" />Kɛkɛ nɛ i de ke, ye sɛsɛɛ mi ji ja a nɛ, kaa Mawu jɔɔmi ɔ plɛ nyɛmi. <verse eid="PSA 77:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11" />I kai nyakpɛ níhi babauu nɛ e tsu ha mi be nɛ be ɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 77:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12" />Jamɛ a nyakpɛ ni ɔmɛ ngɛ ye juɛmi mi be fɛɛ be. Nɛ ye hɛ be a nɔ jee.<verse eid="PSA 77:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o blɔ ɔmɛ ngɛ klɔuklɔu. Jije nɔ ko ngɛ nɛ kle kaa mo? <verse eid="PSA 77:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14" />Mawu nɛ peeɔ nyakpɛ níhi ji mo! Nɛ o tsɔɔ o nyakpɛ he wami ɔ kɛ sa.<verse eid="PSA 77:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15" />O kpɔ wɔ Yakob kɛ Yosef bi ɔmɛ kɛ o he wami. <verse eid="PSA 77:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16" />Hyɛ bɔ nɛ Wo Tsutsu ɔ ye gbeye ha benɛ e na mo ɔ! E kpokpo kɛ ya sisi tɔɔ! <verse eid="PSA 77:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17" />Nyu nɛ kɛ je bɔ kuu ɔmɛ a mi pue si, nɛ hiɔwe si. O oslabai ɔ gba. <verse eid="PSA 77:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18" />Hiɔwe simi ɔ ngɛ pɛe ngɛ kɔɔhiɔ ɔ mi; nɛ la kpɛmi ɔ ha nɛ je mi tsɔ. Zugba a huanya.<verse eid="PSA 77:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19" />O blɔ ɔ gu wo ɔ mi. E ji blɔ nɛ nɔ ko li kaa e ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 77:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20" />O kudɔ o nimli ɔmɛ kaa tohi kɛ gu jamɛ a blɔ ɔ nɔ, nɛ o ha Mose kɛ Aaron kpaka mɛ.<verse eid="PSA 77:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77" />
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 78</para>
  <para style="s1">Tsaatsɛ Mawu kɛ Israel bi ɔmɛ a nyɛɛmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1" />Oo ye bimɛ, nyɛɛ bu ye mlaa amɛ tue. Nyɛɛ pa nyɛ tue mi nɛ nyɛɛ nu nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ dee ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2" />I ma tu munyu ngɛ abɛ mi, nɛ i ma de nyɛ blema sanehi. <verse eid="PSA 78:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3" />Níhi nɛ wa nu nɛ wa le, kɛ níhi nɛ wa tsɛmɛ de wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4" />I ma je anɔkuale nɛ ɔmɛ kpo ma de nyɛ, konɛ nyɛ hu nyɛɛ sɛɛ Mawu yi jemi kɛ he wami kɛ nyakpɛ ni tsumi nɛ e tsu ɔ kɛ ha nyɛ bimɛ. <verse eid="PSA 78:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5" />Ejakaa e wo Israel mlaahi nɛ e de wa tsɛ ɔmɛ kaa a tsɔɔ a bimɛ. <verse eid="PSA 78:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6" />Bɔ nɛ pee nɛ mɛ hu a tsɔɔ a bimɛ, konɛ mlaa amɛ a hi si kɛ je yi nɔ kɛ ya yi nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7" />Nɛ a ngɔ a hɛ kɛ fɔ Mawu nɔ, nɛ a hɛ ko je e ni tsumi ɔmɛ a nɔ, se mohu a hɛɛ e mlaa amɛ a mi. <verse eid="PSA 78:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8" />Kɛkɛ ɔ, a be pee kaa a tsɛmɛ tsui wali kɛ atuã tsɔli nɛ yi anɔkuale, nɛ ngɔɛ a tsui kɛ ha we Mawu ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9" />Efraim bi ɔmɛ wlua kɛ ta hwumi níhi mohu, se a tu fo ngɛ ta a nya benɛ ta hwumi ligbi ɔ su ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10" />Ejakaa a yi Mawu mlaa amɛ a nɔ, nɛ a kua nyɛɛmi ngɛ e blɔ nɔ tomi ɔmɛ a nya. <verse eid="PSA 78:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11" />Nɛ a hɛ je e ni tsumi ɔmɛ kɛ nyakpɛ ni ɔmɛ nɛ e pee kɛ tsɔɔ mɛ ɔ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12" />E pee nyakpɛ nihi ngɛ a tsɛ ɔmɛ a hɛ mi ngɛ Mizraim ngɛ Zoan nga a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13" />E gba wo ɔ mi enyɔ nɛ e ha a gu mi kɛ be; nɛ e ha nyu ɔ bua ngɛ hiɛ kɛ hiɛ. <verse eid="PSA 78:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14" />Je nanɛɛ mi ɔ, e nyɛɛ a hɛ mi kɛ bɔ kuu, nɛ nyɔ mi be mi ɔ, e kpakaa mɛ kɛ kane. <verse eid="PSA 78:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15" />E gba tɛ mi ngɛ nga a nɔ nɛ nyu je mi fuu kaa pa nɛ ngɛ bee nɛ a nu. <verse eid="PSA 78:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16" />E ha dɔhi hia kɛ je tɛ ɔ mi nɛ nyu ɔ be kaa pa. <verse eid="PSA 78:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17" />Se kɛ ɔ, a ngmɛɛ we atuã tsɔmi ɔ he, nɛ a pee yayami kɛ si Mawu nɛ kle pe mawuhi kulaa a. <verse eid="PSA 78:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18" />Ngɛ a akɔnɔ he je ɔ, a ka Mawu nɛ a bi lɛ nɛ e ha mɛ de lo nɛ a ye. <verse eid="PSA 78:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19" />A tu munyu kɛ si Mawu nɛ a bi ke, “Anɛ Mawu be nyɛe maa ngmɛ wɔ okplɔɔ ngɛ nga a nɔ lo? <verse eid="PSA 78:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20" />Hyɛ, e gba tɛ ɔ nɛ nyu su kɛ je kpo nɛ dɔ ɔmɛ hia. Anɛ e be wɔ abolo nyɛe ma ha lo? E be e nimli ɔmɛ de lo nyɛe ma ha lo?” <verse eid="PSA 78:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Mawu nu enɛ ɔ, nɛ e mi mi wo la, nɛ e je e mi mi la a kɛ wo Israel he. <verse eid="PSA 78:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22" />Ejakaa a he we Mawu nɔ yi, nɛ a he we e yi wami hemi ɔ hu nɛ a ye. <verse eid="PSA 78:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23" />Tsɛ be ɔ, e fã bɔ kuu ɔmɛ nɛ hiɔwe sinya amɛ bli. <verse eid="PSA 78:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24" />Nɛ e ha mana nɛ pue si kɛ ha mɛ nɛ a ye. E ha mɛ hiɔwe abolo. <verse eid="PSA 78:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25" />Adesa ye bɔfohi a niye ni. E ha mɛ de lo babauu.<verse eid="PSA 78:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26" />E ha puje he kɔɔhiɔ te, nɛ e kudɔ wo mi blɔ kɔɔhiɔ ɔ kɛ e he wami ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27" />E ha de lo ba pue si ha mɛ kaa bunyuku, kɛ lohwe pɛlitsɛhi hu kaa wo nya zia. <verse eid="PSA 78:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28" />E ha e pue si ngɛ a kpɛti ngɛ he nɛ a ba to nɛ a bua ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a ye nɛ a tɔ saminya, ejakaa e ha mɛ a suɔmi nya ni. <verse eid="PSA 78:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30" />Se a kpa we ngɛ a akɔnɔ ɔ se. Nɛ benɛ lo ɔ ngɛ a nya mi lolo ɔ, <verse eid="PSA 78:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31" />Mawu mi mi fumi ɔ ba a nɔ, nɛ e gbe he wali ɔmɛ nɛ ji Israel nihewi kpakpa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 78:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32" />Enɛ ɔ kulaa se ɔ, a kpa we yayami peemi kɛ sa; nɛ a he we e nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ tete yi. <verse eid="PSA 78:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e po a wami ligbi ɔmɛ a nɔ kpiti, kɛ a mi amanehlu.<verse eid="PSA 78:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34" />Jehanɛ ɔ, benɛ e kpata a kpɛti nihi a hɛ mi se ɔ, loko ji a kpale hla e se blɔ mla nɛ a nyɛɛ e se. <verse eid="PSA 78:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35" />Nɛ a kai kaa Mawu ji a Tɛ Sa, nɛ hiɔwe Mawu ɔ ji a yi wami helɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36" />Se a nya mi munyu kɛkɛ nɛ a kɛ ngɛ e se nyɛɛe, nɛ a tsui be e he. <verse eid="PSA 78:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37" />A yi lɛ anɔkuale, nɛ e si womi ɔmɛ hu a yi nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38" />Se lɛɛ e na mɛ mɔbɔ nɛ e ngɔ a yayami ɔmɛ kɛ ke mɛ nɛ e kpataa we mɛ tsuo a hɛ mi. Behi fuu ɔ, e gblaa e mi mi fumi ɔ se. <verse eid="PSA 78:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39" />Ejakaa e kai kaa nimli adesahi kɛkɛ ji mɛ, nɛ a ngɛ kaa kɔɔhiɔ nɛ fiaa kɛ bee.<verse eid="PSA 78:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40" />Oo, hyɛ bɔ nɛ a tsɔ e hɛ mi atuã ha si abɔ ngɛ nga a nɔ, nɛ a pee lɛ nidɔ ni. <verse eid="PSA 78:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41" />Nɛ a kpale ka lɛ nɔtonɔto, nɛ a kɛ wo Israel Mawu Klɔuklɔu ɔ mi mi la. <verse eid="PSA 78:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42" />A hɛ je e he wami ɔ nɔ, kɛ bɔ nɛ e kpɔ mɛ kɛ je a he nyɛli a dɛ mi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43" />A he je kpatu gbenɔ nɛ e ha Mizraim bi ɔmɛ gbo ngɛ Zoan nga a nɔ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44" />Kɛ bɔ nɛ e ha a pa amɛ plɛ muɔ nɛ nɔ ko nyɛ we a mi nyu nɛ e nu ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45" />E ha nɛ anunuhi babauu ba ha mɛ, nɛ ovɔnɔhi ba hyi zugba a nɔ he fɛɛ he.<verse eid="PSA 78:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46" />E ha gɔgɔhi ye a ngmɔ ni ɔmɛ. Nɛ baalɛhi kpata a ngmɔ ɔmɛ a hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 78:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47" />E gbe a wai tso ɔmɛ kɛ hiɔmi tɛ tsɔwi, nɛ e gbe a kɔɔle tso ɔmɛ kɛ hiɔmi tɛ nguahi. <verse eid="PSA 78:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48" />E ha hiɔmi tɛ kpata a na amɛ a hɛ mi ngɛ nga a nɔ. Nɛ oslabai hu gbe a to ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 78:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49" />E je e mi mi fumi nɛ nya wa kɛ pue a nɔ nɛ e ha bɔfo yobuhi wo haomi kɛ ba fɔ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50" />E je e mi mi fumi ɔ kpo, nɛ e tsi we a hɛ mi kpatami nya, nɛ e ngɔ mɛ kɛ ha kpatu gbenɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51" />Nɛ e gbe bi tɛtehi kɛ dedehi tsuo ngɛ Mizraim, bihi nɛ ji a he wami kɛ bua jɔmi.<verse eid="PSA 78:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52" />Se e kpaka lɛ nitsɛ e nimli ɔmɛ kaa tohi nɛ e bu a he kɛ nyɛɛ nga a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53" />E kpaka mɛ pɛpɛɛpɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a yi gbeye. Se wo ɔ mii a he nyɛli ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 78:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54" />Nɛ e ngɔ mɛ kɛ ba su e zugba nɛ e jɔɔ nɔ ɔ huzu nya, zugba kɛ e mi yokuhi nɛ e to kɛ ha mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55" />E fie wɔ jali ɔmɛ ngɛ zugba a nɔ, nɛ e ha Israel wɛtso tsuaa wɛtso e blɔ fa mi nɔ́ kaa e sihi he.<verse eid="PSA 78:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56" />Enɛ ɔmɛ kulaa a se ɔ, loloolo ɔ a te si kɛ si Mawu nɛ kle pe mawuhi kulaa a, nɛ a kua e kita amɛ a nɔ yemi. <verse eid="PSA 78:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57" />A ya sui Si Womi Zugba a nɔ. A gbo tue kaa bɔ nɛ a tsɛ ɔmɛ pee ɔ. A je Mawu he kaa kɛ̃ɛ̃ nɛ a tsiɛ nɛ gba afa. <verse eid="PSA 78:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58" />A wo lɛ mi mi fumi kɛ a he nɔ womi ni peemi ni ɔmɛ, nɛ a ha e je hunga ngɛ amagahi nɛ a puɛ ɔ he.<verse eid="PSA 78:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59" />Benɛ Mawu na a ni peemi ni ɔmɛ ɔ, e mi mi fu wawɛɛ nɛ e hiɔ Israel kulaa. <verse eid="PSA 78:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e si Silo Sɔlemi We ɔ, nɛ ji bo tsu, he nɛ e hi nimli a kpɛti ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61" />E ha he blɔ nɛ a kpɔ e Somi Daka a, nɛ e ngmɛɛ e anunyami ɔ he kɛ ha he nyɛli ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 78:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62" />E ha he blɔ nɛ a gbe e nimli ɔmɛ ngɛ e mi mi fumi ɔ he je. <verse eid="PSA 78:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63" />La ba kpata a nihewi ɔmɛ a hɛ mi, nɛ a yiwi ɔmɛ sui gbagbɛ mi nɛ a gbo. <verse eid="PSA 78:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64" />Osɔfo ɔmɛ nɔ ngɛ klaate nya, nɛ a yi ɔmɛ hu gbo nɛ a yi mɔbɔ kɛ ha we mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 78:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Mawu te si kaa nɔ ko nɛ je mahe mi, nɛ e pee kaa he walɔ ko nɛ tɔ da nɛ ngɛ ngmlaa kpae. <verse eid="PSA 78:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66" />E gbe e he nyɛli ɔmɛ basabasa, nɛ e ngɔ mɛ kɛ wo neneene hɛ mi si puemi mi. <verse eid="PSA 78:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67" />Se e kua Yosef weku ɔ, nɛ ji Efraim wɛtso ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68" />Nɛ e hla Yuda wɛtso ɔ kɛ Zion Yoku ɔ nɛ e suɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69" />Nɛ e ma e sihi he klɔuklɔu ɔ ploplooplo kaa matsɛ mwɔ nɛ maa si kpɛii kaa hiɔwe kɛ zugba kɛ yaa neneene. <verse eid="PSA 78:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70" />Nɛ e hla e sɔmɔlɔ David, nɛ e je lɛ kɛ je to ɔmɛ a se. <verse eid="PSA 78:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71" />E ha e si to nyɛ ɔmɛ a se nyɛɛmi konɛ e ba hyɛ Yakob nɛ ji e nimli ɔmɛ, kɛ Israel nɛ ji e weto ni ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 78:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72" />Nɛ e hyɛ a nɔ kɛ tsui kpakpa, nɛ e kpaka mɛ kɛ e kɔni si wawɛ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78" />
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 79</para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem hɛ mi kpatami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, wɔ jali ɔmɛ kpɔ̃ o zugba a. A wo o Sɔlemi We klɔuklɔu ɔ he mu, nɛ Yerusalem plɛ ma doku. <verse eid="PSA 79:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2" />O sɔmɔli ɔmɛ a gbogboehi pee niye ni kɛ ha lohwe pɛlitsɛhi, nɛ o nimli klɔuklɔu ɔmɛ a gbogboehi plɛ lohwe nane eywiɛtsɛhi a ngma. <verse eid="PSA 79:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3" />He nyɛli ɔmɛ pue a muɔ si ngɛ Yerusalem kɛ bɔle si kaa nyu, nɛ nɔ ko be nɛ maa pu mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 79:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4" />Wa pee nihi nɛ wa he guɛ gbo kɛ ha wa kasa mi bimɛ, nɛ wa pee he fɛu yemi kɛ muɔ nɔ́ kɛ ha nihi nɛ bɔle wɔ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 79:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5" />Oo Yehowa, mɛni be o ma na wɔ mi mi fumi kɛ ya si? Kɛ yaa neneene lo? Anɛ o hunga jemi ɔ maa tso kaa la kɛ ya si hɛ nɔ kami tsuo maa ta lo? <verse eid="PSA 79:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6" />Mo je o mi mi fumi ɔ kɛ pue wɔ jali nɛ li mo ɔ a nɔ, kɛ mahi nɛ tsɛ we o biɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 79:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7" />Ejakaa a kpata o ma Israel hɛ mi, nɛ a butu we fɛɛ we. <verse eid="PSA 79:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8" />Oo, koo bu wɔ fɔ ngɛ wa sa a yayami ɔmɛ a he! Moo ye kɛ bua wɔ ngɛ o mi mi jɔmi kɛ mɔbɔ nami ɔ he, ejakaa a ba wɔ si kulaa. <verse eid="PSA 79:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9" />Moo ye kɛ bua wɔ, Tsaatsɛ Mawu, wa yi wami helɔ! Moo ye kɛ bua wɔ ngɛ o anunyami biɛ ɔ he. Oo, mo kpɔ wɔ nɛ o ngɔ wa yayami ɔmɛ kɛ ke wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 79:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10" />Mɛni he je wɔ jali ɔmɛ na he blɔ maa ye wa he fɛu nɛ a bi ke, “Jije a Mawu ɔ ngɛ?” Nihi nɛ kpata o nimli ɔmɛ a hɛ mi ɔ, moo pee mɛ kɛ to nane mi, nɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ na. <verse eid="PSA 79:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11" />Moo bu nihi nɛ a wo mɛ tsu mi ɔ a kɔmɔ yemi ɔ tue. Nɛ ngɛ o he wami nɛ kle ɔ nya a, mo kpɔ ni nɛmɛ nɛ a bu mɛ gbenɔ fɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 79:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo to mahi nɛ ngɛ mo ahlua bɔe ɔ nane mi ngwɔ he kpaago.<verse eid="PSA 79:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13" />Nɛ wɔ o nimli kɛ o to lɛlɛɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, wa maa na mo si kɛ ya neneene, nɛ wa ma je o yi kɛ ya yi nɔhi kulaa.<verse eid="PSA 79:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79" />
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 80</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel kpɔmi he pee kpami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1" />Oo Israel Kpakalɔ, mo nɔ nɛ o kudɔ Israel kaa tohi. Oo mo Neneene Tsɛ nɛ o hii si ngɛ Somi Daka a yi mi kaa matsɛ, moo ba o tue si nɛ o bu ye pɛɛ kpami ɔ tue. <verse eid="PSA 80:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2" />Mo wo o he nɔ ngɛ Efraim kɛ Benyamin kɛ Manase hɛ mi nɛ o kpɔ wɔ kɛ o he wami ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 80:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo kpale wɔ kɛ ba o ngɔ ekohu, nɛ o ha o hɛ mi nɛ kpɛ ngɛ wa nɔ, nɛ wa yi nɛ na wami. <verse eid="PSA 80:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4" />Oo Yehowa, Hiɔwe tahi a Mawu, mɛni be o mi mi ma fu wɔ nɛ o ma kua wa pɛɛ kpamihi tue bumi kɛ ya si? <verse eid="PSA 80:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5" />O ha wa ye aywilɛho nɛ wa fo ya. <verse eid="PSA 80:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6" />O ha wa pee he fɛu yemi nɔ́ kɛ ha nihi nɛ ngɛ wa kasa mi ɔ, nɛ a hii wɔ muɔe.<verse eid="PSA 80:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7" />Oo Tahi a Mawu, moo kpale wɔ kɛ ba o ngɔ ekohu, nɛ o ha nɛ o hɛ mi nɛ kpɛ ngɛ wa nɔ, nɛ wa yi nɛ na wami. <verse eid="PSA 80:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8" />O ngɔ wɔ kɛ je Mizraim kaa wai tso tsɔwi. O fie wɔ jali ɔmɛ kɛ je o zugba a nɔ nɛ o du wɔ ngɛ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 80:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9" />O gba zugba a nɔ nɛ o tsua mi; wa je sipoku nɛ wa he si ngɛ zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 80:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10" />Wa nini ha yoku ɔmɛ a nɔ, nɛ wa ngɛ kaa Lebanon Sida tso agbo ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 80:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11" />Wa ha zugba a tsuo nɔ kɛ je Mediterenea Wo ɔ nya kɛ ya si Yufrate Pa a he. <verse eid="PSA 80:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12" />Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, o ku wa he gbogbo ɔmɛ nɛ wa be he fami nɔ́ ko. <verse eid="PSA 80:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13" />Demi jee hue mi ba bɔleɔ wa he, nɛ lohwe awi yeli ɔmɛ kɛ wɔ peeɔ a niye ni.<verse eid="PSA 80:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14" />Wa ngɛ mo pɛɛ kpae, oo hiɔwe tahi a Mawu, moo kpale kɛ ba nɛ o ba jɔɔ wɔ. Moo je o hiɔwe ɔ nɛ o hyɛ bɔ nɛ wa ngɛ nɔ́ nae ha, nɛ o ba slaa o wai ngmɔ nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 80:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15" />Moo bu nɔ́ nɛ mo nitsɛ o du ɔ he, bi nɛ ɔ nɛ mo nitsɛ o fɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 80:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16" />Ejakaa wa he nyɛli ɔmɛ po wɔ kɛ pue si kaa tso, nɛ a sa wɔ. Ha a hɛ mi nɛ kpata ngɛ o hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 80:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17" />Moo wo o suɔlɔ ɔ he wami, nɔmlɔ nɛ o hla kɛ ha o he ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 80:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18" />Nɛ wa be mo sie hu. Moo wo wɔ he wami nɛ wa ma he o nɔ maa ye.<verse eid="PSA 80:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19" />Oo Tahi a Mawu, moo kpale wɔ kɛ ba o ngɔ ekohu, nɛ o ha o hɛ mi nɛ kpɛ ngɛ wa nɔ, nɛ wa yi nɛ na wami.<verse eid="PSA 80:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80" />
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 81</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɔhiɔ nya la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1" />Nyɛ la wawɛɛ kɛ ha Neneene Tsɛ Mawu nɛ haa wɔ he wami ɔ. Nyɛ la kɛ bua jɔmi kɛ je Israel Mawu ɔ yi.<verse eid="PSA 81:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2" />Nyɛ la kɛ miɛhi; nyɛ la kɛ sakuhi nɛ ngɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 81:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3" />Nyɛ kpa titimati ngɛ nyɔhiɔ nya, ngɛ be nɛ a to ɔ mi, ngɛ wa gbijlɔ ligbi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 81:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4" />Ejakaa Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɛ to bua jɔmi be nɛ ɔmɛ kɛ ha wɔ. A ngɛ Israel mlaa amɛ a mi. <verse eid="PSA 81:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5" />E to mɛ kaa ta nɛ e kɛ Mizraim, he nɛ wa ya ye nyɔguɛ ngɛ ɔ hwu ɔ e kaimi níhi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PSA 81:5">I nu gbi ko nɛ i nui sisi de ke, <verse eid="PSA 81:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6" />“Jehanɛ ɔ, i ma wo tlomi ɔ ngɛ o konɔ, nɛ i ma je o nine hu kɛ je pɔ tɔtɔɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ a he.” <verse eid="PSA 81:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7" />Nɛ e de ke, “O kpa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ mi ngɛ o haomi ɔ mi nɛ i he o yi wami. I ha o tsɛmi ɔ heto kɛ je oslabai laami he ɔ ngɛ Sinai Yoku ɔ mi. I ka o hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ Meriba be mi nɛ o tu nyu hiami he munyu ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 81:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8" />Oo ye bimɛ, nyɛɛ bu mi tue, nyɛɛ bu ye si womi ɔmɛ tue. Oo Israel, i na nɛ o bu mi tue! <verse eid="PSA 81:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9" />O ko ja mawu kpa ko, nɛ o ko to amaga ko ngɛ o we ɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 81:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10" />Ejakaa ami Yehowa o Mawu ɔ ji nɔ nɛ ngɔ mo kɛ je Mizraim zugba a nɔ kɛ ba. Mo bli o nya mi hatoo nɛ i ma wo mi ni obɔ. <verse eid="PSA 81:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11" />Se ye bi ɔmɛ bui mi tue. Israel hla we mi. <verse eid="PSA 81:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ngɛ a he ngmɛɛe, nɛ a hɛɛ a tsui nɛ ti ɔ mi, nɛ a pee nɔ́ nɛ a suɔ.<verse eid="PSA 81:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13" />Oo, i na nɛ ye bi ɔmɛ bu mi tue, nɛ Israel nyɛɛ ye blɔ ɔmɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 81:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14" />Jinɛ e be kɛe nɛ i ma ba a he nyɛli ɔmɛ si, nɛ i ma dɔ ye nine ngɔ to nihi nɛ ngɛ mɛ haoe ɔ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 81:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15" />Nihi nɛ sume mi ɔ, a maa ba si ngɛ ye hɛ mi kɛ gbeye, nɛ a tue gblami ɔ se be poe kɔkɔɔkɔ. <verse eid="PSA 81:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16" />Se i ma lɛ nyɛ kɛ ngma kpakpa, nɛ i ma ha nyɛ maa tɔ kɛ hwo nɛ a je kɛ je tɛ sa mi.”<verse eid="PSA 81:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81" />
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 82</para>
  <para style="s1">Kojoli yayahi a hɛ mi kami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu hii si ngɛ hiɔwe kojomi sɛ ɔ nɔ, nɛ e kojoɔ kojoli ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 82:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2" />Mɛni be nyɛ maa kojo lakpa kojomi kɛ ya si, nɛ nyɛ maa bu yi mi wali mohu bemi. <verse eid="PSA 82:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3" />Nyɛ fa ohiafo ɔmɛ kɛ awusa amɛ a blɔ nya he, nɛ nyɛɛ ye dami sane kɛ ha nɔ́ nalɔ kɛ nɔ nɛ be nɔ ko ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 82:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4" />Nyɛ kpɔ ohiafo ɔmɛ kɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ fimi mi ɔ kɛ je nimli yayami ɔmɛ a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 82:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5" />Se nyɛ li nɔ́ ko, nɛ nyɛ nui nɔ́ sisi. Nyɛ nyɛɛ diblii mi, nɛ dami sane yemi laa ngɛ je ɔ mi tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 82:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6" />I tsɛ nyɛ tsuo “mawuhi,” kɛ “Hiɔwe Lokoo Tsɛ ɔ bimɛ.” <verse eid="PSA 82:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7" />Se kɛ ɔ, nyɛ ma gbo kaa nimli adesahi nɔuu. Nyɛ wami se maa po kaa matsɛ tsuaa matsɛ.<verse eid="PSA 82:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo te si nɛ o kojo je ɔ, ejakaa o nɔ́ ji zugba a tsuo.<verse eid="PSA 82:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82" />
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 83</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel he nyɛli ɔmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, koo pee dii, ko ma o nya, nɛ koo pee kpoo! Moo bu wɔ tue!<verse eid="PSA 83:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2" />Ejakaa o he nyɛli ɔmɛ ngɛ ngmlaa kpae, nɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ mo nyɛe ɔ ngɛ fiae. <verse eid="PSA 83:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3" />A ngɛ kpee ngɛ diblii mi kɛ wo o nimli ɔmɛ a he, nɛ a ngɛ nihi nɛ o buu a he ɔ he ga toe. <verse eid="PSA 83:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4" />A ngɛ dee ke, “Nyɛɛ ba nɛ wa kpata a ma a hɛ mi, nɛ a ko kai Israel biɛ kulaa hu.” <verse eid="PSA 83:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5" />A ma yi mi tomi nɛ ɔ nya si, nɛ a pee kake kɛ wo o he. <verse eid="PSA 83:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6" />Mɛ ji Edom kɛ Ismael bi, Moab kɛ Hagar bi; <verse eid="PSA 83:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7" />Gebal kɛ Amon kɛ Amalek, Filistia kɛ Tiro bi ɔmɛ hulɔ. <verse eid="PSA 83:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8" />Asiria hu piɛ a he kaa Lot weku ɔ he pataalɔ.<verse eid="PSA 83:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9" />Moo pee mɛ kaa bɔ nɛ o pee Midia kɛ Sisera kɛ Yabin hu ngɛ Kison Pa a nya a. <verse eid="PSA 83:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10" />O ye a nɔ kunimi ngɛ Endor, nɛ a gbogboehi sa ngɛ zugba. <verse eid="PSA 83:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11" />Moo pee a nimeli ɔmɛ kaa bɔ nɛ o pee Oreb kɛ Zeeb; nɛ o ye a matsɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ kunimi kaa bɔ nɛ o ye Zeba kɛ Zalmuna a nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 83:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12" />Mɛ nɛ a de ke, “Nyɛ ha waa ngɔ Mawu zugba a kɛ pee wa nɔ́.”<verse eid="PSA 83:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13" />Oo ye Mawu, mo fli mɛ kɛ mane kaa bunyuku; nɛ o ha a te kaa dudusa nɛ kɔɔhiɔ wo. <verse eid="PSA 83:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14" />Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ la nglaa hue, nɛ la lilɛ ɔmɛ nuu yoku ɔmɛ nɛ a tsoo ɔ, <verse eid="PSA 83:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15" />moo fie mɛ kɛ o hiɔwe kɔɔhiɔ ɔ, nɛ o wo a he gbeye kɛ o kɔɔhiɔhi nɛ nya wa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 83:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16" />Oo Neneene Mawu, mo ha nɛ zo nɛ gbe mɛ, nɛ o ha a na o he wami ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 83:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17" />Ha a juɛmi nɛ futu, nɛ a hao daa. Mo ha nɛ a hɛ mi nɛ pue si nɛ a ye gbeye, <verse eid="PSA 83:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18" />kɛ ya si a maa le kaa mo pɛ ji Yehowa, nɛ o kle pe mawuhi tsuo, nɛ mo ji nɔ nɛ ye zugba a kulaa nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 83:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83" />
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 84</para>
  <para style="s1">Sɔlemi We ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, hiɔwe tahi a Tsɛ, hyɛ bɔ nɛ o Sɔlemi We ɔ ngɛ fɛu ha!<verse eid="PSA 84:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2" />Ye susuma hɛ ngɛ jae, nɛ Mawu We ɔ he kuma ngɛ lɛ yee. Ye nɔmlɔ tso kɛ ye susuma tsuo ngɛ Mawu Hɛ kalɔ ɔ se blɔ hlae. <verse eid="PSA 84:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, hiɔwe tahi a Tsɛ, ye Matsɛ kɛ ye Mawu, otoklii ngɛ we, nɛ odangmɔdangmɔ hu ngɛ tsu ngɛ afɔle sami la tɛ ɔmɛ a kpɛti, he nɛ e toɔ e bimɛ ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 84:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4" />A jɔɔ nihi nɛ hii o We ɔ, nɛ a laa kɛ jeɔ o yi.<verse eid="PSA 84:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5" />A jɔɔ nihi nɛ naa a he wami kɛ jee Neneene Mawu ɔ dɛ mi, nɛ a suɔmi nya ni pe kulaa ji a nyɛɛ o blɔ ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 84:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6" />Ke a nyɛɛ Baka nɛ ji Yafomi Dɔ ɔ mi ɔ, e ma plɛ dɔ bo, he nɛ jɔɔmi kɛ he wami womi ngɛ, ngɛ hiɔmi nɛmi se. <verse eid="PSA 84:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7" />A ma na he wami be fɛɛ be, nɛ a ti nɔ fɛɛ nɔ kɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu maa kpe ngɛ Zion.<verse eid="PSA 84:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, hiɔwe tahi a Tsɛ, moo bu ye kue fami ɔ tue! Moo bu mi tue, oo Israel Mawu. <verse eid="PSA 84:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, wa he falɔ kɛ he pulelɔ, moo na nɔ nɛ o pɔ lɛ nu ɔ mɔbɔ.<verse eid="PSA 84:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10" />Ligbi kake nɛ a maa ye ngɛ o Sɔlemi We ɔ he ngɛ se nami pe ligbi akpe nɛ a maa ye ngɛ he kpa ko! E maa hi kaa ma pee agbo nya bulɔ ngɛ ye Mawu We ɔ pɛ nɛ i ma hi sãu nɔ he nɛ a tsuɔ yi mi wami ni ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 84:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11" />Ejakaa Yehowa Mawu ɔ ji wa kane kɛ he bulɔ. E dlooɔ wɔ nɛ e woɔ wa hɛ mi nyami. Nihi nɛ nyɛɛ ngɛ dami blɔ nɔ ɔ, e be mɛ nɔ́ kpakpa ko he nyɛe.<verse eid="PSA 84:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, hiɔwe tahi a tsɛ, nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ heɔ o nɔ́ yeɔ ɔ, jɔɔmi ji e nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 84:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84" />
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 85</para>
  <para style="s1">Kpɔmi kɛ nyɔguɛ mi jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o nɛ jɔɔmi kɛ pue zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ babauu. O kpale Israel nyɔguɛ ɔmɛ kɛ ba. <verse eid="PSA 85:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2" />Nɛ o ngɔ o bi ɔmɛ a yayami ɔmɛ kɛ ke mɛ. O tsi a yayami ɔmɛ tsuo nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 85:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3" />O ngmɛɛ o mi mi fumi ɔ kulaa he, nɛ o mi mi la nɛ nya wa a se po.<verse eid="PSA 85:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, wa yi wami helɔ, moo kpale wɔ kɛ ba o ngɔ, konɛ o mi mi fumi ɔ nɛ ko te si kɛ wo wɔ ekohu. <verse eid="PSA 85:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5" />Anɛ o mi mi ma fu wɔ kɛ ya neneene lo? Anɛ o maa ngɔ o mi mi la kɛ pue yi nɔhi kulaa nɔ lo? <verse eid="PSA 85:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6" />O be wɔ he wami woe ekohu, konɛ o bi ɔmɛ nɛ a na o he bua jɔmi lo? <verse eid="PSA 85:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo nɛ o suɔmi kɛ o mi mi jɔmi ɔ kɛ pue wa nɔ nɛ wa yi nɛ na wami.<verse eid="PSA 85:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8" />I ma nu nɔ́ nɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɛ ji Yehowa a ma de, ejakaa e maa tu he jɔmi munyu kɛ ha e bi ɔmɛ kɛ e nimli klɔuklɔu ɔmɛ, ke ji a ma kpa a yayami ɔmɛ peemi kɛkɛ. <verse eid="PSA 85:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9" />Niinɛ, e yi wami hemi ɔ na nihi nɛ yee lɛ gbeye ɔ ta; nɛ wa zugba a nɔ ma hyi tɔ kɛ e anunyami ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 85:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10" />Mɔbɔ nami kɛ anɔkuale pee kake. Nɛ dami kɛ he jɔmi pee huɛ. <verse eid="PSA 85:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11" />Anɔkuale maa te si ngɛ zugba a nɔ; nɛ dami maa je hiɔwe kɛ ba zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 85:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12" />Anɔkuale, Tsaatsɛ Mawu maa nɛ e jɔɔmi kɛ pue zugba a nɔ, nɛ e maa ba ni babauu. <verse eid="PSA 85:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13" />E dami ɔ maa je blɔ ha wɔ, nɛ e maa ngɔ wɔ kɛ nyɛɛ e nane mami he ɔmɛ.<verse eid="PSA 85:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85" />
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 86</para>
  <para style="s1">Pɛɛ kpami kɛ ha yemi kɛ buami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo ba o tue si nɛ o bu ye kue fami ɔ tue, ejakaa i ngɛ haomi agbo mi.<verse eid="PSA 86:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2" />Moo bu ye he nɛ o je mi kɛ je gbenɔ mi, ejakaa i bɔɔ mɔde nɛ ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ. Mo he ye yi wami, ejakaa i ngɛ mo sɔmɔe nɛ i heɔ o nɔ yeɔ. <verse eid="PSA 86:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo na mi mɔbɔ, ejakaa i ngɛ mo blɔ hyɛe kɛ hɛ nɔ kami be fɛɛ be. <verse eid="PSA 86:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, mo ha mi bua jɔmi, ejakaa mo pɛ i sɔmɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 86:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, o hi hluu nɛ o mi mi jɔ. O pee klaalo nɛ o maa ngɔ yayami kɛ ke. O hyi kɛ mɔbɔ nami, nɛ o buu nihi kulaa nɛ tsɛɔ mo ɔ tue.<verse eid="PSA 86:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo bu ye kue fami ɔ tue, nɛ o pee ye hiami ni ɔmɛ kɛ ha mi. <verse eid="PSA 86:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7" />Ke i sɛ haomi mi ɔ, ma tsɛ mo, nɛ o maa ye kɛ bua mi.<verse eid="PSA 86:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8" />Mawu ko be mawu ɔmɛ a kpɛti nɛ ngɛ kaa mo, oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu; nɛ ni tsumi ko hu be nɛ ngɛ kaa o ni tsumi ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 86:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, je ɔ nɛ o bɔ ɔ tsuo ma ba sɔmɔ mo nɛ a ma je o biɛ klɔuklɔu ɔ yi. <verse eid="PSA 86:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10" />Ejakaa o kle nɛ o tsuɔ nyakpɛ níhi. Mo pɛ ji Mawu.<verse eid="PSA 86:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo tsɔɔ mi o blɔ ɔ, nɛ i ma nyɛɛ ngɛ o anɔkuale ɔ nya. Mo ha nɛ ma na juɛmi kake, nɛ ma ye o biɛ ɔ gbeye. <verse eid="PSA 86:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12" />I ma je o yi kɛ ye tsui kulaa. I ma wo o biɛ ɔ hɛ mi nyami kɛ ya neneene. <verse eid="PSA 86:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13" />Ejakaa o mɔbɔ nami ɔ kle ha mi, nɛ o je ye susuma kɛ je abosiamihi a je.<verse eid="PSA 86:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, he nɔ woli te si kɛ wo mi, nɛ awi yeli ngɛ ye susuma hɛ mi kpatami he blɔ hlae, nɛ a susuu we kaa o ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 86:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, moo lɛɛ Mawu nɛ naa mɔbɔ ji mo. Anunyamitsɛ ji mo, o mi mi fu we mla, nɛ o hyi tɔ kɛ suɔmi kɛ anɔkuale. <verse eid="PSA 86:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16" />Moo hyɛ mi nɛ o na mi mɔbɔ. Moo wo o sɔmɔlɔ ɔ he wami, nɛ o he ye yi wami. <verse eid="PSA 86:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17" />Moo tsɔɔ mi o mɔbɔ nami ɔ he okadi, konɛ nihi nɛ sume mi ɔ, a na nɛ zo nɛ gbe mɛ. Ejakaa mo Mawu o ye kɛ bua mi nɛ o ha mi bua jɔmi.<verse eid="PSA 86:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86" />
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 87</para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem yi jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1" />Yerusalem, Tsaatsɛ Mawu ma a, maa si ngɛ e yoku klɔuklɔu ɔ yi mi plooplo. <verse eid="PSA 87:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu suɔ Yerusalem pe Israel ma amɛ tsuo.<verse eid="PSA 87:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3" />Oo Mawu ma, nyakpɛ níhi nɛ a deɔ ngɛ o he. <verse eid="PSA 87:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, ke i tsɛ Mizraim biɛ, Babilonia, Filistia kɛ Tiro biɛ, aloo Etiopia nɛ ngɛ lokoo ɔ biɛ ngɛ ye huɛmɛ a kpɛti ɔ, a ti nɔ ko fĩaa nɛ e deɔ ke a fɔ lɛ ngɛ ma nɛ ɔ loo lɔ ɔmɛ a kpɛti eko mi. <verse eid="PSA 87:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5" />Se hwɔɔ se ɔ, nɔ nɛ a maa wo e hɛ mi nyami pe kulaa ji Yerusalem no. Ejakaa Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɛ kle pe mawuhi kulaa a nitsɛ maa jɔɔ ma nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 87:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6" />Benɛ e maa kane e mi nimli ɔmɛ ɔ, e maa wo nihi nɛ a fɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ a biɛ he so. <verse eid="PSA 87:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7" />Nɛ ngɛ gbijlɔ ligbi ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ, lali kɛ fiɛli ɔmɛ tsuo ma la ke, “Ye tsui kulaa ngɛ Yerusalem.”<verse eid="PSA 87:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87" />
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 88</para>
  <para style="s1">Hiɔtsɛmɛ a sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1" />Oo Yehowa, Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ye yi wami helɔ, i fo ya ngɛ o hɛ mi nyɔ kɛ pia. <verse eid="PSA 88:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2" />Jehanɛ ɔ, moo bu ye kue fami ɔ tue, nɛ o nu ye ya fomi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 88:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3" />Ejakaa ye si himi pee kɛ haomi sɔuu, nɛ i su gbenɔ muɔ nya ta. <verse eid="PSA 88:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4" />A bu mi kɛ piɛ ni gbogboe ɔmɛ a he. I ngɛ kaa nɔ ko nɛ be he wami. <verse eid="PSA 88:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5" />A si mi ngɛ hiɛ ɔ nɛ ma gbo kaa nihi nɛ a gbe ngɛ ta nga nɔ nɛ o kai we mɛ hu, o je o hɛ ngɛ a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 88:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6" />O wlɔ mi si ngɛ muɔ voo nɛ mi wo diblii mi. <verse eid="PSA 88:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7" />O mi mi fumi ngɛ ye nɔ wawɛɛ kaa bɔ nɛ oslɔke kuɔ kɛ pueɔ nɔ nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 88:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8" />O ha nɛ ye huɛmɛ sume mi nɛ a si mi. I plɛ gbeye yemi nɔ́ kɛ ha mɛ. I pee kaa nɔ ko nɛ a wo lɛ tsu mi nɛ e be kpo nyɛe maa je hu. <verse eid="PSA 88:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9" />Ye hɛ ngmɛ mi wo diblii kɛ vo nyu. I ngɛ mo pɛɛ kpae daa ligbi ke o ye kɛ bua mi. Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, i wo ye nine nɔ kɛ ngɛ mo pɛɛ kpae ke o na mi mɔbɔ.<verse eid="PSA 88:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10" />E be kɛe nɛ be maa be. Mɛni se nami ma na ngɛ o nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ a he, ke a wo mi kɛ wo gbogboe muɔ mi? Ke i gbo ɔ, kɛ ma plɛ ma je o yi kɛɛ? <verse eid="PSA 88:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11" />Anɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ gbogboe muɔ mi ɔ, ma nyɛ je o suɔmi ɔ kpo kɛ tsɔɔ lo? Anɛ a ma nyɛ jaje o anɔkuale ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ lo? <verse eid="PSA 88:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12" />A maa le o nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ ngɛ diblii mi lo? Aloo a ma nyɛ tu o yemi kɛ buami ɔ he munyu ngɛ he nɛ hɛ jee nɔ nɔ ngɛ lo?<verse eid="PSA 88:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, i ngɛ mo pɛɛ kpae ngɛ ye wami he, nɛ i ma kpa mo pɛɛ daa kɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 88:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mɛni he je o sake ye susuma kɛ fɔ he? Mɛni he je o ngɔ o hɛ mi kɛ laa mi? <verse eid="PSA 88:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15" />Kɛ je ye jokuɛwi a si bebeebe nɛ i ngɛ hiɔ nue, nɛ i su gbenɔ he haa. Ye tue gblami ɔ gbede mi. <verse eid="PSA 88:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16" />O mi mi fumi nɛ nya wa a pee mi pasaa. Nɛ o he gbeye ha ye hɛ mi kpata. <verse eid="PSA 88:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17" />Daa je nanɛɛ ɔ, a bɔle mi kɛ kpe kaa nyu; a sa ye yi. <verse eid="PSA 88:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18" />O je ye suɔli kɛ huɛmɛ tsuo kɛ je ye he, nɛ diblii wo mi ngɛ he fɛɛ he.<verse eid="PSA 88:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88" />
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 89</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu kɛ David a somi ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1" />I ma la ma je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi be fɛɛ be ngɛ e mi mi jɔmi ɔ he. I ma je o anɔkuale ɔ kpo ma tsɔɔ nɔ tsuaa nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 89:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2" />O suɔmi kɛ mi mi jɔmi ɔ ngɛ daa; nɛ o anɔkuale ɔ maa si kaa hiɔwe kɛ yaa neneene. <verse eid="PSA 89:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3" />O de ke, “I kɛ nɔ nɛ i hla a so, nɛ i ka ye sɔmɔlɔ David kita. <verse eid="PSA 89:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4" />Ma ha o bimɛ maa da si kpɛii kɛ ya neneene, nɛ i ma ha nɛ o matsɛ yemi ɔ maa hi si kɛ ya yi nɔhi kulaa!” <verse eid="PSA 89:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, hiɔwe tsuo ma je o nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ a yi, nɛ klɔuklɔu bi ɔmɛ ma la kɛ je o yi ngɛ o anɔkuale ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 89:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6" />Ejakaa mɛnɔ kulaa ngɛ hiɔwe nɛ a ma kɛ to Tsaatsɛ Mawu he? Bɔfo agbo te nɔ nɛ kɛ lɛ sɔ nɛɛ? <verse eid="PSA 89:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7" />Klɔuklɔu bi ɔmɛ yee lɛ gbeye. Nɔ kpa ko be nɛ nihi nɛ bɔle lɛ ɔ buu kaa lɛ. <verse eid="PSA 89:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8" />Oo Yehowa, hiɔwe Tatsɛ, jije Mawu ko ngɛ nɛ kle kaa mo? Anɔkualetsɛ ji mo.<verse eid="PSA 89:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9" />O yeɔ wo ɔmɛ a nɔ, ke kɔɔhiɔ ngɛ fiae gbeyegbeye, nɛ oslɔke ɔmɛ gli ɔ, o tuɔ munyu nɛ a he jɔɔ <verse eid="PSA 89:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10" />Mo nɛ o ku Rahab dukuduku. Nɛ o kɛ o he wami ɔ gbɛ o he nyɛli ɔmɛ kɛ fia. <verse eid="PSA 89:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11" />O nɔ ji hiɔwe kɛ je ɔ. O nɔ ji nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ, ejakaa mo nɛ o bɔ mɛ tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 89:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12" />Mo nɛ o bɔ jɔ mi je kɛ wo yi je! Tabor Yoku kɛ Hermon Yoku ɔ bua jɔɔ a he kaa mo ji a bɔlɔ. <verse eid="PSA 89:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13" />O kɔni mi wa, nɛ o nine si hu wa. O hiɔ nine ya hiɔwe gojoo.<verse eid="PSA 89:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14" />O matsɛ yemi sɛ ɔ maa si ngɛ dami kɛ kojomi nɔ, nɛ mɔbɔ nami kɛ anɔkuale ngɛ o nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ peemi mi. <verse eid="PSA 89:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15" />Hyɛ bɔ nɛ nihi nɛ laa kɛ jaa mo ɔ naa bua jɔmi ha, o hɛ mi la a mi nɛ a nyɛɔ ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 89:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16" />O he je nɛ a naa bua jɔmi ngɛ daa, nɛ o dami ɔ he a buu mɛ ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 89:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17" />Ejakaa mo ji a he wami. Mɛni anunyami ji nɛ! Nɛ o mɔbɔ nami ɔ he je nɛ wa naa he wami. <verse eid="PSA 89:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu nitsɛ nɛ buu wa he, nɛ lɛ nɛ ji Israel Nɔ Klɔuklɔu ɔ, e ha wɔ matsɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19" />O tu munyu kɛ gu ni nami mi nɛ o de o gbalɔ ɔ ke, “I hla niheyo saminya ko kɛ je nimli gu ɔmɛ a kpɛti nɛ e ye matsɛ. <verse eid="PSA 89:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20" />Lɛ ji ye sɔmɔlɔ David. I ngɔ ye nu klɔuklɔu ɔ kɛ pɔ lɛ. <verse eid="PSA 89:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21" />I ma ha e da si kpɛii, nɛ i ma wo lɛ he wami. <verse eid="PSA 89:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22" />E he nyɛli be e nɔ yee, nɛ yi mi walɔ be e nɔ he wami nae. <verse eid="PSA 89:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23" />I ma ku e he nyɛli kɛ pue si ngɛ e hɛ mi, nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ sume lɛ ɔ, i ma kpata a hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 89:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24" />I ma bu e he nɛ i ma jɔɔ lɛ be fɛɛ be, nɛ ye suɔmi ɔ maa bɔle e he. Ye he je ɔ, e ma he biɛ wawɛɛ. <verse eid="PSA 89:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25" />E nɔ yemi he ɔ maa je Yufrate Pa a he kɛ ya si Mediterenea Wo ɔ nya. <verse eid="PSA 89:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26" />E ma kpa ngmlaa ma de mi ke, ‘Mo ji ye Tsɛ, ye Mawu kɛ tɛ sa he nɛ i laa ye he ngɛ.’ ”<verse eid="PSA 89:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27" />“I ma pee lɛ ye binyumu Tɛte, nɛ e maa kle pe zugba a nɔ matsɛ ɔmɛ tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 89:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28" />Ye suɔmi maa hi e nɔ kɛ ya neneene, nɛ ma na lɛ mɔbɔ be fɛɛ be. Nɛ i kɛ lɛ wa kpɛti somi ɔ se be poe gblee. <verse eid="PSA 89:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29" />Bimɛ nɛ maa ba ngɛ e se ɔ, a nya be tae ligbi ko, nɛ e matsɛ sɛ ɔ maa hi si daa kaa hiɔwe ligbi ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 89:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30" />Ke e bi ɔmɛ ngmɛɛ ye mlaa amɛ a he nɛ a yi a nɔ ɔ, <verse eid="PSA 89:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31" />ke a tɔ ye mlaa amɛ a nɔ, nɛ a yi ye kita amɛ a nɔ ɔ, <verse eid="PSA 89:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32" />i ma gbla a tue kɛ kpa. <verse eid="PSA 89:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33" />Se i be ye suɔmi kɛ mi mi jɔmi ɔ jee gblee kɛ je a nɔ kulaa, nɛ i be si womi ɔ hu mi poe. <verse eid="PSA 89:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34" />I ma ye ye somi ɔ nɔ, nɛ i be nɔ́ nɛ i de kɛ ye nya a tsakee. <verse eid="PSA 89:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35" />Si abɔ nɛ i ka kita ngɛ klɔuklɔu nɛ i ji ɔ nya, kaa i be David sisie ɔ, <verse eid="PSA 89:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36" />e matsɛ yemi weku ɔ be gue gblee, nɛ e matsɛ sɛ ɔ maa hi si daa kaa pu ngɛ ye hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 89:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37" />E maa hi si daa kaa nyɔhiɔ, nɛ e maa pee ye anɔkua odase ngɛ hiɔwe.”<verse eid="PSA 89:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38" />Se mɛni he je nɛ o sake mi kɛ fɔ he mɔ, nɛ o kua mi? Mɛni ba nɛ o mi mi fu nɔ nɛ o pɔ lɛ nu ɔ? <verse eid="PSA 89:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39" />Anɛ o po o kɛ lɛ nyɛ kpɛti Somi ɔ mi lo? Ejakaa o kpɔ e matsɛ pɛɛ ɔ kɛ fɔ zugba. <verse eid="PSA 89:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40" />O ku e he gbogbohi nɛ buu e he ɔ kulaa, nɛ o hule mwɔhi nɛ e laa e he ngɛ mi ɔ tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 89:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41" />Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ ngɛ bee ɔ ngɛ e níhi hae, nɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ e kasa mi ɔ ngɛ e he fɛu yee. <verse eid="PSA 89:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42" />O wo e he nyɛli he wami nɛ a ye e nɔ, nɛ o ha a bua jɔ a he. <verse eid="PSA 89:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43" />O sake e ta hwumi klaate ɔ ngɛ e dɛ kɛ fɔ he, nɛ o wa we lɛ ngɛ ta mi hu. <verse eid="PSA 89:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44" />O ha e anunyami ɔ ba nyagbe, nɛ o plɛ e matsɛ sɛ ɔ kɛ bu si. <verse eid="PSA 89:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45" />O po e nihe be ɔmɛ a nɔ, nɛ o ha e bwɔ, nɛ o ha e hɛ mi pue si ngɛ ma hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 89:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46" />Oo Yehowa, mɛni be enɛ ɔ maa ya nɔ kɛ ya si? Anɛ o maa ngɔ o he kɛ laa mi kɛ ya si nyagbe lo? Mɛni be o mi mi fumi ɔ maa tso kaa la kɛ ya si? <verse eid="PSA 89:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47" />Mo kai be nɛ o to kɛ ha nɔmlɔ adesa nɛ e maa ye ngɛ je mi ɔ. Anɛ si himi gu kɛkɛ nɛ o bɔ nɔmlɔ ke e ba hi lo? <verse eid="PSA 89:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48" />Nɔmlɔ adesa ko be si hie kɛ ya neneene. Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ ma gbo. Mɛnɔ ma nyɛ kpɔ e susuma kɛ je gbenɔ muɔ ɔ he wami dɛ? <verse eid="PSA 89:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, jije suɔmi nɛ o kɛ suɔ mi sa a ngɛ? Jije mi mi jɔmi nɛ o wo David si ngɛ he ngɛ o anɔkuale mi ɔ ngɛ? <verse eid="PSA 89:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo hyɛ bɔ nɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ ngɛ mi nyangee ha; kɛ bɔ nɛ i na tsui ngɛ ye hɛ mi nɛ a ngɛ kae ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 89:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51" />O he nyɛli ɔmɛ ngɛ ye he fɛu yee; a ngɛ nɔ nɛ o pɔ lɛ nu kaa a matsɛ ɔ he fɛu yee. <verse eid="PSA 89:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52" />A je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi kɛ ya neneene. Amen, Amen!<verse eid="PSA 89:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89" />
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90" />
  <para style="ms">Mi Gbami 4</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 90:1-106:48">La 90:1—106:48</ref></para>
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 90</para>
  <para style="s1">Neneene Tsɛ Mawu kɛ nɔmlɔ adesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1" />Neneene Tsɛ, kɛ je blema lokoo ɔ, mo ji wa wesa he! <verse eid="PSA 90:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2" />Loko ji a bɔ je ɔ, nɛ loko ji a bɔ yoku ɔmɛ ɔ, mo ji Mawu nɛ be sisije loo nyagbe.<verse eid="PSA 90:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3" />O haa nɛ nɔmlɔ kpaleɔ peeɔ zu, nɛ o deɔ ke, nyɛɛ kpale nyɛ se nɛ nyɛɛ ba, nyɛ nimli a bimɛ. <verse eid="PSA 90:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4" />Jeha akpe ngɛ kaa hiɛ pɛ ngɛ o hɛ mi. E ngɛ kaa nyɔ hwɔɔmi be kɛkɛ! <verse eid="PSA 90:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5" />O muɔɔ mɛ kɛ yaa kaa pa nɛ ngɛ bee; a nya taa kaa mahe nɛ a hwɔɔ. Mɔtu mi ɔ, a ngɛ kaa nga nɛ ma pɔpɔɔpɔ. <verse eid="PSA 90:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6" />Mɔtu mi ɔ, e peeɔ flɔflɔɔflɔ; gbɔkuɛ mi ɔ, a poo lɛ ngɔ fɔɔ si nɛ e nglaa. <verse eid="PSA 90:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7" />O mi mi la a nɛ ha wa hɛ mi ngɛ kpatae, nɛ o mi mi fumi ha wa ngɛ nɔ́ nae. <verse eid="PSA 90:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8" />O ngɔ wa ni peemi ni yayami ɔmɛ kɛ to o hɛ mi, nɛ o naa wa diblii mi ni ɔmɛ hu paa. <verse eid="PSA 90:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9" />Wa ligbi ɔmɛ ngɛ bee ngɛ o abofu nya, nɛ wa yeɔ wa jeha amɛ kaa nyazia nɛ a ngɛ siae.<verse eid="PSA 90:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10" />Jeha nyingmi kpaago ji wa be ɔ nɛ; nɛ ke wa se kɛ hluu ɔ, jeha nyingmi kpaanyɔ; se dengme kɛ aywilɛho nɛ ngɛ mi. E kɛ we nɛ a poo nɔ nɛ wa bee kɛ hoɔ. <verse eid="PSA 90:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11" />Mɛnɔ nɛ le o mi mi fumi ɔ he wami? Bɔ nɛ o he ngɛ gbeye ɔ, ja a o mi mi fumi hu ngɛ.<verse eid="PSA 90:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, moo tsɔɔ wɔ nɛ waa le wa ligbi ɔmɛ kanemi, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ wa na ni lemi tsui.<verse eid="PSA 90:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13" />Oo Yehowa, mo ba jɔɔ wɔ! Mɛni be po o maa mlɛ kɛ ya si? Mo je o mi mi fumi ɔ kɛ je wa nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 90:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14" />Nɛ o je o suɔmi ɔ kpo kɛ tsɔɔ wɔ mla, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ wa nya, nɛ wa na bua jɔmi ngɛ wa si himi be ɔ tsuo mi. <verse eid="PSA 90:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15" />Mo ha nɛ wa na bua jɔmi kɛ to behi nɛ o ha wa ye aywilɛho ɔ nane mi. Moo ngɔ jeha kpakpahi kɛ to jeha yaya amɛ a nane mi. <verse eid="PSA 90:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16" />Mo ha nɛ waa na o nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ ekohu; nɛ o ha wa bi ɔmɛ a na anunyami níhi, nɛ ji níhi nɛ o peeɔ sa be ɔ mi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 90:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17" />Nɛ Neneene Tsɛ, wa Mawu ɔ, e anunyami ɔ nɛ hi wa nɔ, nɛ e jɔɔ wa nine nya ni tsumi ɔmɛ, nɛ a hi ha wɔ daa.<verse eid="PSA 90:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90" />
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 91</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu, wa wesa he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1" />Nɔ nɛ hii Neneene Tsɛ ɔ laami he ɔ, e maa hi Mawu Ope ɔ nɔuu hɔ̃ mi.<verse eid="PSA 91:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2" />I ma de Tsaatsɛ Mawu ke, “Mo ji ye wesa he kɛ ye mwɔ. Ye Mawu, o nɔ nɛ i ngɔ ye hɛ kɛ fɔ.” <verse eid="PSA 91:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3" />E ma je mo kɛ je oslaahi nɛ o nɛ kulaa mi, kɛ gbenɔ hiɔhi tsuo mi. <verse eid="PSA 91:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4" />E maa ha o nɔ kɛ e pɛlihi, nɛ o ma na sihi he. E anɔkuale si womi ɔmɛ maa pee o he fami níhi. <verse eid="PSA 91:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5" />Jehanɛ ɔ, o be nyɔ gbeye yee hu, aloo oslaa nɛ baa piani ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 91:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6" />Nɛ gbenɔ hiɔ nɛ baa nyɔ mi ɔ be o he gbeye woe, aloo hɛ mi kpatami nɛ baa piani.<verse eid="PSA 91:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7" />Ke nihi akpe nɔ ngɛ o kasa nya, nɛ akpe nyɔngma hu ngɛ gboe kɛ bɔle mo tete po ɔ, nɔ́ ko be o he sae. <verse eid="PSA 91:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8" />O hɛ ngmɛ pɛ nɛ o ma kɛ hyɛ nimli yi mi wali a hiɔwo. <verse eid="PSA 91:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9" />Ejakaa Yehowa ji o wesa he! O ngɔ Tsaatsɛ Mawu Ope ɔ kɛ pee o he bulɔ. <verse eid="PSA 91:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10" />Yayami ko be o nɔ bae, nɛ haomi ko be o we nae. <verse eid="PSA 91:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11" />Ejakaa e ma fa e bɔfo ɔmɛ nɛ a bu o he ngɛ o blɔhi kulaa nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 91:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12" />A maa hɛɛ mo ngɛ a dɛ mi konɛ o nane nɛ ko si tɛ ko. <verse eid="PSA 91:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13" />O kɛ jata maa kpe nɛ o maa naa sinɔ duɔtsɛhi a nɔ, o maa naa jata bihi kɛ demi nɔ, se a be mo nɔ́ ko pee.<verse eid="PSA 91:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14" />Ejakaa Neneene Tsɛ ɔ de ke, “Akɛnɛ e suɔ mi he je ɔ, i ma kpɔ lɛ, nɛ i ma wo e nɔ gojoo, ejakaa e le mi. <verse eid="PSA 91:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15" />Ke e tsɛ mi ɔ, i ma he nɔ. I be e he ngmɛɛe ngɛ haomi mi; i ma kpɔ lɛ nɛ i ma wo e hɛ mi nyami. <verse eid="PSA 91:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16" />Ma ha lɛ wami se kɛmi, nɛ e ma na yi wami hemi.”<verse eid="PSA 91:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91" />
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 92</para>
  <para style="s1">Hejɔɔmi ligbi nɔ la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1" />E sa kaa a na Tsaatsɛ Mawu si, nɛ a la kɛ je Mawu Ope ɔ yi.<verse eid="PSA 92:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2" />A na lɛ si daa mɔtu ngɛ e mi mi jɔmi he; nɛ daa gbɔkuɛ ɔ, a nya ngɛ e anɔkuale yemi ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 92:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3" />A la kɛ saku kɛ je e yi. <verse eid="PSA 92:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4" />Ejakaa mo Tsaatsɛ Mawu o pee níhi fuu kɛ ha mi. Lɔ ɔ he je nɛ ye bua jɔ ngɛ. I ngɛ lae kɛ bua jɔmi.<verse eid="PSA 92:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, hyɛ bɔ nɛ o nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ kle ha! O susumi ɔmɛ a mi kuɔ. <verse eid="PSA 92:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6" />Nihi nɛ susuu we a yi mi ɔ nui sisi; nɛ nihi nɛ be juɛmi hu be enɛ ɔ nya nae, <verse eid="PSA 92:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7" />nɔ he je nɛ yi mi wali mohu ngɛ plɔkee kaa nga, se neneene hɛ mi kpatami pɛ ji nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ ha mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 92:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8" />Se mo Tsaatsɛ Mawu o kle kɛ yaa neneene. <verse eid="PSA 92:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9" />Nɛ o he nyɛli ɔmɛ a hɛ mi ma kpata; nihi nɛ tsuɔ yi mi wami ni tsumi ɔmɛ tsuo ɔ, a maa gbɛ mɛ ke fia.<verse eid="PSA 92:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10" />O ha nɛ ye he wa kaa na ku; nɛ o jɔɔmi ɔ ha nɛ ye bua jɔ ye he. <verse eid="PSA 92:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11" />I ma na nɔ́ nɛ i suɔ nɛ e ba ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ kɛ ye hɛ ngmɛ, nɛ i ma nu kɛ ye tue, nɔ́ nɛ i suɔ nɛ e ba yi mi wali nɛ te si kɛ wo mi ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 92:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12" />Dali maa bɔ kaa tã, nɛ a maa wa kaa Lebanon Sida tsohi. <verse eid="PSA 92:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13" />Nihi nɛ he si ngɛ Mawu we ɔ, a maa bɔ ngɛ Mawu Sɔlemi We ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 92:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14" />A maa wo yiblii ngɛ a bwɔmi si tete; a maa hi he wami nɛ a maa pee pɔpɔɔpɔ. <verse eid="PSA 92:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15" />Nɛ a ma kɛ tsɔɔ kaa dalɔ ji Tsaatsɛ Mawu, nɛ lɛ ji ye tɛ sa, nɛ nɔ́ yayami ko be e mi.<verse eid="PSA 92:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92" />
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 93</para>
  <para style="s1">Yehowa ji Matsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1" />Yehowa ngɛ matsɛ yee! E wlua kɛ agbo jemi; e wlua kɛ he wami. Je ɔ maa si kpɛii nɛ e be hosoe.<verse eid="PSA 93:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2" />O matsɛ yemi ɔ maa si kpɛii kɛ je blema, nɛ e ngɛ kɛ je teteete. <verse eid="PSA 93:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, wo ɔmɛ fiaa; a fiaa kɛ ngmlaa; oslɔke ɔmɛ kuɔ. <verse eid="PSA 93:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4" />Se mo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe ɔ, o kle pe nyu babauu pɛmi kɛ oslɔkehi a kumi. <verse eid="PSA 93:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5" />O mlaa amɛ tsakee we. A ma sɔmɔ mo ngɛ o we klɔuklɔu ɔ daa, oo Neneene Tsɛ.<verse eid="PSA 93:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93" />
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 94</para>
  <para style="s1">Yi mi wali a ni tsumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo nɛ o yeɔ nɔ nɛ a ye lɛ amimi sane kɛ haa lɛ ɔ, mo ha nɛ o anunyami ɔ nɛ kpɛ. <verse eid="PSA 94:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2" />Moo te si, mo nɛ o ji je ɔ kulaa kojolɔ, nɛ o wo he nɔ wolɔ ɔ hiɔ. <verse eid="PSA 94:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mɛni be kulaa yi mi wali ɔmɛ maa ye a he kɛ ya si? <verse eid="PSA 94:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4" />Mɛni be a maa tu munyu nɛ sɛ kɛ ya si? Nɛ mɛni be nihi nɛ tsuɔ yi mi wami ni tsumihi maa fia kɛ ya si? <verse eid="PSA 94:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo hyɛ bɔ nɛ a ngɛ o nimli ɔmɛ yi mi wae ha, nɛ a ha o suɔli ɔmɛ ngɛ nɔ́ nae. <verse eid="PSA 94:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6" />A gbe yalɔyi ɔmɛ kɛ nibwɔ ɔmɛ, nɛ a gbe awusa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 94:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7" />Se kɛ ɔ, a ngɛ dee ke, “Mawu nɛ, aloo e pi Yakob Mawu ɔ kɔmɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 94:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8" />Nyɛɛ le nɔ́, nyɛ nihi nɛ be juɛmi; nyɛ kuasiahi, mɛni be nyɛ hɛ mi maa tɛ? <verse eid="PSA 94:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9" />Anɛ nɔ nɛ bɔ tue ɔ, lɛ nitsɛ e nui nɔ́ lo? Nɛ nɔ nɛ bɔ hɛ ngmɛ ɔ, lɛ nitsɛ e hyɛ we nɔ́ lo? <verse eid="PSA 94:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10" />Lɛ nɔ nɛ gblaa wɔ jali a tue ɔ, anɛ e be nyɛ hiɔ woe lo? Lɛ nɔ nɛ tsɔɔ adesa nile, anɛ e be lee lo? <verse eid="PSA 94:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11" />Neneene Tsɛ ɔ le adesa yi mi susumi ɔmɛ kaa a ji yakayaka níhi. <verse eid="PSA 94:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, a jɔɔ nɔ nɛ o gblaa e tue ɔ, nɛ o ngɔɔ o mlaa a kɛ tsɔɔ lɛ ni ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 94:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13" />Konɛ o ha lɛ tue mi jɔmi ngɛ haomi behi a mi kɛ ya si a maa tsua muɔ kɛ ha yi mi wali ɔmɛ nɛ a ma kpata a hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 94:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14" />Ejakaa Tsaatsɛ Mawu be e nimli ɔmɛ a he ngmɛɛe, nɛ e be e we bi ɔmɛ kuae hulɔ. <verse eid="PSA 94:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15" />Kojomi kpakpa maa kpale kɛ ba ekohu, nɛ dali ɔmɛ tsuo ma nya.<verse eid="PSA 94:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16" />Mɛnɔ maa te si kɛ wo yayami peeli ɔmɛ kɛ ha mi? Aloo mɛnɔ maa te si kɛ si yi mi wali ɔmɛ kɛ ha mi? <verse eid="PSA 94:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17" />Kaa Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi kɛ bua we mi ɔ, jinɛ i gbo. <verse eid="PSA 94:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18" />I kpa ngmlaa ke, “Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ye nane ngɛ sanee!” Kɛkɛ nɛ e na mi mɔbɔ nɛ e je mi.<verse eid="PSA 94:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ke ye juɛmi ngɛ mi pee sikɔsikɔ ɔ, ke ye tsui ngɛ mi haoe ɔ, moo jɔɔ ye bua nɛ o ha mi hɛ nɔ kami. <verse eid="PSA 94:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20" />Anɛ o maa ngmɛ nɔ yeli ojo fiali blɔ nɛ a ye nɔ, nihi nɛ a kɛ mlaa tsu we ni ɔ lo? <verse eid="PSA 94:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21" />A kpee kɛ woɔ dalɔ he, nɛ a buu nɔ nɛ li nɔ́ ko ɔ fɔ. <verse eid="PSA 94:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22" />Se Tsaatsɛ Mawu ji ye he falɔ; lɛ ji tɛ sa, he nɛ i laa ye he ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 94:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23" />Nɛ e ma ha mɛ nitsɛmɛ a ni yayami ɔmɛ ma kpa bu a nɔ, nɛ e ma ha a yi mi wami ni tsumi ɔmɛ ma kpata a hɛ mi. Yehowa, wa Mawu ɔ maa poo mɛ kɛ pue si.<verse eid="PSA 94:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94" />
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 95</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu ji wa tɛ sa kɛ wa kpakalɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1" />Oo, nyɛɛ ba, nyɛ ha nɛ wa la kɛ ha Neneene Tsɛ ɔ! Wa la bua jɔmi la kɛ wo wa yi wami hemi tɛ sa a hɛ mi nyami.<verse eid="PSA 95:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2" />Nyɛ ha nɛ waa ba e hɛ mi kɛ sina, nɛ wa la kɛ bua jɔmi kɛ ha lɛ. <verse eid="PSA 95:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3" />Ejakaa e ji Mawu agbo, nɛ e ji Matsɛ ngua nɛ kle pe mawuhi kulaa. <verse eid="PSA 95:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4" />Lɛ ji nɔ nɛ hɛɛ je ɔ sisi tomi ɔmɛ kɛ yoku ngua amɛ tsuo; e níhi ji kulaa. <verse eid="PSA 95:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5" />Lɛ ji nɔ nɛ bɔ wo ɔ, nɛ lɛ e pee zugba a; kulaa e níhi i. <verse eid="PSA 95:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6" />Nyɛɛ ba, nyɛ ba kpla si ngɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu wa Bɔlɔ ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 95:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7" />Ejakaa lɛ ji wa Mawu. E tohi ji wɔ, nɛ lɛ ji wa Kpakalɔ. Oo, nyɛɛ bu tue, e ngɛ nyɛ tsɛe mwɔnɛ ɔ nɛ nyɛɛ ba e ngɔ!<verse eid="PSA 95:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8" />Nyɛ ko wa nyɛ tsui kaa bɔ nɛ Israel bi ɔmɛ pee ngɛ nga a nɔ ngɛ Meriba kɛ Masa a. <verse eid="PSA 95:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9" />Lejɛ ɔ nɛ nyɛ tsɛ ɔmɛ je mi nguane ngɛ, tsɛ be ɔ, a na ye nyakpɛ ni tsumihi babauu hyɛ. A ni bimi ɔmɛ hao ye tsui.<verse eid="PSA 95:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10" />“Jeha nyingmi eywiɛ sɔuu nɛ i hao ngɛ nimli nɛ ɔmɛ a he, nɛ i de ke a ji ma nɛ a susumi kɛ a tsui be ye he. Nɛ a kua ye mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi. <verse eid="PSA 95:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ka kita ngɛ mi mi fumi mi ke a be Siwomi Zugba a, he nɛ a ma na he jɔmi ngɛ ɔ nɔ yae.”<verse eid="PSA 95:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95" />
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 96</para>
  <para style="s1">La he kɛ ha Mawu, Matsɛ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1" />Nyɛ la la he kɛ ha Tsaatsɛ Mawu. Nyɛ je ɔ tsuo nyɛ la. <verse eid="PSA 96:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2" />Nyɛ la kɛ ha Neneene Tsɛ ɔ, nyɛ je e biɛ ɔ yi. Nyɛɛ jaje e yi wami hemi ɔ he sane daa ligbi.<verse eid="PSA 96:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3" />Nyɛɛ fiɛ e anunyami ni tsumi ɔmɛ ngɛ je ɔ mi he fɛɛ he. Nyɛɛ jaje e nyakpɛ ni ɔmɛ a he sane kɛ tsɔɔ nɔ tsuaa nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 96:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4" />Ejakaa Mawu kle pe bɔ nɛ a ma nyɛ kale, nɛ e sa yi jemi babauu. Lɛ pɛ e sa nɛ a ja ngɛ mawu ɔmɛ kulaa a kpɛti. <verse eid="PSA 96:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5" />Ejakaa amagahi kɛkɛ ji ma amɛ a mawu kpa amɛ; se wa Mawu ɔ ji nɔ nɛ bɔ hiɔwe. <verse eid="PSA 96:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6" />Anunyami kɛ agbo jemi ngɛ e he; he wami kɛ he fɛu ngɛ e We ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 96:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7" />Oo, nyɛ je ɔ tsuo nyɛ de ke Mawu kɛkɛ nɛ e hɛ mi ngɛ anunyami, nɛ e he wa. <verse eid="PSA 96:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8" />Nyɛɛ ngɔ anunyami nɛ sa kɛ ha lɛ! Nyɛɛ ngɔ nyɛ bɔ sami ni ɔmɛ kɛ ba e We ɔ nɛ nyɛ ba ja lɛ. <verse eid="PSA 96:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9" />Nyɛ sɔmɔ Tsaatsɛ Mawu ngɛ klɔuklɔu peemi mi. Nyɛ je ɔ tsuo nyɛ he nɛ kpokpo ngɛ e hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 96:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10" />Nyɛ de je ɔ tsuo ke Yehowa ngɛ matsɛ yee! E ngɛ je ɔ nɔ yee. A be e he wami ɔ nyɛe maa gbe. E maa kojo je ɔ tsuo ngɛ dami nya.<verse eid="PSA 96:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11" />Hiɔwe nɛ nya, nɛ zugba a bua nɛ jɔ; nɛ wo ɔ kɛ e mi nɔ fɛɛ nɔ a tsɔɔ e anunyami ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 96:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12" />Nyɛ je e yi ngɛ zugba amɛ nɛ ngɛ ni baeɔ he, ejakaa e tsɔɔ bɔ nɛ Mawu kle ha. Tsohi nɛ ngɛ hue mi ɔ tsuo a huanya nɛ a je e yi. <verse eid="PSA 96:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13" />Ejakaa Tsaatsɛ Mawu ma nɛ e ba kojo je ɔ; e maa kojo nimli ɔmɛ ngɛ dami kɛ anɔkuale mi.<verse eid="PSA 96:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96" />
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 97</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu ji Matsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1" />Yehowa ji Matsɛ! Je ɔ kulaa nɛ nya! Nyɛ de wo kpɔ ɔmɛ ngɛ lokoo ɔ tsuo nɛ a bua nɛ jɔ.<verse eid="PSA 97:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2" />Bɔ kuu kɛ diblii bɔle lɛ. Dami kɛ dami sane yemi ji níhi nɛ a kɛ to e matsɛ yemi ɔ sisi. <verse eid="PSA 97:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3" />La nyɛɛ e hɛ mi nɛ e ya saa e he nyɛli ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 97:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4" />E oslabai ɔ gbaa nɛ je ɔ mi tsɔɔ. Zugba a naa nɛ e hosoɔ. <verse eid="PSA 97:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5" />Yoku ɔmɛ ywiaa dukuduku ngɛ je ɔ tsuo a Mawu ɔ hɛ mi kaa bɔ nɛ hwo gbaku sileɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 97:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6" />Hiɔwe jajeɔ e dami kɛ tsɔɔ, nɛ ma fɛɛ ma naa e anunyami ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 97:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7" />Wɔ jali ɔmɛ tsuo a hɛ mi ma pue si, nihi kulaa nɛ fiaa kɛ fɔɔ a wɔhi nɛ a he be se nami ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ; hiɔwe kɛ zugba tsuo a sɔmɔ lɛ. <verse eid="PSA 97:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8" />Zion nu he nɛ e na bua jɔmi; nɛ Yuda biyiwi ɔmɛ nya ngɛ mo Neneene Tsɛ o kojomi ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 97:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9" />Ejakaa Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo ji nɔ nɛ ya hiɔmi pe zugba a tsuo. O nɔ kuɔ pe mawu kpa amɛ kulaa.<verse eid="PSA 97:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10" />Yehowa suɔ nihi nɛ sume nɔ́ yayami ɔ; e buu e bimɛ a he nɛ e kpɔɔ mɛ kɛ jee yi mi wali a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 97:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11" />A ngɔ la kɛ ha dalɔ, nɛ a ngɔ bua jɔmi kɛ ha nɔmlɔ kpakpa a. <verse eid="PSA 97:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12" />Dali ɔmɛ tsuo a bua nɛ jɔ ngɛ Mawu mi, nɛ a wo e biɛ klɔuklɔu ɔ hɛ mi nyami.<verse eid="PSA 97:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97" />
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 98</para>
  <para style="s1">Je ɔ nɛ nya, Mawu ji Matsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1" />Nyɛ la la he kɛ ha Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɛ nyɛ kɛ tsɔɔ nyakpɛ ni nguahi nɛ e pee ɔ! Ejakaa e kɛ e klɔuklɔu nɛ e ji ɔ kɛ e he wami ye kunimi agbo ko. <verse eid="PSA 98:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2" />Neneene Tsɛ ɔ ha nɛ a le e yi wami hemi ɔ, nɛ e tsɔɔ e klɔuklɔu nɛ e ji ɔ paa ngɛ wɔ jali a hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 98:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3" />E kai mɔbɔ nami kɛ anɔkuale yemi he si nɛ e wo Israel bi ɔmɛ; nɛ je ɔ tsuo na wa Mawu ɔ e yi wami hemi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 98:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4" />Je ɔ tsuo nɛ je Yehowa yi. Nyɛ kpa ngmlaa wawɛɛ nɛ nyɛ nya, nɛ nyɛ la kɛ je e yi.<verse eid="PSA 98:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5" />Nyɛ la kɛ je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi, nyɛ la kɛ saku kɛ je e yi. <verse eid="PSA 98:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6" />Nyɛ kpa titimati, nɛ nyɛ kpa bɛ ngɛ Matsɛ, Neneene Tsɛ ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 98:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7" />Wo ɔ nɛ fia kɛ e mi nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ kɛ je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi. Zugba a kɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ nɔ ɔ nɛ kpa ngmlaa ke, “A ngɔ anunyami kɛ ha Neneene Tsɛ ɔ!”<verse eid="PSA 98:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8" />Oslɔke ɔmɛ a gbɔ vu, nɛ yoku ɔmɛ tsuo a la kɛ bua jɔmi ngɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 98:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9" />Ejakaa e ma je ɔ kojomi. E maa kojo je ɔ ngɛ dami nya.<verse eid="PSA 98:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98" />
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 99</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɛ je Anunyami Matsɛ ɔ yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1" />Yehowa ji Matsɛ! Nimli ɔmɛ a he nɛ kpokpo! E hii si ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ ngɛ Bɔfo He buli ɔmɛ a kpɛti. Zugba a tsuo nɛ hoso.<verse eid="PSA 99:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2" />Yehowa hii si ngɛ Zion ngɛ agbo jemi mi; e ye zugba a nɔ matsɛ ɔmɛ kulaa a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 99:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3" />A je o biɛ nɛ kle nɛ he ngɛ gbeye, nɛ ngɛ klɔuklɔu ɔ yi.<verse eid="PSA 99:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4" />Matsɛ Hewalɔ nɛ ɔ yeɔ dami sane. Dami sane yemi ji oti ngɛ e nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ peemi mi, nɛ e kojoɔ ngɛ Israel tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 99:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5" />Nyɛ je Yehowa wa Mawu klɔuklɔu ɔ yi! Nyɛ kpla si ngɛ e nane nya, ejakaa e ngɛ klɔuklɔu.<verse eid="PSA 99:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6" />Benɛ Mose kɛ Aaron kɛ Samuel nɛ ji e gbalɔ ɔ kpa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ lɛ nɛ e ye kɛ bua mɛ ɔ, e ha mɛ heto. <verse eid="PSA 99:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7" />E kɛ mɛ tu munyu kɛ je bɔ kuu kpii ɔ mi. A hɛɛ e he odase yemi, nɛ a pɛtɛ mlaa amɛ nɛ e wo mɛ ɔ a he. <verse eid="PSA 99:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8" />Oo Yehowa, wa Mawu! O ha mɛ heto nɛ o ngɔ a yayami ɔmɛ kɛ ke mɛ, se kɛ ɔ, o gbla a tue benɛ a tɔ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 99:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9" />Nyɛ je Yehowa, wa Mawu ɔ yi, nɛ nyɛ sɔmɔ ngɛ Yerusalem ngɛ e yoku klɔuklɔu ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 99:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99" />
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 100</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɛ je Mawu yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1" />Oo nyɛ nimli kulaa nyɛ hwɔ lele kɛ bua jɔmi ngɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 100:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2" />Nyɛ sɔmɔ lɛ kɛ bua jɔmi, nɛ nyɛ la kɛ ba e hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 100:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3" />Mo na nɛ o le kaa Neneene Tsɛ ɔ ji Mawu! Lɛ ji nɔ nɛ bɔ wɔ. E nihi ji wɔ nɛ wa peeɔ e tohi nɛ e lɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 100:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4" />Moo sɛ e agbo ɔmɛ a mi kɛ sina; nɛ o sɛ e kpe he ɔmɛ kɛ yi jemi. Moo na lɛ si nɛ o je e biɛ ɔ yi. <verse eid="PSA 100:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5" />Ejakaa Tsaatsɛ Mawu hi be fɛɛ be. E hyi kɛ suɔmi nɛ e mi mi hi be tsuaa be. E anɔkuale yemi ɔ ngɛ kɛ ha yi nɔhi kulaa.<verse eid="PSA 100:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100" />
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 101</para>
  <para style="s1">Matsɛ kpakpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, i ma la kɛ je o yi ngɛ o suɔmi kɛ mi mi jɔmi kɛ o dami sane yemi ɔ he. I ma la kɛ je o yi babauu.<verse eid="PSA 101:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2" />I ma nyɛɛ blɔ nɛ piami be he ɔ nɔ; se o yemi kɛ buami he hia mi, titli ɔ, ngɛ ami nitsɛ ye we mi he nɛ i suɔ nɛ ma pee nɔ́ nɛ sa ngɛ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 101:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3" />Moo ye kɛ bua mi nɛ ma kua yakayaka níhi nɛ sɛ ɔmɛ; moo ye kɛ bua mi nɛ ma hiɔ ni peemi nihi nɛ dɛ ɔmɛ, nɛ ma ko wo ye he kɛ wo a mi. <verse eid="PSA 101:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4" />I ma kua yi kpɛti wawɛ níhi, nɛ i ma je ye he kɛ je nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ ji yayami mi. <verse eid="PSA 101:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5" />I kɛ nɔ nɛ puɛɔ nɔ ngɛ laami mi ɔ be bɔe. Nɛ i kɛ fiali kɛ he nɔ woli be nyɛɛe. <verse eid="PSA 101:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6" />Mawu gbeye yeli ɔmɛ maa pee ye suɔli, nɛ i ma kpee mɛ kɛ ba ye we mi. Nimli kpakpahi nɛ ma sɔmɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 101:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7" />I be nɔ sisili blɔ hae ngɛ ye we mi, nɛ nihi nɛ yeɔ lakpa be ye ngɔ hie. <verse eid="PSA 101:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8" />I ma kpata yi mi wali ɔmɛ tsuo a hɛ mi ngɛ zugba a nɔ daa ligbi, konɛ ma ha nɛ dika yeli ɔmɛ tsuo a se nɛ po ngɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu ma a mi.<verse eid="PSA 101:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101" />
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 102</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɔguɛ ko sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo nu ye kue fami ɔ, nɛ o bu ye pɛɛ kpami ɔ tue.<verse eid="PSA 102:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2" />Mo ko wo o hɛ mi kɛ laa mi ngɛ ye haomi be nɛ ɔ mi. Moo bu mi tue nɛ o ha mi heto mla. <verse eid="PSA 102:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3" />Ejakaa ye ligbi ɔmɛ ngɛ bee kaa la su ku, nɛ ye he mi dɔ la kaa la tɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 102:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4" />Ye tsui nya ngɛ tae, nɛ i pee kaa nga nɛ gbo. Niye ni tete jlo we mi. <verse eid="PSA 102:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5" />I kɛmɛ hluu nɛ i ta he lo, nɛ i pee kaa wu. <verse eid="PSA 102:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6" />I pee kaa okpoku ngɛ nga nɔ tsitsaa, aloo klomi ngɛ magbɛ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 102:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7" />Ke je jɔ ɔ, i hwɔɛ mahe. I pee kaa otoklii ngɛ tsu yi kpɛti nɛ be fiɛlɔ.<verse eid="PSA 102:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8" />Ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ ngɛ ye he fɛu yee, nɛ a ngɛ mi gbiɛe daa je nɛ maa na. <verse eid="PSA 102:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9" />La zu ji ye niye ni, nɛ ke i ngɛ nyu nue ɔ, ye vo nyu futuu mi. <verse eid="PSA 102:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10" />Ejakaa o na mi abofu nɛ o sake mi kɛ fɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 102:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11" />Ye ligbi ɔmɛ ngɛ kaa gbɔkuɛ he nini, nɛ i ngɛ gboe kaa nga. <verse eid="PSA 102:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12" />Se Tsaatsɛ, mo ji Neneene Matsɛ ɔ nɛ. O biɛ ngɛ daa kɛ daa.<verse eid="PSA 102:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13" />Mo wo o he nɔ nɛ o na Yerusalem mɔbɔ. Be nɛ o to nɛ o maa ye kɛ bua lɛ ɔ su. Be ɔ ji enɛ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="PSA 102:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14" />Ejakaa e gbogbo ɔmɛ a mi tɛ ɔmɛ peeɔ o tsɔli ɔmɛ bua jɔmi, nɛ gbɛjegbɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ bunyuku ɔ peeɔ mɛ mɔbɔ. <verse eid="PSA 102:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15" />Mo ha nɛ je mi ma amɛ kɛ a nɔ yeli ɔmɛ tsuo a ye Tsaatsɛ Mawu kɛ e anunyami ɔ gbeye. <verse eid="PSA 102:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16" />Be nɛ Yehowa maa ma Yerusalem ekohu ɔ, e maa ba ngɛ e anunyami mi.<verse eid="PSA 102:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17" />E maa bu ohiafo ɔmɛ a kue fami tue, ejakaa e ngɛ a he deka. <verse eid="PSA 102:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18" />I ngɛ enɛ ɔ ngmae kɛ fɔ si ha yi nɔ bihi nɛ maa ba a, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ mɛ hu a je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi ngɛ níhi nɛ e tsu ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 102:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19" />Neneene Tsɛ ɔ plɛ nɛ e hyɛ zugba a kɛ je hiɔwe lokoo. Tsaatsɛ Mawu hyɛ zugba a kɛ je hiɔwe. <verse eid="PSA 102:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20" />E nu e nimli ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ nyɔguɛ yemi mi ɔ a kɛmɛmi, nɛ e ngmɛɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ a to nɛ a maa gbe ɔ a he, <verse eid="PSA 102:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21" />bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a wo Tsaatsɛ Mawu biɛ ta ngɛ Zion nɛ a je e yi ngɛ Yerusalem. <verse eid="PSA 102:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22" />Nɛ ma amɛ a nɔ matsɛ ɔmɛ tsuo ma bua a he nya nɛ a ja lɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23" />E ku ye he wami nya be mi nɛ ye be sui, nɛ e po ye ligbi ɔmɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 102:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24" />I kpa ngmlaa nɛ i de ke, “Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo ko kpatu mi! Moo o ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene. <verse eid="PSA 102:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25" />Kɛ je blema lokoo nɛ o to je ɔ sisi. O nine nya ni tsumi ji hiɔwe nɛ o bɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 102:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26" />A hɛ mi ma kpata, se moo lɛɛ o maa hi si daa. Mɛ tsuo a maa bwɔ nɛ a maa pee kaa tako. O ma tsake mɛ kaa bɔ nɛ a woɔ tade he, nɛ a sakee momo ɔ kɛ fɔɔ he ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 102:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27" />Se moo lɛɛ o tsakee we, o ngɛ ja a daa, nɛ o jeha amɛ be nyagbe.<verse eid="PSA 102:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28" />O tsɔli a bimɛ be tae, nɛ o maa baa a bibimɛ a yi.”<verse eid="PSA 102:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102" />
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 103</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɛ je Mawu yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1" />Mo je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi, ye susuma; i ma je e yi kɛ ye tsui kulaa. <verse eid="PSA 103:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2" />Mo je Neneene Tsɛ ɔ yi, ye susuma; nɛ o hɛ nɛ ko je e dloomi ní slɔɔtohi nɛ e kɛ dloo mo ɔ a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 103:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3" />Lɛ nɛ e woɔ o yayami ɔmɛ tsuo kɛ kee mo, nɛ e tsaa o he mi hiɔhi kulaa. <verse eid="PSA 103:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4" />Lɛ nɛ e heɔ o yi wami kɛ jee hɛ mi kpatami mi, nɛ e wo suɔmi kɛ mɔbɔ nami kɛ bɔle mo kɛ kpe. <verse eid="PSA 103:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5" />Lɛ nɛ e woɔ o nya ngma kɛ ni kpakpahi, nɛ e haa nɛ o hii nihe mi be fɛɛ be kaa kɔle. <verse eid="PSA 103:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6" />Yehowa yeɔ dami sane, nɛ e kojoɔ kɛ haa nihi nɛ a ngɛ mɛ amimi yee ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 103:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7" />E ha Mose le e suɔmi nya ní, nɛ e ha Israel bi ɔmɛ hu le e ni tsumi ɔmɛ.<verse eid="PSA 103:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8" />E kɛɔ loko Tsaatsɛ Mawu naa abofu, ejakaa mɔbɔ nalɔ kɛ dloolɔ ji lɛ, nɛ e suɔmi hiɛ fuu. <verse eid="PSA 103:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9" />E ka we nɔ hɛ mi be fɛɛ be, nɛ e mi mi fumi yɛ kɛkɛɛ. <verse eid="PSA 103:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10" />E kojo we wɔ ngɛ wa yayami ɔmɛ a nya, nɛ e sɛ̃ wa tue ngɛ wa tɔmi ɔmɛ a klemi nya. <verse eid="PSA 103:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11" />Ejakaa bɔ nɛ hiɔwe kɛ zugba a kpɛti kɛ ɔ, ja a nɛ e mɔbɔ nami kle kɛ ha nihi nɛ yee lɛ gbeye ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 103:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12" />Kaa bɔ nɛ pu site he kɛ pu sinɔ he a kpɛti kɛ ɔ, ja a nɛ e ha waa kɛ wa yayami ɔmɛ a kpɛti kɛ. <verse eid="PSA 103:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13" />Kaa bɔ nɛ tsɛ mi mi saa lɛ ngɛ e bimɛ a he ɔ, ja a nɛ Yehowa mi mi saa lɛ ngɛ nihi nɛ yee lɛ gbeye ɔ a he. <verse eid="PSA 103:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14" />Ejakaa e le bɔ nɛ wa nɔmlɔ tso ɔ ngɛ ha, kaa zu kɛkɛ ji wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 103:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15" />Nɔmlɔ adesa wami se kɛmi ngɛ kaa nga, e bɔɔ mlɔmlɔɔmlɔ kaa mɔmɔ ngɛ nga nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 103:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16" />Se ke kɔɔhiɔ gu nɔ pɛ e be hu; kɛkɛ ɔ, a li lɛ ngɛ he nɛ e hiɔ hu.<verse eid="PSA 103:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17" />Se Yehowa mɔbɔ nami ɔ ngɛ daa kɛ ha ni nɛmɛ nɛ yeɔ lɛ gbeye ɔ. Nɛ e dami ɔ ngɛ kɛ ha bimɛ kɛ bibimɛ tsuo; <verse eid="PSA 103:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18" />kɛ nihi nɛ yeɔ e somi ɔ nɔ, kɛ nihi nɛ kai e kita amɛ nɛ a yeɔ a nɔ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 103:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu to e matsɛ sɛ ɔ si ngɛ hiɔwe; e yeɔ je ɔ tsuo nɔ matsɛ. <verse eid="PSA 103:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20" />Nyɛ je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi, nyɛ e bɔfo ɔmɛ, nyɛ he wali nɛ yeɔ e mlaa amɛ a nɔ, nɛ nyɛ buɔ e gbi tue ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 103:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21" />Nyɛ je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi, nyɛ e ta hwuli ɔmɛ, nyɛ e sɔmɔli nɛ peeɔ e suɔmi nya ni ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 103:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22" />Nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ he fɛɛ he ɔ nɛ je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi. Oo ye susuma, mo hu mo je e yi.<verse eid="PSA 103:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103" />
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 104</para>
  <para style="s1">Yehowa ji je ɔ bɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1" />Oo ye susuma, mo je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi. Oo Neneene Tsɛ, ye Mawu, o kle agbo. Bumi kɛ agbo jemi bɔle o he. <verse eid="PSA 104:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2" />O ngɔ la kɛ ha o he kaa a buɔ bo. O ha kɛ kpe hiɔwe tsuo kaa tsu nya bo. <verse eid="PSA 104:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3" />O ha nɛ zugba a hɛ mi wo muɔ voo nɛ e pee wo. Bɔ kuu ɔmɛ ji o trɔkehi. Nɛ o hii kɔɔhiɔ pɛli ɔmɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 104:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4" />O pee o bɔfo ɔmɛ mumihi; nɛ la nɛ ngɛ tsoe ji o sɔmɔli.<verse eid="PSA 104:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5" />O fia je ɔ ngɔ ma e sisi tomi ɔmɛ a nɔ bɔ nɛ e be hosoe ligbi ko. <verse eid="PSA 104:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6" />O ha nyu ɔmɛ ha zugba a nɔ nɛ yoku ɔmɛ a yi laa. <verse eid="PSA 104:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7" />O wo gbi, nɛ ngɛ o ngmlaa a nya a, nyu ɔmɛ bua a he nya nɛ e pee wo gbajaa. <verse eid="PSA 104:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8" />A kuɔ yoku ɔmɛ nɛ a kple dɔ ɔmɛ a mi kɛ ya da he nɛ o to ha mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 104:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9" />O to huzu ha wo ɔmɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a ko ha zugba a nɔ hu.<verse eid="PSA 104:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10" />O to nyuhi nɛ jiɔ kɛ jee zu mi ɔ ngɛ dɔhi a mi, kɛ pahi nɛ bee ɔ ngɛ yokuhi a kpɛti. <verse eid="PSA 104:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11" />A haa nga mi lohwehi tsuo nyu nɛ a nuu, nɛ a gbee nga mi tejihi a kuma. <verse eid="PSA 104:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12" />Lohwe pɛlitsɛhi maa tsu ngɛ a kasa mi, nɛ a laa ngɛ tso kɔnihi a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 104:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13" />O haa nɛ nyu nɛɛ kɛ pueɔ yoku ɔmɛ a nɔ nɛ tso yiblii woɔ ngɛ zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 104:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14" />O ha nɛ nga puɛɛ kɛ ha nahi, kɛ tsohi hu nɛ nimli ma du, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a na nya ngma kɛ je zu ɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 104:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15" />Nɛ e na wai kɛ wo e tsui bua, kɛ nu nɛ ma ha e he womi ma kpɛ, kɛ abolo nɛ maa wo lɛ he wami. <verse eid="PSA 104:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu ji nɔ nɛ du Lebanon sida tso ɔmɛ. A wa nɛ a ka gagaaga. <verse eid="PSA 104:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17" />A mi nɛ lohwe pɛlitsɛhi maa tsu ngɛ, nɛ aklawahi hu peeɔ tsu ngɛ tso gaga amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 104:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18" />Nga mi apletsihi hii yoku gaga amɛ a nɔ, nɛ kahi laa ngɛ tɛ sahi a mi.<verse eid="PSA 104:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19" />O bɔ hlami nɛ e tsɔɔ be ngɛ jeha a mi, kɛ pu hu nɛ e tsɔɔ ligbi. <verse eid="PSA 104:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20" />O bɔ diblii nɛ ke e wo pɛ je jɔ, kɛkɛ nga mi lohwehi je kpo. <verse eid="PSA 104:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21" />Jata bihi keɔ kɛ hlaa lohwe nɛ a nu; a hlaa a niye ni ke jee mo Tsaatsɛ Mawu o dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 104:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22" />Makɛ mi pɛ a sɛ hue kɛ ya laa ngɛ muɔhi a mi. <verse eid="PSA 104:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23" />Kɛkɛ adesahi hu ho ni tsumi ya kɛ ya si gbɔkuɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 104:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o nibɔ ni ɔmɛ ngɛ munomuno. Nile nɛ o kɛ pee kulaa. Zugba a nɔ hyi tɔ kɛ o nibɔ ni ɔmɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25" />Wo hu ji lɔ ɔ nɛ, e yi bli nɛ e mi hyi tɔ kɛ nibɔ ni slɔɔtohi nɛ ngɛ hɛ ngmle, ni nguahi kɛ ni tsɔwi tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 104:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26" />E nɔ nɛ lɛhi nyɛɛɔ, nɛ e mi nɛ boso nɛ o bɔ ɔ jeɔ e hɛ ja ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 104:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27" />Nɛ ní nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo hyɛɔ mo blɔ nɛ o ha mɛ a niye ni ngɛ be nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 104:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28" />O haa mɛ nɛ a buaa nya. O paa o dɛ mi nɛ a tɔɔ kɛ ni kpakpahi.<verse eid="PSA 104:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29" />Ke o wo o hɛ mi ngɔ laa pɛ kɛkɛ a hao. Nɛ ke o ngɔ a mumi ɔmɛ ngɛ a dɛ ɔ, a yi taa nɛ a kpaleɔ kɛ hoɔ zu mi ya.<verse eid="PSA 104:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30" />Ke o wo mumi pue a nɔ pɛ a plɛ nibɔ nihi, kɛkɛ zugba a hɛ mi pee ehe. <verse eid="PSA 104:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31" />Neneene Tsɛ ɔ anunyami maa hi si daa. Tsaatsɛ Mawu bua maa jɔ e nibɔ ni ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 104:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32" />Ke e hyɛ zugba a pɛ kɛkɛ zugba a huanya; nɛ ke e ta yoku ɔmɛ a he pɛ a bɔni la su ku jemi!<verse eid="PSA 104:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33" />I ma la ha Tsaatsɛ Mawu be abɔ nɛ i ngɛ je mi ɔ. I ma la kɛ je Neneene Tsɛ ɔ yi be abɔ nɛ i ngɛ wami mi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 104:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34" />I na nɛ ye yi mi susumi nɛ ɔmɛ sa e hɛ mi, ejakaa Tsaatsɛ Mawu pɛ ji nɔ nɛ haa mi bua jɔmi. <verse eid="PSA 104:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35" />Ha nɛ yayami peeli a hɛ mi nɛ kpata ngɛ zugba a nɔ, nɛ dikali a ko hi si hu. Oo ye susuma, mo je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi. Nyɛ je Neneene Tsɛ ɔ yi.<verse eid="PSA 104:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104" />
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 105</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu hɛ ji e si womi ɔmɛ a nɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1" />Nyɛɛ na Yehowa si; nyɛ tsɛ e biɛ nɛ nyɛ ha nimli ɔmɛ a le e ni tsumi ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 105:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2" />Nyɛ la kɛ je e yi, nɛ nyɛɛ fiɛ e nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ kɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 105:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3" />Nyɛ nya ngɛ Neneene Tsɛ ɔ mi; nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ Yehowa se blɔ hlae ɔ a bua nɛ jɔ.<verse eid="PSA 105:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4" />Nyɛ hla Yehowa kɛ e he wami ɔ se blɔ, nɛ nyɛɛ ya nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ lɛ nɛ hi si.<verse eid="PSA 105:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5" />Nyɛ kai nyakpɛ ni tsumihi nɛ e tsu ɔ, kɛ e kojomi ɔmɛ, <verse eid="PSA 105:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:6" />nyɛ Abraham, Mawu sɔmɔlɔ ɔ bimɛ, kɛ Yakob nɔ nɛ e hla a bimɛ. <verse eid="PSA 105:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7" />Lɛ ji Yehowa, wa Neneene Tsɛ, e kojomi kpe zugba nɔ tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 105:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8" />E kai e somi ɔ, nɛ ji si nɛ e wo yi nɔhi akpe abɔ ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 105:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9" />Somi nɛ e kɛ Abraham so, kɛ kita nɛ e ka Isak ɔ; <verse eid="PSA 105:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10" />nɛ e ma nɔ mi kaa mlaa kɛ ha Yakob, kɛ Israel hu kaa neneene somi. <verse eid="PSA 105:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11" />Nɛ e de ke, “I ma wo Kana zugba a kɛ ha mo kaa o gbosi ni.” <verse eid="PSA 105:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12" />Be mi nɛ a he pi, nɛ a ji nibwɔhi ngɛ zugba a mi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 105:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13" />Be mi nɛ a gbɛ fia nɛ a ngɛ mɛ fiee kɛ ngɛ ma amɛ a nɔ kpae ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 105:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14" />E ha we he blɔ nɛ nɔ ko nɛ pee mɛ yayami. Nɛ e kpata matsɛmɛ a hɛ mi ngɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 105:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15" />E de ke, “Nyɛ ko ta ye nihi nɛ i pɔ mɛ nu ɔ a he, nɛ nyɛ ko pee ye gbali ɔmɛ nɔ́ yayami ko.”<verse eid="PSA 105:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16" />E ha nɛ hwɔ ba zugba nɔ, nɛ a na we niye ni. <verse eid="PSA 105:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e tsɔ Yosef kaa nyɔguɛ kɛ ho Mizraim ya nɛ e ya he e nimli ɔmɛ a yi wami kɛ je hwɔ ɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 105:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18" />A wo e nane kɔsɔkɔsɔ kɛ e kuɛ ga ngɛ tsu ɔ mi, <verse eid="PSA 105:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19" />kɛ ya si Tsaatsɛ Mawu be nɛ e to ɔ su, nɛ Neneene Tsɛ ɔ ka lɛ hyɛ. <verse eid="PSA 105:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20" />Kɛkɛ nɛ matsɛ ɔ tsɔ nɛ a ya pine lɛ nɛ e ngmɛɛ e he. <verse eid="PSA 105:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21" />E to lɛ e we ɔ nyatsɛ kɛ e nihi a nɔ hyɛlɔ. <verse eid="PSA 105:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22" />E ma nyɛ wo matsɛ ɔ sɔmɔli tsu mi ke e suɔ, nɛ e ni tsumi hu ji kaa e tsɔɔ matsɛ ɔ ga woli ɔmɛ ni.<verse eid="PSA 105:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23" />Yakob hu ba je Mizraim nɛ e ba hi Ham zugba a nɔ kɛ e bi ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 105:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24" />Nɛ e ha e nimli ɔmɛ a he ba hiɛ saminya, nɛ e ha a he wa pe a he nyɛli ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 105:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu ha Mizraim bi ɔmɛ te si kɛ wo e nimli ɔmɛ; a nyɛ e tsɔli ɔmɛ, nɛ a ye mɛ nyɔguɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26" />E tsɔ e tsɔlɔ Mose, nɛ e ngɔ Aaron kɛ piɛ e he. <verse eid="PSA 105:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27" />Nɛ a tsu nyakpɛ níhi nɛ ngɛ gbeye ngɛ Mizraim zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 105:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28" />E ha nɛ diblii wo ngɛ zugba a tsuo nɔ se Mizraim bi ɔmɛ bui. <verse eid="PSA 105:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29" />E ha nɛ a nyu ɔmɛ plɛ muɔ, nɛ a pa amɛ a mi lohi kulaa gbo, <verse eid="PSA 105:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30" />Zugba a wo ovɔnɔhi babauu, nɛ a sɛ a matsɛ ɔmɛ a se tsuhi a mi fuu. <verse eid="PSA 105:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31" />E fa nɛ zugba a wo anunu slɔɔtohi kɛ lohwe tsɔwi babauu ngɛ he fɛɛ he. <verse eid="PSA 105:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32" />E ha nɛ gbiɛ ngo ngu nɛ pue si kaa hiɔmi, nɛ je ɔ mi pa la ngɛ zugba a mi tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 105:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33" />E gbe a wai tso ɔmɛ kɛ kɔɔle tso ɔmɛ kɛ tso kpahi kulaa ngɛ zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 105:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34" />E fa nɛ baalɛhi kɛ gɔgɔhi ba, bɔ nɛ a be nane mami he nae. <verse eid="PSA 105:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35" />Nɛ a ye zugba a nɔ bahi kɛ ngahi kɛ tso wowoehi kulaa. <verse eid="PSA 105:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36" />E gbe a bi tɛtehi kɛ bi dede ɔmɛ tsuo, nɛ ji a fiami kɛ a bua jɔmi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 105:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37" />Nɛ e kpaka Israel bi ɔmɛ kɛ je kɛ a dɛ mi sika tsu kɛ sika hiɔ, nɛ hiɔtsɛ ko be a kpɛti. <verse eid="PSA 105:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38" />Mizraim bi ɔmɛ na bua jɔmi kaa Israel bi ɔmɛ je, ejakaa a ngɛ mɛ gbeye yee.<verse eid="PSA 105:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39" />E ha nɛ bɔ kuu ha a nɔ konɛ pu nɛ ko saa mɛ, nɛ la hu nyɛɛ a hɛ mi gbɔkuɛ. <verse eid="PSA 105:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40" />A bi lɛ nɛ e ha mɛ de lo nɛ a ye, nɛ e ha nɛ hɔnehi ba fuu ha mɛ, nɛ e ha mɛ abolo hu kɛ je hiɔwe. <verse eid="PSA 105:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41" />E ha nɛ tɛ sa gba nɛ nyu je mi, nɛ e fo dɔ kaa pa. <verse eid="PSA 105:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42" />Ejakaa e hɛ ji e tsɔlɔ Abraham kɛ si nɛ e wo ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 105:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43" />Nɛ e kpaka e nimli ɔmɛ kɛ a nya la kɛ bua jɔmi. <verse eid="PSA 105:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44" />Nɛ e ngɔ ma je li ɔmɛ a zugba a kɛ ha mɛ kɛ e mi níhi nɛ a du ɔ tsuo. Nɛ níhi nɛ ni kpahi gbo he dengme ɔ ba plɛ a gbosi ni. <verse eid="PSA 105:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45" />E pee enɛ ɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a ye e mlaa amɛ a nɔ. Nyɛ je Neneene Tsɛ ɔ yi.<verse eid="PSA 105:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105" />
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 106</para>
  <para style="s1">Moo na o nimli yayami peeli ɔmɛ mɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1" />Nyɛ je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi! Oo, nyɛɛ na Neneene Tsɛ ɔ si, ejakaa e hi, nɛ e mɔbɔ nami ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 106:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2" />Mɛnɔ ma nyɛ maa jaje Neneene Tsɛ ɔ ni tsumi ngua amɛ ngɔ tsɔɔ, aloo e ma nyɛ je e yi bɔ nɛ sa?<verse eid="PSA 106:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3" />A gbaa nihi nɛ yeɔ dami sane nɛ a peeɔ nɔ́ nɛ da be tsuaa be.<verse eid="PSA 106:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo kai mi, nɛ o na ami hu mɔbɔ kaa bɔ nɛ o naa o nimli ɔmɛ mɔbɔ ɔ; mo he ye yi wami. <verse eid="PSA 106:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5" />Mo ha nɛ ami hu ma na o nimli ɔmɛ nɛ o hla a a nɔ́ nami ɔ eko; nɛ ma na a bua jɔmi ɔ eko, nɛ ami hu ye nine nɛ su anunyami nɛ o kɛ ha mɛ ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 106:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6" />Wɔ kɛ wa tsɛ ɔmɛ tsuo pee yayami; wa pee nɔ́ nɛ dɛ, kɛ yi mi wami níhi. <verse eid="PSA 106:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7" />Wa tsɛ ɔmɛ nui o nyakpɛ níhi nɛ o tsu ha mɛ ngɛ Mizraim ɔ sisi; nɛ a kai we o suɔmi babauu ɔ, se mohu a tsɔ o hɛ mi atuã ngɛ Wo Tsutsu ɔ nya. <verse eid="PSA 106:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8" />Se enɛ ɔmɛ kulaa se ɔ, o he a yi wami ngɛ o biɛ ɔ he je, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ o je o he wami ɔ kpo kɛ tsɔɔ je ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 106:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9" />O nga Wo Tsutsu ɔ yi nɛ e mi gba nɛ e pee zugba gbigbli, nɛ o nyɛɛ a hɛ mi kɛ gu mi kaa nga nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 106:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10" />Nɛ o kpɔ mɛ kɛ je a he nyɛli ɔmɛ a dɛ mi, kɛ a he wami sisi. <verse eid="PSA 106:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nyu ɔ kpale se kɛ ba ha he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nɔ nɛ a hɛ mi kpata; nɛ a ti nɔ kake hu piɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12" />Nɛ jehanɛ ɔ lɛɛ e nimli ɔmɛ he lɛ ye nɛ a la kɛ je e yi.<verse eid="PSA 106:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13" />Se be bɔɔ se pɛ nɛ a hɛ je e ni tsumi ɔmɛ a nɔ ekohu, nɛ a mlɛ́ lɛ nɛ e wo mɛ ga. <verse eid="PSA 106:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14" />A di niye ni ngɔngɔɛ se wawɛɛ ngɛ nga a nɔ nɛ a ka Tsaatsɛ Mawu. <verse eid="PSA 106:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15" />E ha mɛ nɔ́ nɛ a bi lɛ ɔ, se e ha nɛ a ta he lo. <verse eid="PSA 106:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16" />Nɛ a nyɛ Mose, kɛ Aaron hu nɛ ji Mawu nɔmlɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 106:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17" />Kɛkɛ nɛ zugba gba nɛ e mi Datan kɛ Abiram kɛ e we bi ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 106:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18" />Nɛ la hu je hiɔwe ba sa dikali nɛ piɛ ɔmɛ tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 106:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19" />A ngɔ sika kɛ pee na bi amaga ngɛ Horeb nɛ a ja lɛ. <verse eid="PSA 106:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20" />A ngɔ Mawu anunyami ɔ kɛ ha na nɛ kpeɔ nga. <verse eid="PSA 106:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21" />A hɛ je a yi wami helɔ Mawu ɔ nɔ, nɔ nɛ tsu ni nguahi ngɛ Mizraim ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 106:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22" />Nɔ nɛ tsu nyakpɛ nihi ngɛ Ham zugba a nɔ kɛ gbeye níhi hu ngɛ Wo Tsutsu ɔ mi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 106:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Tsaatsɛ Mawu de ke e ma kpata a hɛ mi. Se Mose, Nɔmlɔ nɛ e hla a, da mi kɛ ha mɛ ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi, nɛ e kpa lɛ pɛɛ kaa e ngmɛɛ e mi mi fumi ɔ he nɛ e ko kpata a hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 106:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24" />Jehanɛ ɔ, a kua Siwomi Zugba a nɔ yami, ejakaa a he we e munyu ɔ yi kaa e maa hyɛ a nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 106:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25" />Se mohu a huhuɛ̃ ngɛ a bo tsu ɔmɛ a mi, nɛ a bui Neneene Tsɛ ɔ gbi tue. <verse eid="PSA 106:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e ka kita kaa e ma kpata a hɛ mi ngɛ nga a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 106:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27" />Nɛ e ma ha nɛ a bimɛ ma da; e maa gbɛ mɛ kɛ fia zugba kpahi a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 106:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28" />Nɛ a wo a he kɛ ya piɛ Baal amaga jali ngɛ Peor ɔ a he, nɛ a yeɔ wɔ nya niye ni. <verse eid="PSA 106:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29" />A ni peemi ni nɛ ɔmɛ wo Tsaatsɛ Mawu mi mi la nɛ hiɔ ba sɛ a kpɛti nɛ e gbe mɛ kaa aja gbee kungwɔ. <verse eid="PSA 106:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30" />Gbenɔ nɛ ɔ ngɛ nɔ yae kɛ ya si Pinehas te si nɛ e da mi kɛ ha mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 106:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ a bu lɛ dalɔ kɛ yaa yi nɔhi kulaa.<verse eid="PSA 106:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32" />A wo e muklii mi la ngɛ Meriba hu nɛ a ha nɛ Mose na amane. <verse eid="PSA 106:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33" />Ejakaa a ha nɛ e tsui hua nɛ e tu munyu yaya. <verse eid="PSA 106:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34" />A ya bui Tsaatsɛ Mawu gbi tue, kaa a kpata nimli ɔmɛ a hɛ mi ngɛ zugba a nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 106:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35" />Se mohu a ya futu wɔ jali ɔmɛ a kpɛti nɛ a kase a ni yayami peemi ni ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 106:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36" />Nɛ a sɔmɔ a amaga amɛ; nɛ enɛ ɔ je mɛ kɛ je Mawu he. <verse eid="PSA 106:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37" />A wo a bimɛ tɛte kɛ sã bɔ kɛ ha jemɛ a wɔ ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 106:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38" />A kpata nihi nɛ pee we nɔ́ ko ɔ a hɛ mi, nɛ ji mɛ nitsɛmɛ a binyumuwi kɛ yiwi nɛ a ngɔ kɛ sã bɔ kɛ ha Kanaan amagahi, nɛ muɔ si puemi ɔ wo zugba a he mu. <verse eid="PSA 106:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39" />A ni yayami peemi nɛ ɔmɛ wo mɛ nitsɛmɛ a he mu, ejakaa amaga jami ɔ, e ji ajuama bɔmi ngɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 106:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ Yehowa mi mi fu e nimli ɔmɛ ngɛ, nɛ a he pee lɛ tai. <verse eid="PSA 106:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41" />Nɛ e ngmɛɛ a he kɛ ha a he nyɛli wɔ jali nɛ sume mɛ ɔ nɛ a ye a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 106:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42" />A hi a he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nɔ yemi kɛ a he wami sisi nɛ a wa mɛ yi mi.<verse eid="PSA 106:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43" />E kpɔ mɛ si abɔ kɛ je nyɔguɛ yemi ɔ mi, se mɛ hu a ngɛ nɔ ngɛ atuã tsɔe, nɛ a yayami peemi ɔ nya ba wa. <verse eid="PSA 106:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44" />Enɛ ɔ kulaa se ɔ, a nɔ́ nami pee lɛ mɔbɔ, nɛ e bu a ngmlaa kpami ɔ tue. <verse eid="PSA 106:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45" />E kai e somi ɔ, nɛ e tsake e juɛmi, ejakaa e suɔmi kle. <verse eid="PSA 106:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46" />E ha nɛ a nɔ yeli ɔmɛ tete na mɛ mɔbɔ.<verse eid="PSA 106:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47" />“O Neneene Tsɛ, wa Mawu, mo he wa yi wami. Mo bua wa nya ekohu kɛ je ma amɛ a nɔ kɛ ba we, konɛ waa na mo si, nɛ wa nya, nɛ wa je o yi.”<verse eid="PSA 106:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48" />A je Neneene Tsɛ, Israel Mawu ɔ yi kɛ ya neneene. Nɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ de ke, “Amen!” Haleluya!<verse eid="PSA 106:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106" />
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107" />
  <para style="ms">Mi Gbami 5</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="PSA 107:1-150:6">La 107:1—150:6</ref></para>
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 107</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu Kpɔ́lɔ ɔ yi jemi la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1" />Oo, nyɛɛ na Tsaatsɛ Mawu si, ejakaa e hi, nɛ e mɔbɔ nami ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 107:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2" />Nyɛ nihi nɛ Neneene Tsɛ ɔ kpɔ nyɛ kɛ je he nyɛli a dɛ mi ɔ, nyɛ de ja.<verse eid="PSA 107:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3" />Nyɛ nihi nɛ e bua nyɛ nya kɛ je zugba amɛ a nɔ, kɛ je pu site he kɛ pu sinɔ he, kɛ je Jɔ mi blɔ kɛ Wo mi blɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 107:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4" />A ngɛ si lilaae ngɛ nga a nɔ, nɛ a nɛ he nɛ a maa hi. <verse eid="PSA 107:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5" />Hwɔ kɛ kuma ye mɛ nɛ a hɛ mi yu mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 107:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6" />A kpa ngmlaa nɛ a de ke; “Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo ye kɛ bua wɔ!” Nɛ e bu mɛ tue. <verse eid="PSA 107:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7" />E kpaka mɛ tɛɛ kɛ ya su he nɛ a maa hi nɛ a yi ma na wami ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 107:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8" />Oo, e sa kaa kikɛmɛ a nimli nɛ ɔmɛ a je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi ngɛ e suɔmi kɛ mi mi jɔmi kɛ e nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 107:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9" />Ejakaa e haa susuma nɛ kuma ngɛ lɛ yee ɔ nyu, kɛ susuma nɛ hwɔ ngɛ lɛ yee ɔ hu ni kpakpahi.<verse eid="PSA 107:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10" />Mɛnɔmɛ ji enɛ ɔmɛ nɛ hii si ngɛ diblii mi, ngɛ gbenɔ hɔ mi nɛ aywilɛho kɛ nyɔguɛ yemi kpata a hɛ mi? <verse eid="PSA 107:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11" />A tsɔ Tsaatsɛ Mawu hɛ mi atuã, nɛ a ye Mawu Ope ɔ he fɛu. <verse eid="PSA 107:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12" />Lɔ ɔ he je nɛ e ha nɛ a tsu ni nɛ he wa nɛ a hao; a nɔ si nɛ nɔ ko be a nɔ nyɛe ma wo nɛ a maa te si. <verse eid="PSA 107:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a kpa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu ngɛ a haomi ɔmɛ a mi nɛ e kpɔ mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 107:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14" />E je mɛ kɛ je diblii kɛ gbenɔ hɔ ɔ mi, nɛ e kplɔ a kɔsɔkɔsɔ ɔmɛ pue si. <verse eid="PSA 107:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15" />Oo, e sa kaa kikɛmɛ a nimli nɛ ɔmɛ a je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi ngɛ e suɔmi kɛ mi mi jɔmi kɛ e nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 107:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16" />Ejakaa e ku a tsu womi he ɔ akɔblee sinya amɛ nɛ e poo blɔ tsimi dade ɔmɛ a mi.<verse eid="PSA 107:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17" />Nihi nɛ be juɛmi ɔ hu nu hiɔ ngɛ a ni yayami peemi he je. <verse eid="PSA 107:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18" />A nyɛ we ngma nɛ a ye, a su gbenɔ muɔ nya haa. <verse eid="PSA 107:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a kpa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu ngɛ a haomi ɔ mi, nɛ e ye kɛ bua mɛ nɛ e kpɔ mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 107:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20" />E tu munyu nɛ a na he wami; nɛ e je mɛ kɛ je a hɛ mi kpatami ɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 107:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21" />Oo, e sa kaa kikɛmɛ a nimli nɛ ɔmɛ a je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi ngɛ e suɔmi kɛ mi mi jɔmi kɛ nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ a he! <verse eid="PSA 107:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22" />E sa nɛ a sã sina afɔle nɛ a ngɔ bua jɔmi kɛ jaje e ni tsumi ɔmɛ kɛ tsɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 107:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23" />Nɛ jehanɛ ɔ hu, nihi nɛ hii lɛ mi kɛ nyɛɛ wo hɛ mi ngɛ jua yemi nɔ ɔ, <verse eid="PSA 107:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24" />mɛ hu a naa Tsaatsɛ Mawu ni tsumi ɔmɛ kɛ e nyakpɛ ni ɔmɛ ngɛ wo ɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 107:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25" />E haa kɔɔhiɔ nɛ nya wa tee, nɛ oslɔke ɔmɛ woɔ a he nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 107:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26" />A lɛ ɔmɛ yaa hiɔwe nɛ a ba nɔɔ si, nɛ lɛ hluili ɔmɛ yee gbeye. <verse eid="PSA 107:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27" />A dedeɔ kaa nihi nɛ de da, nɛ a li bɔ nɛ a maa pee. <verse eid="PSA 107:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28" />Kɛkɛ ɔ, a kpaa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛɔ Tsaatsɛ Mawu ngɛ a haomi ɔ mi nɛ e jeɔ mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 107:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29" />E jɔɔ kɔɔhiɔ ɔ he, nɛ oslɔke ɔmɛ peeɔ dii. <verse eid="PSA 107:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30" />A bua jɔɔ, ejakaa wo ɔ he jɔ; nɛ e kɛ mɛ ba suu kpo kɛ manye. <verse eid="PSA 107:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31" />Oo, e sa kaa kikɛmɛ a nimli nɛ ɔmɛ a je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi ngɛ e suɔmi kɛ mi mi jɔmi kɛ e nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ a he! <verse eid="PSA 107:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32" />Nyɛ ha nɛ a je e yi ngɛ asafo ɔ hɛ mi, nɛ a je e yi ngɛ matsɛmɛ a hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 107:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33" />E haa nɛ pahi miiɔ, nɛ lejɛ ɔmɛ peeɔ nga nɔ; nɛ nyu jimi hehi peeɔ zugba gbigbli nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 107:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34" />E haa nɛ dikali a zugba kpakpa plɛɔ ngo zugba kplanaa. <verse eid="PSA 107:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35" />Nɛ ja a nɔuu e haa nɛ zia zugba plɛɔ zugba kpakpa kɛ e mi nyu dɔhi. <verse eid="PSA 107:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36" />Nɛ e kpakaa nihi nɛ hwɔ ngɛ mɛ yee ɔ kɛ ba hii lejɛ ɔ nɛ a bɔɔ ma. <verse eid="PSA 107:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37" />A duɔ ni nɛ a peeɔ wai abɔɔ, nɛ a kpaa ni fuu. <verse eid="PSA 107:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38" />E jɔɔ mɛ nɛ a fɔɔ babauu, nɛ a nahi a he hiɛɛ fuu.<verse eid="PSA 107:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39" />Se ni kpahi lɛɛ a yeɔ ohia kɛ guu yi mi wami kɛ haomi kɛ aywilɛho mi. <verse eid="PSA 107:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40" />Ejakaa Tsaatsɛ Mawu haa he nɔ woli a he guɛ gboɔ, nɛ e haa matsɛmɛ a bimɛ kpaa nga yi. <verse eid="PSA 107:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41" />Se e woɔ ohiafohi nɛ yeɔ lɛ gbeye ɔ a nɔ, nɛ e haa mɛ bimɛ babauu kɛ nɔ yami. <verse eid="PSA 107:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42" />Dali ngɛ he fɛɛ he maa na nɛ a bua maa jɔ a he, se dikali ɔmɛ maa pee dii.<verse eid="PSA 107:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43" />Nɔ nɛ hine ni lelɔ nɛ e maa to ni nɛ ɔmɛ a he hɛ ɔ, e maa na Tsaatsɛ Mawu suɔmi kɛ mɔbɔ nami ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 107:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107" />
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 108</para>
  <para style="s1">Yemi kɛ huami he pɛɛ kpami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, ye bua jɔ ye he, nɛ i pee klaalo nɛ ma je o yi! I ma la kɛ je o yi nɛ i ma nya ngɛ o hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 108:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2" />Oo, i ma te si makɛ mla nɛ ma la kɛ saku. <verse eid="PSA 108:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, i ma je o yi ngɛ nimli a kpɛti. I ma la kɛ je o yi kɛ kpa mahi a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 108:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4" />Ejakaa o suɔmi kle kɛ ho hiɔwe ya, bɔ nɛ juɛmi sui he, nɛ o anɔkuale yemi su bɔ kuu ɔmɛ a mi tɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 108:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5" />O anunyami ɔ kle pe hiɔwe, nɛ e ha zugba a nɔ tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 108:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6" />Moo bu o suɔmi bi ɔ ngmlaa kpami ɔ tue, nɛ o ba kɛ he wami nɛ o ba je mi.<verse eid="PSA 108:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu wo si kɛ je e sihi he klɔuklɔu ɔ, nɛ lɔ ɔ ha nɛ ye bua jɔ. E wo si kaa e maa ngɔ Sekem zugba a kulaa kɛ Sukot Dɔbo ɔ kɛ ha wɔ. <verse eid="PSA 108:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8" />E de ke, “Gilead ɔ ye nɔ́ i, nɛ i ma ngɔ kɛ ha nyɛ; nɛ i ma ngɔ Manase hu kɛ piɛ he ha nyɛ. Ye yi pɛɛ ji Efraim zugba a, nɛ Yuda ji ye matsɛ tso. <verse eid="PSA 108:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9" />Moab ji ye dɛ fɔmi nɔ́, nɛ Edom nɔ nɛ i jeɔ ye tokota kɛ pueɔ. Nɛ i ma po kunimi yemi ose ngɔ pue Filisti bi ɔmɛ a nɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 108:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10" />Mɛnɔ ma kpaka mi kɛ ya ma nɛ a fia gbogbo kɛ bɔle lɛ ɔ mi? Mɛnɔ ma kpaka mi kɛ ya Edom?<verse eid="PSA 108:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, anɛ o ngmɛɛ wa he kɛ fɔ si lo? O nyɛɛ we wa hɛ mi kɛ yɛ ta a lo? <verse eid="PSA 108:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12" />Moo ye kɛ bua wɔ nɛ waa kɛ wa he nyɛli ɔmɛ nɛ hwu ta, ejakaa nɔmlɔ he wami sui he ko. <verse eid="PSA 108:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13" />Ke Tsaatsɛ Mawu ye kɛ bua wɔ ɔ, wa maa pee kã, nɛ wa ma tsu nyakpɛ ni nguahi. Lɛ nɛ e maa naa wa he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 108:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108" />
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 109</para>
  <para style="s1">He nyɛli a yayami nane mi tomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1" />Moo bu mi tue, Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ejakaa o yi nɛ i jeɔ. <verse eid="PSA 109:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2" />Dikali kɛ nɔ sisili ngɛ lakpa munyuhi tue ngɛ ye he. <verse eid="PSA 109:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3" />A ngɛ mi nyɛe nɛ a kɛ mi ngɛ hwue nɛ sisi numi be he. <verse eid="PSA 109:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4" />I suɔ mɛ, se be mi nɛ i ngɛ sɔlee kɛ ha mɛ ɔ, mɛɛ lɛɛ a ngɛ ye hɛ mi kpatami he mɔde bɔe. <verse eid="PSA 109:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5" />A woɔ yayami kɛ toɔ ye kpakpa nɛ i peeɔ mɛ ɔ nane mi, i suɔ mɛ se mɛɛ lɛɛ a nyɛɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 109:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6" />Mo je dikalɔ ko kɛ wo ye he nyɛlɔ ɔ he, nɛ o ha nɛ a ye e he lakpa, nɛ o ngɔ lɛ kɛ ha kojolɔ nɛ maa bu lɛ fɔ. <verse eid="PSA 109:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7" />Ke a kojo lɛ ɔ, e ye fɔ, nɛ e kue fami nɛ e hine tɔmi! <verse eid="PSA 109:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8" />E je mi si himi se nɛ kó kɛ, nɛ nɔ kpa nɛ ye e nane mi. <verse eid="PSA 109:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9" />E bimɛ a pee awusahi, nɛ e yo nɛ pee yalɔyo. <verse eid="PSA 109:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10" />E bimɛ a nyɛɛ nɛ a ba ni, nɛ a fie mɛ kɛ je a we doku ɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 109:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11" />E hiɔtsɛmɛ nɛ a muɔ e nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ, nɛ nibwɔhi a ha e dengme ni tsumi ɔ mi nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 109:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12" />Nɔ ko nɛ ko na lɛ mɔbɔ; nɛ e awusa bi ɔmɛ hu a ko ye kɛ bua mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 109:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13" />E bimɛ nɛ a gu, nɛ a biɛ nɛ laa ngɛ yi nɔhi nɛ maa ba amɛ a mi. <verse eid="PSA 109:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14" />Moo gbla e tsɛ kɛ e nyɛ a tɔmi ɔmɛ a he tue; nɛ o hɛ nɛ ko je a nɔ! <verse eid="PSA 109:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15" />Mo kai e yayami ɔmɛ daa, nɛ o gbe e biɛ, nɛ nɔ ko nɛ kó kai lɛ ngɛ zugba a nɔ ligbi ko!<verse eid="PSA 109:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16" />Ejakaa e pee we nɔ ko kpakpa; se mohu e wa ohiafohi kɛ nihi nɛ e fí mɛ ɔ yi mi, nɛ e hao aywilɛho yeli kɛ ya si gbenɔ mi tete. <verse eid="PSA 109:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17" />Akɛnɛ, e suɔ nɔ gbiɛmi he je ɔ, moo gbiɛ lɛ. Nɛ akɛnɛ e jɔɔ we nɔ he je ɔ, mo ko jɔɔ lɛ. <verse eid="PSA 109:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18" />Gbiɛmi ji e je mi bami, e ngɛ kaa bo nɛ e haa, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, mo ha nɛ e be ngɛ e mi kaa nyu, nɛ e sɛ e wuhi a mi kaa nu.<verse eid="PSA 109:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19" />Mo ha nɛ e gbiɛmi ɔmɛ nɛ a kpale kɛ ba na lɛ, nɛ a mata e he kaa e bo nɛ e ha a, nɛ a pee kaa e mlɛ mi bɔjuɛ nɛ e maa tsiɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 109:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20" />Enɛ ɔ nɛ pee hiɔ nɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu maa wo ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ kɛ nihi nɛ tuɔ ye he munyu yaya a.<verse eid="PSA 109:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21" />Se ami lɛɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o kɛ mi nɛ ye kaa o bi, kaa nɔ nɛ a kɛ o biɛ wo lɛ! Ejakaa o mi jɔ, oo Neneene Tsɛ; mo kpɔ mi.<verse eid="PSA 109:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22" />Ejakaa ohiafo nɛ ni ngɛ mɔbɔ ji mi, nɛ ye tsui ngɛ mi yee. <verse eid="PSA 109:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23" />I pee kaa nini nɛ ngɛ laae. A ngɛ mi fie kɛ yaa gbenɔ mi kaa a fieɔ baalɛhi. <verse eid="PSA 109:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24" />I hiɔ̃ ngma hluu nɛ ye nakutsohi a mi jɔ ngɛ ye sisi; nɛ ye nɔmlɔ tso je wu. <verse eid="PSA 109:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25" />I plɛ ahlua bɔmi nɔ́ kɛ ha mɛ, nɛ ke a na mi pɛ a huanya yi.<verse eid="PSA 109:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, ye Mawu, moo ye kɛ bua mi; mo he ye yi wami ngɛ o suɔmi kɛ o mɔbɔ nami ɔ nya. <verse eid="PSA 109:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27" />Moo pee nɛ a na kaa mo nɛ o tsu kikɛmɛ a ni nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 109:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28" />Mo ha nɛ a gbiɛ mi, ke moo lɛɛ o ngɛ mi jɔɔe kɛkɛ! Nɛ a mɔde bɔmi nɛ a ma kɛ kpata ye hɛ mi ɔ maa pee yaka, nɛ ami o sɔmɔlɔ ɔ ma nya.<verse eid="PSA 109:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29" />Mo ha nɛ a nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ pee yaka, nɛ zo nɛ gbe mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 109:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30" />I ma je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi babauu; i ma je e yi ngɛ nihi fuu a kpɛti. <verse eid="PSA 109:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31" />Ejakaa e daa si ngɛ ohiafo hiɔ nɔ, konɛ e je lɛ kɛ je e he nyɛli a dɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 109:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109" />
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 110</para>
  <para style="s1">Mesia, David Bi ɔ he la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1" />Yehowa de ye Nutsɔ ɔ ke, “Moo hi si ngɛ ye hiɔ nɔ kɛ ya si be nɛ i ma ha nɛ o ye o he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 110:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2" />Yehowa ngɔ o matsɛ yemi ɔ kɛ ma si ngɛ Yerusalem, konɛ o ye o he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nɔ matsɛ. <verse eid="PSA 110:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3" />Nɛ ngɛ o kɛ o he nyɛli ɔmɛ nyɛ ta hwumi be mi ɔ, o nimli ɔmɛ nitsɛ maa ngɔ a he kɛ ha mo. A maa wlua a he ngɛ klɔuklɔu mi. A maa wo mo he wami daa ligbi kaa mɔtu bɔ. <verse eid="PSA 110:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4" />Yehowa ka kita, nɛ e be e nya se kpalee, kaa osɔfo ji mo kɛ yaa neneene ngɛ Melkizedek blɔ nya tomi ɔ nya. <verse eid="PSA 110:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5" />Neneene Tsɛ ɔ daa si ngɛ o kasa nya nɛ e ma fa o he. Nɛ ligbi nɛ e abofu maa te si ɔ, e maa ku matsɛhi babauu ngɔ pue si. <verse eid="PSA 110:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6" />E maa gbla ma amɛ a tue, nɛ a ma hyi kɛ gbogboehi. Nɛ e maa plaa mahi babauu a nɔ yeli. <verse eid="PSA 110:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7" />Matsɛ ɔ maa nu nyu ngɛ blɔ he pa a mi, nɛ e maa wo lɛ he wami.<verse eid="PSA 110:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110" />
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 111</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu yi jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1" />Nyɛ je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi. I ma je Neneene Tsɛ ɔ yi kɛ ye tsui kulaa ngɛ dali a asafo ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 111:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu ni tsumi ɔmɛ ɔ kle. Nihi kulaa nɛ le sina a, a kɛ mi nɛ susu a he. <verse eid="PSA 111:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3" />E nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ tsɔɔ bumi nɛ ngɛ e he, e agbo jemi, kɛ e dami nɛ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 111:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4" />Mɛnɔ hɛ maa je e mɔbɔ nami kɛ dloomi kɛ nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 111:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5" />E haa nihi nɛ heɔ e nɔ yeɔ ɔ niye ni; nɛ e kaii e somi ɔ daa. <verse eid="PSA 111:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6" />E ngɔ ma je li ɔmɛ a zugba a kɛ ha e nimli ɔmɛ nɛ e kɛ tsɔɔ mɛ e he wami. <verse eid="PSA 111:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7" />Nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e pee ɔ da nɛ e hi, nɛ e mlaa amɛ kulaa da. <verse eid="PSA 111:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8" />Ejakaa anɔkuale kɛ dami nɔ nɛ e gu kɛ pee; a maa ma si kpɛii kɛ ya neneene. <verse eid="PSA 111:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9" />E ha e nimli ɔmɛ ye a he, nɛ e kɛ mɛ so somi nɛ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene. E biɛ ngɛ klɔuklɔu nɛ e he ngɛ gbeye.<verse eid="PSA 111:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu gbeye yemi ji nile sisi jemi, nɛ nihi kulaa nɛ yeɔ e mlaa amɛ a nɔ ɔ, a ma na nɔ́ sisi numi. A je e yi kɛ ya neneene .<verse eid="PSA 111:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111" />
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 112</para>
  <para style="s1">Dali a jɔɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1" />Nyɛ je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi! A gbaa nɔ nɛ yeɔ Neneene Tsɛ ɔ gbeye, nɛ e bua jɔɔ e mlaa amɛ a he nɛ e yeɔ a nɔ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 112:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2" />E bimɛ maa pee he wali ngɛ zugba a nɔ; nɛ a maa gbaa dali a bimɛ nɛ maa ba ngɛ a se ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 112:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3" />E ma na ni babauu, nɛ hɛ be e ni kpakpahi nɛ e pee ɔmɛ a nɔ jee gblee. <verse eid="PSA 112:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4" />Ke diblii wo lɛ ɔ, la ma kpɛ kɛ ha lɛ. Ejakaa dloolɔ kɛ mɔbɔ nalɔ kɛ dalɔ ji Yehowa. <verse eid="PSA 112:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5" />Nɔmlɔ nɛ mi mi jɔ, nɛ e haa nɔ nɔ́, nɛ e tsuɔ ni ngɛ anɔkuale yemi mi ɔ, e nɔ tsuaa nɔ yaa nɔ bɔ nɛ sa.<verse eid="PSA 112:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6" />Nɔ ko nɔ ko be dalɔ nyɛe ma je kɛ je e da he ligbi ko; nɛ a ma kai lɛ kɛ ya neneene. <verse eid="PSA 112:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7" />Amaniɛ yobu pui e tsui, nɛ nɔ́ nɛ maa ba a wui e he gbeye. Ejakaa e wo e hɛ kɛ fɔ Yehowa nɔ be tsuaa be kaa e maa hyɛ e nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 112:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8" />E tsui hɛwi; nɛ nɔ́ ko wui e he gbeye kɛ yaa si be nɛ e maa ye e he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 112:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9" />E mi mi jɔ, nɛ e dlooɔ ohiafohi. E dami kɛ e anɔkuale yemi be nyagbe. E maa ye nguɔ nɛ a maa bu lɛ.<verse eid="PSA 112:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10" />E nɔ yami ɔ maa pee dikali abofu gu, nɛ a maa je. A yi mi tomi ɔmɛ maa pee yaka.<verse eid="PSA 112:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112" />
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 113</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu yi jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1" />Nyɛ je Neneene Tsɛ ɔ yi! Oo nyɛ Yehowa sɔmɔli ɔmɛ, nyɛ je e yi! <verse eid="PSA 113:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2" />A je e yi daa kɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 113:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3" />A je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi kɛ je pu si temi he kɛ ya pu si nɔmi he. <verse eid="PSA 113:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4" />Ejakaa e kle pe je kɛ wɛ tsuo; nɛ e anunyami hu kle pe hiɔwe.<verse eid="PSA 113:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5" />Mɛnɔ kɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɛ ngɛ matsɛ yee ngɛ hiɔwe ɔ maa sɔ? <verse eid="PSA 113:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6" />E sisi tɔɔ nɛ hiɔwe kɛ zugba ngɛ, nɛ e maa e yi si nɛ e hyɛɔ mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 113:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7" />E woɔ ohiafohi nɛ a si himi mi wa a, a nɔ, nɛ nihi nɛ hwɔ ngɛ mɛ yee nɛ a ngɛ kuku nɔ kpae ɔ, e haa mɛ niye ni. <verse eid="PSA 113:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8" />Nɛ e kɛ mɛ futuu matsɛbihi kɛ abladehi a kpɛti. <verse eid="PSA 113:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9" />E haa nɛ yosa fɔɔ nɛ e plɛɔ bimɛ a nyɛ, nɛ e naa bua jɔmi. Nyɛ je Neneene Tsɛ ɔ yi!<verse eid="PSA 113:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113" />
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 114</para>
  <para style="s1">Hebemi kaimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1" />Be mi nɛ Israel hia kɛ je Mizraim, nɛ Yakob we ɔ hia kɛ je ma je li a kpɛti ɔ, <verse eid="PSA 114:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2" />Yuda ba plɛ e nimli klɔuklɔuhi, kɛ Israel hu e nɔ yemi he.<verse eid="PSA 114:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3" />Wo Tsutsu ɔ na mɛ nɛ e mi gba enyɔ, nɛ Yordan Pa a hu ha mɛ blɔ nɛ a be. <verse eid="PSA 114:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4" />Yoku ɔmɛ tuu kaa to kuhi; nɛ kpo ɔmɛ hii kaa to bihi. <verse eid="PSA 114:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5" />Wo Tsutsu, mɛni he je nɛ o gba o mi enyɔ? Yordan Pa, mɛni ba o nyu ɔmɛ a nɔ? Mɛni he je nɛ a kpale se? <verse eid="PSA 114:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6" />Nyɛ yokuhi, mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ tuu kaa to kuhi? Nɛ nyɛ kpohi hu, mɛni ba nɛ nyɛ hii kaa to bihi?<verse eid="PSA 114:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7" />Oo zugba, mo hoso ngɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu hɛ mi, Yakob Mawu ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 114:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8" />Lɛ nɛ e ha nyu jee tɛ sa mi nɛ e plɛɔ pa, nɛ e haa tɛ pleɔ nyu hɛ ngmɛ nɛ baa.<verse eid="PSA 114:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114" />
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 115</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu yi jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1" />Tsa pi wɔ, oo Yehowa, tsa pi wɔ, se o biɛ ɔ mohu nɛ o maa ngɔ anunyami kɛ ha ngɛ o suɔmi kɛ o anɔkuale yemi ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 115:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2" />Mɛni he je nɛ o ha nɛ ma amɛ ma bi ke, “Jije a Mawu ɔ ngɛ?”<verse eid="PSA 115:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3" />Wa Mawu ɔ ngɛ hiɔwe, nɛ nɔ nɛ e suɔ ɔ, lɔ ɔ nɛ e peeɔ. <verse eid="PSA 115:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4" />Mɛɛ lɛɛ a amaga amɛ ɔ, sika hiɔ kɛ sika tsu nɛ ji nimli a nine nya ni tsumi kɛkɛ i. <verse eid="PSA 115:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5" />A ngɛ nya, se a tui munyu, a ngɛ hɛ ngmɛ, se a hyɛ we nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 115:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6" />A ngɛ tue, se a nui nɔ, a ngɛ gugwɔ, se a nui nɔ he fu. <verse eid="PSA 115:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7" />A ngɛ ninehi, se a kɛ tɛ nɔ́ he, a ngɛ nanehi ngɛ a sisi, se a nyɛɛ we; nɛ a kuɛ si hu pɛ́. <verse eid="PSA 115:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8" />Ni nɛmɛ nɛ pee mɛ ɔ, a ngɛ kaa mɛ nɔuu; nɛ ja a nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ woɔ e hɛ kɛ fɔɔ a nɔ ɔ hu ngɛ.<verse eid="PSA 115:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9" />Oo Israel, mo wo o hɛ ngɔ fɔ Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɔ! Lɛ ji o yemi kɛ bualɔ kɛ o he pulelɔ. <verse eid="PSA 115:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10" />Oo Aaron we osɔfohi, nyɛ wo nyɛ hɛ kɛ fɔ Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɔ! Lɛ ji nyɛ yemi kɛ bualɔ kɛ nyɛ he pulelɔ. <verse eid="PSA 115:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11" />Nyɛ nihi tsuo nɛ nyɛ yee Yehowa gbeye ɔ, nyɛ wo nyɛ hɛ kɛ fɔ e nɔ! Lɛ ji nyɛ yemi kɛ bualɔ kɛ nyɛ he pulelɔ.<verse eid="PSA 115:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12" />Yehowa hɛ ji wa nɔ; e maa gbaa wɔ. E maa gbaa Israel, nɛ e maa gbaa Aaron we osɔfo ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 115:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13" />E maa gbaa nihi kulaa nɛ yee lɛ gbeye ɔ, nimli guhi kɛ nimli nguahi tsuo.<verse eid="PSA 115:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14" />Neneene Tsɛ ɔ nɛ ha nɛ o plɔke kɛ o bimɛ tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 115:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15" />Yehowa, hiɔwe kɛ zugba bɔlɔ ɔ maa jɔɔ mo. <verse eid="PSA 115:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16" />Hiɔwe ɔ, Yehowa nɔ i; se e wo zugba a kɛ ha nimli a bimɛ.<verse eid="PSA 115:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17" />Gbogboehi kɛ nimli nɛ ngɛ gbeje ɔ je we Yehowa yi. <verse eid="PSA 115:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18" />Se wɔɔ lɛɛ wa ma je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi! Wa ma je e yi kɛ ya neneene! Nyɛ je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi!<verse eid="PSA 115:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115" />
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 116</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu si nami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1" />I suɔ Neneene Tsɛ ɔ, ejakaa e nuɔ ye kue fami ɔmɛ nɛ e haa a heto. <verse eid="PSA 116:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2" />Akɛnɛ e buɔ mi tue he je ɔ, be abɔ nɛ i ngɛ wami mi nɛ ɔ, i ma sɔle ma tsɛ lɛ.<verse eid="PSA 116:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3" />Gbenɔ fiɛ nu mi, nɛ gbeje nɔ nami ɔ ta ye he. I sɛ haomi kɛ aywilɛho mi. <verse eid="PSA 116:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4" />Kɛkɛ nɛ i kpa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɛ i de ke, “Neneene Tsɛ, i kpa mo pɛɛ, mo he ye yi wami!” <verse eid="PSA 116:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5" />Dloolɔ, dalɔ kɛ mɔbɔ nalɔ ji wa Neneene Tsɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 116:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6" />E baa humihi a yi. Benɛ i su gbenɔ muɔ nya ta a, e he ye yi wami. <verse eid="PSA 116:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i ma jɔɔ ye he. Tsaatsɛ Mawu tsu nyakpɛ ni agbo nɛ ɔ ha mi! <verse eid="PSA 116:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8" />E kpɔ ye susuma kɛ je gbenɔ mi; e tsu ye hɛ mi vo nyu, nɛ e ha we ma tɛ nɔ nɛ ma nɔ si. <verse eid="PSA 116:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9" />I ma hi Tsaatsɛ Mawu ngɔ, be abɔ nɛ i ngɛ je mi ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 116:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10" />I ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi, be mi tete nɛ i de ke, “I ngɛ nɔ nae saminya.” <verse eid="PSA 116:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11" />Benɛ gbeye nu mi ɔ, i de ke, “Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ toɔ lakpa.” <verse eid="PSA 116:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12" />Se jehanɛ ɔ, mɛni i ma kɛ na Yehowa si ngɛ e dloomi nike ni babauu nɛ e kɛ dloo mi ɔmɛ a he? <verse eid="PSA 116:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13" />I ma wo bɔ sami wai kɛ ba na lɛ si, nɛ i ma je e biɛ ɔ yi ngɛ ye yi wami nɛ e he ɔ he je. <verse eid="PSA 116:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14" />I ma ye ye si womi ɔmɛ a nɔ ha Tsaatsɛ Mawu ngɛ e nimli ɔmɛ tsuo a hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 116:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15" />E suɔli ɔmɛ a he jua wa kɛ ha lɛ, nɛ e ha we nɛ a gboɔ kɛkɛ.<verse eid="PSA 116:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o he ye yi wami kɛ je ye haomi ɔ mi; i ma sɔmɔ mo daa kɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 116:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17" />I ma sɔmɔ mo, nɛ i ma sã sina afɔle kɛ ha mo. <verse eid="PSA 116:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18" />I ma ye ye si womi ɔmɛ a nɔ ha Tsaatsɛ Mawu ngɛ e nimli ɔmɛ tsuo a hɛ mi, <verse eid="PSA 116:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19" />ngɛ Yerusalem Sɔlemi We ɔ kpo ɔ nɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PSA 116:19">Nyɛ je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi!<verse eid="PSA 116:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116" />
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 117</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɛ je Mawu yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1" />Nyɛ je Neneene Tsɛ ɔ yi, nyɛ mahi ngɛ he fɛɛ he. Nyɛ je e yi, nyɛ nimli tsuo nɛ ngɛ zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 117:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2" />Ejakaa e suɔ wɔ saminya, nɛ e anɔkuale yemi ɔ ngɛ daa. Nyɛ je Neneene Tsɛ ɔ yi!<verse eid="PSA 117:2" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117" />
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 118</para>
  <para style="s1">Kunimi yemi he si nami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1" />Oo, nyɛɛ na Tsaatsɛ Mawu si, ejakaa e hi; e mɔbɔ nami ngɛ daa.<verse eid="PSA 118:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2" />Mo ha nɛ Israel asafo ɔ nɛ de ke, “E mɔbɔ nami ngɛ daa.” <verse eid="PSA 118:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3" />Mo ha nɛ Aaron osɔfo ɔmɛ a la ke, “E mɔbɔ nami ngɛ daa.” <verse eid="PSA 118:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4" />Mo ha nɛ nihi tsuo nɛ yeɔ Yehowa gbeye ɔ a de ke, “E mɔbɔ nami ngɛ daa.”<verse eid="PSA 118:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5" />Benɛ i ngɛ haomi mi ɔ, i sɔle kɛ ha Tsaatsɛ Mawu. E he nɔ nɛ e je mi. <verse eid="PSA 118:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6" />Nɛ e ngɛ ye se nɛ ɔ, i yi gbeye. Mɛni nɔmlɔ ma nyɛ maa pee mi? <verse eid="PSA 118:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu kɛ mi ngɛ, nɛ e maa ye kɛ bua mi. Nihi nɛ nyɛɛ mi ɔ, a hyɛ saminya.<verse eid="PSA 118:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8" />E hi kaa o maa ngɔ o hɛ kɛ fɔ Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɔ, pe nɔ nɛ o ma he nɔmlɔ adesa maa ye. <verse eid="PSA 118:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9" />E hi kaa o maa sa we ngɛ Neneene Tsɛ ɔ ngɔ, pe nɔ nɛ o maa ngɔ o hɛ kɛ fɔ matsɛmɛ a nɔ!<verse eid="PSA 118:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10" />Je ɔ tsuo ba tua mi, se i ma kpata a hɛ mi ngɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu biɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 118:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11" />A sa ye yi, a bɔle mi kɛ kpe; se i ma kpata a hɛ mi ngɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu biɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 118:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12" />A ha mi kaa hwohi, a mle kɛ wo mi kaa mio tso la; se i ma kpata a hɛ mi ngɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu biɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 118:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13" />Oo, ye he nyɛlɔ, o bɔ mɔde nɛ o gbe mi, se Tsaatsɛ Mawu ye kɛ bua mi. <verse eid="PSA 118:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14" />Lɛ ji ye he wami kɛ ye nya la ngɛ ta nɛ nya wa mi, nɛ amlɔ nɛ ɔ, e ha nɛ i ye kunimi. <verse eid="PSA 118:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15" />A nuɔ kunimi kɛ bua jɔmi lahi ngɛ dalɔ we. Tsaatsɛ Mawu hiɔ nine tsuɔ he wami ni tsumihi. <verse eid="PSA 118:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16" />E hiɔ nine ho Hiɔwe ya, Tsaatsɛ Mawu hiɔ nine tsuɔ he wami ni tsumihi. <verse eid="PSA 118:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17" />I be gboe; i ma hi je mi, nɛ i ma jaje Tsaatsɛ Mawu ni tsumi ɔmɛ kɛ tsɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 118:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18" />E gbla ye tue wawɛɛ mohu, se e ha we nɛ ma gbo.<verse eid="PSA 118:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19" />Nyɛ bli dami agbo ɔmɛ ha mi nɛ ma sɛ mi nɛ ma wo ye sina kɛ ya ha Tsaatsɛ Mawu. <verse eid="PSA 118:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20" />Jamɛ a agbo ɔmɛ ji blɔ kɛ yaa Tsaatsɛ Mawu hɛ mi, nɛ dali ji nihi nɛ sɛɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 118:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, i naa mo si kaa o bu mi tue nɛ o he ye yi wami.<verse eid="PSA 118:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22" />Tɛ ɔ nɛ tsu fiali ɔmɛ je ngɔ fɔ he ɔ ba plɛ pee kɔ̃ nya tɛ. <verse eid="PSA 118:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23" />Enɛ ɔ lɛɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu ni tsumi i, nɛ e ngɛ nyakpɛ ngɛ wa hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 118:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24" />Ligbi nɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu bɔ ji enɛ ɔ nɛ; nyɛ ha nɛ wa nya nɛ wa bua nɛ jɔ. <verse eid="PSA 118:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, wa ngɛ mo pɛɛ kpae nɛ o ye kɛ bua wɔ. Mo he wa yi wami, nɛ o ha nɛ waa ye kunimi. <verse eid="PSA 118:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26" />A gbaa nɔ nɛ ma ngɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu biɛ mi ɔ! Wa je Sɔlemi We ɔ kɛ ngɛ mo si nae.<verse eid="PSA 118:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27" />Yehowa, Neneene Tsɛ ɔ ji wa kane. I ngɔ ye bɔ sami nɔ́ ɔ kɛ ya fɔ afɔle sami la tɛ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 118:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28" />Mo ji ye Mawu, i ma na mo si. Mo ji ye Mawu, i ma je o yi. <verse eid="PSA 118:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29" />Oo, nyɛɛ na Tsaatsɛ Mawu si, ejakaa e hi; e mɔbɔ nami ngɛ daa.<verse eid="PSA 118:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118" />
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 119</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu mlaa amɛ a he se nami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1" />Nihi kulaa nɛ yeɔ Mawu mlaa amɛ a nɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ ɔ naa bua jɔmi. <verse eid="PSA 119:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2" />A gbaa nihi kulaa nɛ yeɔ e mlaa amɛ a nɔ, nɛ a sɔmɔɔ lɛ kɛ a tsui kulaa a. <verse eid="PSA 119:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3" />Ni nɛmɛ nɛ pee we yayami, se mohu a nyɛɛɔ ngɛ e blɔ ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4" />O fã kaa waa ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5" />Oo, i na nɛ o kudɔ mi nɛ i ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6" />Ye hɛ mi be si puee ke i ngɛ o mlaa amɛ kulaa a nɔ yee ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7" />I ma je o yi kɛ tsui klɔuklɔu be nɛ i le o dami mlaa amɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8" />I ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ! Oo, mo ko ngmɛɛ ye he kɛ fɔ si kulaa.<verse eid="PSA 119:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9" />Kɛ niheyo maa pee kɛ hi si pɛpɛɛpɛ kɛɛ? Ja e kaneɔ o Munyu ɔ, nɛ e yeɔ mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10" />I hla o se blɔ kɛ ye tsui kulaa. Oo, mo ko ha nɛ ma tla kɛ je o mlaa amɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 119:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11" />I ngɔ o Munyu ɔ kɛ to ngɛ ye tsui mi, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma ko pee yayami kɛ si mo.<verse eid="PSA 119:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12" />I ngɛ o yi jee, oo Neneene Tsɛ; moo tsɔɔ mi o mlaa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13" />I jaje mlaa amɛ nɛ je o nya a tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 119:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14" />O mlaa amɛ haa mi bua jɔmi kaa bɔ nɛ ni nami haa nɔmlɔ bua jɔmi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15" />I ma susu o mlaa amɛ a he, nɛ ye hɛ maa hi o blɔ ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 119:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16" />O mlaa amɛ ma ha mi bua jɔmi, nɛ ye hɛ be o Munyu ɔ nɔ jee.<verse eid="PSA 119:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17" />Mo ha nɛ ye se nɛ kɛ ngɛ je mi, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma ye o Munyu ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18" />Mo bli ye hɛ ngmɛ nɛ ma na nyakpɛ níhi nɛ ngɛ o mlaa a mi. <verse eid="PSA 119:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19" />Nubwɔ ji mi ngɛ zugba a nɔ; mo ko wo o mlaa amɛ kɛ laa mi. <verse eid="PSA 119:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20" />Ye susuma hɛ jaa ngɛ o mlaa amɛ a he be fɛɛ be.<verse eid="PSA 119:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21" />O kãa he nɔ woli kɛ musutsɛmɛ nɛ kua o mlaa amɛ a hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 119:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22" />Mo je ahlua bɔmi kɛ he guɛ gbemi kɛ je ye nɔ, ejakaa i yeɔ o mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23" />Ke nɔ yeli kpe kutuu kɛ wo ye he po ɔ, i ma susu o mlaa amɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 119:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24" />O mlaa amɛ ji ye bua jɔmi; a mi nɛ i naa ga womi ngɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25" />Ye he mi jɔ; moo wo mi he wami ngɛ o Munyu ɔ he je. <verse eid="PSA 119:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26" />I tsɔɔ mo ye blɔ nya tomi ɔmɛ, nɛ o ha mi heto; moo tsɔɔ mi o mlaa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27" />Mo ha nɛ ma le nɔ nɛ o ngɛ hlae, nɛ i ma susu o nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ a he.<verse eid="PSA 119:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28" />Kɔmɔ yemi ha nɛ ye susuma hao, moo wo mi he wami ngɛ o Munyu ɔ nya. <verse eid="PSA 119:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29" />Mo je yayami peemi ngɛ ye blɔ mi; nɛ o tsɔɔ mi o mlaa amɛ ngɛ o dloomi ɔ he je. <verse eid="PSA 119:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30" />I ngɔ anɔkuale yemi blɔ ɔ; nɛ i ngɔ o mlaa amɛ kɛ fɔ ye hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 119:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, i pɛtɛ o mlaa amɛ a he, mo ko ha nɛ ye hɛ mi nɛ pue si. <verse eid="PSA 119:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32" />Ke o ma ha mi nɔ sisi numi ɔ, i ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo tsɔɔ mi o mlaa amɛ a sisi, nɛ i ma ye nɔ be fɛɛ be. <verse eid="PSA 119:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34" />Mo ha mi nɔ sisi numi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ kɛ ye tsui kulaa. <verse eid="PSA 119:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35" />Mo ha nɛ ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ, ejakaa a mi nɛ i naa bua jɔmi ngɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36" />Mo ha nɛ ye tsui nɛ e gbo o mlaa amɛ mohu a nɔ pe ni nami. <verse eid="PSA 119:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37" />Mo je ye he kɛ je yakayaka níhi a he, nɛ o wo mi he wami ngɛ o blɔ ɔmɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38" />Mo ha mi nɔ mi mami ekohu kaa o si womi ɔmɛ ngɛ kɛ ha mi, ejakaa i ngɔ ye hɛ kɛ fɔ o nɔ, nɛ i buu mo.<verse eid="PSA 119:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39" />Mo je hɛ mi si puemi nɛ i yee gbeye ɔ ngɛ ye nɔ, ejakaa o mlaa amɛ hi. <verse eid="PSA 119:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40" />I suɔ kaa ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ, mo ha mi he wami he, ejakaa dalɔ ji mo. <verse eid="PSA 119:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo na mi mɔbɔ, nɛ o he ye yi wami ngɛ o si womi ɔ nya. <verse eid="PSA 119:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42" />Bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma nyɛ ma ha ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ mi ahlua bɔe ɔ heto, ejakaa o Munyu ɔ nɔ nɛ i wo ye hɛ kɛ fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43" />Mo ko ha nɛ ye hɛ nɛ je o anɔkuale munyu ɔmɛ a nɔ, ejakaa mɛ kɛkɛ a nɔ nɛ i ngɔ ye hɛ kɛ fɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44" />I ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ daa. <verse eid="PSA 119:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45" />Nɛ i ma nyɛɛ ngɛ he jɔmi mi, ejakaa i hlaa o mlaa amɛ a se blɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46" />I ma ye o mlaa amɛ a he odase ngɛ matsɛmɛ a hɛ mi nɛ zo be mi pee.<verse eid="PSA 119:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47" />I naa bua jɔmi ngɛ o mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi mi, ejakaa i suɔ mlaa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48" />I buu o mlaa amɛ nɛ i suɔ mɛ, nɛ i ma susu a he daa.<verse eid="PSA 119:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49" />Mo kai si nɛ o wo mi o tsɔlɔ ɔ, ejakaa e nɔ nɛ i wo ye hɛ kɛ fɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50" />Be mi nɛ i ngɛ nɔ nae tete ɔ, i na bua jɔmi, ejakaa o si womi ɔ wo mi he wami. <verse eid="PSA 119:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51" />He nɔ woli ɔmɛ yeɔ ye he fɛu be fɛɛ be, se i kpale we ngɛ o mlaa amɛ a se. <verse eid="PSA 119:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ke i kai o blema munyu ɔmɛ ɔ, a haa mi bua jɔmi.<verse eid="PSA 119:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53" />Ye mi mi fuɔ ngɛ dikali nɛ bui o mlaa amɛ ɔ a he. <verse eid="PSA 119:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54" />Ye si himi ngɛ zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, o mlaa amɛ kɛkɛ ji la nɛ i laa. <verse eid="PSA 119:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, i kaii mo ngɛ nyɔ be mi nɛ i susuu o mlaa amɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 119:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56" />I naa bua jɔmi ngɛ o mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi mi.<verse eid="PSA 119:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57" />Oo Yehowa, mo ji nɔ nɛ he hia mi. I wo si kaa i ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58" />I ngɛ mo pɛɛ kpae kɛ ye tsui kulaa nɛ o na mi mɔbɔ kaa bɔ nɛ o wo si ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59" />I susu ye je mi bami he, nɛ i wo si kaa i ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60" />I kpɛ we se, se mohu i kpale ye se mla nɛ ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61" />Dikali bɔ mɔde nɛ a sa mi kɛ wo yayami mi, se i pɛtɛ o mlaa amɛ a he wawɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62" />I ma te si nyɔ mi kpɛti nɛ ma je o yi ngɛ o mlaa kpakpa amɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 119:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63" />Ni nɛmɛ nɛ yeɔ mo gbeye nɛ a yeɔ o mlaa amɛ a nɔ ɔ ji ye huɛmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, zugba a nɔ hyi kɛ o mɔbɔ nami; moo tsɔɔ mi o mlaa amɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o jɔɔ mi o sɔmɔlɔ ɔ kaa bɔ nɛ o wo si ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66" />Mo ha mi nile, nɛ o tsɔɔ mi dami sane yemi, ejakaa i heɔ o mlaa amɛ a nɔ yeɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67" />Loko ji o gbla ye tue ɔ, i tla kɛ je o blɔ ɔ nɔ, se jehanɛ ɔ lɛɛ i yeɔ o Munyu ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68" />O hi nɛ o peeɔ nɔ nɛ da, moo tsɔɔ mi o mlaa amɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69" />He nɔ woli ye ye he lakpa, se i ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ kɛ ye tsui kulaa. <verse eid="PSA 119:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70" />A ji nihi nɛ nui nɔ sisi, se ami lɛɛ o mlaa a he nɛ ye bua jɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71" />Ye tue gblami ɔ hi ha mi, ejakaa e ha nɛ i kase o mlaa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72" />O mlaa amɛ nɛ o wo ɔ hi ha mi hluu pe sika tsu kɛ sika hiɔ akpe abɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73" />O nine nɛ bɔ mi; mo ha mi nɔ sisi numi konɛ ma kase o mlaa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74" />Ni nɛmɛ nɛ yee mo gbeye ɔ, a bua maa jɔ ke a na mi, ejakaa ami hu i he o Munyu ɔ ye.<verse eid="PSA 119:74" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, i le kaa o kojomi ɔmɛ da, nɛ anɔkuale yemi mi nɛ o gbla ye tue ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76" />Mo o je o suɔmi ɔ mi nɛ o ha mi bua jɔmi ngɛ si nɛ o wo mi ɔ nya. <verse eid="PSA 119:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77" />Moo na mi mɔbɔ, nɛ ye yi ma na wami, ejakaa o mlaa amɛ nɛ a haa mi bua jɔmi.<verse eid="PSA 119:77" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78" />Mo ha nɛ he nɔ woli ɔmɛ a hɛ mi nɛ pue si, ngɛ ye he lakpa nɛ a ye ɔ he je. Se ami lɛɛ i ma susu o mlaa amɛ a he.<verse eid="PSA 119:78" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79" />Mo ha nɛ nihi nɛ yee mo gbeye, kɛ nihi nɛ le o mlaa amɛ a ba ye ngɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80" />Mo ha nɛ ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ sisiisi nɛ piami ko nɛ ko hi ye he, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ye hɛ mi nɛ ko pue si.<verse eid="PSA 119:80" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81" />Ye yi wami hemi ɔ he kuma ye mi hluu, se loloolo ɔ, i ngɛ o yemi kɛ buami ɔ blɔ hyɛe kaa bɔ nɛ o wo mi si ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:81" /><verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82" />I hyɛ o si womi ɔ blɔ hluu nɛ pɔ tɔ. I biɔ ke, “Mɛni be nɛ o maa jɔɔ ye bua lo?” <verse eid="PSA 119:82" /><verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83" />Ejakaa i pee kaa da tɔ nɛ se nami ko be he, se kɛ hu ye hɛ ji o mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:83" /><verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84" />Mɛni be nɛ o tsɔlɔ ɔ maa mlɛ kɛ ya si? Mɛni be nɛ o maa gbla nihi nɛ ngɛ mi haoe ɔ a tue? <verse eid="PSA 119:84" /><verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85" />He nɔ woli nɛ yi o mlaa amɛ a nɔ ɔ tsuaa muɔ ha mi ngɛ ye blɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 119:85" /><verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86" />O mlaa amɛ kulaa ji anɔkuale, nɛ ye haoli ɔmɛ ngɛ mi haoe yaka gu; moo ye kɛ bua mi. <verse eid="PSA 119:86" /><verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87" />A kpata ye hɛ mi ta ngɛ zugba a nɔ, se i ngmɛɛ we o mlaa amɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 119:87" /><verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88" />Mo he ye yi wami ngɛ o suɔmi ɔ he je, konɛ ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:88" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, o Munyu ɔ maa si ngɛ hiɔwe daa kɛ yaa nyagbe. <verse eid="PSA 119:89" /><verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90" />O anɔkuale yemi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa yi nɔhi tsuo; mo nɛ o to je ɔ sisi nɛ e maa si. <verse eid="PSA 119:90" /><verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91" />Ngɛ o demi nya a, a maa si kɛ ba si mwɔnɛ ɔ, ejakaa o sɔmɔli ji mɛ tsuo.<verse eid="PSA 119:91" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92" />Ke pi o mlaa amɛ nɛ ha mi bua jɔmi jinɛ ye hɛ mi kpata ngɛ ye nɔ nami ɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 119:92" /><verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93" />Ye hɛ be o mlaa amɛ a nɔ jee ligbi ko, ejakaa a nɔ nɛ o gu nɛ o kɛ he ye yi wami. <verse eid="PSA 119:93" /><verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94" />O nɔ ji mi, mo he ye yi wami! Ejakaa i bɔ mɔde nɛ ma ye O mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:94" /><verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95" />Dikali wo ka nɛ a ma kpata ye hɛ mi, se ye hɛ ji o mlaa amɛ a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:95" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96" />I le kaa nɔ́ ko be nɛ hi kɛ pi si, ja o mlaa amɛ pɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:96" /><verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97" />Oo, hyɛ bɔ nɛ i suɔ o mlaa amɛ ha! I susuu he mɔtu kɛ du bubui. <verse eid="PSA 119:97" /><verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98" />O mlaa amɛ ha nɛ i le nɔ́ pe ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ, ejakaa a ngɛ mi kudɔe daa. <verse eid="PSA 119:98" /><verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99" />I le ni pe ye tsɔɔli ɔmɛ tsuo, ejakaa i susuu o mlaa amɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 119:99" /><verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100" />I nuɔ nɔ sisi pe nimeli tete po; ejakaa i yeɔ o mlaa amɛ a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:100" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101" />I nyɛɛ we nɔ yayami se, ejakaa i suɔ nɛ ma ye o Munyu ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:101" /><verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102" />I tlɛ kɛ ji o mlaa amɛ a he, ejakaa mo nitsɛ nɛ o tsɔɔ mi ni. <verse eid="PSA 119:102" /><verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103" />Hyɛ bɔ nɛ o Munyu ɔmɛ ngɔɔ ha mi ha. A ngɔɔ pe hwo ngɛ ye nya mi. <verse eid="PSA 119:103" /><verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104" />I na nile kɛ nɔ sisi numi kɛ gu o mlaa amɛ a nɔ; nɛ ja a he je ɔ, i hiɔ nɔ yayami.<verse eid="PSA 119:104" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105" />O Munyu ɔ ji kane ha ye nane, kɛ la ngɛ ye blɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:105" /><verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106" />I ka kita kaa i ma ye o mlaa dadɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:106" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, i na nɔ saminya, moo wo mi he wami kaa bɔ nɛ o wo si ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:107" /><verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo he ye sina sɔlemi ɔ, nɛ o tsɔɔ mi o mlaa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:108" /><verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109" />I ngɛ hɛ mi kpatami mi be fɛɛ be, se ye hɛ ji o mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:109" /><verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110" />Dikali ɔmɛ tsɔ mi klama se i tɔ we o mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:110" /><verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111" />O mlaa amɛ ji ye gbosi ni kɛ yaa neneene. Mɛ nɛ a haa mi bua jɔmi. <verse eid="PSA 119:111" /><verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112" />Ye juɛ mi ji kaa ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ kɛ ya si ye nyagbe ligbi.<verse eid="PSA 119:112" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113" />I hiɔ nihi nɛ a juɛmi ngɛ enyɔɔnyɔ ngɛ o he, se ami lɛɛ i suɔ o mlaa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:113" /><verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114" />Mo ji ye wesa he kɛ ye he pulelɔ; i wo ye hɛ kɛ fɔ o si womi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:114" /><verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115" />Nyɛɛ je ye ngɔ kɛ ho se ya, nimli yayamihi, ejakaa ami lɛɛ i ma ye ye Mawu ɔ mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:115" /><verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116" />Moo pɛtɛ ye he ngɛ o si womi ɔ nya, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ye yi nɛ na wami; nɛ mo ko ha nɛ zo nɛ gbe mi ngɛ ye hɛ nɛ i kɛ fɔ o nɔ ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 119:116" /><verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117" />Moo pɛtɛ ye he nɛ ye yi nɛ na wami, nɛ i ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ be tsuaa be.<verse eid="PSA 119:117" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118" />O kua nihi kulaa nɛ bui o mlaa amɛ ɔ. Se nami be a gɔdɔgɔdɔ ni tsumi ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 119:118" /><verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119" />Dikali ɔmɛ tsuo ngɛ kaa dwɔmi nɛ o bɛɛ kɛ pueɔ he. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i suɔ o mlaa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:119" /><verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120" />O he gbeye ha nɛ bibi gbee mi, nɛ i yeɔ o kojomi gbeye.<verse eid="PSA 119:120" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121" />I pee nɔ nɛ hi kɛ nɔ nɛ da blɔ, mo ko ngmɛɛ ye he kɛ ha ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:121" /><verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122" />Moo wo mi si kaa o maa ye kɛ bua o sɔmɔlɔ ɔ; mo ko ha nɛ he nɔ woli nɛ a hao mi. <verse eid="PSA 119:122" /><verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123" />I hyɛ ye yi wami hemi ɔ nɛ o wo mi si ngɛ he ɔ blɔ hluu nɛ ye hɛ ngmɛ bɔni yumi. <verse eid="PSA 119:123" /><verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124" />O kɛ mi o sɔmɔlɔ ɔ nɛ ye ngɛ o suɔmi nɛ tsakee we ɔ nya, nɛ o tsɔɔ mi o mlaa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:124" /><verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125" />O sɔmɔlɔ ji mi; mo ha mi nɔ sisi numi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma le o mlaa amɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:125" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, e su be nɛ e sa kaa o pee nɔ́ ko, ejakaa a tɔ o mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:126" /><verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127" />Se ami lɛɛ i suɔ o mlaa amɛ pe sika tsu. <verse eid="PSA 119:127" /><verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128" />Nɛ enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, i buu o mlaa amɛ kulaa kaa a da ngɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ blɔ fa mi, nɛ i hiɔ lakpa ni peemi ɔmɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:128" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129" />O mlaa amɛ a he ngɛ nyakpɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je nɛ i yeɔ a nɔ ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:129" /><verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130" />O munyu ɔmɛ haa nɔ nuɔ nɔ sisi, nɛ a haa nɔ nɛ li nɔ́ ko ɔ plɛɔ ni lelɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:130" /><verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131" />Ngɛ o mlaa amɛ a se dimi mi ɔ, ye mumi nya ta.<verse eid="PSA 119:131" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132" />Mo plɛ nɛ o hyɛ mi nɛ o na mi mɔbɔ kaa bɔ nɛ o peeɔ kɛ haa nihi kulaa nɛ suɔ mo ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:132" /><verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133" />Mo kudɔ mi kɛ o mlaa amɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ yayami nɛ ko ye ye nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:133" /><verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134" />Mo kpɔ mi kɛ je yi mi wali ɔmɛ a dɛ mi, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:134" /><verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135" />Moo hɛɛ mi kɛ o suɔmi ɔ, nɛ o tsɔɔ mi o mlaa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:135" /><verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136" />I foɔ ya wawɛɛ, ejakaa a yi o mlaa amɛ a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:136" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, dalɔ ji mo, nɛ o kojomi ɔmɛ hu da. <verse eid="PSA 119:137" /><verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138" />O mlaa amɛ nɛ o wo ɔ hi nɛ a da. <verse eid="PSA 119:138" /><verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139" />O mlaa amɛ a he hɛ dɔ nya ha ye mi mi fuɔ, ejakaa ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ bui o mlaa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:139" /><verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140" />I na kaa o si womi ɔmɛ baa mi, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i suɔ mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:140" /><verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141" />I pi nɔ ko, nɛ a bui mi, se ye hɛ ji o mlaa amɛ a nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:141" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142" />O dami ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene; nɛ o mlaa amɛ hine anɔkuale. <verse eid="PSA 119:142" /><verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143" />Ngɛ ye nɔ nami kɛ haomi mi ɔ, o mlaa amɛ wo mi bua. <verse eid="PSA 119:143" /><verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144" />O mlaa amɛ da be fɛɛ be; moo ye kɛ bua mi nɛ ma nu a sisi, nɛ ye yi nɛ na wami.<verse eid="PSA 119:144" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145" />I je ye tsui mi kɛ tsɛ mo; moo bu mi tue, Tsaatsɛ Mawu, nɛ i ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:145" /><verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146" />I tsɛ mo; mo he ye yi wami, nɛ i ma ye o mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:146" /><verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147" />I te si makɛ nɛ i tsɛ mo ke o ye kɛ bua mi; o munyu ɔmɛ a nɔ nɛ i wo ye hɛ kɛ fɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:147" /><verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148" />Nyɔnyɔɔnyɔ tsuo i hwɔɛ mahe, nɛ i ngɛ o si womi ɔmɛ a he susue. <verse eid="PSA 119:148" /><verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149" />Moo bu mi tue ngɛ o suɔmi nɛ tsakee we ɔ he. Oo Neneene Tsɛ, moo na mi mɔbɔ nɛ o he ye yi wami.<verse eid="PSA 119:149" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150" />Dikali ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ ye se nyɛɛe ɔ na mi ta; a ji nihi nɛ bui o mlaa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:150" /><verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151" />Se Tsaatsɛ Mawu, o ngɛ ye kasa nya haa; nɛ o mlaa amɛ kulaa hine anɔkuale. <verse eid="PSA 119:151" /><verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152" />I na le kɛ je blema lokoo kaa o mlaa amɛ be tsakemi ko nɛ a ma tsake. <verse eid="PSA 119:152" /><verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153" />Moo hyɛ ye nɔ nami ɔ nɛ o kpɔ mi, ejakaa ye hɛ ji o mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:153" /><verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154" />Moo ye ye sane ɔ ha mi nɛ o kpɔ mi; mo he ye yi wami ngɛ o si womi ɔ nya. <verse eid="PSA 119:154" /><verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155" />A be dikali ɔmɛ a yi wami hee, ejakaa a bui o mlaa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:155" /><verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156" />Neneene Tsɛ, o mɔbɔ nami kle, moo na mi mɔbɔ nɛ o he ye yi wami ngɛ o mlaa amɛ a nya.<verse eid="PSA 119:156" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157" />Ye he nyɛli kɛ yi mi wali ɔmɛ hiɛ; se i kua we o mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi. <verse eid="PSA 119:157" /><verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158" />Ke i na níhi nɛ be hemi kɛ yemi nɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, a he peeɔ mi tai, ejakaa a yi o mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:158" /><verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159" />Moo hyɛ bɔ nɛ i suɔ o mlaa amɛ ha, Tsaatsɛ Mawu! Mo he ye yi wami ngɛ o suɔmi nɛ tsakee we ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 119:159" /><verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160" />O munyu ɔmɛ tsuo hine anɔkuale, nɛ o mlaa amɛ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene.<verse eid="PSA 119:160" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161" />Nɔ yeli ngɛ mi haoe be mi nɛ i pee we nɔ ko, se i yeɔ o munyu ɔmɛ gbeye. <verse eid="PSA 119:161" /><verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162" />O munyu ɔ ha nɛ ye bua jɔɔ ye he kaa nɔ ko nɛ hiɛ june agbo ko. <verse eid="PSA 119:162" /><verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163" />I sume lakpa, se i suɔ o mlaa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:163" /><verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164" />I jeɔ o yi si kpaago daa ligbi ngɛ o dami mlaa amɛ a he.<verse eid="PSA 119:164" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165" />Nihi nɛ suɔ o mlaa amɛ ɔ, a ngɛ tue mi jɔmi saminya, nɛ nɔ́ ko be a nane tɔtɔe. <verse eid="PSA 119:165" /><verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166" />Neneene Tsɛ, i ngɛ o yi wami hemi ɔ blɔ hyɛe; nɛ i yeɔ o mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:166" /><verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167" />Ye mumi he o mlaa amɛ saminya, nɛ i yeɔ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:167" /><verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168" />I yeɔ o mlaa amɛ a nɔ; nɛ o naa ye nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ i peeɔ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:168" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, moo bu ye kue fami ɔ tue; mo ha mi nɔ sisi numi kaa bɔ nɛ o wo mi si ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:169" /><verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170" />Mo ha nɛ ye kue fami ɔ nɛ su o ngɔ. Mo kpɔ mi ngɛ o munyu ɔ nya. <verse eid="PSA 119:170" /><verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171" />I ma je o yi be fɛɛ be, ejakaa o tsɔɔ mi o mlaa amɛ. <verse eid="PSA 119:171" /><verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172" />O munyu ɔ maa pee ye nya la, ejakaa o mlaa amɛ kulaa da. <verse eid="PSA 119:172" /><verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173" />Moo pee klaalo nɛ o ye kɛ bua mi, ejakaa i ngɛ o mlaa amɛ a nɔ yee. <verse eid="PSA 119:173" /><verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, o yi wami hemi ɔ he kuma yee mi, ejakaa o mlaa amɛ haa ye bua jɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 119:174" /><verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175" />Mo ha nɛ o mlaa amɛ nɛ a kudɔ mi, nɛ ye yi nɛ na wami, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma je o yi.<verse eid="PSA 119:175" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176" />I tla nɛ i ngɛ si kpae kaa to nɛ laa. Moo ba nɛ o ba hla mi, ejakaa i ngmɛɛ we o mlaa amɛ a he.<verse eid="PSA 119:176" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119" />
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 120</para>
  <para style="s1">Yemi kɛ buami he pɛɛ kpami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1" />Benɛ i sɛ haomi mi ɔ, i tsɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɛ e bu mi tue.<verse eid="PSA 120:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, mo kpɔ mi kɛ je lakpa yeli kɛ nɔ sisili a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 120:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3" />Lakpa yeli, mɛni Tsaatsɛ Mawu maa pee nyɛ? Kɛ e maa gbla nyɛ tue kɛɛ? <verse eid="PSA 120:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4" />A ma tsiɛ̃ nyɛ kɛ̃ɛ̃ nɛ nya ba, nɛ a maa sa nyɛ ngɛ la nɛ ngɛ tsoe glegleegle nɛ be gboe mla mi!<verse eid="PSA 120:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5" />Due ha mi kaa i ba to nubwɔ ngɛ Mesek, nɛ i ba hi Keda bo tsu ɔmɛ a mi! <verse eid="PSA 120:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6" />I hi nimli nɛ sume tue mi jɔmi nɛ ɔmɛ a kpɛti be kɛkɛɛ tsɔ. <verse eid="PSA 120:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7" />Ami lɛɛ he jɔmi Nɔmlɔ ji mi, se ke i tu munyu pɛ mɛɛ lɛɛ a hia ta kɛ wo mi.<verse eid="PSA 120:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120" />
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 121</para>
  <para style="s1">Yehowa ji o he bulɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1" />I wo ye hɛ nɔ kɛ ngɛ yoku ɔmɛ hyɛe; jije ye yemi kɛ buami maa je kɛ ba? <verse eid="PSA 121:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2" />Ye yemi kɛ buami maa je Neneene Tsɛ ɔ, nɔ nɛ bɔ hiɔwe kɛ zugba a ngɔ. <verse eid="PSA 121:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3" />E be hae nɛ o nane maa sane; nɔ nɛ baa o yi ɔ, e dí kɔnɔɛ. <verse eid="PSA 121:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4" />O nɛ, nɔ nɛ buu Israel he ɔ, e di kɔnɔɛ, nɛ e be mahe hu hwɔe ligbi ko.<verse eid="PSA 121:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5" />Yehowa ji o he bulɔ; lɛ ji o he doolɔ. <verse eid="PSA 121:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6" />Piani ɔ, pu be mo saae, nɛ nyɔ mi hu nɔ́ ko be mo pee. <verse eid="PSA 121:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7" />Yehowa maa bu o he kɛ je yayami kulaa mi; e maa baa o yi. <verse eid="PSA 121:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu maa bu o kpo jemi kɛ o mi bami he kɛ je be nɛ ɔ mi kɛ ya neneene.<verse eid="PSA 121:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121" />
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 122</para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem tue mi jɔmi he kue fami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1" />I na bua jɔmi be nɛ a de mi ke, “Moo te si nɛ waa ho Tsaatsɛ Mawu We ɔ ya.” <verse eid="PSA 122:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2" />Oo Yerusalem, wa daa si ngɛ o agbo ɔmɛ a mi. <verse eid="PSA 122:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3" />Yerusalem ji ma nɛ a sa yi. <verse eid="PSA 122:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4" />Ma he nɛ Mawu we bi ɔmɛ yaa, ngɛ Israel wɛtsowɛtso ɔmɛ a nya nɛ a ya sãa bɔ kɛ haa Tsaatsɛ Mawu kaa bɔ nɛ e fa mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 122:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5" />Lejɛ ɔ nɛ a wo matsɛ sɛ ɔ kɛ ma si ngɛ, David matsɛ kojomi sɛ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 122:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6" />Nyɛɛ sɔle kɛ ha Yerusalem tue mi jɔmi nami. Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ suɔ mo ɔ, e maa ya nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 122:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7" />He jɔmi maa hi o we ɔmɛ a mi; nɛ tue mi jɔmi maa hi o matsɛ we ɔmɛ a mi. <verse eid="PSA 122:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8" />Ye nyɛmimɛ kɛ ye huɛmɛ a he je ɔ, i ngɛ Yerusalem “Manye hae!” <verse eid="PSA 122:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9" />Nɛ ngɛ Neneene Tsɛ, wa Mawu ɔ We ɔ he je ɔ, i ma sɔle nɛ e hi kɛ ha mo.<verse eid="PSA 122:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122" />
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 123</para>
  <para style="s1">Kue fami ha mɔbɔ nami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1" />I wo ye hɛ nɔ kɛ ngɛ mo hyɛe, mo Mawu hiɔwe lokoo matsɛ!<verse eid="PSA 123:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2" />Bɔ nɛ sɔmɔlɔ hyɛɔ e wetsɛ blɔ, nɛ mawayo hyɛɔ e wenyɛ blɔ ɔ, ja a nɛ wa ngɛ Neneene Tsɛ, wa Mawu ɔ, blɔ hyɛe kɛ ya si be nɛ e maa na wɔ mɔbɔ.<verse eid="PSA 123:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3" />Moo na wɔ mɔbɔ, Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo na wɔ mɔbɔ. Ejakaa a pue wa hɛ mi si pe bɔ nɛ sa. <verse eid="PSA 123:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4" />Sikatsɛmɛ ye wa he fɛu saminya; nɛ he nɔ woli hu pue wa hɛ mi si.<verse eid="PSA 123:4" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123" />
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 124</para>
  <para style="s1">Kpɔmi kɛ oslaa mi jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1" />Ke pi Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɛ ngɛ wa se; ha nɛ Israel nɛ e de ke, <verse eid="PSA 124:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2" />“Ke pi Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɛ ngɛ wa se, jinɛ benɛ wa he nyɛli ɔmɛ te si kɛ wo wɔ ɔ, <verse eid="PSA 124:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3" />a ko mii wɔ hɛ ngmengmle be mi nɛ a mi mi fu wɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 124:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4" />Jinɛ nyu hyihyi ɔ sa wɔ kɛ je; jinɛ wa tlɔ pa mi, <verse eid="PSA 124:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5" />jinɛ nyu nɛ fluku ɔ ha wa nɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 124:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6" />Nyɛ ha nɛ waa na Tsaatsɛ Mawu si, nɔ nɛ ha we nɛ wa he nyɛli ɔmɛ nɛ a kpata wa hɛ mi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 124:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7" />Wa je a klama a mi, kaa lohwe pɛlitsɛ jee klama tsɔlɔ klama mi ɔ; klama a puɛ nɛ wa je mi!<verse eid="PSA 124:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8" />Neneene Tsɛ ɔ nɛ bɔ hiɔwe kɛ zugba a, lɛ ji nɔ nɛ yeɔ kɛ buaa wɔ.<verse eid="PSA 124:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124" />
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 125</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu baa e nimli a yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1" />Nihi nɛ wo a hɛ kɛ fɔ Neneene Tsɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, a ngɛ kaa Zion Yoku ɔ; e ngɛ daa, nɛ e be hosoe ligbi ko.<verse eid="PSA 125:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2" />Kaa bɔ nɛ yoku ɔmɛ bɔle Yerusalem kɛ kpe ɔ, ja a pɛ nɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu bɔle e nimli ɔmɛ a he kɛ kpe kɛ yaa neneene. <verse eid="PSA 125:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3" />Dikali be dali a nɔ yee, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a ko nyɛ dali ɔmɛ a nɔ nɛ a pee yayami. <verse eid="PSA 125:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo pee nihi nɛ hi ɔmɛ kpakpa, nihi nɛ a tsui ngɛ o he ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 125:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5" />Se yayami peeli ɔmɛ ɔ, o kpaka mɛ kɛ ya hɛ mi kpatami mi; nɛ o ha Israel he jɔmi kɛ tue mi jɔmi.<verse eid="PSA 125:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125" />
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 126</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɔguɛhi nɛ a kpɔ ɔ a la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1" />Benɛ Yehowa kpɔ wɔ e nimli ɔmɛ kɛ je nyɔguɛ yemi ɔ mi kɛ ba Yerusalem ɔ, wa pee kaa nihi nɛ ngɛ nlae. <verse eid="PSA 126:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2" />Hyɛ bɔ nɛ wa muɔ saminya nɛ wa la kɛ bua jɔmi. Nɛ ma kpa amɛ de ngɛ wa he ke, “Mawu tsu nyakpɛ ni nguahi ha mɛ.”<verse eid="PSA 126:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3" />Niinɛ, Tsaatsɛ Mawu tsu ni nguahi ha wɔ, nɛ wa na bua jɔmi. <verse eid="PSA 126:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4" />Neneene Tsɛ, moo jɔɔ wɔ ekohu, kaa bɔ nɛ o haa nɛ hiɔmi nɛɛ kɛ woɔ pahi nɛ a mi gbli ɔ a mi nɛ a hyiɔ ekohu ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 126:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5" />Mo ha nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ duɔ ni kɛ a hɛ mi ya a, a kpa kɛ bua jɔmi. <verse eid="PSA 126:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6" />Hɛɛ, ni nɛmɛ nɛ duɔ ni kɛ ya a, a ma kpa kɛ bua jɔmi.<verse eid="PSA 126:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126" />
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 127</para>
  <para style="s1">Hɛ ke Mawu nɔ fɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1" />Ke pi Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɛ ngɛ tsu ɔ mae ɔ, lɛɛ yaka dengme nɛ tsu fiali ɔmɛ ngɛ gboe. Ke pi Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɛ ngɛ ma a he bue ɔ, lɛɛ yaka tsuaa nɛ buli ɔmɛ ngɛ nyɔ hwɔɔe. <verse eid="PSA 127:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2" />Yaka tsuaa nɛ o tee si makɛ nɛ o tsuɔ ni hluu kɛ ya siɔ nyɔ mi ngɛ, ejakaa o ngɛ gbeye yee kaa hwɔ maa gbe mo. Mawu haa nihi nɛ e suɔ mɛ ɔ a hiami ni, nɛ e suɔ kaa a na he jɔɔmi bɔ nɛ sa.<verse eid="PSA 127:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu nike ni ji bimɛ, nɛ a ji jɔɔmi. <verse eid="PSA 127:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4" />Nihe mi bimɛ nɛ nɔ ko fɔ ɔ, a ngɛ kaa ta hwuli nɛ ma fã e he. <verse eid="PSA 127:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5" />Nɔ nɛ ngɛ bi nɛ ɔmɛ fuu ɔ, bua jɔmi ji e nɔ. Zo be lɛ gbee ke e kɛ e he nyɛli kpe ngɛ kojomi he.<verse eid="PSA 127:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127" />
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 128</para>
  <para style="s1">Gbaami nɛ baa Mawu jalɔ we mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1" />A gbaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ yee Mawu gbeye nɛ e nyɛɛ e blɔ ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 128:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2" />O maa ye o dengme gbomi kɛ o nine nya ni tsumi mi ni. O ma na bua jɔmi, nɛ o níhi kulaa maa pee bɔ nɛ sa. <verse eid="PSA 128:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3" />O yo ma fɔ, nɛ o bimɛ maa hiɛ fuu kɛ bɔle o ni yemi okplɔɔ ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 128:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4" />Nɔ nɛ buɔ Tsaatsɛ Mawu tue ɔ, kikɛ ɔ ji bɔ nɛ e maa jɔɔ lɛ.<verse eid="PSA 128:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5" />Neneene Tsɛ ɔ maa gbaa mo kɛ je hiɔwe! Nɛ o je mi si himi maa da mo ke ji o yeɔ kɛ buaa ni kpahi. <verse eid="PSA 128:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6" />O bibimɛ maa wa ba na mo. Israel, mo he manye!<verse eid="PSA 128:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128" />
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 129</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel he nyɛli a gbiɛmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1" />A wa mi yi mi kɛ je ye jokuɛ mi. Mo ha nɛ Israel nɛ e de ke: <verse eid="PSA 129:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2" />Ye he nyɛli wa mi yi mi kɛ je ye jokuɛ mi, se a yi ye nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 129:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3" />A fiaa mi kpa nɛ ye se mi poo. <verse eid="PSA 129:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4" />Se Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɛ ji dalɔ ɔ, e kpɔ mi kɛ je nyɔguɛ yemi ɔ mi.<verse eid="PSA 129:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5" />Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ sume Israel sane ɔ, a maa ye e nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 129:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6" />A maa pee kaa nga nɛ puɛ ngɛ tsu yi mi, nɛ e wɛ loko ji e nglaa. <verse eid="PSA 129:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7" />Nɛ ni kpalɔ bua we nya, se e siɔ kɛ pueɔ si. <verse eid="PSA 129:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8" />Nɛ nihi nɛ bee ɔ, a nga we lɛ ke, “Mawu nɛ gbaa mo! Mo he manye ngɛ Yehowa biɛ mi!”<verse eid="PSA 129:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129" />
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 130</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu blɔ hyɛmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, i kpa ngmlaa kɛ tsɛ mo be mi nɛ ye hɛ nɔ kami tsuo ta. <verse eid="PSA 130:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, moo bu ye ngmlaa kpami ɔ tue; moo bu ye kue fami ɔ tue nɛ o ye kɛ bua mi!<verse eid="PSA 130:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ke o kɛ wɔ maa ye ngɛ wa yayami ɔmɛ a nya a, mɛnɔ ma nyɛ si maa da? <verse eid="PSA 130:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4" />Mo wo kɛ ke wɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ waa ye mo gbeye. <verse eid="PSA 130:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5" />I ngɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu mlɛe nɛ e ye kɛ bua mi; e munyu ɔ ji ye hɛ nɔ kami. <verse eid="PSA 130:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6" />I ngɛ lɛ blɔ hyɛe po pe bɔ nɛ nyɔ hwɔɔlɔ hyɛɔ je nanɛɛ blɔ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 130:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7" />Israel, mo wo o hɛ kɛ fɔ Tsaatsɛ Mawu nɔ, ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ be nyagbe, nɛ e hlaa be fɛɛ be kaa e ma he wa yi wami. <verse eid="PSA 130:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8" />E ma he Israel yi wami kɛ je e tɔmi ɔmɛ tsuo a mi.<verse eid="PSA 130:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130" />
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 131</para>
  <para style="s1">Humi si himi he kue fami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1" />Neneene Tsɛ, i fiɛ̃ nɛ i wo we ye he nɔ. I hla we kaa ma pee nɔ́ ngua ko, aloo ma ye sanehi nɛ kle pe mi. <verse eid="PSA 131:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2" />Niinɛ, ye he jɔ kaa bi nɛ pupɔ nyɔ ta, nɛ ye tsui nɔ ye mi.<verse eid="PSA 131:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3" />Israel, mo hu mo wo o hɛ kɛ fɔ Neneene Tsɛ ɔ nɔ kɛ je be nɛ ɔ mi kɛ ya neneene.<verse eid="PSA 131:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131" />
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 132</para>
  <para style="s1">David kpale Somi Daka a kɛ ba Zion</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo kai David kɛ haomi ɔmɛ nɛ ba e nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 132:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2" />Bɔ nɛ e kã Neneene Tsɛ ɔ kita, nɛ e wo Mawu Ope ɔ si ke, <verse eid="PSA 132:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3" />i be we mi yae nɛ i be si hwɔe; <verse eid="PSA 132:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 132:4" />i be mahe hwɔe nɛ i be kɔnɔɛ dee; <verse eid="PSA 132:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:5" />kɛ ya si be nɛ i ma na hi he kɛ ha Neneene Tsɛ ɔ, hi he kɛ ha Yakob Mawu ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 132:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6" />Kekleekle ɔ, wa nu Somi Daka a he ngɛ Efrata, nɛ jehanɛ ɔ, wa ya na lɛ ngɛ Jaa nga a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 132:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7" />Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, e maa hi Mawu We ɔ. Wa maa ya e Sɔlemi We ɔ, nɛ wa ma ja ngɛ e nane nya. <verse eid="PSA 132:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8" />Moo te si, Neneene Tsɛ, kɛ ba Sɔlemi We ɔ kɛ Somi Daka nɛ ji o he wami ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 132:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9" />Mo ha nɛ o osɔfo ɔmɛ a pee nɔ dadɛ be fɛɛ be, nɛ o nimli ɔmɛ a hwɔ lele kɛ bua jɔmi.<verse eid="PSA 132:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10" />Mo ko kua o tsɔlɔ David, matsɛ nɛ o wo kɛ ha o nimli ɔmɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 132:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11" />O wo David si nɛ o be o nya se kpalee. O de ke, “I ma wo o bi ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake matsɛ nɛ e ma ba ye o se. <verse eid="PSA 132:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12" />Ke ji o binyumu ɔmɛ maa ye ye somi ɔ kɛ mlaa amɛ nɛ i ma wo ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ, lɛɛ mɛ hu a bimɛ maa hi o matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 132:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, o hla Yerusalem kaa o sihi he. <verse eid="PSA 132:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14" />Nɛ o de ke, “Hiɛ ɔ maa pee ye sihi he daa, ejakaa ja a ji bɔ nɛ i suɔ. <verse eid="PSA 132:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15" />I ma ha ma nɛ ɔ maa ya nɔ, nɛ i ma ha e mi ohiafo ɔmɛ a nya ngma. <verse eid="PSA 132:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16" />I ma jɔɔ e mi osɔfo ɔmɛ ngɛ a nɔ fɛɛ nɔ mi, nɛ e mi nimli klɔuklɔu ɔmɛ ma la nɛ a ma hwɔ lele kɛ bua jɔmi. <verse eid="PSA 132:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17" />Nɛ i ma ha David bi ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake maa pee matsɛ agbo, nɛ i ma ha nɛ nɔ nɛ i hla a, e matsɛ yemi ɔ maa da si. <verse eid="PSA 132:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18" />I ma bɔ e he nyɛli ɔmɛ ahlua, se lɛɛ e matsɛ yemi ɔ maa ya nɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 132:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132" />
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 133</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɛmimɛ a kake peemi mi jɔɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1" />Hyɛ bɔ nɛ e hi, bɔ nɛ e ngɛ fɛu ha, ke nyɛmimɛ pee kake kɛ hi si ngɛ tue mi jɔmi mi. <verse eid="PSA 133:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2" />E ngɛ kaa nu je via nɛ a kɛ wo Aaron yi mi, nɛ kple si kɛ ba sɛ e kpɛni mi, nɛ e be hluu kɛ ba su e tade ɔ nya. <verse eid="PSA 133:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3" />E ngɛ kaa bɔ ngɛ Hermon Yoku ɔ nɔ, nɛ ngɛ nɛe kɛ ngɛ Zion Yoku ɔmɛ a nɔ puee. Ejakaa lejɛ ɔ nɛ Yehowa wo si ngɛ kaa a ma na jɔɔmi kɛ wami kɛ ya neneene.<verse eid="PSA 133:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133" />
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 134</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɔ mi lá ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1" />Nyɛɛ ba, nyɛ Yehowa sɔmɔli ɔmɛ tsuo, nɛ nyɛ ba je e yi, nyɛ nihi kulaa nɛ sɔmɔɔ ngɛ e Sɔlemi We ɔ nyɔ mi ɔ! <verse eid="PSA 134:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2" />Nyɛ wo nine nɔ kɛ sɔle ngɛ e Sɔlemi We ɔ, nɛ nyɛ je Neneene Tsɛ ɔ yi!<verse eid="PSA 134:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3" />Neneene Tsɛ ɔ, hiɔwe kɛ zugba bɔlɔ ɔ, maa gbaa mo kɛ je Zion!<verse eid="PSA 134:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134" />
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 135</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu yi jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1" />Nyɛ je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi! Nyɛ je e biɛ ɔ yi! Nyɛ e sɔmɔli ɔmɛ tsuo nyɛ wo yi jemi kɛ ha lɛ. <verse eid="PSA 135:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2" />Nyɛ je Yehowa yi, nyɛ nihi nɛ daa si ngɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu We ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 135:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3" />Nyɛ je Neneene Tsɛ ɔ yi, ejakaa e hi; nyɛ la kɛ je e biɛ ɔ yi, ejakaa e mi mi jɔ. <verse eid="PSA 135:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4" />E hla Yakob kɛ ha e he; lɛ nitsɛ e nihi ji Israel bi ɔmɛ.<verse eid="PSA 135:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5" />I le kaa wa Mawu ɔ kle, e kle hluu pe mawuhi kulaa. <verse eid="PSA 135:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6" />Nɔ nɛ e suɔ ɔ, lɔ ɔ nɛ e peeɔ ngɛ hiɔwe kɛ zugba a nɔ, kɛ wo ɔmɛ a hehi nɛ kuɔ ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 135:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7" />E haa nɛ bɔ kuu woɔ ngɛ je ɔ mi tsuo; nɛ hiɔwe paa la; nɛ kɔɔhiɔ fiaa kɛ jee e je he. <verse eid="PSA 135:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8" />Lɛ nɛ e gbe Mizraim bi tɛte kɛ dede ɔmɛ, kɛ lohwehi a kekle bihi tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 135:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9" />Nɛ e ha okadihi kɛ nyakpɛ níhi ba Farao kɛ e we bi ɔmɛ tsuo a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 135:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10" />E kpata mahi a hɛ mi nɛ e tane matsɛmɛ he wali a yi. <verse eid="PSA 135:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11" />Nɛ ji Sihon, Amor bi ɔmɛ a matsɛ ɔ, kɛ Og nɛ ji Bashan matsɛ ɔ, kɛ Kanaan matsɛ ɔmɛ tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 135:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12" />Nɛ e wo a zugba amɛ kɛ ha e ma Israel kaa gbosi ni.<verse eid="PSA 135:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13" />Oo Yehowa, o biɛ maa hi si daa; nɛ a ma kai mo kɛ ya yi nɔhi kulaa. <verse eid="PSA 135:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14" />Yehowa maa wo e nimli ɔmɛ nguɔ nɛ e maa na e sɔmɔli ɔmɛ mɔbɔ.<verse eid="PSA 135:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15" />Ma je li ɔmɛ jaa sika hiɔ kɛ sika tsu amagahi nɛ nimli pee. <verse eid="PSA 135:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16" />Amagahi nɛ ngɛ nya, se a tui munyu; a ngɛ hɛ ngmɛ, se a hyɛ we nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 135:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17" />A ngɛ tue, se a nui nɔ; nɛ a nyɛ we mumi tete womi. <verse eid="PSA 135:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18" />A ngɛ kaa nihi nɛ pee mɛ kɛ nihi nɛ woɔ a hɛ kɛ fɔɔ a nɔ ɔ!<verse eid="PSA 135:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19" />Oo Israel, mo je Yehowa yi! Aaron we osɔfo ɔmɛ, nyɛ je e yi. <verse eid="PSA 135:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20" />Levi we, nyɛ je Yehowa yi! Nyɛ nihi tsuo nɛ nyɛ yeɔ Yehowa gbeye ɔ, nyɛ je e yi. <verse eid="PSA 135:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21" />Nyɛ Yerusalem bihi tsuo nyɛ je Neneene Tsɛ ɔ yi, ejakaa Yerusalem ji e sihi he. Nyɛ je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi!<verse eid="PSA 135:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135" />
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 136</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu yi jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1" />Oo, nyɛɛ na Neneene Tsɛ ɔ si; ejakaa e hi, nɛ e suɔmi ngɛ daa.<verse eid="PSA 136:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2" />Nyɛɛ na mawuhi a Mawu ɔ si, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3" />Nyɛɛ na nutsɔhi a Nutsɔ ɔ si, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4" />Nɔ nɛ lɛ pɛ nɛ e tsuɔ nyakpɛ ni nguahi ɔ, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5" />Nyɛ je e yi, nɔ nɛ bɔ hiɔwe ɔmɛ kɛ je e nile mi, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6" />Nɔ nɛ gba zugba a kɛ wo ɔmɛ a kpɛti ɔ, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7" />Nɔ nɛ bɔ pu kɛ nyɔhiɔ kɛ hlami dodoe ɔmɛ, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8" />Nɛ e ha pu tsoo ke je na, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9" />Nɛ hlami kɛ dodoehi kpɛɔ ke je jɔ, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10" />Nɔ nɛ gbe Mizraim nimli kɛ lohwehi a kekle bihi, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11" />Nɛ e je Israel kɛ je a kpɛti ɔ, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12" />Nɔ nɛ kɛ kɔni si wami tsu kikɛmɛ a ni nɛ ɔ, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13" />Nɔ nɛ ha nɛ Wo Tsutsu ɔ mi gba nɛ e je blɔ ha mɛ ɔ, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14" />Nɛ e kpaka mɛ kɛ manye kɛ gu kpɛti kɛ be ɔ, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa.<verse eid="PSA 136:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15" />Se e ha nɛ Farao ta a tlɔ wo ɔ mi, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa.<verse eid="PSA 136:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16" />Nɔ nɛ kpaka e nimli ɔmɛ kɛ gu nga a nɔ́ ɔ, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17" />Nɔ nɛ gbe matsɛ nguahi, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18" />Nɛ e kpata matsɛhi nɛ he biɛ a hɛ mi ɔ, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19" />Amor bi a matsɛ Sihon, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa.<verse eid="PSA 136:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20" />Kɛ Bashan bi a matsɛ Og, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21" />Nɛ e wo a zugba a ngɔ ha Israel kaa gbosi ni, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22" />Kaa gbosi ni kɛ ha e sɔmɔlɔ Israel, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa.<verse eid="PSA 136:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23" />Lɛ nɔ nɛ kai wɔ benɛ wa gbɔjɔ ɔ, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24" />Nɛ e kpɔ wɔ kɛ je wa he nyɛli ɔmɛ a dɛ mi ɔ, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa.<verse eid="PSA 136:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25" />Lɛ nɔ nɛ e lɛɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ woɔ mumi ɔ, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa. <verse eid="PSA 136:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26" />Oo, nyɛ wo sina kɛ ha Hiɔwe Mawu ɔ, ejakaa e suɔmi ngɛ daa.<verse eid="PSA 136:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136" />
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 137</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel bi a nyɔguɛ yemi mi la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1" />Babilon pa amɛ a tue nɛ wa ya ho hi si ngɛ, nɛ wa wo ya nɛ wa fo benɛ wa kai Zion ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 137:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2" />Wa wo wa kpa saku ɔmɛ ngɔ kpla si ngɛ pa tue tso ɔmɛ a kɔni ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 137:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3" />Ejakaa ni nɛmɛ nɛ nuu wɔ nyɔguɛ ɔ bi wɔ nɛ wa la wa je lahi ha mɛ. Nɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ wɔ yi mi wae ɔ de wɔ ke, “Nyɛ la Zion la amɛ eko ha wɔ.” <verse eid="PSA 137:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4" />Se kɛ e maa pee kɛɛ nɛ wa ma la Yehowa la ngɛ ma je li a zugba nɔ kɛɛ? <verse eid="PSA 137:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5" />Oo Yerusalem, ke ye hɛ je o nɔ ɔ, ye hiɔ nine nɛ gbo. <verse eid="PSA 137:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6" />Mo ha nɛ ye lilɛ nɛ du ye nya mi, ke i kai we mo, nɛ ma le kaa Yerusalem ji ye bua jɔmi nɔ pe kulaa a.<verse eid="PSA 137:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7" />Oo Yehowa, mo kai nɔ nɛ Edom bi ɔmɛ peeɔ ɔmɛ a ligbi ɔ nɔ. Benɛ Babilon ta a nine su Yerusalem nɔ ɔ, nɔ nɛ a de ji, “Nyɛ kpata ma a hɛ mi butubutu.” <verse eid="PSA 137:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8" />Oo Babilon, musu lohwe ɔ ma kpata o hɛ mi. A maa gbaa nɔ nɛ ma kpata o hɛ mi kaa bɔ nɛ o pee wɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 137:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9" />A maa gbaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ma wo o bi tsɔwi ɔmɛ a yi ngɔ fiaa tɛ ɔmɛ.<verse eid="PSA 137:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137" />
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 138</para>
  <para style="s1">Sina sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, i ngɛ mo si nae kɛ ye tsui kulaa. I ma la ma je o yi ngɛ mawu ɔmɛ tsuo a hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 138:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2" />I wo ye hɛ mi kɛ kpee o Sɔlemi We ɔ, nɛ i kpla si kɛ ngɛ sɔlee kɛ ngɛ mo si nae ngɛ o suɔmi nɛ be nyagbe kɛ o anɔkuale yemi ɔ he, ejakaa o tsɔɔ kaa o biɛ ɔ kɛ o munyu ɔ mi jiɔ. <verse eid="PSA 138:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3" />Ligbi ɔ nɛ i tsɛ mo ɔ, o he nɔ, nɛ o wo mi he wami.<verse eid="PSA 138:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, zugba a nɔ matsɛ ɔmɛ tsuo ma je o yi, ejakaa a nu o si womi ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 138:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5" />A ma la o ni tsumi ɔmɛ a he la, ejakaa o anunyami kle. <verse eid="PSA 138:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu kle mohu se e buu he si bali, nɛ he nɔ woli ɔmɛ lɛɛ e kɛ a kpɛti kɛ. <verse eid="PSA 138:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7" />Haomi babauu bɔle mi mohu se o ma je mi kɛ je a mi slɔkee. O maa te si kɛ si ye he nyɛli nɛ a mi mi wo la a, o he wami ɔ ma kpɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 138:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8" />Neneene Tsɛ ɔ ma tsu blɔ nyahi nɛ e to kɛ ha mi ɔ a he ni, ejakaa o suɔmi ngɛ daa. Mo ko ngmɛɛ ye he kɛ fɔ si, ejakaa mo nɛ o bɔ mi.<verse eid="PSA 138:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138" />
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 139</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu he nile kɛ yi baami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, o kpa ye tsui mi kulaa nɛ o na bɔ nɛ i ngɛ ha. <verse eid="PSA 139:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2" />O le ye si himi kɛ ye si temi, nɛ o le ye susumihi tsuo kɛ je lokoo. <verse eid="PSA 139:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3" />O le ye blɔ ɔmɛ, nɛ o tsɔɔ mi he nɛ ma wa nɛ ma jɔɔ ye he ngɛ. Be fɛɛ be ɔ, o le he nɛ i ngɛ. <verse eid="PSA 139:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4" />O le nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ hlae nɛ ma de momo loko ji i deɔ. <verse eid="PSA 139:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5" />O ngɛ ye hɛ mi, nɛ o ngɛ ye se hulɔ, nɛ o jɔɔmi nine ɔ ngɛ ye nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 139:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6" />Enɛ ɔ ji anunyami kɛ nyakpɛ nɔ ko nɛ ye juɛmi sui he. <verse eid="PSA 139:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7" />Jije i ma je o Mumi ɔ he kɛ ya, nɛ jije i ma tu fo kɛ je o hɛ mi kɛ ya? <verse eid="PSA 139:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8" />Ke i kuɔ kɛ ho hiɔwe ya a, o ngɛ lejɛ ɔ! Nɛ ke i ho gbeje ya hu o ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 139:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9" />Ke i puɛ pɛli nɛ i te kɛ ho wo se lokoo ya aloo kɛ ho pu sinɔ he tsitsaa ya a, <verse eid="PSA 139:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10" />lejɛ ɔ tete po ɔ, o nine ma kpaka mi, nɛ o hiɔ nine maa pɛtɛ ye mi. <verse eid="PSA 139:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11" />Ke i ke ma laa ye he ngɛ diblii mi ɔ, diblii ɔ tete plɛɔ la kɛ bɔleɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 139:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12" />Diblii be nyɛe maa laa e he ngɛ mo Tsaatsɛ Mawu o hɛ mi; diblii ɔ kpɛɔ kaa la kɛ ha mo, ejakaa diblii kɛ la sɔ ngɛ o hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 139:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13" />Ejakaa mo nɛ o bɔ ye mi níhi tsuo; mo nɛ o bɔ mi ngɛ ye nyɛ muklii mi. <verse eid="PSA 139:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14" />I ngɛ o yi jee, ejakaa o bɔ mi ngɛ gbeye kɛ nyakpɛ blɔ nɔ. O ni tsumi ɔmɛ ngɛ nyakpɛ. I le enɛ ɔ saminya. <verse eid="PSA 139:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15" />O ngɛ lejɛ ɔ be mi nɛ a ngɛ mi bɔe ngɛ laami mi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 139:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16" />O hɛ ngmɛ na mi be mi nɛ a bɔɛ mi gbi nya tete po; nɛ o to ye wami Ligbi ɔmɛ kulaa a he blɔ nya momo loko ji i bɔni mumi womi. A ngma ye ligbi ɔmɛ eko fɛɛ eko ngɛ o Womi ɔ mi.<verse eid="PSA 139:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, hyɛ bɔ nɛ e ngɔɔ ye nya ha kaa o susuu ye he be fɛɛ be! Ye he susumi ɔ hiɛ fuu bɔ nɛ i li nya. <verse eid="PSA 139:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18" />Ke i ke ma kane mɛ ɔ, a he maa hiɛ pe wo nya kewu. Ke i hwɔ si nɛ ye he tsiɛ ɔ, o ngɛ ye he susue kɛ sa.<verse eid="PSA 139:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19" />Neneene Tsɛ, mo kpata dikali ɔmɛ a hɛ mi, nɛ o ha nɛ muɔ si pueli ɔmɛ a ya se ngɛ ye he. <verse eid="PSA 139:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20" />A tuɔ musu bɔmi munyu kɛ siɔ mo, nɛ a bui mo. <verse eid="PSA 139:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, anɛ e sɛ nɛ ma nyɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ nyɛɛ mo ɔ? Nɛ e sɛ nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ tee si kɛ siɔ mo ɔ a he tai peeɔ mi lo? <verse eid="PSA 139:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22" />I nyɛɛ mɛ saminya, ejakaa nihi nɛ a ji o he nyɛli ɔ, a peeɔ ami hu ye he nyɛli.<verse eid="PSA 139:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, moo kpa ye mi nɛ o le ye tsui mi; moo ka mi hyɛ ha nɛ o le ye susumi ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 139:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24" />Nɛ o hyɛ ha kaa nɔ yayami ko ngɛ ye mi lo, nɛ o kpaka mi kɛ nyɛɛ neneene wami blɔ ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 139:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139" />
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 140</para>
  <para style="s1">Kpɔmi kɛ je dikali a dɛ mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, mo kpɔ mi kɛ je dikali a dɛ mi; moo baa ye yi kɛ je yi mi wali a dɛ mi, <verse eid="PSA 140:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2" />nihi nɛ toɔ nɔ yayami peemi he ga ngɛ a tsui mi nɛ a jeɔ sane be fɛɛ be ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 140:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3" />A lilɛ ngɛ kaa sinɔ duɔtsɛ lilɛ, nɛ a nya mi munyu ngɛ kaa sanga duɔ. <verse eid="PSA 140:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo bu ye he kɛ je dikali ɔmɛ a dɛ mi; moo baa ye yi kɛ je yi mi wali ɔmɛ a dɛ mi, ejakaa a ngɛ ye he ga woe. <verse eid="PSA 140:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5" />He nɔ woli ɔmɛ tsɔ̃ mi klama ngɛ laami mi; a tsɔ̃ kpahi kɛ ha mi nɛ ma sɛ mi; a wo ya ngɛ blɔ ɔ he nɛ a kɛ nu mi.<verse eid="PSA 140:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6" />I de Yehowa ke, “Mo ji ye Mawu; moo bu ye kue fami ɔ tue! <verse eid="PSA 140:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, ye yi wami helɔ nɛ he wa. Mo nɛ o bu ye he ngɛ ta be ɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 140:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, ko ha nɛ nɔ́ nɛ dikali ɔmɛ ngɛ hlae ɔ nɛ ba mi; ko ha nɛ yi mi wami ga nɛ a tsɔ̃ ɔ nɛ e nu nɔ́ , konɛ a ko wo a he nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 140:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9" />Mo ha nɛ a yi mi tomi ɔmɛ nɛ kpa kɛ bu a nɔ. Nɛ yayami nɛ a to kɛ ha mi ɔ nɛ kpata mɛ nitsɛmɛ a hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 140:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10" />Mo ha nɛ la ngu nɛ kpa pue a nɔ; nɛ a tsitsiɛ mɛ kɛ wo la mi, kɛ muɔ nɛ mi kuɔ mi, nɛ a ko nyɛ kpo nɛ a je hu.<verse eid="PSA 140:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11" />Mo ko ha nɛ lakpa yeli a ya nɔ ngɛ wa zugba a mi. Mo kpata a hɛ mi mla. <verse eid="PSA 140:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12" />I le kaa Tsaatsɛ Mawu maa ye kɛ bua nihi nɛ a ngɛ mɛ haoe ɔ; nɛ e ma fã ohiafo ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 140:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13" />Anɔkuale, dali ɔmɛ maa na mo si, nɛ a maa hi o we ɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 140:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140" />
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 141</para>
  <para style="s1">He bumi kɛ je yayami peemi mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, i ngɛ mo tsɛe, mo he nɔ mla. Moo bu ye gbi tue, ke i tsɛ mo ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 141:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2" />Moo ngɔ ye kue fami ɔ kaa o he la su ku nɛ ma o ngɔ; nɛ ye nine nɔ womi kɛ sɔlemi ɔ nɛ pee kaa gbɔkuɛ bɔ sami!<verse eid="PSA 141:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, mo ha ma kɔ ye lilɛ mi, nɛ ma le munyu tumi. <verse eid="PSA 141:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4" />Mo ko ha nɛ ma di yayami peemi se, nɛ o ko ha nɛ i kɛ dikali nɛ bɔ, nɛ ma ko tsu a ni tsumi ɔmɛ; nɛ o ko ha nɛ ma ye a niye ni ɔmɛ eko. <verse eid="PSA 141:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5" />Mo ha nɛ nɔmlɔ kpakpa nɛ tsɔse mi nɛ e ka ye hɛ mi. E ji tsopa, ko ha nɛ ma kua. Se be tsuaa be ɔ, i ngɛ Sɔlee ngɛ dikali kɛ a ni tsumi ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 141:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6" />Ke be nɛ o wo mɛ ngɔ wo ninɛmɛ nɛ maa bu mɛ gbenɔ fɔ ɔ a dɛ mi pɛ, a maa le kaa Mawu Munyu ɔ anɔkuale i. <verse eid="PSA 141:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7" />Kaa bɔ nɛ a gbaa lɛ tsɔwitsɔwi ngɛ zugba a, ja a nɛ a maa gbɛ a wu ngɔ fia ngɛ gbogboe muɔ nya.<verse eid="PSA 141:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8" />Se Neneene Tsɛ, ami lɛɛ mo blɔ nɛ i ngɛ hyɛe nɛ o ye kɛ bua mi. Mo ji ye wesa he. Ko ha nɛ a gbe mi. <verse eid="PSA 141:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9" />Mo je mi kɛ je klamahi nɛ yayami peeli nɛ ɔmɛ tsɔ̃ kɛ ha mi ɔ a mi. <verse eid="PSA 141:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10" />Mo ha nɛ dikali nɛ a du mɛ nitsɛmɛ a klama amɛ, nɛ ami lɛɛ ma je mi slɔkee.<verse eid="PSA 141:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141" />
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 142</para>
  <para style="s1">Yemi kɛ buami he sɔlemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1" />I wo ye gbi nɔ kɛ tsɛ Tsaatsɛ Mawu ke e ye kɛ bua mi. I kpa ngmlaa kɛ kpa Tsaatsɛ Mawu pɛɛ. <verse eid="PSA 142:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2" />I jaje ye sane ɔ ngɛ e hɛ mi, nɛ i bɔ lɛ ye haomi ɔmɛ tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 142:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3" />Ke ye susuma hao ngɛ ye mi ɔ, mo pɛ nɛ o le. Ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ tsɔ̃ mi klama ngɛ ye blɔ mi. <verse eid="PSA 142:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4" />I hyɛ ye hiɔ mi, se nɔ ko be nɛ maa ye kɛ bua mi, nɔ ko be nɛ ma fã ye he. Nɛ nɔ ko be nɛ ye nɔ peeɔ lɛ kɔmɔ. <verse eid="PSA 142:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5" />Kɛkɛ nɛ i sɔle kɛ ha Yehowa nɛ i de ke, “Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo pɛ ji ye wesa he. Mo pɛ nɛ o ma nyɛ ye yi maa baa.<verse eid="PSA 142:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6" />Moo bu ye kue fami ɔ tue, ejakaa ye hɛ nɔ kami ta kulaa. Mo kpɔ mi kɛ je ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a dɛ mi, ejakaa a he wa pe mi. <verse eid="PSA 142:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7" />Mo je mi kɛ je haomi ɔ mi, konɛ ma na mo si. Dali ɔmɛ tsuo kɛ mi ma nya ngɛ o yemi ke buami ɔ he.”<verse eid="PSA 142:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142" />
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 143</para>
  <para style="s1">Sɔlemi ngɛ haomi mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo bu ye sɔlemi ɔ tue; mo ha ye kue fami ɔ heto, ejakaa anɔkualetsɛ kɛ dalɔ ji mo. <verse eid="PSA 143:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2" />Mo ko kojo mi o tsɔlɔ ɔ, ejakaa nɔmlɔ ko be nɛ hi kɛ pi si ngɛ o hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 143:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3" />Ye he nyɛlɔ ɔ fie mi nɛ e fia mi nɔ kɛ fɔ si; e ha nɛ i tlɔ diblii mi kaa ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ gbogboe muɔ mi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 143:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ye hɛ nɔ kami ngɛ tae, nɛ gbeye nu mi.<verse eid="PSA 143:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5" />I kai nyakpɛ anunyami ni tsumihi nɛ o tsu ngɛ blema be ɔmɛ a mi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 143:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6" />I wo ye nine nɔ kɛ ngɛ kue fae ha mo; o he kuma ngɛ mi yee kaa bɔ nɛ nyu he hiaa zugba gbigbli ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 143:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu, mo ha mi heto mla, ejakaa ye mumi nya ngɛ tae. Mo ko wo o hɛ mi kɛ laa mi nɛ ma gbo. <verse eid="PSA 143:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8" />Mo ha nɛ ma na o suɔmi ɔ mɔtu mi; ejakaa o nɔ nɛ i wo ye hɛ kɛ fɔ. Anɔkuale sɔlemi nɛ i ngɛ sɔlee ɔ nɛ, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, moo tsɔɔ mi he nɛ ma gu. <verse eid="PSA 143:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, i tu fo kɛ ba sa we ngɛ o ngɔ; mo kpɔ mi kɛ je ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 143:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10" />Moo ye kɛ bua mi nɛ ma pee o suɔmi nya ni, ejakaa mo ji ye Mawu. Mo ha nɛ o mumi kpakpa a nɛ kpaka mi kɛ gu blɔ nɛ hi nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 143:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11" />Neneene Tsɛ, ke o kpɔ mi ɔ, e ma ha nɛ o biɛ ɔ hɛ mi maa ba nyami. Mo je mi kɛ je haomi nɛ ɔ tsuo mi, ejakaa o yeɔ o si womi nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 143:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12" />Nɛ ngɛ suɔmi kɛ mɔbɔ nami nɛ o ngɛ kɛ ha mi he je ɔ, moo gbe ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ, nɛ o kpata ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ mi awi yee ɔ a hɛ mi, ejakaa o tsɔlɔ ji mi.<verse eid="PSA 143:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143" />
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 144</para>
  <para style="s1">Kunimi yemi he si nami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1" />A je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi, lɛ ji ye tɛ sa. E woɔ mi he wami nɛ e tsɔɔ mi ta hwumi. <verse eid="PSA 144:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2" />E mi mi jɔ kɛ ha mi nɛ e suɔ mi be fɛɛ be. Lɛ ji ye laami he, ye he wami, ye yi wami nami kɛ ye kpɔlɔ. Lɛ ji ye he pulelɔ; e ngɔɔ ma amɛ kɛ woɔ ye sisi.<verse eid="PSA 144:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3" />Neneene Tsɛ, mɛni ji nɔmlɔ adesa nɛ o susuu e he, aloo nɔmlɔ bi nɛ o buu e he akɔtaa? <verse eid="PSA 144:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4" />Nɔmlɔ ngɛ kaa kɔɔhiɔ; e ligbi ɔmɛ ngɛ kaa nini nɛ bee.<verse eid="PSA 144:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5" />Oo Tsaatsɛ Mawu, moo je o hiɔwe ɔ nɛ o kple si! Moo ta yoku ɔmɛ a he nɛ a maa je la su ku! <verse eid="PSA 144:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6" />Mo ha nɛ oslabai, nɛ pa la nɛ o gbɛ mɛ ngɔ fia; mo tsiɛ o kɛ̃ɛ̃ ɔ nɛ o kpata a hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 144:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7" />Moo bɔle o nine kɛ je hiɔwe nɛ o kpɔ mi; mo je mi kɛ je nyu nɛ mi kuɔ nɛ ɔ mi, nɛ o he mi kɛ je ye he nyɛli ɔmɛ a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 144:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8" />A nya mi hyi tɔ kɛ lakpa, nɛ a kaa kita, be mi nɛ a ngɛ lakpa yee.<verse eid="PSA 144:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9" />Oo Neneene Tsɛ, i ma la la he kɛ kpa nyɔngma saku kɛ je o yi. <verse eid="PSA 144:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10" />Mo nɛ o haa matsɛmɛ yeɔ kunimi; nɛ mo ji nɔ nɛ ma je o tsɔlɔ David kɛ je awi yemi ha a nya. <verse eid="PSA 144:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11" />Mo he ye yi wami! Mo kpɔ mi kɛ je he nyɛli, lakpa yeli kɛ awi yeli nɛ ɔmɛ a dɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 144:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12" />Mo ha nɛ wa binyumuwi ɔmɛ a wa nɛ nihe nɛ pue a nɔ, nɛ a pee kaa tsohi nɛ a du nɛ a ngɛ wae, kɛ wa biyiwi ɔmɛ hu a hɛ mi nɛ hi anunyami nɛ a he nɛ pee fɛu kaa pilahi ngɛ matsɛ we ɔ kɔ nyahi. <verse eid="PSA 144:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13" />Mo ha nɛ wa niye ni gba amɛ a hyi fuu kɛ ngmɔ ni slɔɔtohi. Wa to ɔmɛ a fɔ nɛ a ku kɛ bɔ he akpeakpe abɔ ngɛ wa nga amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 144:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14" />Mo ha nɛ wa na amɛ a he nɛ wa kɛ ha ni tsumi. Mo ko ha nɛ he nyɛli a ba tua wɔ, se mohu tue mi jɔmi nɛ hi he fɛɛ he. Nɛ o ko ha nɛ awi yemi nɔ ko nɛ ba ngɛ wa gbɛjegbɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 144:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15" />Nihi tsuo nɛ ma na jɔɔmi nɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, a bua maa jɔ a he. A gbaa nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ Yehowa ji e Mawu.<verse eid="PSA 144:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144" />
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 145</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu yi jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1" />I ma je o yi, ye Mawu kɛ ye Matsɛ; nɛ i ma je o biɛ ɔ yi be fɛɛ be. <verse eid="PSA 145:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2" />I ma na mo si daa, nɛ i ma je o yi kɛ ya neneene.<verse eid="PSA 145:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3" />Yehowa kle, nɛ e sa yi jemi babauu. A be nyɛe ma susu e klemi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 145:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4" />Yi nɔ tsuaa yi nɔ maa jaje o anunyami ni tsumi ɔmɛ kɛ tsɔɔ e bimɛ. <verse eid="PSA 145:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5" />I ma susu o afɛu kɛ o agbo jemi kɛ o nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="PSA 145:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6" />A maa jaje o gbeye ni tsumi ɔmɛ kɛ tsɔɔ, nɛ i ma ye o klemi ɔ he odase ma tsɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 145:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7" />Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ ma de bɔ nɛ o hi ha, nɛ a ma la o dami ɔ he la.<verse eid="PSA 145:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8" />Dloolɔ kɛ mɔbɔ nalɔ ji Yehowa, e na we abofu mla; nɛ e suɔmi hiɛ babauu. <verse eid="PSA 145:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9" />E dloomi ɔ ngɛ kɛ ha nɔ fɛɛ nɔ, nɛ mɔbɔ nami ngɛ e nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ peemi mi. <verse eid="PSA 145:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10" />Neneene Tsɛ, o nibɔ ni ɔmɛ tsuo maa na mo si, nɛ o nimli ɔmɛ ma je o yi. <verse eid="PSA 145:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11" />A maa jaje o matsɛ yemi ɔ anunyami ɔ he sane, nɛ a maa tu o he wami ɔ he munyu. <verse eid="PSA 145:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12" />A maa jaje o nyakpɛ ni tsumi ɔmɛ kɛ o agbo jemi kɛ o matsɛ yemi ɔ e anunyami ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ. <verse eid="PSA 145:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13" />O matsɛ yemi ɔ be nyagbe, e ngɛ kɛ yaa yi nɔhi kulaa.<verse eid="PSA 145:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu tleɔ ni nɛmɛ nɛ nɔ si ɔ si, nɛ e yeɔ kɛ buaa ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ haomi mi ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 145:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ hyɛɔ mo blɔ, nɛ o haa mɛ a nya ngma ngɛ be nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 145:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16" />O haa bɔ nihi a nya ngma be fɛɛ be.<verse eid="PSA 145:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17" />Tsaatsɛ Mawu da ngɛ e nɔ fɛɛ nɔ peemi mi, nɛ e mi mi jɔ babauu. <verse eid="PSA 145:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18" />E ngɛ nihi kulaa nɛ tsɛɔ lɛ ngɛ anɔkuale mi ɔ a kasa mi haa. <verse eid="PSA 145:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19" />Nihi kulaa nɛ buu lɛ nɛ a ngɔɔ a hɛ kɛ fɔɔ e nɔ ɔ, e peeɔ a suɔmi nya ni kɛ haa mɛ; e buu a ngmlaa kpami tue nɛ e jeɔ mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 145:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20" />E baa nihi nɛ suɔ lɛ ɔ a yi, se e kpataa dikali a hɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 145:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21" />I ma je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi, nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ he fɛɛ he ma je e biɛ klɔuklɔu ɔ yi kɛ ya neneene.<verse eid="PSA 145:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145" />
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 146</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu yi jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1" />Mo je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi! Mo je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi, ye susuma! <verse eid="PSA 146:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2" />Be abɔ nɛ i ngɛ wami mi nɛ ɔ, i ma je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi. I ma la yi jemi la kɛ ha Neneene Tsɛ ɔ, be abɔ nɛ i ngɛ mumi woe ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 146:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3" />Mo ko wo o hɛ kɛ fɔ matsɛmɛ a nɔ, loo nɔmlɔ adesa ko nɔ; a be o yi wami nyɛe ma he. <verse eid="PSA 146:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4" />Ejakaa adesa fɛɛ adesa ma gbo. E ma plɛ zu ekohu. Nɛ jamɛ a ligbi ɔ nɔuu ɔ, e yi mi tomi ɔmɛ tsuo maa ba nyagbe. <verse eid="PSA 146:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5" />Se a jɔɔ nɔ nɛ Yakob Mawu ɔ ji e yemi kɛ bualɔ; nɔ nɛ e hɛ nɔ kami ji Yehowa, e Mawu ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 146:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6" />Nɔ nɛ bɔ hiɔwe kɛ zugba, wohi kɛ a mi nɔ fɛɛ nɔ, nɔ nɛ yeɔ si womi nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 146:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7" />Nɔ nɛ yeɔ ohiafohi kɛ nihi nɛ a ngɛ mɛ yi kpɛti wae ɔ a sane kɛ haa mɛ; nɛ e woɔ ni nɛmɛ nɛ hwɔ ngɛ mɛ yee ɔ a nya ngma a. E ngmɛɛɔ nihi nɛ a wo mɛ tsu mi ɔ a he. <verse eid="PSA 146:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8" />Neneene Tsɛ ɔ bliɔ hɛ yuyuili a hɛ ngmɛ. E woɔ nihi nɛ a nɔ si ɔ a nɔ. Tsaatsɛ Mawu suɔ dali ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 146:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9" />Yehowa buu nibwɔhi a he; e hyɛɔ yalɔyihi kɛ awusahi a nɔ; se e butuu dikali a blɔ nya tomi ɔmɛ.<verse eid="PSA 146:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10" />Yehowa maa ye matsɛ kɛ ya neneene. Oo Yerusalem, o Mawu ɔ ji Matsɛ kɛ ha yi nɔhi kulaa! Nyɛ je Neneene Tsɛ ɔ yi.<verse eid="PSA 146:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146" />
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 147</para>
  <para style="s1">Yehowa yi jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1" />Nyɛ je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi! E sa kaa a la nɛ a je Neneene Tsɛ wa Mawu ɔ yi. E hi nɛ e da kaa a je e yi.<verse eid="PSA 147:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2" />Yehowa maa ma Yerusalem ekohu, nɛ e maa kpale nihi nɛ a ngɔ mɛ nyɔguɛ ɔ kɛ ba. <verse eid="PSA 147:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3" />E tsaa nihi tsuo nɛ a tsui hao ɔ, nɛ e fiɔ a pa amɛ a nɔ kɛ haa mɛ. <verse eid="PSA 147:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4" />E le hlami dodoe ɔmɛ tsuo a yi bɔ, nɛ e tsɛɔ eko tsuaa eko kɛ e biɛ. <verse eid="PSA 147:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5" />Wa Neneene Tsɛ ɔ kle, nɛ e he wami hu kle. E nɔ sisi numi kɛ e nile be nyagbe. <verse eid="PSA 147:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6" />Yehowa woɔ he si bali a nɔ, nɛ e woɔ dikali ɔmɛ kɛ fiaa si. <verse eid="PSA 147:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7" />Nyɛ la nɛ nyɛɛ na Neneene Tsɛ ɔ si; nyɛ la kɛ kpa saku nɛ nyɛ je wa Tsɛ Mawu yi. <verse eid="PSA 147:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8" />Lɛ nɛ e haa bɔ woɔ; e haa nyu nɛɛ pueɔ zugba a nɔ, nɛ nga puɛɛ ngɛ yoku ɔmɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="PSA 147:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9" />E haa lohwe nane eywiɛtsɛmɛ niye ni, kɛ kɔɔkɔmite ɔmɛ nɛ hii pɛe ɔ hu a nya ngma. <verse eid="PSA 147:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10" />Okpɔngɔ fo tumi pi nɔ́ ko nɛ e nyaa he, nɛ nɔmlɔ he wami pi nɔ́ ko kulaa ngɛ e hɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 147:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11" />Se mohu e naa bua jɔmi ngɛ nihi nɛ yee lɛ gbeye ɔ a mi, nɛ a woɔ a hɛ kɛ fɔɔ e suɔmi kɛ mɔbɔ nami nɔ ɔ.<verse eid="PSA 147:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12" />Oo Yerusalem, mo je e yi! Mo je o Mawu ɔ yi, oo Zion! <verse eid="PSA 147:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13" />Ejakaa e ha o agbo ɔmɛ a he wa, nɛ e jɔɔ o nimli ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 147:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14" />E haa tue mi jɔmi baa o huza amɛ tsuo a mi, nɛ e haa mo ngma kpakpa. <verse eid="PSA 147:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15" />E woɔ kita kɛ maneɔ zugba a nɔ, e munyu ɔ he sɔɔ wawɛɛ. <verse eid="PSA 147:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16" />E haa nɛ sinoo nɛɛ kɛ pueɔ si futafuta, nɛ e gbɛɛ bɔ nɛ fi ɔ kɛ fiaa kaa la zu. <verse eid="PSA 147:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17" />Nɛ e fiaa nyu nɛ fi kaa tɛ ɔ kɛ pueɔ zugba a nɔ. Mɛnɔ ma nyɛ maa da e yluduu ɔ nya? <verse eid="PSA 147:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18" />Se e haa nɛ je mi dɔɔ la nɛ aisi ɔ sileɔ; e haa kɔɔhiɔ fiaa nɛ nyu ɔmɛ foo dɔ kɛ yaa. <verse eid="PSA 147:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19" />E ha nɛ Israel le e mlaa amɛ kɛ e sɔmɔmi blɔ nya tomi ɔmɛ. <verse eid="PSA 147:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20" />E pee we enɛ ɔ kɛ ha we ma kpa amɛ; a li e mlaa amɛ. Nyɛ je Yehowa yi!<verse eid="PSA 147:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147" />
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 148</para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu yi jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1" />Nyɛ je Yehowa yi! Nyɛɛ je hiɔwe kɛ je e yi; nyɛ je e yi kɛ je hiɔwe lokoo. <verse eid="PSA 148:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2" />Nyɛ e bɔfo ɔmɛ tsuo nyɛ je e yi; nyɛ je e yi, nyɛ hiɔwe ta amɛ tsuo. <verse eid="PSA 148:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3" />Nyɛ je e yi, pu kɛ hlami; nyɛ je e yi, nyɛ dodoehi tsuo nɛ nyɛ kpɛɔ. <verse eid="PSA 148:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4" />Nyɛ je e yi, nyɛ níhi nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe lokoo, kɛ nyɛ nyuhi ngɛ hiɔwe yi nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 148:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5" />Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ ne e bɔ ɔ, a je e yi, ejakaa lɛ nɛ e fa nɛ a ba bɔ ade. <verse eid="PSA 148:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6" />E wo mɛ kɛ ma si kpɛii kɛ yaa neneene. E mlaa amɛ be nyagbe.<verse eid="PSA 148:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7" />Nyɛ je Yehowa yi ngɛ zugba a nɔ, nyɛ wo mi níhi nɛ ngɛ hehi nɛ kuɔ, <verse eid="PSA 148:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8" />la kɛ hiɔmi tɛ, sinoo kɛ hiɔmi, kɔɔhiɔ kɛ je mi, nyɛ nihi nɛ buu lɛ tue ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 148:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9" />Nyɛ je e yi, yohi kɛ yokuhi, tsohi nɛ woɔ yiblii kɛ sedahi. <verse eid="PSA 148:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10" />Nga mi lohwe nane eywiɛtsɛmɛ kɛ nahi, sinɔhi kɛ lohwe pɛlitsɛhi. <verse eid="PSA 148:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11" />Nyɛ je e yi, zugba a nɔ matsɛmɛ kɛ nyɛ nimli guhi tsuo; nyɛ zugba nɔ konɔhi, ganɔhi kɛ kojoli tsuo; <verse eid="PSA 148:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12" />ma mi nihewi kɛ zangmawi, nimeli kɛ jokuɛwi. <verse eid="PSA 148:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13" />Mɛ tsuo a je Yehowa yi, ejakaa e biɛ kle pe biɛ fɛɛ biɛ, nɛ e anunyami kle pe Hiɔwe kɛ zugba. <verse eid="PSA 148:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14" />E wo e nimli ɔmɛ he wami, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e nimli klɔuklɔu ɔmɛ je e yi. Mɛ ji Israel bi ɔmɛ, nihi nɛ a he jua wa kɛ ha lɛ ɔ. Nyɛ je Neneene Tsɛ ɔ yi.<verse eid="PSA 148:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148" />
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 149</para>
  <para style="s1">Kunimi yemi la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1" />Nyɛ je Yehowa yi! Nyɛ la la he kɛ ha lɛ. Nyɛ e nimli ɔmɛ, nyɛ tsuo nyɛ la kɛ je e yi.<verse eid="PSA 149:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2" />Oo Israel, o bua nɛ jɔ ngɛ o Bɔlɔ ɔ he. Oo Yerusalem bi, nyɛ nya ngɛ nyɛ Matsɛ ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 149:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3" />Nyɛ je e biɛ ɔ yi kɛ do; nyɛ fiɛ do, nɛ nyɛɛ fia saku kɛ je e yi.<verse eid="PSA 149:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4" />Yehowa naa e nimli ɔmɛ a he bua jɔmi; nɛ e woɔ he si bali ɔmɛ a hɛ mi nyami nɛ e haa a yeɔ kunimi. <verse eid="PSA 149:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5" />Nyɛ ha nɛ Mawu nimli ɔmɛ a nya ngɛ a kunimi yemi ɔ mi, nɛ a la kɛ bua jɔmi nyɔ mi tsuo.<verse eid="PSA 149:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6" />Nyɛ ha nɛ a kpa ngmlaa kɛ je Mawu yi, nɛ a hɛɛ a ta yami ha amɛ ngɛ a dɛ mi. <verse eid="PSA 149:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7" />Nɛ a ye ma amɛ a nɔ kunimi, nɛ a gbla nimli ɔmɛ a tue. <verse eid="PSA 149:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8" />Nɛ a wo a matsɛ ɔmɛ kɔsɔkɔsɔ kɛ asafoatsɛ ɔmɛ ga. <verse eid="PSA 149:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9" />Nɛ a gbla a tue kaa bɔ nɛ Neneene Tsɛ ɔ fa a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PSA 149:9">Tsaatsɛ Mawu nimli ɔmɛ a kunimi yemi ji enɛ ɔ nɛ. Nyɛ je Yehowa yi!<verse eid="PSA 149:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149" />
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150" />
  <para style="cl">La Amɛ 150</para>
  <para style="s1">A je Mawu yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1" />Nyɛ je Tsaatsɛ Mawu yi! Nyɛ je e yi ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ! Nyɛ je e yi ngɛ hiɔwe he nɛ e he wami ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PSA 150:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2" />Nyɛ je e yi ngɛ e ni tsumi ngua amɛ a he. Nyɛ je e yi ngɛ e agbo jemi ɔ he. <verse eid="PSA 150:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3" />Nyɛ je e yi kɛ titimati. Nyɛ je e yi kɛ saku. <verse eid="PSA 150:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4" />Nyɛ je e yi kɛ miɛhi kɛ do. Nyɛ je e yi kɛ saku kɛ bɛ. <verse eid="PSA 150:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5" />Nyɛ je e yi kɛ sawahi. Nyɛ je e yi kɛ sawahi nɛ nya wa.<verse eid="PSA 150:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6" />Nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ ngɛ mumi woe ɔ, e je Yehowa yi! Nyɛ je Neneene Tsɛ ɔ yi.<verse eid="PSA 150:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150" />
</usx>